window.AKK_APOCALYPSE_STOCKPILING_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_APOCALYPSE_STOCKPILING_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":301,"title":"Chapter 301: Grapevine News","paragraphs":["“Crack~”","At that moment, the sound of glass cracking suddenly rang out.","The group turned their heads and saw that the glass of the train car to their left had been forced open by the zombies, creating a gap.","The gap grew larger and larger, and it seemed like it was about to shatter completely.","Yun Xiaoxiao immediately conjured a thick layer of ice and pushed it forward.","The train car was instantly frozen solid.","Even the terrifying faces of the zombies were completely obscured.","Yun Xiaoxiao withdrew her hand, “I’ll spare you for now. I don’t have time to deal with you.”","“It went this way,” Lu Chen, standing in the waiting area not far away, pointed to the empty tracks on the other side.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly followed.","They saw that the sealed glass door had been smashed open by something, leaving a large gap.","The destructive force was clearly man-made.","The paw prints of “Da Piaoliang” (Big Beauty) disappeared in the area littered with glass shards.","The group quickly entered the subway tracks.","They continued walking along the tracks, passing two stations along the way.","They encountered some zombies lingering on the tracks, all of which were easily dealt with by Yun Xiaoxiao and her team.","After walking for what felt like an eternity, they finally arrived at the third station.","A subway train was parked there, completely empty and free of zombies.","One of the train cars had its glass shattered as well.","“Hey, that tiger of yours is pretty impressive. Did it just fly in through here?” Nie Yizhou pointed to where he was standing and then to the subway train opposite, sounding both amazed and amused.","“Why not call it ‘Flying Tiger’ instead of ‘Big Beauty’? It’d be more fitting.”","“Can you just shut up? You talk way too much!” Xiao Feng shot him a glare.","Nie Yizhou pouted, “Mind your own business!”","The group then entered the subway train, only to find the interior in a horrific state.","The floor, seats, handrails, walls, and glass were all covered in dried blood.","There were also chunks of flesh that had been bitten off.","It was clear how dire and brutal the situation had been when the zombie virus broke out in this train.","The subway doors were open.","The zombies and survivors inside must have already fled.","Following Da Piaoliang’s paw prints, the group made their way to the upper hall.","As soon as they reached the staircase, they saw numerous zombie corpses lying on the ground.","Each one had deep bite marks on its head.","Some were even completely crushed.","It was evident that whoever had killed these zombies had been both brutal and ruthless.","Moreover, the zombie cores in their heads were all missing.","The modus operandi and the level of brutality clearly pointed to Da Piaoliang’s handiwork.","The group knew they were on the right track.","They continued upward, encountering more zombie corpses along the way.","“Da Piaoliang’s combat power is really something,” Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but secretly give a thumbs-up.","Soon, they reached the station exit.","The exit wasn’t sealed.","Outside, zombies roamed the streets.","It was clear they were no longer in their original area.","“The paw prints are gone,” Ling Jing stated matter-of-factly as he killed an approaching zombie.","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows and searched the area for a long time, but found no trace of any clues.","However, it was clear that Da Piaoliang had definitely exited the subway station.","Its paw prints had disappeared at the station exit.","Where had it gone?","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned deeply, her gaze wandering into the pitch-black street.","With no direction to follow, the group had no choice but to return empty-handed.","When they returned to the original station exit, Yun Xiaoxiao, seemingly venting her frustration, slaughtered all the zombies in the subway train.","It was a cathartic massacre.","For the rest of the day, even though Yun Xiaoxiao and her team advanced further and cleared out many areas of zombies, they still couldn’t find any trace of Da Piaoliang.","The increasingly harsh conditions of the battle forced Yun Xiaoxiao to put aside her search and focus on working with the team to eliminate the zombies more efficiently.","That night, at the camp of the Tang brothers.","As everyone rested, they sat around the fire, chatting idly.","“If nothing goes wrong, we should be able to take over the entire city in two more days.”","“Yeah, hopefully. The weather isn’t waiting for us. At first, it was just light snow that melted as soon as it hit the ground, but now it’s heavy snowfall, and the ground is freezing over. If we don’t finish soon, it’ll be trouble getting back.”","“True. I don’t want to see any more casualties.”","Even though the plan was meticulous and everyone was being extremely careful, casualties were still unavoidable.","“By the way, have you guys heard about something?”","One of the group members glanced around, making sure no one from Yun City was nearby, then lowered his voice as if he had stumbled upon a big secret.","“What is it?”","“Come on, don’t keep us in suspense.”","Naturally, everyone’s curiosity was piqued.","Seeing everyone’s attention on him, the man’s vanity was greatly satisfied.","He cleared his throat pretentiously, then began speaking in a hushed, dramatic tone.","“I heard this from a fellow villager of mine.","You know how we ran into the Yun City team today?","He’s part of it.","After the battle, while collecting zombie cores, I managed to chat with him for a bit.","From what he told me, I learned something truly terrifying.","He used to work in another city and stayed there.","But recently, by chance, he joined Yun City.","Guess what he discovered?”","He deliberately paused, savoring the suspense.","The others, however, were growing impatient.","“How are we supposed to guess?”","“Just tell us already!”","“You’re cutting it short, and it’s annoying. Spit it out!”","Under their urging, the man finally spoke.","“You know the most powerful members of Yun City, right?”","“Yeah, yeah. There’s that little girl who’s only five or six, that super strong and cold guy in black, that ridiculously handsome guy who can summon black mist, and...”","Before the person could finish, the man interjected.","“Right, that ridiculously handsome guy who can summon black mist.","One night, my fellow villager was hiding behind a car to relieve himself. Just as he finished, he overheard a conversation among some Yun City members.","They said their teammates no longer recognized them, and it was all because of that guy, Ling Jing.","But they were speaking vaguely, and my fellow villager couldn’t figure out the whole story.","When the group dispersed, he quietly followed two of them.","Sure enough, those two continued discussing the matter.","What he heard shocked him to the core.","They said that one of their teammates had been infected with the zombie virus and was on the verge of turning into a full zombie. But then, Ling Jing bit him.","And something incredible happened.","The guy didn’t turn into a zombie, but he didn’t return to being human either. Instead, he became a half-zombie, half-human.","He stopped speaking and became Ling Jing’s shadow, following his every command.","Doesn’t that sound horrifying?”","“That’s just like those puppets you see in TV dramas!”"]},{"number":302,"title":"Chapter 302: Where Has the Jade Pendant Gone","paragraphs":["\"Exactly! Just think about it, if Ling Jing bites someone, that person becomes completely under his control.","If he bites all of us, wouldn’t the whole world be under his command?","That’s terrifying!","And another thing, I’ve heard that Ling Jing never eats with everyone during meals. Not just one meal, but every single day.","As the saying goes, skipping one meal makes you hungry, but he skips all three meals every day. Isn’t that strange?","What’s even weirder is that he feeds his puppets raw meat!","Tell me, apart from animals, what else loves raw meat?\"","\"Zombies!\"","\"Exactly, zombies!\"","\"So, if Ling Jing doesn’t eat with everyone, does that mean he’s also eating raw meat like his puppets?","And to avoid being seen as different, he hides away and secretly eats raw meat by himself?\"","\"Yeah, I think that’s highly possible!\"","\"Oh my god, what kind of monster is Ling Jing? He can control zombies, eats raw meat—could he also be a zombie?!\"","\"!!!\"","\"That could really be the case!\"","\"Thinking about it gives me chills! It’s absolutely chilling!\"","\"...\"","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were completely unaware of this conversation.","They were busy counting the supplies and crystal cores they had gathered that day.","\"I didn’t steal it!\"","A furious voice suddenly rang out.","The voice was loud, and everyone nearby turned to look.","A girl with a bun hairstyle was glaring at a middle-aged man, her face filled with anger.","\"Stop lying! Little girl, don’t you know stealing is wrong? At such a young age, you’re already stealing and refusing to admit it!\"","\"I said I didn’t steal it, and I didn’t!\"","The girl’s voice was full of both frustration and defiance.","The middle-aged man pointed at the jade pendant hanging around the girl’s neck.","\"This is the only keepsake left by my late wife. It was custom-made, and there’s no other like it in the world. I lost mine this morning, so if it’s not you who stole it, who else could it be?\"","The girl kept denying it, which only made the man angrier.","He had lost his pendant that morning and had searched everywhere for it.","Now, it was hanging around this girl’s neck—how could it not be her?","The girl touched her pendant, her eyes red.","\"I’ve been wearing this since I was a child. How could it be yours? If you lost yours, why don’t you go look for it instead of accusing me? This is bullying!\"","\"Little girl, let’s be fair. This pendant really is the only keepsake left by my late wife.","If you like pendants, I can get you any style, any design you want.","Just give this one back to me, okay?\"","The man’s tone softened a bit.","It was clear he had deep feelings for his late wife.","\"This is mine. How can I give it back? What am I supposed to return?\" The girl’s eyes were filled with stubbornness.","The onlookers couldn’t stand it anymore.","\"Little girl, I’ve seen Brother Wang’s pendant before, and it’s exactly the same as the one you’re wearing.","Stop lying.","Even if you admit you stole it, we won’t blame you.","What’s important is to admit your mistake and correct it.","Just give it back to Brother Wang. He needs it to sleep peacefully every night.\"","\"Yeah, pendants aren’t even valuable these days. There are jewelry shops everywhere. You can get any pendant you want. Why steal someone else’s?\"","\"Why won’t you listen? I didn’t steal it. This is mine!\"","\"Has anyone seen her wearing it before?\" A woman stepped forward.","She glanced around. \"If anyone has, please come forward and vouch for this girl.\"","But after waiting for a while, no one stepped forward.","\"I’ve always kept it hidden under my clothes. It’s been cold, so no one’s seen it before.\"","Seeing the distrustful and suspicious looks from everyone, the girl grew anxious.","\"Stop explaining. Explaining just means you’re hiding something. Just give it back.\"","\"Yeah, stealing is stealing. Acting like this only makes people look down on you more.\"","\"She didn’t steal it.\"","Just as most people were convinced the girl was a thief, and others were still undecided, a young voice spoke up.","The crowd parted, and Yun Xiaoxiao stepped forward.","\"This big sister is telling the truth. The pendant really is hers.\"","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao’s words, the girl was so moved she almost cried.","When everyone had labeled her a thief, having someone suddenly stand up for her felt like a miracle.","It was like someone stranded in a desert for days, dying of thirst, suddenly finding a sip of sweet water.","She looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with gratitude.","\"Little Base Leader Yun, have you seen her wear it before?\" someone asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head.","\"Then...\"","Everyone was puzzled.","If she hadn’t seen it before, why was she so sure the pendant belonged to the girl?","Many had questions, but out of respect for Yun Xiaoxiao’s position, they didn’t dare ask.","Finally, the middle-aged man couldn’t hold back.","\"Little Base Leader Yun, can I ask why you’re so sure the pendant belongs to this girl?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head. \"I can’t explain it.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","At that moment, Yun Xiaoxiao noticed someone’s gaze seemed off.","His eyes kept darting toward the middle-aged man.","She suddenly had an idea.","\"However, I can try to help you find the real thief.\"","Hearing this, everyone looked at her curiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao walked up to a man in a gray down jacket.","The man hadn’t expected Yun Xiaoxiao to approach him, and for a moment, he looked panicked.","He had just heard her say she was going to find the real thief.","Had she figured something out?","The man avoided eye contact, forcing an awkward smile.","\"Little Base Leader Yun, what... what do you need from me?\"","\"Did you take the pendant?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked directly.","In truth, the man’s thoughts had already betrayed him.","She just wanted to confirm it further.","Sure enough, the man immediately shook his head in denial.","\"How could I? I’m a grown man. What would I do with a pendant? I don’t even wear that kind of thing.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao continued calmly, \"Did you lose it, or did you hide it somewhere?\"","The man didn’t understand why Yun Xiaoxiao kept asking questions after he had already denied it.","He didn’t answer.","But the moment she asked, he had already subconsciously revealed everything in his mind.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow and pointed at him.","\"The pendant is in your tent.\""]},{"number":303,"title":"Chapter 303: Even a soap opera wouldn't dare to script this","paragraphs":["As soon as these words were spoken, everyone was shocked.","“On him?”","“Really?”","“No way?”","Many found it hard to believe.","Because this man seemed to have no connection to the theft of the jade pendant.","Seeing everyone’s puzzled expressions, Nie Yizhou curled the corner of his lips.","“Why don’t we just search him? Does anyone know where his tent is?”","“I do!”","One person immediately raised their hand.","“Good, then please lead the way.”","As everyone headed toward his tent, the man’s palms began to sweat.","But he forced himself to stay calm, hoping that Nie Yizhou wouldn’t find where he had hidden the jade pendant.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao started asking questions again.","For example, she asked, “Is it under the bedding or in the bag?”","“Where in the bag?”","“Left side or right side?”","Even though he refused to answer, she somehow managed to pinpoint the exact location where he had hidden the jade pendant.","At that moment, he was filled with regret.","He shouldn’t have hidden the pendant; he should have just thrown it away!","But regret was useless now.","There was no such thing as a pill for regret in this world.","When Nie Yizhou found the jade pendant, everyone was stunned.","It really was with him!","“Is this yours?”","Nie Yizhou handed the pendant to the middle-aged man.","The man recognized it at a glance. “Yes, yes, this is it!”","He grabbed the thief by the collar. “Why did you steal my jade pendant?!”","“You have the nerve to ask me why?” the man snapped angrily.","“You’re the one who humiliated me in public by saying I have body odor!”","The reason was so absurd that it was hard not to laugh.","“That’s why?” The middle-aged man’s lips twitched.","“What else could it be? You made me miserable, so I wanted to make you miserable too!”","“...”","No one had expected this reason.","The middle-aged man realized that his earlier careless remark had hurt someone, so he decided not to press charges for the theft.","He even apologized sincerely.","Seeing his sincerity, the thief also felt ashamed and apologized as well.","The two of them reached a truce.","“But if this pendant is yours, then that means the girl wasn’t lying earlier.”","Someone chimed in.","Everyone then remembered how they had wrongly accused the girl.","“I’m sorry, miss. I misunderstood you.”","The middle-aged man quickly apologized.","The girl wasn’t the type to hold a grudge.","She shook her head. “It’s fine. As long as the truth came out, that’s what matters.”","“But Brother Wang, didn’t you say this pendant was custom-made? That there’s only one like it in the world?”","Someone voiced their confusion.","Both the girl and the middle-aged man fell silent.","They both looked at their pendants.","Suddenly, the middle-aged man turned to the girl with an excited expression.","“Miss, may I ask how old you are?”","The girl was taken aback but answered truthfully, “Nineteen.”","“Nineteen...”","The middle-aged man repeated the number, his voice trembling more and more.","Finally, he couldn’t hold back and asked, “Miss, do you have a small black mole shaped like a heart on your right shoulder?”","After asking, he looked at her with hopeful eyes.","“How do you know that?!”","The girl’s eyes widened in shock.","Logically, there was no way he could have known.","But...","“Miss, I’m your biological father!”","The middle-aged man’s face was filled with excitement, his eyes brimming with joy.","As soon as he said this, everyone was stunned.","What kind of soap opera plot was this?","First, they thought she was a thief, and now it turned into a family reunion?","Even soap operas wouldn’t dare to write something this dramatic!","But that was exactly what happened.","“You know, if you look closely, the two of you do resemble each other a bit.”","“Yeah, especially the eyes and nose. The more I look, the more similar they seem.”","Everyone couldn’t help but observe them closely.","The girl froze for a moment, then looked at the middle-aged man with a complicated expression.","It was as if she had many questions and grievances.","But in the end, she said nothing and turned to leave.","Seeing this, the middle-aged man hurried after her.","“Little Ya, don’t go! Your mother and I have been looking for you for over a decade. Now that we’ve finally found you, you...”","“You abandoned me! Why are you looking for me now?!”","The girl stopped in her tracks, clenching her fists, her body trembling slightly.","Her voice was full of pain.","The middle-aged man was stunned, then shook his head desperately.","“No, we didn’t abandon you! How could we ever abandon you?”","His emotions were overwhelming as he frantically explained.","“You were only four years old at the time. We took you out to shop for the New Year.","You were playing with toys in a corner of the store, but when we finished picking out what we needed, we turned around and you were gone.","We were frantic. We searched the entire market but couldn’t find you.","We reported it to the police, and they checked the surveillance footage. All they could tell was that you were taken away by a woman.","But back then, surveillance wasn’t as widespread as it is now.","We tried everything, but we couldn’t find you.","But we never gave up. Your mother and I kept searching for you all these years.","We never had another child.","Your mother always blamed herself, saying she should have kept a closer eye on you.","And because we never heard any news about you, she eventually fell into depression and passed away.”","As he spoke, the man’s eyes reddened.","It seemed he was thinking of his late wife.","He sighed. “Actually, this jade pendant was part of a pair. When we had them made, there were two—one for your mother and one for you.","Your mother said she wanted to have a bond with her daughter, like best friends.","The pendants were meant to be a symbol of that bond.","Earlier, I didn’t even consider that you might be my daughter, which is why I said there was only one pendant.”","The middle-aged man’s words made the girl’s eyes well up with tears.","Her adoptive mother had always told her that her biological parents had abandoned her.","Now, looking back, her adoptive mother had indeed displayed an almost obsessive level of control over her.","She was kind, but it always felt like she was looking at someone else through her.","The memories from her childhood were too distant. She could remember having biological parents, but the details of why she ended up with her adoptive mother were hazy.","Could it be that her adoptive mother was the one who took her away?","In the end, the father and daughter were reunited.","In the post-apocalyptic world, many had lost their loved ones.","To find a family member under such circumstances made everyone around them envious.","They all offered their heartfelt congratulations.","“Little Commander Yun, thank you.”","After everything was settled, as Yun Xiaoxiao was about to leave, the girl hurried over.","“If you really want to thank me, give me your jade pendant,” Yun Xiaoxiao said with a sly smile."]},{"number":304,"title":"Chapter 304: Shocking Big Beauty is Back","paragraphs":["The girl touched the jade pendant around her neck, as if she had made a difficult decision.","\"Alright, then...\"","She was about to take it off.","\"Just kidding,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a smile, pursing her lips.","\"I don’t want your pendant. Keep it. Congratulations on finding your father.\"","\"Thank you,\" the girl replied with a heartfelt smile.","\"By the way, Yun Xiaoxiao, what about your... parents?\" the girl asked cautiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow. \"I don’t have parents.\"","The girl gasped. \"I’m sorry, I shouldn’t have been so abrupt.\"","\"It’s fine. I’m used to it.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and walked away.","She didn’t know who her biological parents were, nor did she want to know.","The night passed peacefully.","The next day, the siege continued.","Due to the weather, everyone knew the battle had to end quickly.","So, everyone’s nerves were on edge.","They fought with even greater strength than usual.","After lunch, they set up new traps and activated another barrier.","Countless zombies immediately swarmed toward the five strongholds.","But the closer they got to the inner circle, the stronger the zombies became.","The difficulty of dealing with them increased exponentially.","No one dared to slack off even a little.","\"Come on, brothers! Let’s clear that street ahead, and we can rest for the day,\" Earth Traveler Sun said, wiping the sweat from his forehead.","Sweating in such cold weather showed just how hard he was working.","He called out to the people around him and headed toward the final area.","The end of this area was the new barrier.","In other words, once they cleared all the zombies on this street, their mission would be complete.","But just as he took a step forward, a series of loud footsteps suddenly echoed from ahead.","The sound was deafening, shaking the ground with its intensity.","\"What’s that?!\"","\"Something’s coming toward us!\"","\"Oh no, could it be another massive wave of zombies?\"","\"Quick, defend the area!\"","\"Call Captain Lu immediately!\"","Lu Chen and Nie Yizhou rushed over as soon as they heard the urgent call on the walkie-talkie.","When they arrived, they saw thick smoke rising from the middle of the street, with something rapidly approaching.","As it got closer, they could make out the figure of a severely molted... fox.","Beside it was a scrawny... giant panda?","The further back they looked, the more absurd it became.","This wasn’t a horde of zombies—it was a squad of animals!","There were giraffes, elephants, wolves, lions, brown bears, monkeys, pangolins, and more.","Roughly estimated, there were at least a dozen different land animals!","The numbers varied for each species.","Some had only one, while others had several.","But without exception, every one of them looked pitiful.","Some were severely molted, while others were emaciated.","Except for the elephant.","Its already massive body had swollen to twice its original size.","Suddenly, Nie Yizhou’s eyebrows shot up as he stared intently at the two large tigers leading the pack.","One of them... majestic, with glossy fur, looked incredibly familiar.","\"Wait, isn’t that Little Ghost’s Big Beauty?!\"","Nie Yizhou rubbed his eyes, making sure he wasn’t mistaken.","Judging by the scene, these must be its underlings, right?","In fact, Nie Yizhou guessed correctly.","Back when Big Beauty was slaughtering zombies, it suddenly heard the roar of a female tiger.","It followed the sound and found its way to a subway tunnel.","That tunnel led to Rong City’s largest zoo.","Most of the animals there had either starved to death or turned into zombie beasts.","But a small number had mutated and survived.","Big Beauty took a liking to the female tiger, and with its absolute strength and dashing appearance, it fought her and successfully won her heart.","None of the other mutated animals could defeat it either.","Thus, it naturally became the leader of this group of mutated animals.","By the time Yun Xiaoxiao returned, she had already helped Peng Shaowei deal with a sixth-tier zombie.","When she saw the large group of mutated animals standing before her, along with Big Beauty’s proud and triumphant expression, her lips twitched involuntarily.","As Big Beauty eagerly awaited Yun Xiaoxiao’s praise, she walked over and smacked its head, hands on her hips, scolding fiercely.","\"If you ever run off without a word again, don’t even think about following me!","Do you know how worried I was?\"","Just thinking about it made her angry.","She had been so concerned that something might have happened to it.","But here it was, carefree and oblivious.","Big Beauty immediately nuzzled Yun Xiaoxiao’s leg, whining softly.","It could tell that despite her anger, Yun Xiaoxiao was genuinely concerned for it.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched again.","Why was it that everything she raised—whether plants or animals—was so good at acting spoiled?","She really couldn’t handle it.","Yun Xiaoxiao gently stroked Big Beauty’s smooth, glossy fur, her tone softening.","\"Alright, I’ll let it slide this time. But next time, you have to let me know where you’re going, understand?\"","\"Roar~\"","Big Beauty let out another soft whine.","All traces of its former majesty as the king of the forest were gone.","Yun Xiaoxiao was speechless.","Lu Chen and the others were utterly bewildered.","The mutated animals were equally confused.","Where was the fierce and mighty tiger king who had defeated them all?","After taking a deep breath, Yun Xiaoxiao carefully examined the large group of mutated animals behind Big Beauty.","There were at least twenty or thirty of them.","Strangely, every single one was a mutated animal.","But at the moment, they all looked pitiful.","They were clearly malnourished, having gone without proper food for a long time.","Each of them bore wounds of varying severity.","Some of the bloodstains had dried, while others were still oozing fresh blood.","As Yun Xiaoxiao observed them, they also watched her.","Their eyes held a mix of curiosity, wariness, and a timid desire to get closer.","Who knew how Big Beauty had managed to convince them to come along.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised a finger, and a thin stream of water flew from her fingertip, showering the animals.","At first, all the animals panicked, wanting to flee.","But Big Beauty roared, calming them down.","Though they didn’t run, their bodies trembled as if they were enduring some great humiliation.","Gradually, however, they began to feel relief in the areas that had been hurting.","Their eyes widened in surprise as they looked at Yun Xiaoxiao, who was shorter than most of them.","The tiger king hadn’t lied.","Its master was truly incredible!","And when Yun Xiaoxiao secretly fed them meat later, without anyone noticing, the animals were nearly moved to tears.","Wuwuwu, Master, you are our forever master~"]},{"number":305,"title":"Chapter 305: The Final Battle","paragraphs":["After being \"taken care of\" by Yun Xiaoxiao, in just one night, the injuries of these supernatural beasts had almost completely healed, and their strength had doubled compared to before.","With their addition, the next day's siege battle became a breeze for Lu Chen's side, as they swept through everything in their path.","With Lu Chen and Ling Jing acting as the two pillars of strength, the battle in their assigned area ended swiftly. Afterward, they rushed to Zheng Xin'er's side to help eliminate the remaining zombies.","Lu Chen's team was overwhelmingly powerful, so it was decided that Lu Chen would lead the original group as one team. Ling Jing and Nie Yizhou became mobile units, splitting into two groups with Yun Xiaoxiao and others, each piloting a helicopter to patrol the skies and provide support wherever needed.","That afternoon, everyone gazed at the final barrier with unwavering determination.","Only the central area remained!","Taking it down would mark the success of the initial zombie eradication plan!","It was do or die!","Over the past two or three days of the Rongcheng campaign, they had rescued a total of over 5,600 survivors who had been trapped in the city.","These survivors were scattered across various corners of Rongcheng.","Some lived in groups, with the largest group numbering over a thousand.","Others survived alone.","Among them were many individuals with supernatural abilities.","With their addition, everyone's confidence in the final battle grew stronger.","As a signal flare shot into the sky, the decisive battle officially began!","The barrier fell, and zombies surged out in a frenzy.","Explosions boomed, and screams echoed continuously.","Soon, the sounds of fierce combat erupted from different streets, shattering the previous calm.","\"Thud, thud, thud, thud!\"","Suddenly, a zombie nearly ten meters tall stomped heavily toward Jiang Huai's group.","Countless smaller zombies were crushed into pulp under its feet.","The glass windows of nearby buildings shattered under the force of its massive arms.","Its entire body was covered with other zombies, still alive, their mouths opening and closing grotesquely.","This was an upgraded version of the fusion monster Yun Xiaoxiao and the others had encountered before!","On the surface, it was a battle against one zombie, but in reality, they were facing the threat of countless zombies.","The fusion monster quickly reached Jiang Huai's group.","It raised its enormous foot and began stomping on the nearest people.","Facing such a colossal creature was visually overwhelming and terrifying.","One person, unable to dodge in time, was crushed under the monster's foot, vomiting blood and dying on the spot.","Others were flung aside by its flailing arms, crashing into walls or the ground, sustaining severe internal injuries.","The fusion monster's destructive power was immense, and many were no match for it.","Supernatural attacks seemed like mere tickles to it, utterly ineffective.","For a while, everyone could only fight while retreating, helpless.","Jiang Huai quickly brought over his stronger subordinates, leaving the others to deal with the remaining zombies.","But despite trying various methods, they still couldn't take down the fusion monster.","More people tragically lost their lives.","\"Strange! I shot it in the head, so why isn't it dead?!\"","\"It's too hard to fight! What kind of monster is this?!\"","Jiang Huai frowned, his expression grave as he looked at his fallen comrades.","\"Send a signal to Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.\"","Normally, he wouldn't bother Yun Xiaoxiao with something they could handle with effort.","His pride wouldn't allow it.","But when faced with an impossible situation that endangered many lives, he had no choice but to seek their help.","Upon receiving the signal, Yun Xiaoxiao rushed over immediately.","Seeing the massive fusion monster, her eyes lit up.","This thing had two crystal cores—killing it would be worth it!","She initially wanted to handle it herself, but two other distress signals came in.","She furrowed her brow.","Oh well, she'd let Jiang Huai have this one.","After all, the spoils would still end up in her hands.","She knew Jiang Huai's group hadn't succeeded because they didn't realize the fusion monster's weakness wasn't its head but its eyes.","Taking a megaphone, she shouted, \"Its weakness is its eyes! Pierce its eyes to kill it.","Oh, and there are crystal cores in both eyes—don't forget to collect them.\"","After delivering the message, she and Mu Yang hurried off to Zheng Xin'er's side, while Ling Jing and the others headed to the Tang Brothers' location.","Watching the helicopter depart, Jiang Huai immediately issued orders.","\"Everyone heard that, right? Aim for the eyes!\"","Though it seemed unbelievable, Jiang Huai chose to trust Yun Xiaoxiao.","He had also seen the two other signals rising into the sky and knew other areas were in trouble.","So he held no resentment toward Yun Xiaoxiao's departure.","She had already revealed the giant zombie's weakness—now it was up to them.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao arrived at Zheng Xin'er's location.","They were facing no small trouble either.","The entire street was swarming with zombie cockroaches, densely packed.","More were pouring out of a sewer pipe, seemingly endless.","Many had already fallen victim.","Though these zombie cockroaches carried less virus than regular zombies, their sheer numbers made them terrifying.","Worst of all, the sight of these small, black creatures crawling in masses was enough to make anyone nauseous.","Just one crawling on you was disgusting enough, let alone dozens trying to climb up your pants.","It was utterly revolting.","Before Yun Xiaoxiao's group even landed, they heard countless screams.","One person was completely covered in zombie cockroaches, writhing in agony as he slapped at them, only for some to crawl into his mouth.","\"Ugh!\"","Someone who witnessed this immediately vomited.","\"Ahhh! Please, just kill me!\"","The man covered in cockroaches screamed desperately.","He knew he was doomed—he didn't want to turn into a zombie, nor did he want to endure this torment any longer.","He felt like his stomach was full of cockroaches!","\"Whoosh!\"","An ice spike shot through the air, piercing his forehead.","He gave a grateful glance in Yun Xiaoxiao's direction before collapsing lifelessly.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't heartless—she simply couldn't save him.","His body was already overrun with zombie cockroaches, and even if they could remove them quickly, he had been bitten too many times to avoid infection.","Not to mention the ones that had crawled into his stomach.","There was no way to cleanse that.","Though it pained her, ending his suffering was the most merciful option."]},{"number":306,"title":"Chapter 306: Perilous Crisis","paragraphs":["\"Everyone, retreat quickly! Or run to higher ground!\"","Mu Yang shouted.","There were quite a few people on this street, easily over a hundred.","Some were already completely unable to escape.","The rest attacked while rapidly retreating.","Although they had erected multiple barriers to block the zombie cockroaches,","the zombie cockroaches kept climbing up the buildings on both sides of the street, scaling the barriers, and relentlessly advancing toward Zheng Xin'er and the others.","They attacked with all their might, but the sheer number of zombie cockroaches, their scattered distribution, and their rapid crawling speed made it nearly impossible to stop them.","Even if they focused their attacks on one area, they could only kill a portion, while the rest would scatter and flee quickly.","Aside from Liu Xiaohui, who was piloting the helicopter, Yun Xiaoxiao, along with Han Bing, Mu Yang, and Zheng Yuner, quickly descended from the helicopter onto the barriers the others had created.","Mu Yang and Zheng Yuner swiftly attacked the zombie cockroaches that were about to climb over the walls.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao and Han Bing darted around, rescuing those who couldn't run fast enough and were about to be caught by the zombie cockroaches, bringing them to safety.","\"Leave the rest to you.\"","After saving several people in danger, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded at Han Bing and left.","Han Bing continued to assist those who couldn't escape in time.","Yun Xiaoxiao, on the other hand, teleported back to the helicopter.","Following her instructions, Liu Xiaohui swiftly flew the helicopter above the entrance to the underground pipeline.","Yun Xiaoxiao, her face cold, launched a fierce attack on the manhole cover.","In no time, the cover shattered into pieces and fell into the sewer below.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly pulled out a barrel of oil, unscrewed the lid, and poured it down into the pipeline.","\"Go!\"","As the helicopter flew away, a streak of fire shot out, heading straight for the pipeline entrance.","\"Boom!\"","The flames erupted into the sky, accompanied by the sizzling sound of burning.","The helicopter continued to pour oil along the street, especially on the walls on both sides.","By now, both the walls and the ground were teeming with zombie cockroaches.","The fire spread from the sewer entrance, following the trail of oil, igniting flames everywhere.","The scorching blaze burned intensely, crackling and popping.","The firelight illuminated the sky, dyeing the entire area red.","With Yun Xiaoxiao and the others joining the fight, Zheng Xin'er and her group quickly regained their composure.","This was everyone's first encounter with zombie cockroaches, and on such a massive scale at that.","Both physically and mentally, they were somewhat disoriented and panicked.","But with strong backup, Zheng Xin'er and the others quickly recovered.","They retreated in an orderly manner, setting up new barriers to block the zombie cockroaches.","This time, they didn't just focus on the street.","With the help of Wind System Ability Users, they flew into the air,","building the barriers even higher.","They also sealed off the tops and outer sides of the buildings on both sides of the street.","The goal was to prevent the zombie cockroaches from escaping and to wipe them out completely!","Under Zheng Xin'er's command, they coordinated seamlessly with Yun Xiaoxiao, focusing on both defense and offense.","Han Bing and some Wind System Ability Users brought the others to the outermost barriers, tasked with dealing with any cockroaches that the fire hadn't reached.","Through their combined efforts, the zombie cockroaches on the entire street were finally eradicated.","To ensure none had slipped into the buildings on either side, Yun Xiaoxiao set both buildings ablaze.","A clean sweep.","The zombies in the central district were indeed formidable. All five factions encountered trouble.","The Tang Brothers faced a high-level mutated zombie that could burrow underground.","This zombie was not only adept at escaping underground but also caused massive ground collapses whenever it surfaced.","Anyone standing on that ground who couldn't fly was in grave danger,","likely to be dragged into a deep pit or buried under debris.","By the time Ling Jing arrived, over a dozen people had already perished.","However, in the end, Ling Jing and Tang Jun managed to dig out the mutated zombie and smash its skull.","Peng Shaowei's group encountered a ferocious zombie dog and a terrifying zombie cat.","The zombie dog was enormous, though not as tall as the fusion monster Jiang Huai's group had faced, it still stood at least two meters tall.","And it was far more agile than the fusion monster.","Its teeth had evolved into sharp fangs, with a bite force and lethality that were off the charts.","Its claws were also far more deadly than those of an ordinary dog, razor-sharp.","At least fifteen people had been killed or injured by it!","But it wasn't the scariest of the two. The zombie cat perched on its back was even more horrifying.","The zombie cat was tiny, about the size of a large rat.","It moved with incredible agility, its speed like lightning.","It was nearly impossible to track its movements with the naked eye.","If you weren't careful, it would dart to your feet and bite your ankle,","or climb onto your back and sink its teeth into your neck when you least expected it.","What made it worse was that it coordinated perfectly with the zombie dog.","Dealing with them was a nightmare.","Fortunately, Peng Shaowei and his team were no pushovers.","With their previous experience fighting a level-six initial-stage zombie alongside Yun Xiaoxiao, they managed to overcome this daunting challenge through teamwork.","Lu Chen, on the other hand, faced a level-six high-stage mutated zombie.","Outwardly, it looked like a normal zombie,","but it was incredibly difficult to deal with.","Even Lu Chen could only fight it to a standstill.","The problem was, unless Lu Chen struck its head, any damage he dealt was meaningless.","But if the zombie injured him even once, it was game over.","So while the battle seemed evenly matched, it was fraught with peril.","Only Lu Chen could truly understand the difficulty of this fight.","He wore an expression of unprecedented seriousness,","and a fighting spirit he had never shown before.","His gaze, upon closer inspection, was strikingly similar to Yun Xiaoxiao's when she was roused to battle—","like a leopard locking onto its prey, eager to strike.","Lei Ming and the others wanted to help, but Lu Chen refused.","He said he wanted to try it alone.","If he truly couldn't handle it, they could step in.","Lei Ming and the others had no choice but to stand by.","This stubborn side of Lu Chen was something they had never seen before.","In the end, a miracle happened.","The fight had been evenly matched,","and Lu Chen had been at a disadvantage for some time.","But during the battle, he suddenly leveled up!","Just... out of nowhere, in the middle of the fight, he leveled up!","Lei Ming and the others were stunned.","Such a situation was truly hard to imagine.","Unsurprisingly, Lu Chen single-handedly defeated the level-six high-stage mutated zombie.","Lei Ming and the others were left in awe and admiration.","Strong, incredibly strong!","No wonder the little base leader trusted him to take on such a heavy responsibility.","With strength like this, who wouldn't be convinced?"]},{"number":307,"title":"Chapter 307: Sudden Accident","paragraphs":["Although everyone had mentally prepared themselves, this battle turned out to be even more grueling than they had imagined.","By evening, the zombies in the city center still hadn’t been completely eradicated.","Originally, the plan was to seal them off again and continue the fight at dawn.","But things didn’t go as hoped.","The remaining high-level zombies, lurking in the shadows and waiting for an opportunity, suddenly seemed to be provoked by something and emerged all at once.","Under the cover of darkness, they launched a counterattack.","Their target was none other than Yun Xiaoxiao and her group!","It was as if they had specifically targeted them.","At that moment, the group was just about to have dinner.","But Hua Bai suddenly stood up.","“Something’s coming from over there!”","With a grave expression, he quickly ran outside and looked toward the earthen wall in the distance.","Liu Xiaohui adjusted her glasses. “It’s zombies!”","Hearing this, everyone immediately jumped to their feet and rushed outside.","Just then, a deafening *boom* echoed as the earthen wall in front of them collapsed.","Immediately after, a horde of mid-to-high-level mutated zombies surged forward.","The weakest among them were high-tier Level 3, while the strongest were low-tier Level 6.","Individually, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group weren’t afraid of any single zombie.","The real problem lay in their overwhelming numbers—nearly a thousand of them!","In the past few days, even though they had encountered some high-level zombies, those were mostly scattered.","Even when they did gather, it was never in such large numbers.","Moreover, a single low-tier Level 6 zombie had already thrown Peng Shaowei’s group into chaos. Now, several of them had appeared at once.","And this was happening at night, the worst time to fight zombies!","Not everyone was as powerful as Yun Xiaoxiao or Lu Chen.","Many in their group were only of average strength, or even below average.","What’s more, they were the smallest of the five factions, with fewer than a thousand members in total.","Now, they had to face nearly a thousand mid-to-high-level zombies.","There weren’t even enough people to assign one zombie to each fighter.","And many of these zombies couldn’t be handled by a single person.","For example, a low-tier Level 5 zombie could easily take down several of their members.","Everyone instantly realized the gravity of the situation.","Their expressions turned grim.","Without hesitation, Yun Xiaoxiao fired a signal flare.","With so many high-level zombies, their group alone couldn’t handle it!","This wasn’t the time to play the hero—sometimes, you had to swallow your pride.","She could have escaped unscathed, but she couldn’t disregard the lives of everyone else.","At the same time, Peng Shaowei, Jiang Huai, Zheng Xin’er, and the Tang brothers, who had been resting, suddenly stood up upon hearing the three consecutive signal flares.","“Something’s wrong at Yun City!”","“Everyone, move out! Head to the Yun City camp immediately!”","“They’ve helped us so many times before. Now it’s our turn to repay them!”","“All units, move out!”","The members of the four factions quickly boarded their vehicles and sped toward Yun Xiaoxiao’s location.","Though they didn’t know the exact spot, they had a general direction.","Once they got close, the sounds of battle would guide them.","Countless vehicles raced through the dark, silent streets under the night sky.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao’s group had already engaged in combat!","Yun Xiaoxiao and the other barrier-wielding ability users stood at the front lines.","As the vanguard of the mutated zombies charged forward, they quickly erected barriers, blocking the rest of the horde.","Layer upon layer of barriers stacked up, halting the advance of most of the mutated zombies.","But these zombies weren’t pushovers. They relentlessly slammed against the barriers, trying to break through.","Meanwhile, the vanguard of over a dozen mutated zombies charged toward Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and the others who were waiting for them.","Among them were two Level 6 zombies and three Level 5 zombies!","Lu Chen and Ling Jing each took on one of the Level 6 mutated zombies.","Ci Wan, Zheng Yuner, Lei Ming, and others teamed up to deal with the rest.","While no one could handle a single zombie alone, they employed a swarm tactic.","One group would attack, then retreat, while another group stepped in.","They avoided putting themselves in danger while continuously dealing damage to the zombies.","Yun Xiaoxiao, meanwhile, focused on a high-tier Level 6 mutated zombie that had climbed to the top of the barrier.","In her past life, she had encountered many zombies of this level.","But in this life, she hadn’t faced one yet!","She couldn’t help but feel intrigued.","How long would it take her to take down a high-tier Level 6 zombie now?","Why not give it a try!","Her eyes burned with fighting spirit, like a raging flame, fierce and full of killing intent.","The zombie, resembling a slithering serpent, perched on top of the metal wall, glaring at her.","Then, with a piercing screech, it lunged at her with incredible speed.","Its movements were swift, its attacks ferocious. It was also a corrosive-type zombie!","Wherever its hands touched, a sizzling sound followed.","A closer look revealed that the area had already been eaten away, leaving behind a blackened, charred surface.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t dare to be careless.","She chose to fight from a distance, avoiding close combat.","Frigid ice spikes, brimming with power, shot toward the zombie like a storm.","But the zombie was formidable. Its body was as flexible and slippery as a snake, allowing it to dodge and slither to the other side of the wall.","It clung to the surface, circling around to Yun Xiaoxiao’s side.","But Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t foolish enough to stand still and wait for it to attack.","As it moved toward her, she instantly teleported to the other side.","As long as it couldn’t get close to her, it posed no threat.","In a way, it had met its worst match.","If it had encountered an ability user without teleportation or speed abilities, even someone of equal strength would have been at a disadvantage.","They might have eventually been overwhelmed.","But unfortunately for the zombie, it had run into Yun Xiaoxiao.","Someone even more slippery than itself.","After repeatedly failing to sneak up on Yun Xiaoxiao, the zombie was nearly driven mad with frustration.","It let out furious howls.","If Yun Xiaoxiao could understand zombie language, she would have known it was cursing her.","Luckily, she couldn’t.","So, only the zombie was left seething.","Yun Xiaoxiao, on the other hand, remained calm and composed.","She was like a hunting wolf, patient and calculating.","She continued to test and observe, waiting for the perfect moment to strike.","Finally, when the zombie lost all patience and became reckless, Yun Xiaoxiao knew her opportunity had arrived.","Whether it was a human or a zombie, once rage clouded their judgment, they were bound to reveal a weakness.","And that was when the hunter would make their move!"]},{"number":308,"title":"Chapter 308: The Little Zombie Has Appeared Again","paragraphs":["Sure enough, it didn’t take long for Yun Xiaoxiao to spot the flaw in her opponent.","This was the moment!","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes, her gaze filled with killing intent.","The instant the enemy peeked out from behind the wall, an ice spike shot straight into its head!","The ice spike had been launched while the creature was still sliding behind the wall.","It was as if Yun Xiaoxiao had predicted its exact movement, knowing precisely where it would emerge, and had already positioned herself there, waiting.","The moment it appeared, she struck with deadly precision, aiming straight for its vital spot.","\"Boom!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t have time to celebrate, as another wall was knocked down by the high-level zombies behind it.","While she and the others were busy dealing with the vanguard, the blocked zombies had already broken through several barriers.","Now, only one barrier remained, and they were about to break through completely.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly glanced over at Lu Chen and the others.","Fortunately, at that very moment, Lu Chen and Ling Jing had just finished killing the Level 6 high-level zombies in front of them.","Ci Wan and the others weren’t doing too bad either, having already taken out two-thirds of the remaining zombies.","The last third looked like it would be dealt with soon.","Yun Xiaoxiao understood the situation and decided to release a few more.","It wasn’t that she didn’t want to use oil and gas tanks to blow up the mutated zombies.","It was just that the gas tanks had been used up in the earlier battles.","There wasn’t much oil left either.","There would still be many situations where oil would be needed later, and if they used it all up now, they’d be in trouble later.","Besides, she had her own concerns.","Although these zombies were tough to deal with, with enough effort and the arrival of the other four factions, they could definitely handle them.","But burning them? That was a different story.","Most of the zombies they had burned or blown up before were mindless, low-level zombies.","These zombies weren’t strong, but their numbers were overwhelming.","If they didn’t deal with them early, not only would it be troublesome, but being surrounded by them would be terrifying.","As the saying goes, two fists are no match for four hands.","No matter how strong you are, if you get tired, you’ll eventually be overwhelmed.","That’s why they had decided to lure these numerous but weak zombies out of the city and kill them first.","This way, they could focus their energy on dealing with the more dangerous mutated zombies.","After all, the number of mutated zombies was limited.","But the incident where Ah Hao got injured had made her realize something.","Burning or blowing up these zombies also came with risks.","Even low-level zombies could evolve into terrifying, nearly invincible monsters.","What if burning or blowing up these already powerful high-level mutated zombies caused them to evolve into even stronger, more bizarre creatures?","That was hard to predict.","So Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t dare take that risk.","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was preparing to create new walls, the distant roar of car engines grew louder and closer.","Her eyebrows lifted in relief—reinforcements had arrived!","The next second, the zombie horde broke through the final barrier.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly conjured several ice walls to block the zombies again.","Then she moved to the rear of the zombie horde and created another ice wall.","Her goal was to prevent the reinforcements from being suddenly attacked by zombies before they even understood the situation.","Jiang Huai and Zheng Xin'er were the closest, arriving almost simultaneously.","Seeing everyone arrive in such a short time, Yun Xiaoxiao felt a warm sense of gratitude.","Almost everyone from their camp had come.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly explained the situation, taking less than a minute.","Though her words were brief, everyone understood what was happening.","\"So, we don’t need this many people. Just pick out those with strength at the peak of Level 3 high-tier,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said directly, wanting to avoid wasting time and unnecessary casualties.","Jiang Huai and Zheng Xin'er, being sharp-minded, immediately understood her intentions.","They quickly organized the combatants and had the non-combatants retreat.","This was both for their safety and to make way for Peng Shaowei and the Tang Brothers.","They also stationed people at the intersections to intercept and brief anyone from those two groups, saving time and allowing them to deal with the current threat more efficiently.","Once everything was ready, Yun Xiaoxiao removed the ice walls and released a portion of the zombies.","Not long after the battle began, Peng Shaowei and the Tang Brothers arrived with their people.","Now, the strongest members of the zombie-slaying army had all gathered here.","They were engaged in a fierce battle against the most powerful high-level mutated zombies in Rong City.","The night sky was pitch black, and the air was bitterly cold.","But in the silent city, the battle raged fiercely.","It wasn’t until around one or two in the morning that the battle finally ended.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief and felt a deep sense of relief.","This time, they had miraculously suffered zero casualties!","It was nothing short of a miracle!","With the battle won and no lives lost, everyone was overjoyed.","The empty streets echoed with laughter and cheers of celebration.","But no one knew that, on a tall building about two kilometers away,","a small figure was watching intently.","If Yun Xiaoxiao had been there, she would have recognized him—it was the small zombie that had escaped from her in Gong City, the one that held a deep grudge against her!","But now, his zombie-like face looked softer, more human-like.","Hearing the laughter and cheers in the distance, the small zombie clenched his fists, then relaxed them.","Then, under the cover of night, he leapt swiftly between the tall buildings, moving away from Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Finally, he left Rong City.","Yun Xiaoxiao was unaware of all this.","The next day,","they spent half a day cleaning up the remaining zombies in the city before tallying up the supplies and crystal cores and distributing them.","In the end, each base received dozens of truckloads of supplies.","Even the stragglers who had joined later got their fair share.","Although some of the supplies included expired food,","like expired rice and instant noodles,","no one complained.","After all, who knew how long this snowstorm would last?","Having something to eat was better than nothing—it could be life-saving in critical moments.","Who would complain about that?","They also handed over some of the zombie crystal cores to Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, who recorded them.","Yun Xiaoxiao then gave them the corresponding evolution fluid from Liu Xiaohui.","The transaction left everyone satisfied.","\"So, can we really buy food from your Yun City in the future?\" Wang Dahai asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and nodded. \"Of course.\"","\"But with this snowstorm, the roads might be blocked, making it hard to get to your place.\"","\"Don’t worry, we offer delivery. You just need to pay an extra 10% delivery fee.\"","\"...Heh...heh, that’s...that’s quite a good deal.\""]},{"number":309,"title":"Chapter 309: Help","paragraphs":["That evening, everyone held a simple celebration banquet.","It was also a farewell banquet.","Because the next morning, everyone would return to their respective bases.","As for those rescued in Rong City, they chose to stay.","Rong City was their hometown.","They were unwilling to leave their homeland and travel far away.","Naturally, everyone supported this decision.","Zhang Piaopiao and the people from her base were also preparing to leave the next day.","Zhang Piaopiao felt a bit reluctant.","She said it was a real pity she couldn’t fight with Yun Xiaoxiao every day.","As for Earth Traveler Sun and the others...","“From now on, you’re free to go wherever you want. But don’t go around stealing things anymore, or next time we meet, I won’t let you off so easily.”","After Yun Xiaoxiao finished speaking, Earth Traveler Sun and the others exchanged uneasy glances.","They had never imagined they would regain their freedom.","But now that they were suddenly free, they felt a bit lost.","A few of them nudged Earth Traveler Sun, giving him meaningful looks.","Their former leader had already died in the battle at Rong City.","Now, their group was like a ship without a captain, scattered and disorganized.","Being told to leave so abruptly left them unsure of where to go.","Receiving their hints, Earth Traveler Sun hesitated for a moment. Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao about to leave, he quickly spoke up.","“Little Base Leader, um... we don’t have anywhere to go. Can we follow you back to your base?”","As soon as he finished speaking, urgent shouts suddenly came from outside the museum entrance.","“Help! Where’s Ling Jing? Where is he? Hurry, save him!”","A man, looking frantic, dragged another man with a slight limp inside.","The limping man was in bad shape, his body trembling as if he were cold.","“If he’s injured, just find someone with healing abilities. Why are you looking for Ling Jing?”","Nie Yizhou, hearing the commotion, walked over with a puzzled expression.","Suddenly, his brow furrowed.","“Wait, he’s not injured—he’s been infected with the zombie virus, right?”","At his words, everyone stopped their laughter and turned to look.","“Weren’t all the zombies wiped out? Where did he get infected?” Tang Jun asked, his expression serious as he approached.","Both men were from his base.","If someone was infected, he couldn’t just ignore it.","Seeing everyone’s eyes on him, the man who had called for help quickly explained, “It’s like this. We went outside earlier... to relieve ourselves.","It was too dark, and he accidentally tripped over a brick, scraping his foot against the wall.","He thought it was just a scratch and didn’t think much of it.","But after a while, he started sweating profusely and said he felt unwell.","When I lit a lighter to check, I realized something was wrong.","The spot where he’d scraped his skin was bleeding!","And besides the blood, there was some yellowish, sticky fluid.","I rushed to check the spot where he’d tripped, and my heart sank.","There was a large pool of zombie blood and brain matter there!”","Hearing this, Tang Jun immediately drew a knife.","“Young Master Jun, what are you doing?!”","The man shouted in alarm, quickly stepping in front of the injured man.","Tang Jun remained calm. “He’s been infected. He’s going to turn into a zombie soon. We can’t let him live. He has to be killed.”","“No!”","The man roared, his emotions running high.","“He can’t die! He can still be saved! If Ling Jing is willing, he can turn him into a half-zombie. You can’t kill him!”","At this, Yun Xiaoxiao, Nie Yizhou, and the others all furrowed their brows.","How did he know about this?","Wasn’t the incident with Ah Hao strictly forbidden from being discussed or leaked?","“What does Ling Jing have to do with this?” Tang Jun was also confused.","Before the man could explain, he saw Ling Jing approaching.","Without hesitation, he rushed over.","“Ling Jing, isn’t it true that if you bite someone, you can turn a person infected with the zombie virus into a half-zombie? I’m begging you, save my brother. If you save him, I’ll do anything you ask.”","He pleaded desperately.","The infected man was his sworn brother, and he couldn’t just watch him die.","Ling Jing glanced at the injured man and shrugged.","“Sorry, it’s not that I don’t want to save him. It’s just that it’s too late now.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a loud growl erupted.","The injured man had completely turned into a zombie and lunged at Tang Jun, who was closest to him.","Tang Jun reacted instinctively, driving his knife into the zombie’s head.","*Thud!*","The man collapsed to the ground, lifeless.","“No!”","The man cried out in anguish, rushing over and falling to his knees.","“We promised to survive together!”","He wept bitterly.","Suddenly, he raised his bloodshot eyes and glared at Ling Jing.","“It’s all your fault! You could have saved him—why didn’t you?!”","“Are you insane? He’d already turned into a zombie. How could he have been saved?” Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but retort.","Though he wasn’t particularly fond of Ling Jing, he was still one of their group. This wasn’t his fault, and it wasn’t for an outsider to accuse him.","But the man seemed not to hear Nie Yizhou. He continued to cry and laugh hysterically.","“Hah, you said all the zombies were wiped out, didn’t you? I don’t think so!","There are still two right here!”","He pointed at Ling Jing and Ah Hao, laughing maniacally.","Then he rolled up his sleeve, revealing his bare arm, and rushed toward Ah Hao.","He shoved his arm toward Ah Hao’s mouth.","Sure enough, Ah Hao’s expression changed in an instant.","He opened his mouth wide, ready to bite.","“Ah Hao, don’t bite!”","Lei Ming and the others shouted in alarm.","Ling Jing also frowned and said softly, “Stop.”","As soon as he spoke, Ah Hao immediately calmed down.","“Hahaha, did you all see that? He wanted to bite me!”","The man laughed wildly, pointing at Ah Hao.","“He wants to eat raw flesh! Isn’t that what zombies do?","And him!”","He glared at Ling Jing.","“He can control zombies!”","Like a madman, he paced in front of everyone, ranting as he walked.","“Do you know what this means?","It means...”","Just as he was about to continue, a small figure suddenly appeared in front of him, her expression stern and icy.","“If you say one more word, don’t blame me for being ruthless.”","The man laughed bitterly. “Hah, don’t try to scare me. My brother’s already dead—what do I have to fear?","I know you people from Yun City are powerful.","What, do you really think the world revolves around you?","You can’t even handle the truth.","Feeling guilty?","You can kill me if you want, but if you do, you’re just using your strength to bully others!","With so many people here, I don’t believe there’s no one who will stand up for justice!”"]},{"number":310,"title":"Chapter 310: Ling Jing at the Forefront of the Storm","paragraphs":["As soon as the man finished speaking, several others stepped forward.","\"That's right, why not let him finish what he was saying?!\"","\"We also want to know, buddy, speak up boldly. With so many people watching, no one can act lawlessly here!\"","\"Exactly, if Ling Jing really has a problem, it concerns the safety of all of us. We have the right to know!\"","\"Right!\"","At this moment, everyone seemed to unite against a common enemy.","\"Tsk~\"","Suddenly, Ling Jing curled his lips into a faint smile.","He slipped his hands into his pockets and gazed leisurely at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Little one, let him speak. I’d like to hear what kind of nonsense he’ll come up with.\"","\"But...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows.","She was worried.","If Ling Jing’s secret were revealed to everyone, his situation would become extremely dangerous.","Even if he had no intention of harming anyone, people’s fear would push him into the spotlight, making him a target.","Ling Jing shook his head and chuckled lightly, \"It’s fine.\"","He appeared completely indifferent.","Besides, even if they wanted to stop it now, it was already too late.","If they tried to force the issue, these people would accuse the little one of bullying others with her authority.","By then, what was originally just about him would take on a different tone.","He didn’t care about himself, but he didn’t want to drag Yun Xiaoxiao or Yun City into this mess.","After all, he had always been alone, walking past the gates of the underworld countless times since he was a child.","If it weren’t for Yun Xiaoxiao, after taking revenge on his father’s family, he would have wanted to end it all.","If it weren’t for Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, and the others, who made him feel that life wasn’t as boring or meaningless as he had imagined, he wouldn’t have clung to this half-human, half-ghost existence.","Hearing Ling Jing’s thoughts, Yun Xiaoxiao’s frown deepened.","She was about to say that even if it meant turning against these people, she would protect him!","The people of Yun City—she could deal with them, but no one else could insult him!","But before she could speak, the man across from them took the initiative.","\"Since you’re letting me speak, I won’t hold back.","When you bite someone, they turn into a half-corpse. Half-corpses, like zombies, carry a virus inside them. They have an obsession with raw flesh and blood and possess a strong aggression.","Yet, you can easily control them, making them obey only you.","Right now, you only have one half-corpse by your side. But if the numbers grow, and you control them, doesn’t that mean you could dominate everything with just a word?","If even one of them enters a human settlement, it would spell disaster for everyone there.","Just like now, you and your puppet are wandering among us as if nothing’s wrong.","We’re completely defenseless against you.","What if he bites us while we’re asleep? Wouldn’t we be doomed?","And...\"","The man stared at Ling Jing.","\"I’ve heard you never eat with others. Three meals a day, every single day.","You can’t possibly not eat, right?","What exactly do you eat? Dare to tell us?","Your complexion is paler than most, and your eyes...","All of this makes me seriously suspect that you’re a hidden zombie!\"","His words were sharp, each sentence cutting like a knife, completely unlike his earlier pleading tone.","His speech caused most of the people around them to change their expressions.","The looks they gave Ling Jing were filled with scrutiny and fear.","They all knew, more or less, about Ling Jing’s strength.","If he really was a zombie and decided to attack them, most of them would undoubtedly die!","Their minds automatically conjured images of Ling Jing lunging at them, biting them.","The thought sent shivers down their spines, and they instinctively took a few steps back, their bodies tense with caution.","\"Bullshit!\" Xiao Feng glared at the man.","\"Everything you’ve said is just speculation. He’s never harmed anyone. In fact, he’s contributed a lot during the recent battles to defend the city. And now you’re using your wild assumptions to accuse him? Don’t you find yourself ridiculous?\"","\"Before danger strikes, it’s all just speculation. But once it happens, it’s an irreversible tragedy!\"","The man’s eyes reddened as he shouted back.","The scene fell silent for a couple of seconds.","Then, murmurs began to spread through the crowd.","\"He’s right, I think he has a point.\"","\"Ling Jing hasn’t explained himself. Does that mean what he said is true?\"","\"I don’t know, but there’s definitely something eerie about Ling Jing. He’s kind of terrifying.\"","The power of gossip was on full display at this moment.","\"Clap, clap, clap...\"","Just then, the sound of applause broke the silence.","Ling Jing suddenly burst into laughter.","\"Bravo, truly bravo. You’ve predicted everything I’m going to do. If I don’t live up to your expectations, wouldn’t you be disappointed?\"","He laughed so hard that tears nearly streamed down his face.","His demeanor was both sinister and unrestrained.","\"Oh, and by the way, you got one thing wrong. When I bite someone, they don’t become half-corpses. They turn into full zombies~\"","Everyone: !!!","In an instant, many people drew their weapons, aiming them at Ling Jing.","It was as if they were facing an extremely dangerous individual.","Their eyes were filled with intense wariness.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at Ling Jing disapprovingly.","Idiot, why say that now?!","Do you think they’re not scared enough of you?","Or do you think you’re not in enough trouble already?!","Though she cursed him in her mind, she immediately stepped in front of Ling Jing.","Her little pets, Xiao Keai and Xiao Huahua, were summoned.","Da Piaoliang and its beast squad also arrived.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s gaze turned icy, her aura overwhelming.","\"Who dares to touch him?!\"","Lu Chen quietly positioned himself to Ling Jing’s right.","Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, Mu Yang, Zheng Yuner, Ci Wan, Lei Ming, and the rest of the Yun City members also formed a defensive formation, shielding Ling Jing in the center.","Ling Jing’s expression softened slightly.","The darkness in his eyes faded, and a faint smile tugged at the corners of his lips.","\"Leader Yun, Ling Jing may be a member of Yun City, but he’s admitted to being a zombie. Such a dangerous individual shouldn’t be protected.","By killing him, we’re eliminating a potential threat to your base.\"","\"Has he ever killed an innocent person?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked coldly.","\"...No, he hasn’t.\"","\"Did he not contribute during the battles to defend the city?\" Yun Xiaoxiao pressed.","The man’s lips twitched, \"...He did.\"","\"Hmph, you’re all so amusing,\" Yun Xiaoxiao sneered. \"Because of the words of a murderer, you’re ready to exterminate someone who’s done no wrong and only contributed. How brave! Truly brave!\"","Hearing this, everyone was stunned.","What did she mean?","What murderer?","As Yun Xiaoxiao finished speaking, the man who had been so domineering earlier suddenly averted his gaze."]},{"number":311,"title":"Chapter 311: Who Is the Real Murderer","paragraphs":["\"Commander Yun Xiaoxiao, who are you talking about?\"","\"Who is the murderer?\"","Many people turned to look at Yun Xiaoxiao in surprise.","Why had a murderer suddenly been brought into the conversation?","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't answer, but instead raised her eyebrows and looked at the man who had first accused Ling Jing.","Everyone followed her gaze.","When they saw it was that man, they were all taken aback.","\"He's the murderer?\"","\"Who did he kill?\"","\"What's going on here?\"","Feeling all eyes on him, the man became uncomfortable.","But he knew that if he showed weakness now, it would be as good as a confession!","So, he maintained his composure and deliberately displayed anger at being falsely accused.","\"Commander Yun Xiaoxiao, you can't make such reckless accusations. You can't slander me just because I voiced my suspicions about Ling Jing!\"","Seeing that he wouldn't admit defeat until forced to, Yun Xiaoxiao gave a cold laugh.","Pointing at the corpse on the ground, she said, \"He didn't fall by himself. You injured him and deliberately smeared zombie blood and brain matter into his wounds!","Then, you waited until he started to transform and couldn't control his consciousness to tell the truth, before bringing him here.","This way, you could have him die in front of everyone and clear your name without anyone knowing.","You first called for help loudly, getting Ling Jing to come save him - you had already planned to divert everyone's attention and shift the blame.","As long as everyone focused their accusations on Ling Jing, no one would think about the truth behind this incident.\"","At first, she hadn't noticed anything unusual either.","But just now, when everyone started targeting Ling Jing, this man had unconsciously revealed a smile of success.","In his moment of pride, he had exposed his true intentions.","That's when she understood that today's events were all deliberately orchestrated.","The purpose was to use Ling Jing as a scapegoat, perfectly clearing someone else of their crimes!","It was indeed a clever plan, but also truly vicious!","The man was shocked internally, amazed that Yun Xiaoxiao had figured everything out!","Had this young girl been at the scene?","Had she seen everything?","No, that's not right - she hadn't exposed him at first, so she couldn't have known.","Yes, she doesn't know!","She must be guessing, trying to trick him!","And even if she did know, so what?","She has no evidence!","Having made up his mind, the man regained his composure.","He glared angrily at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"You're spewing lies! I didn't kill him. Don't try to shift attention away from Ling Jing by directing accusations at me!","You say I killed him - where's your evidence?","Throwing accusations without evidence is called framing! It's slander!\"","\"Heh, who says I don't have evidence?\" Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a sidelong glance.","Pointing at the corpse, she continued, \"We can just examine the injuries on his body to see if you beat him.","Besides, injuries from being beaten by a person look very different from zombie scratches or falling injuries.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled leisurely, her smile full of deeper meaning.","The man's heart skipped a beat, and before he could think of a way to stop it, Yun Xiaoxiao had already called someone over.","\"Aunt Long, please help examine the injuries.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, a capable-looking middle-aged woman stepped out from the crowd.","\"Aunt Long used to be the leader of the police special operations unit and has seen all kinds of criminal cases. Examining injuries on a body is certainly within her expertise.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao gave this brief introduction, then politely nodded to her.","\"I'll leave it to you.\"","But the man wouldn't have it, glaring with furious eyes.","\"She's from your Yun City, she'll just say whatever you want her to say!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao stroked her chin, \"In that case...\"","She looked around the crowd, \"Would anyone else with experience in examining injuries please come forward to help with the examination?\"","After she spoke, people looked at each other and began whispering among themselves.","Soon, someone stepped forward from the crowd.","It was a man around thirty-five or thirty-six years old.","He introduced himself, \"My name is Wu Da, I used to be a forensic pathologist.\"","Seeing him, the accused man tried hard to suppress his overwhelming joy.","Perfect!","With Wu Da here, he would surely speak in his favor!","Yun Xiaoxiao caught a glimpse of the man's expression.","Although he had hidden it well, she still noticed the flash of joy in his eyes.","Lu Chen saw it too, and warned,","\"We should find a few more people.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao had the same thought.","So, several more people were selected.","These people were all from other bases.","There were police officers, forensic experts, surgeons...","Once everyone was ready, they used a cloth to create a barrier around the corpse.","Then, the examining personnel went inside together.","Everyone watched the situation carefully.","Their eyes filled with curiosity and inquiry.","The wait seemed long.","After about twenty minutes, Aunt Long and the others finally came out.","\"How is it?\"","\"What's the result?\"","\"How did he actually die?\"","Everyone eagerly asked questions.","But Aunt Long and the others said they needed to check the scene of the incident.","Yun Xiaoxiao saw from the man's evasive eyes that he would definitely try something.","Sure enough, when it came time to point out the exact location, the man's attitude was suspicious.","Yun Xiaoxiao took the initiative, and in just a few words, left the man nowhere to hide, forcing him to indicate the true crime scene.","While he was still regretting this, Aunt Long and the others went to investigate.","They used flashlights to examine everything carefully.","Shortly after, Aunt Long and the others stood up.","Seeing everyone looking their way, Aunt Long gestured for the others to state their findings first.","After all, she was from Yun City.","If she spoke first, people might not trust her assessment.","It would be better to let others speak first, and she could add supplementary information.","They were all professionals, and their findings should be similar to hers.","It didn't matter who spoke first.","So, one of the former forensic pathologists began speaking first.","\"Looking at the victim's injuries, there are heavy impacts to the jaw, head, chest cavity, and abdomen.","Based on the severity of the bruising, these were inflicted recently.","Blood in the hair has been roughly wiped away.","The killer clearly tried to hide something.","The wound on the victim's ankle doesn't match the scrape marks on the wall at the crime scene.","Those wall marks must be from something else.","We found a bloody brick fragment nearby.","Judging by the color of the blood, it was recently stained.","That should be the weapon that caused the victim's ankle injury.","Additionally, we found a cigarette case.","The lower right corner of the case has two colors - black-red and light yellow.","Initial assessment suggests these are zombie blood and brain matter.\"","After he finished, another police officer added, \"Besides what my colleague mentioned about the cigarette case, I also found a faint fingerprint on the upper left corner.","With professional equipment, we could extract the fingerprint for comparison.\""]},{"number":312,"title":"Chapter 312: Escape from the Cloud City","paragraphs":["\"Also, everyone, look at the marks on the ground.\"","Following his gaze, under the beam of the flashlight, they could clearly see chaotic footprints scattered across the dusty floor.","In one spot, there were imprints of two figures overlapping each other.","\"From my years of investigative experience, there must have been a serious confrontation between two people here. During their fight, they both fell to the ground.\"","\"What does that prove?\" the man asked with a gloomy face. \"Even if people fought here and fell to the ground, how does that implicate me?\"","\"Who says it doesn't?\"","Aunt Long stepped forward.","She pointed at the ground with a serious expression. \"Everyone, look here.\"","She moved the flashlight closer.","The spot became more visible under the light.","\"Four fingers?\" someone asked puzzlingly.","\"Yes, four fingers!\"","Aunt Long grabbed the man who was trying to hide his right hand behind his back, raised his palm, and removed the prosthetic from his right pinky finger.","She placed the man's hand above the imprint – the shape and position of the missing finger matched perfectly!","Everyone gasped.","No further explanation seemed necessary.","If this was a coincidence, it was too perfect to be one!","But the man still defended himself, \"You can't just conclude it was me based on this alone. That's too arbitrary! I object!\"","\"Don't rush,\" Aunt Long gave him a cool glance.","She grabbed the man's right hand again.","She shone the flashlight on his sleeve.","There was a stain there.","\"What's that?\" someone asked.","Aunt Long replied: \"If I'm not mistaken, it's the victim's blood. We found a wound on the victim's head earlier with blood that had clearly been wiped away. We didn't find any bloodied cloth or anything around here, so I guess the killer must have hastily used their own clothes to wipe it off in panic.\"","\"You're just guessing!\" the man gritted his teeth. \"This stain on my clothes isn't blood, it's just something I accidentally got dirty with earlier.\"","\"Oh, really?\" Aunt Long smirked. \"Whether it's the victim's blood or not can be easily determined with a DNA test. Fortunately, Rong City has many hospitals and forensic departments, and we have professionals here. It wouldn't be difficult to verify. Shall we all go there now?\"","Aunt Long's words made the man freeze.","He was clearly panicking.","Because they seemed to have uncovered the whole truth.","He looked desperately toward Wu Da, who had been silent all this time.","But Wu Da avoided his gaze, and in the moment before looking away, there was hatred in his eyes.","The man's expression froze.","Then he began laughing like a madman, laughing until tears nearly came to his eyes.","\"Hahaha, I deserve this!\"","He looked at the cold-hearted Wu Da with profound disappointment.","Finally, his emotions could only manifest as bursts of laughter that seemed mixed with crying.","He and the deceased had indeed been good friends.","While fleeing, they had coincidentally met Wu Da.","The three of them had escaped together to a survivor shelter.","They always carried out various missions together.","Gradually, their relationships became complicated.","Recently, he discovered that his good friend, the victim, had also fallen in love with Wu Da.","He couldn't tolerate this!","Because he too was deeply in love with Wu Da!","And Wu Da had subtly expressed having feelings for him.","Tonight, when he planned to confront his friend and tell him to stay away from Wu Da, saying that he and Wu Da were meant to be together,","his friend actually claimed that Wu Da loved him instead.","This enraged him instantly.","The two began arguing.","As the argument heated up, neither could control their emotions, and they began fighting physically.","In the heat of the moment, he knocked the other person to the ground.","He had wanted to kill him right there, but worried about explaining it later, especially to Wu Da.","At that moment, he recalled people at the base talking about Ling Jing.","And his ankle had previously scraped against a corner.","A quick idea formed – he hastily picked up a broken brick and cut his friend's ankle, then smeared some zombie blood and brain matter on the wound.","After wiping the blood from the victim's head and face with his sleeve, he noticed the victim starting to shiver, likely beginning to transform.","Only then did he hurriedly drag the body back to where everyone was resting, staging the scene they had witnessed earlier.","But he never expected everything he did would turn out to be a joke!","Wu Da's earlier glance told him everything.","He didn't love him!","In fact, he despised him because of his friend's death.","It turned out his friend had been telling the truth.","Wu Da loved him instead.","Hahaha, how ridiculous.","He was truly ridiculous.","The man kept laughing, bending over with laughter, tears streaming down his face.","\"Yes, you're all correct, I killed him.\"","He stopped denying and openly admitted his crime and intentions.","\"But so what? Who hasn't killed someone in this apocalypse? He deserved to die, hahaha, he deserved to die!\"","He screamed with bloodshot eyes.","His crazed expression made everyone frown.","\"If I had another chance, I would... ugh!\"","Before he could finish, a knife plunged into his abdomen.","He looked up in disbelief at the cold-faced Wu Da, opened his mouth, but ultimately closed his eyes without saying anything.","Before his eyes closed, there was a hint of attachment in them, and also... hatred.","But finally, everything fell silent.","After killing him, Wu Da bowed to everyone.","Without saying a word, before anyone could react, he slit his own throat.","Blood immediately splattered everywhere.","He fell straight to the ground.","No one had anticipated this turn of events.","Everyone remained stunned for quite a while before coming to their senses.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the two corpses without comment.","Although she knew the whole story now.","But the dead should rest in peace, and whatever happened in the past should be left to drift away with the wind.","There was no need to discuss it and let the dead be gossiped about.","The truth had come to light anyway.","\"But even if he deliberately tried to use Ling Jing to divert our attention, what he said wasn't wrong. Ling Jing himself admitted that his bite turns people into zombies. That's a fact, and I think Yun City should give us all an explanation.\"","After everyone had calmed down, someone raised their concerns.","At that moment, a voice spoke from a dark corner.","\"This has nothing to do with Yun City. I declare that from today onwards, I, Ling Jing, completely separate myself from Yun City!","From now on, my personal actions and all my behavior have nothing to do with Yun City!\""]},{"number":313,"title":"Chapter 313: The Mole","paragraphs":["\"So, if you have any issues, come directly to me. Don't involve Yun City in everything.\"","After Ling Jing said this, everyone present, including Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, was shocked.","At this moment, Yun Xiaoxiao finally understood why Ling Jing had openly revealed that his bite would turn people into zombies.","As it turned out, he had planned this from the beginning!","He had been thinking about leaving before, and today's incident gave him the perfect opportunity.","He was simply going with the flow.","Given the current situation, even if they wanted to stop him, they couldn't.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned, looking at Ling Jing disapprovingly.","\"I disagree!\"","Her gaze was exceptionally determined, with a hint of stubbornness.","Then, she swept her eyes across the others.","\"Our base already has people researching a vaccine specifically targeting the zombie virus. We might have a cure before long.","With Ling Jing in Yun City, under our watch, you don't need to worry about him harming you.","If you insist on targeting him today, then Yun City will stand against you till the end!\"","Her voice was soft but filled with authority.","No one doubted the sincerity of her words.","The atmosphere instantly became tense.","At this moment, Zheng Xin'er tucked her long hair behind her ear and yawned.","\"Haven't we already said we're researching a virus vaccine? Everyone should show some mercy. Ling Jing has done so much to help kill zombies, and now you're calling for his head? Even those who abandon their helpers after using them aren't as ungrateful as you.\"","Jin Zhuyan also smiled, \"Yes, let me state Ren City Base's position first - as long as Ling Jing doesn't deliberately harm innocent people, we won't get involved. Right, honey?\"","She nudged Shen Tianlei.","Shen Tianlei quickly agreed, \"Yes, that's right.\"","\"Since the young leader of Yun City has given her guarantee, let's put this matter to rest,\" Peng Shaowei also spoke up.","His words carried significant weight.","Several smaller bases followed suit.","The Tang Brothers even left directly with their people.","Though they didn't say anything, their attitude was clear.","As prideful as ever.","Jiang Huai also stated, \"Our Rongsheng Base looks forward to Yun City developing the virus vaccine.\"","People from various bases gradually dispersed.","Only a few bases' representatives remained.","They looked at each other, wanting to say something, but seeing all the major bases leaving, they didn't know how to speak up.","If they wanted to demand an explanation from Ling Jing...","Any random person from Yun City could crush them, let alone asking for explanations - what were they thinking?","These people exchanged glances and finally left, albeit unwillingly.","Once everyone had left, Yun Xiaoxiao turned to look at Ling Jing.","A vine shot out, binding him completely.","Except for his feet which could still move, everything else was tied up tight.","Ling Jing smiled helplessly, \"Little one, what are you doing?\"","\"This is what you get for always trying to sneak away,\" Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a side-eye.","After spending so much time together, they had become friends.","And friends should face problems together.","She understood Ling Jing's concerns - he was afraid he might suddenly lose control over the toxin in his body and harm them.","But he was underestimating them.","Initially, he was able to take her away from under Lu Chen and others' noses because of his special physique.","He was naturally able to gain stronger abilities than others from the start.","But everything continues to develop and change.","Although he was still strong now, superior to many others,","she and Lu Chen weren't far behind.","In fact, if they were to fight now, she might be slightly more powerful than him.","If he truly lost control of himself, she and Lu Chen had the ability to subdue him.","Of course, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't completely disregarding the safety of others in the base.","However, letting Ling Jing go wouldn't be safer than keeping him close.","Someone as powerful as him, if he turned into a zombie,","He would definitely be a top-tier Zombie King candidate.","Letting him go would be like releasing a tiger back to the mountains.","Allowing him to grow stronger freely would eventually lead to an uncontrollable situation.","By then, even she might not be confident in dealing with him.","So, the best solution was to keep him here.","\"Our little one is so heartless,\" Ling Jing said 'heartless' but his tone was full of affection.","\"Haha, let's see if you dare to try running away again,\" Nie Yizhou teased.","Mu Yang also raised his eyebrows, \"We'll head back tomorrow. Maybe Old Zhong has made some progress.\"","Seeing everyone's concerned looks, Ling Jing's eyes flickered momentarily.","Then his lips curved into a smile.","This smile contained much more warmth.","Due to this incident, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others didn't return to the previous museum, but instead found another clean building to rest in.","However, before resting, Yun Xiaoxiao had one more thing to do.","That was to find out who had leaked information about Ling Jing!","The man from earlier wasn't from Yun City and hadn't stayed with them, yet he knew Ah Hao was a half-zombie.","This information had been classified at the time.","Moreover, the man had mentioned how Ling Jing didn't eat meals with them.","Only people who frequently stayed with them would know this.","So, there was a mole among them!","When Yun Xiaoxiao conducted a wide-scale investigation, she noticed someone acting suspiciously, their eyes constantly shifting.","After just a few questions, they revealed their true colors.","\"I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, I meant no harm, I was just curious and talkative, I couldn't help but say a few things when I met someone from my hometown, I really didn't know it would turn into this situation.\"","The person kept apologizing, confessing everything about how they had eavesdropped on Lei Ming and others' conversations and how they had leaked the information.","This person was one of Earth Traveler Sun's group.","After they were exposed, Earth Traveler Sun and others were terrified.","They feared Yun Xiaoxiao might implicate them in her anger.","Yun Xiaoxiao was indeed unhappy and immediately made that person slap themselves a thousand times.","The person, fearing Yun Xiaoxiao and others might kill them, hit themselves quite hard.","They kept apologizing while slapping.","Their attitude towards admitting their mistake was extremely good.","In the end, even with their mouth and hands bruised and bleeding, they didn't dare complain.","\"I'm really sorry, I promise I'll never gossip again, please let me go.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at them and waved her hand, \"You may leave.\"","Such a person wasn't even worth dirtying her hands to kill.","Besides, they had shown a good attitude in admitting their mistake, and even with their swollen mouth, they harbored no hatred towards her.","They hadn't actively started today's incident - guilty but not deserving death.","The thousand slaps were punishment enough.","Of course, driving them away was also a punishment.","In this freezing weather, without supplies and all alone, survival wouldn't be easy."]},{"number":314,"title":"Chapter 314: Farewell","paragraphs":["\"Little one, how about you let me go? I promise I won’t run away.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao and Ling Jing walked one after the other toward a room.","Ling Jing stared at the little figure standing in front of him and couldn’t help but laugh helplessly.","\"I’m a bit hungry. You’ve tied me up like this, so I can’t eat anything.\"","He gestured pitifully at his bound body.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him, noticing his bright smile and sincere expression.","Her little head immediately shook. \"No.\"","Ling Jing: ......","Was his smile not bright enough, or was his expression not sincere enough?","\"Can’t we negotiate?\"","\"Not until you give up the idea of sneaking away.\"","\"...I don’t want to leave anymore.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao rolled her eyes.","Her expression seemed to say, \"Do you really think I’d believe you?\"","\"Your hands are tied. Do you want me to feed you?\"","Nie Yizhou, always eager to stir up trouble, chimed in.","He winked at Ling Jing, his face full of teasing.","Ling Jing’s lips twitched. \"No need.\"","\"Then I’ll feed you,\" Lu Chen stepped forward.","Everyone immediately turned to look at him.","Bro, do you have to say something so creepy?","In the end, since having anyone feed Ling Jing felt incredibly awkward, Yun Xiaoxiao had no choice but to untie him.","\"Don’t even think about sneaking away.\"","\"Got it. You’re so talkative at such a young age. Be careful, or you might not find anyone to marry when you grow up,\" Ling Jing chuckled.","\"Who says I want to get married? These days, it’s trendy to stay single.\"","Ling Jing gave her a thumbs-up. \"Not bad. You’ve got the right mindset.\"","That night, nothing else happened.","Ling Jing stayed obediently in the room and didn’t bring up leaving again.","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t really keep him tied up forever.","Her earlier words were just to make it clear to Ling Jing that they genuinely wanted him to stay and to stop him from overthinking.","So, she untied him while he was eating.","However, that night, Ling Jing’s room was unusually lively.","Watching Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, and the others sprawled out on the floor, tossing and turning while snoring, Ling Jing rubbed his throbbing temples.","He really wanted to kick them out!","The next morning, as soon as the sky began to lighten, everyone was up and about.","Some were busy packing supplies into vehicles, others were checking the condition of the cars, and some took the opportunity to bid farewell to new friends they had met at other bases.","The entire street was bustling, filled with laughter and chatter, as if the good old days had returned.","\"Xiaoxiao, are you there?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was checking the front of a snowplow with Mu Yang when she suddenly heard Long Zhe’s voice.","She stepped out from beside the vehicle.","\"What’s up?\"","The moment he saw Yun Xiaoxiao, Long Zhe’s face flushed red.","He scratched his head. \"It’s nothing much. I’m about to head back to the base with my uncle, so I wanted to say goodbye before I left. Didn’t want to miss the chance later.\"","\"Oh, I see. Well... goodbye then~\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and waved her little hand.","Long Zhe was momentarily stunned, instinctively waving back.","\"Yeah, goodbye. Um...\"","\"Hey, Long, you’re here too? What a coincidence. Are you also here to see Xiaoxiao?\"","Before Long Zhe could finish, Shen Yan’s voice rang out.","Soon, his figure appeared at the end of the street.","His face was lit up with a bright smile, though it looked noticeably faker when he turned to Long Zhe.","Don’t be so obvious!","With Shen Yan’s playful interruption, Long Zhe didn’t get to finish what he wanted to say. Instead, Shen Yan started chatting nonstop with Yun Xiaoxiao.","In the end, Long Zhe checked the time and reluctantly said his goodbyes to Yun Xiaoxiao before leaving.","Watching Long Zhe walk away, Shen Yan’s smile grew noticeably brighter.","\"Xiaoxiao, where exactly is Yun City? Can I come visit you sometime?\"","\"Of course, you’re always welcome. But make sure to bring some crystals. Things aren’t cheap in our base.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yan immediately looked crestfallen.","His dad seemed pretty \"poor,\" with not many crystals to spare. The few he had were all spent on buying evolution serum from Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","Sigh...","Why couldn’t his dad be a bit richer, so he could mooch off him?","So frustrating...","So annoying...","\"Brat, so this is where you’ve been hiding!\"","At that moment, Jin Zhuyan walked over.","Her voice arrived before she did.","She grabbed Shen Yan’s ear and scolded, \"Didn’t I tell you to let us know where you’re going?","You just disappeared without a word. Do you have any idea how worried your dad and I were?","Just wait till we get home. I’m going to teach you a lesson!\"","\"Ouch! That hurts! Jin Zhuyan, be gentle! You’re going to rip my ear off!\"","Shen Yan clutched his ear, whining in pain.","\"Don’t be so dramatic. It’s not like your ear’s going to fall off from a little twist,\" Jin Zhuyan shot him a sideways glance.","\"And I’m your mom! If you call me Jin Zhuyan again, you can say goodbye to your other ear too!\"","With that, she tightened her grip a bit more.","Then, she turned to Yun Xiaoxiao with a completely different demeanor—friendly and warm, as if she hadn’t just been scolding Shen Yan like a fierce lioness.","\"Xiaoxiao, you’re welcome to visit Ren City anytime. I’ll cook something delicious for you.\"","\"Thank you, Auntie Jin. Your cooking is amazing. I loved the dishes you made last time.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, her dimples showing, her expression pure and innocent.","Her adorable appearance made Jin Zhuyan sigh in frustration.","Why couldn’t she have a sweet daughter like this?","Instead, she got stuck with this mischievous monkey!","Meanwhile, on the other side...","\"If you want to say goodbye, go ahead. There’s still some time.\"","Noticing Tang Yanchi repeatedly glancing toward Yun Xiaoxiao, Tang Jun spoke up casually.","However, Tang Yanchi reacted as if someone had stepped on his tail. He immediately bristled.","He turned his head away and lifted his chin proudly.","\"Who said I wanted to? I don’t want to!\"","Tang Jun gave him a skeptical look. \"Really?\"","Just a moment ago, he had clearly seen Tang Yanchi sneaking glances at Yun Xiaoxiao multiple times.","Especially when the other two boys were talking to her—his eyes had practically glued themselves to the scene.","\"Of course!\"","Tang Yanchi puffed out his chest, his tone full of pride.","Seeing this, Tang Jun decided not to push further.","He shook his head. \"Alright, as long as you won’t regret it. Just a reminder, after this, it might be a long time before you see her again.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Tang Yanchi’s shoulders visibly stiffened.","Tang Jun chuckled inwardly but didn’t call him out on it.","They were the first to finish preparing to leave.","As they passed by Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, Tang Jun deliberately slowed the car and rolled down the window facing Yun Xiaoxiao.","Sitting in the back seat, Tang Yanchi recalled Tang Jun’s earlier words. The moment he saw Yun Xiaoxiao, he wanted to call out.","But just as the words reached his lips, Yun Xiaoxiao turned and walked away.","He immediately pressed his lips together, his little face full of displeasure.","Hmph, whatever!","It’s not like he wanted to say goodbye anyway!"]},{"number":315,"title":"Chapter 315: Return Journey","paragraphs":["The various bases set off one after another.","Almost every base was equipped with a snowplow.","Of course, these weren't exactly standard snowplows.","After all, Rong City wasn't a place where it snowed heavily every day in winter—in fact, it rarely snowed at all.","So, the snowplows were modified by Mu Yang and other metal-element ability users.","They turned out to be even more efficient than regular snowplows.","Just last night, the snowfall had been heavier than usual.","By this morning, thick piles of snow had accumulated on the ground.","Without the snowplows, vehicles wouldn’t have been able to travel normally.","Bases like Yangcheng Base, Rongsheng Base, and others had managed to find helicopters.","So, their people were divided into two groups.","One group traveled by road, while the other took to the skies.","The massive convoy departed in waves, and the once bustling streets quickly returned to silence.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were already near Rong City.","By that evening, everyone had returned.","\"Ah, finally, we can get some proper rest,\" Nie Yizhou stretched and let out a big yawn.","The others didn’t say much, but when they saw the towering city walls in the distance, their expressions relaxed.","They were home!","During the time Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were away, the base had undergone significant changes.","Liu Yi, along with many others, had constructed a cluster of buildings on the open ground outside the base’s main gate.","They had upgraded the temporary reception area.","Now, there was a proper reception center with accompanying rest facilities.","The entire reception area was surrounded by high walls, so security wasn’t a major concern.","Moreover, the area was equipped with water, electricity, and gas.","These utilities were piped in from inside the base.","However, Liu Yi had noticed something strange.","Originally, he had planned to dig a tunnel underground to connect the pipelines between the base and the outside.","But when the workers dug down ten meters, they hit solid rock at the outermost edge of the base.","Thinking the foundation was just unusually deep, he ordered them to keep digging.","Even after digging twenty, then thirty meters, they still encountered nothing but solid rock.","Eventually, he gave up and decided to try drilling through the rock with an electric drill.","But he had underestimated the situation.","The rock was indestructible!","The drill couldn’t make a dent.","In the end, he had no choice but to run the utility lines over the top of the high walls.","That was how they finally managed to get water, electricity, and gas connected.","Meanwhile, Feng Jin and his team had made significant progress with greenhouse farming.","Now, even in such freezing weather, everyone could enjoy fresh vegetables they had grown themselves. It was a source of great joy.","Over at the livestock farm, many animals had given birth.","Although the base consumed fresh meat daily, the number of livestock had actually increased.","They lived comfortably in specially built warm shelters, leading leisurely lives.","Xie Youcai and his team were nearing the end of their coal mining efforts. In about a week, their work would be completely finished.","Inside the base, everyone was busy but orderly.","All the collected wood had been turned into charcoal.","The residential areas were now equipped with special heating systems designed for extreme cold.","Combined with air conditioning, even if temperatures dropped to minus sixty or seventy degrees, they wouldn’t have to worry.","The indoors would stay warm and cozy.","Grandma Niu’s flowers had all been moved into warm greenhouses.","Some had already bloomed into vibrant, beautiful flowers, adding a touch of life to the snowy winter landscape.","Some simple food processing factories had already started production, and the workers were full of energy.","New shops had also sprung up along the streets.","When Yun Xiaoxiao and her group returned, it happened to be everyone’s rest time.","So the streets were bustling with people strolling around, chatting, and enjoying snacks. The lively atmosphere almost felt like the bustling commercial streets before the apocalypse.","For Earth Traveler Sun and the others, who were visiting Yun City for the first time, it was like stepping into a whole new world.","From the moment they saw the base’s towering walls, they were in a constant state of awe.","Yes, Yun Xiaoxiao had brought them back.","Although their initial actions had been wrong, their experiences in battling zombies had brought about significant changes in both their skills and their mindset.","No one can go through life without making mistakes.","Since they had changed, there was no need to hold their past against them forever.","In the apocalypse, how many truly good people were left?","Besides, after Yun Xiaoxiao saved them, their loyalty to her had skyrocketed.","The worst among them had either died in the zombie battles or been eliminated by Yun Xiaoxiao’s group when they showed signs of betrayal.","So, those who remained were redeemable.","The base also needed more workers, so Yun Xiaoxiao decided to keep them all.","Mu Yang had his assistant take Earth Traveler Sun and the others to their assigned residences and register their skills for future job assignments.","Aunt Long, the Hua Brothers, and the others already had their living arrangements sorted.","Once back at the base, they all went to rest.","After such a long and exhausting journey, they could finally relax.","\"Hey, isn’t this the scene from when we first attacked Danhong County?\" Tao Mi'er exclaimed, standing in front of a large electronic display on the street.","The screen showed streets packed with zombies.","They were hideous and terrifying, emitting eerie growls that sent chills down the spine.","Then, the scene changed.","The zombie-slaying army entered the county, with several teams spreading out into different streets.","The sounds of battle erupted as countless zombies were killed, but many people were also bitten and killed on the spot.","The bloody scenes were horrifying to watch.","The video was quite long, featuring footage from their attacks on Danhong County and other places.","All the shots were taken from above, likely by drones.","\"You guys are really amazing!\" Tao Mi'er said, just as a passing auntie chimed in.","She watched the video and sighed, \"When we first saw this, we were absolutely stunned.","We already thought zombies were terrifying, but seeing it like this made it so much more real.\"","Soon, a small crowd had gathered around.","\"Yeah, living in Yun City is so peaceful. If it weren’t for this video, I’d almost forget how dangerous the outside world is.\"","\"It’s hard to imagine what we’d do if we hadn’t come to Yun City and had to face those terrifying zombies.\"","\"Exactly, exactly.\"","This video had been part of Yun Xiaoxiao’s plan from the beginning.","During their attacks on the cities, she had used drones to record everything from above.","When Mu Yang came to deliver supplies, she handed him the recording device and had him edit the footage to play on a loop on the streets."]},{"number":316,"title":"Chapter 316: The Base Upgrades Again","paragraphs":["The purpose was to keep those in the base vigilant and mindful of danger.","At the same time, to make them understand.","Their current comfortable life was paid for with the blood and flesh of many others.","Lest they become too comfortable in their safe environment and start believing that all is well with the world.","Self-deception would make them numb and naive, potentially giving rise to thoughts they shouldn't have.","---","When Yun Xiaoxiao returned to the base with Big Beauty and its followers, they immediately became the center of attention.","Everyone was shocked to see so many zoo animals at once.","These were the kind of animals that would normally be kept behind iron bars due to their aggressive nature.","Yet now they were quietly queuing up, following behind their small base leader, moving forward slowly step by step?!","It was absolutely incredible!","The scene was both adorable and terrifying at the same time.","Yun Xiaoxiao paid little attention to everyone's surprised and curious gazes.","She had anticipated such a reaction before bringing Big Beauty and the others back.","The reason she didn't simply store them in her space","Was because many people knew of their existence, and having them suddenly disappear would seem unreasonable.","So, she led them to the hillside.","There was a large meadow behind the cottage, which she thought would be perfect for them to live.","After settling everything, Yun Xiaoxiao finally returned to her room.","As soon as she closed the door, she entered her space.","She hadn't been in there for a while.","Upon entering, she encountered Big White who was huffing and puffing while carrying baskets.","The baskets were full of fresh tangerines.","Yun Xiaoxiao casually took one and tasted it.","Hmm, quite sweet!","\"Keep up the good work, Big White, I believe in you~\"","Yun Xiaoxiao winked at Big White, her eyes curved in a smile.","Big White paused for two seconds, lowered its head, and continued huffing and puffing with the baskets.","Yun Xiaoxiao ate the tangerine while looking at the space packed full of supplies.","And in the open area, there were countless livestock.","Also...","A large patch of green fruit seedlings.","The seedlings were covered in small red fruits.","They were only about the size of a fingertip, similar to strawberries but different.","They were some kind of small fruit she couldn't name.","These small fruits could enhance abilities like evolution liquid.","She had discovered these when meeting Liang Chao's group at the foot of the mountain while picking up Xie Youcai.","At that time, Yun Xiaoxiao had taken many of them.","Initially, there were only seedlings, but after this period, they had grown so many small fruits.","She immediately squatted down and picked one to taste.","It didn't have much flavor, but it wasn't unpleasant either.","She ate many in succession.","Gradually, she could feel a warm current flowing through her body.","However, possibly due to her already high power level, these fruits didn't have much effect on her.","Still, it was better than nothing.","Besides, she could sell them, couldn't she?","Given the current flow rate in the space, the fruit harvest would definitely be substantial.","In high spirits, Yun Xiaoxiao summoned the self-service shopping machine.","The zombie battle had brought her quite a harvest.","The crystal cores were stored in gunny sacks.","Some were obtained by them, others were traded for evolution liquid and supplies from other bases.","She threw them one by one into the points conversion hole.","She became numb from the repetitive motion, yawning repeatedly.","However, watching the points rapidly increase kept her drowsiness at bay.","\"Big White, bring a small stool and table.\"","\"Big White, get some fried chicken and fries.\"","\"Oh right, Big White, don't forget some fruit.\"","\"Big White...\"","Big White diligently prepared everything Yun Xiaoxiao requested.","Yun Xiaoxiao also took out her tablet and stand, playing a comedy movie she had previously downloaded.","She ate, watched, and mechanically threw crystal cores.","Multitasking at its finest.","Due to the large number of crystal cores, it wasn't until the movie was almost over that all of them were converted into points.","Looking at the point count on the display screen, Yun Xiaoxiao smiled with satisfaction.","She immediately clicked the base upgrade button.","[Ding! Congratulations host, the base has been upgraded again!","Level One Aerial Defense!","From now on, an invisible barrier will automatically form above the entire base.","Any objects that could fall into the base from above will be automatically intercepted.","If anything launches an attack on the base from the airspace, the system will launch a counter-attack.]","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!","How amazing is that?!","\"So does that mean those mutated flying creatures can't fly into the base anymore?\"","[That's correct, host.]","Yun Xiaoxiao was shocked.","Her biggest worry was now resolved!","\"Can rain still fall through?\"","[Yes, naturally occurring wind, rain, snow, and sunlight can still pass through normally.]","Hearing the system's words, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","It would have been better if it could block rain too.","There would be acid rain later...","Oh well.","This was good enough already.","You can't expect everything to be perfect.","As for the acid rain, they'd deal with it when the time came.","Worst case scenario, they could just have everyone stay indoors.","After upgrading the base, Yun Xiaoxiao converted all the crystal cores into evolution liquid.","Only then did she lie down to rest, yawning continuously.","A month passed after returning to the base.","During this month, the weather became even more severe.","Now, if people wanted to go outside, they had to wrap themselves in multiple layers.","The cold wind and flying snow stung their faces.","Every early morning in the base, someone would drive a snow plow to clear the roads.","If they didn't plow, people's entire calves would sink into the snow with each step.","Even taking one step would be extremely difficult.","Xie Youcai and his team had already completed their mining task.","Jin Xiaoqing and her brother had also brought their parents to the base.","Originally, their parents didn't want to come.","But the extreme cold weather was too harsh, and Jin Xiaoqing's mother had fallen seriously ill from the cold.","So finally, they had no choice but to come down from the mountain to Yun City.","After treatment from Ye Shuyuan and others, Jin Xiaoqing's mother gradually recovered her health.","Notably, among the group that came with Earth Digger, there were several doctors.","There were internal medicine doctors who specialized in treating colds and fevers, as well as surgeons who treated injuries and trauma.","Presumably, they had also encountered that unscrupulous leader when they were desperate,","And were forced by circumstances to do things against their conscience.","Despite the harsh weather, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others hadn't slackened.","They built a large indoor sports arena.","Every morning, everyone in the base would be taken there for training.","Lu Chen and Xiao Feng would be responsible for teaching combat techniques.","Despite the cold weather, everyone would work up a sweat.","The feeling was incredibly refreshing.","Of course, it was also incredibly exhausting."]},{"number":317,"title":"Chapter 317: Happy Birthday, Yun Xiaoxiao","paragraphs":["During this month, Zhong Mingsheng and his team made some progress in their research.","Although they hadn't fully developed a vaccine against the zombie virus, they had created an inhibitor.","This inhibitor could delay the onset of the zombie virus in the body.","They conducted experiments using viral cells and proved its effectiveness.","Ling Jing and Ah Hao both received injections.","After the injections, Zhong Mingsheng and his team collected fresh blood samples from both of them for further analysis.","Research showed that the zombie virus cells in both their bodies had developed an additional transparent membrane, as if the virus cells were encapsulated.","This discovery excited everyone.","With the inhibitor, even if someone contracted the zombie virus in the future, an injection would prevent them from turning into a zombie immediately.","This could be a life-saving solution in crucial moments!","Days passed one by one.","On this particular day, Yun Xiaoxiao went about her usual routine of exercising, eating, and inspecting various parts of the base.","After a busy day, she returned to her room.","She took out a birthday cake with the number '6' written on it from her spatial storage.","Time had passed so quickly, without her even noticing.","In the blink of an eye, she had turned six years old.","She took out six candles, placed them on the cake, and lit them one by one.","\"Yun Xiaoxiao, happy birthday! You're another year older.\"","She smiled softly, clasped her hands together, and closed her eyes, ready to make a wish.","\"Hmm... what should I wish for?\"","When it came time to make a wish, she hesitated, unsure of what to wish for.","She had food, clothes, and decent abilities...","Just as she was thinking, there was a sudden knock at the door.","\"Kid, are you in there?\" Nie Yizhou's voice came from outside.","\"Yes, what is it?\" Yun Xiaoxiao looked toward the door.","\"I have something to tell you. Could you come out for a moment?\"","\"...Alright, coming.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the cake before getting up and walking to the door.","The door opened slightly.","She looked at Nie Yizhou standing in the doorway.","\"What do you want to say?\"","Nie Yizhou said mysteriously, \"It's not convenient to talk here. Come with me, let's go outside.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked around, confused.","How was it not convenient to talk here?","On this floor, only she and big brother lived here.","Moreover, big brother's door was closed, and there was no one around.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao's confusion, Nie Yizhou continued, \"I really have something very important to tell you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at him but couldn't read anything from his expression.","She could only say, \"Fine... let's go then.\"","She went back to get a thick coat and followed Nie Yizhou out.","Nie Yizhou happened to notice the large cake on the table.","His eyes flickered for a moment.","Then he casually turned his gaze away.","They went downstairs together and came outside.","They walked along the path to the left of the building for a while.","Until they were almost at the bottom of the hillside.","\"Are we not there yet?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow slightly.","What exactly did he need to say?","Why did they have to come out to this cold, snowy place, and at night no less.","\"Almost there, almost there.\" Nie Yizhou chuckled.","While laughing, he secretly looked around.","Suddenly, his eyes lit up.","He turned around and pointed to the sky.","\"Kid, look over there.\"","He said with a face full of smiles.","Following his gaze, Yun Xiaoxiao looked up.","\"Bang!\"","At that moment, there was a sudden explosion in the sky.","A brilliant firework rose into the air, golden and beautiful like a lovely daisy.","Then, continuous fireworks kept bursting forth, sometimes red, sometimes blue, creating a colorful display that lit up the entire night sky.","It was then that Yun Xiaoxiao saw large characters written in the snow at the bottom of the hillside.","'Xiaoxiao, Happy Birthday!'","Behind these words were many dolls and flowers.","In front was a huge six-tiered cake.","Around all of these items was a large circle.","At this moment, along with the blooming fireworks, this circle continuously emitted brilliant beams of light.","Together with the fireworks in the sky, it created a breathtaking scene.","In the illumination of the fire, Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and others all silently appeared from various directions.","Everyone's face was beaming with warm smiles.","\"Kid, happy birthday!\"","Nie Yizhou said with a grin, pulling out a small box from his pocket.","The box was decorated with a beautiful butterfly bow.","\"Here, your birthday present.\"","He held the box out to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"From now on, don't celebrate your birthday alone. Don't forget, you have us now.\"","Ling Jing also came over and gave Yun Xiaoxiao his prepared gift.","Then, Lu Chen, Xiao Feng, Mu Yang, Zheng Yuner, Ci Wan, and others all came forward.","They gave their gifts while offering birthday wishes.","Yun Xiaoxiao's hands were full with all the presents.","Because... everyone from the entire base had come!","She remained in a dazed state throughout.","\"Haha, are you surprised, are you amazed?\"","Nie Yizhou smiled mischievously.","\"Did you not expect us to celebrate your birthday?\"","Knowing that Yun Xiaoxiao could read people's thoughts, he had been careful not to think too much the whole time.","It had been quite a struggle for him along the way.","\"How did you know...\"","\"You're wondering how we knew today was your birthday?\" Mu Yang smiled gently.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded blankly.","Mu Yang: \"Remember when you asked me to modify your car?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Well, I don't know if you ever looked in the storage compartment in front of the passenger seat.","Your birth certificate was in there.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: ......","This... she had never actually looked.","She had only used the car as a zombie-killing battle vehicle.","She had never searched to see what else was in the car.","However, she hadn't expected her birth certificate to be so casually stored in a car.","But regardless, she was very happy today.","Finally, she had people to celebrate her birthday with!","And so many people at that.","The fireworks continued for a full half hour before ending.","Everyone from the base, wearing thick clothes, woolen hats, and gloves, danced around the newly lit bonfire.","The atmosphere was very lively.","Everyone in the base was like one big close family, laughing and having fun.","However, when it came time to cut the cake, there was a big joke.","The cake had frozen solid!","They couldn't even insert the candles.","So, everyone quickly made a huge snow cake instead and put the candles on that.","It turned out to be quite a unique experience.","When the candles were lit, everyone shouted in unison.","\"Yun Xiaoxiao, happy birthday!\"","The loud voices pierced through the night sky, echoing throughout the entire base."]},{"number":318,"title":"Chapter 318: Gone","paragraphs":["This time, Yun Xiaoxiao had a truly meaningful birthday celebration.","On a freezing snowy day, in the dark of night.","The temperature was cold, but hearts were warm.","After that day, the weather became even worse.","The whole world was covered in snow, turning into a vast white expanse.","Life in Yun City, thanks to Yun Xiaoxiao's advance preparations, continued in an orderly fashion.","Except for the cold when going outside, everything else seemed normal.","But other places were different.","It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say they were in dire straits.","The freezing weather, scarce resources, and shortage of medicine made every second and minute extremely difficult to endure.","Some people hid in their homes, used up their last firewood, and froze to death.","Some people, faced with a snow-covered world, were helpless, couldn't find food, and starved to death.","Some people who initially only had a small cold, but without proper medicine, their condition worsened into pneumonia or even worse.","In the end, they could only die tragically.","Scene after scene of despair played out in different regions.","People were dying almost every day.","Due to resource shortages, conflicts over supplies between different groups and bases gradually began.","A new round of silent warfare quietly started.","During this time, Yun Xiaoxiao and her people kept their promise, delivering supplies and evolution fluid to bases that needed them.","Because some places were far away, a single delivery could take several days round trip.","And there were many places that needed supplies.","So, Yun Xiaoxiao formed many small teams.","Of course, each team had powerful individuals in charge.","This reduced the occurrence of unexpected situations.","Yun Xiaoxiao also gave these team members many generous rewards.","Such as evolution fluid suitable for improving their abilities, or points for purchasing supplies.","So, everyone was very willing to make deliveries.","One day.","While Yun Xiaoxiao was \"sparring\" with Lu Chen, Tao Mi'er came running over.","\"Young Base Leader, the radio station staff just received a message from a place called Blue Sea Orphanage requesting help.","They asked me to check if you want to respond?\"","Tao Mi'er waited until Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen finished their match before speaking.","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao paused.","Blue Sea Orphanage?","Suddenly, her eyes lit up.","She remembered!","It was the place she had encountered when collecting supplies at the dock earlier.","At that time, she had left them a small radio.","She told them to contact Yun City if they needed help.","\"What did they say?\" she asked.","Tao Mi'er replied: \"They said someone is seriously ill and needs urgent medical treatment.\"","Upon hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao immediately headed toward the hospital.","Since she had promised to help before, she couldn't go back on her word.","So, she went to find Ye Shuyuan and asked her to bring two other doctors along.","Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, and Ling Jing had all gone to deliver supplies.","Lu Chen and Mu Yang had their own previously arranged tasks, so Yun Xiaoxiao went with Zheng Yuner, taking Ye Shuyuan and the others with them.","Due to the snowy weather, the helicopter had to fly very low.","However, this helicopter had been modified by Mu Yang.","Its shell had an automatic heating function that melted the ice and snow covering it, so it wouldn't affect normal flight.","By the next afternoon, they finally arrived at Blue Sea Orphanage, located on a seaside hillside.","When they saw Yun Xiaoxiao and her group appear, the Mother Superior and others looked on in disbelief.","Originally, they had only tried sending the message with hope but didn't expect Yun City to actually send anyone.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao had left them with an impression of being very capable, with maturity beyond her years.","But she was still very young.","Moreover, they had only met once as strangers.","Plus, Yun City was so far away from them.","But unexpectedly, Yun Xiaoxiao really came with help.","This left them both surprised and deeply moved.","\"Mother Superior, who is sick?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","The Mother Superior finally came to her senses and hurriedly answered, \"All the younger children in the orphanage are sick.\"","As she spoke, her brows were tightly knitted.","Her tone carried worry and self-blame.","\"It's all my fault for not taking it seriously at first, thinking it was just a common cold when only Yi Nuo was coughing.","He didn't have a fever or runny nose, so I thought he just had some internal heat and only tried to cool him down.","But unexpectedly, his cough got worse and worse.","Then he started running a high fever.","At the same time, other children started coughing and developing fevers too.","The situation spiraled out of control.","Yesterday, Yi Nuo became delirious and fainted several times, burning up with fever.","The fever medicine we gave him didn't work.","We don't have any doctors here and didn't know who else to turn to, so we could only think of asking for your help.\"","As she spoke, the Mother Superior's eyes turned red.","It was clear that she was genuinely worried about the children.","At the same time, she was continuously blaming herself.","\"Can you take us to see them first?\" Ye Shuyuan asked calmly.","She naturally had a cold and detached air about her.","Of course, this demeanor also made her appear more composed.","\"And you are?\" Mother Superior looked at Ye Shuyuan questioningly.","Yun Xiaoxiao introduced her, \"This is Dr. Ye.\"","Upon hearing the word \"doctor,\" the Mother Superior and Tang Lu behind her lit up.","\"That's wonderful! Dr. Ye, please help our children!\"","The Mother Superior said excitedly.","Ye Shuyuan nodded, \"Let's assess the situation first, we'll do our best.\"","\"Yes, yes, please come in.\"","They quickly cleared the way.","Ye Shuyuan and the other two doctors hurried inside with their medical kits.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao was stopped.","The Mother Superior said with concern, \"Xiaoxiao, you're young, and this illness only seems to be spreading among children. It's better if you don't go in, it wouldn't be good if you got infected.\"","\"...Actually, I'm very healthy.\"","With spirit spring water and evolution fluid, her constitution wasn't comparable to ordinary children.","But the Mother Superior didn't know this, she just thought it would be dangerous for Yun Xiaoxiao to go inside.","To avoid worrying them, Yun Xiaoxiao agreed to stay outside.","While waiting and feeling bored, she heard a huge sound from not far away.","\"Sister Yuner, wait here, I'll go check it out and come right back.\"","\"Let me come with you,\" Zheng Yuner said worriedly.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and shook her head, \"It's fine, I'm just bored. I'll just take a look and come right back.\"","The next morning.","Just as Mu Yang arrived at the office building, someone came running frantically, almost bumping into him.","\"Why such a panic?\" He frowned at the person.","Seeing it was him, the person anxiously said, \"Something terrible has happened, Brother Yang, the Young Base Leader has disappeared!\""]},{"number":319,"title":"Chapter 319: Where Exactly Is It","paragraphs":["\"What did you say?\"","Mu Yang asked again uncertainly.","\"What do you mean she's gone?\"","The man hurriedly explained, \"We just received a message from Blue Sea Orphanage. They said that after the little Commander left yesterday, she never came back.","They've searched everywhere nearby but couldn't find any trace of her.","Even this morning, there's still no news of her.","They're very worried that something might have happened to the little Commander.\"","Upon hearing this, Mu Yang froze.","He took a deep breath, trying to maintain his composure.","It can't be, the little one is so capable, nothing bad could have happened to her.","She must have been delayed by something and couldn't make it back in time.","He tried to comfort himself, but his shoulders were trembling slightly.","He turned and walked outside.","Walking faster and faster, until finally, without caring about his image, he broke into a run.","He found Lu Chen who was busy, then they found Liu Xiaohui and Han Bing, and hurriedly took off in a helicopter heading south.","Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng were returning in another helicopter.","From high up, they saw Lu Chen and Mu Yang boarding a helicopter together.","\"Hey, why are Brother Chen and Brother Yang leaving together?\"","Nie Yizhou stretched his neck curiously, trying to look down at an angle.","\"Could it be that business at the base is so good that even they both need to go out?\"","Shortly after, the two of them landed.","Nie Yizhou looked toward a worried-looking man.","\"Hey, brother, do you know where my Brother Chen and Brother Yang went?\"","The man looked up - it was the same man who had worked at the radio station before.","At this moment, there was panic in his eyes.","\"The little Commander has disappeared, they went to look for her.\"","Upon hearing this, both Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng's expressions changed simultaneously.","\"What did you say? The little one is missing!\"","Nie Yizhou stared in disbelief with widened eyes.","He grabbed the man's collar, \"What exactly happened? Explain clearly!\"","The man hurriedly explained the whole situation from beginning to end.","Before he could finish, the impetuous Xiao Feng had already jumped onto the helicopter.","Nie Yizhou was also anxious, but he still waited to get the exact address from the man before hurriedly boarding the aircraft.","Just as they were about to start up, Ling Jing and the Hua brothers returned from their mission.","\"Where are you going?\" Ling Jing asked.","Nie Yizhou waved at him, \"No time to explain, get on quickly.\"","Ling Jing frowned but seeing the anxious expressions on Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng's faces, he didn't ask anything more and immediately boarded.","The helicopter took off again, flying into the distant sky.","They arrived at Blue Sea Orphanage one after another with Lu Chen's group.","\"What exactly happened?\"","They found Zheng Yuner, Ye Shuyuan, and the others.","It was obvious that Zheng Yuner and Ye Shuyuan hadn't slept the previous night - they had dark circles under their eyes and looked completely exhausted.","Zheng Yuner spoke with a hoarse voice, \"That day, while Doctor Ye and the others were inside examining the children, Xiaoxiao and I were waiting outside.","After a while, there was suddenly a huge noise in the distance.","Xiaoxiao said she'd go check it out.","I wanted to go with her, but she told me to keep waiting here, saying she'd be right back.","But we waited until dark and never saw her again.","We were worried something had happened to her, so we went together in the direction of where we heard the noise.","But after searching all night, we couldn't find her.","We wanted to keep searching, but ahead there's a large city.","It's full of zombies.","Besides, we weren't even sure if Xiaoxiao was in that city.","We had no choice but to send a message back to the base.\"","Even with her included, their combat strength wasn't strong enough.","Searching for someone in a city full of zombies would be like moths flying into flames.","They probably would have been devoured by zombies before finding Yun Xiaoxiao.","It wouldn't have accomplished anything and would have resulted in needless sacrifices - the cost would have outweighed any potential benefit.","So, they could only seek help.","This way, the chances of finding Xiaoxiao would be greater.","Upon hearing this, Lu Chen and the others' expressions became very grim.","They had faith in Yun Xiaoxiao's abilities.","Even if she were alone in a city full of zombies, she could move about freely.","But counting the time it took them to get here, she had been missing for almost two days and two nights!","She wasn't the type of person who would make others worry.","Even if something prevented her from returning, she would definitely let them know first, not leave so many people anxiously worried about her.","The fact that she hadn't sent any message and hadn't returned meant she must have encountered trouble she couldn't escape from!","Yun Xiaoxiao's abilities were unfathomable - even they weren't confident they could defeat her.","What could possibly be powerful enough to trap her and prevent her from getting away?!","Everyone's hearts were in turmoil, extremely worried.","\"Where is this place you mentioned? Take us there.\" Lu Chen spoke with a cold expression.","He usually had a cool demeanor, but now with his cold expression, he gave off an even stronger 'keep your distance' vibe.","So, the group hurriedly boarded the helicopter again, flying at low altitude under Zheng Yuner's guidance.","While flying, Nie Yizhou kept calling out Yun Xiaoxiao's name through a megaphone.","\"See anything?\"","Ling Jing looked toward Hua Bai and Liu Xiaohui.","One had eagle eyes, and the other could see through basic obstacles.","But both of them shook their heads repeatedly.","One week later.","Lu Chen and the others, now with scraggly beards, stood heavily on a mountaintop.","They gazed silently at the massacred city below.","Their eyes were bloodshot and had dark circles underneath - clearly showing signs of sleep deprivation.","The gentle wind tousled their already messy hair, making it even more disheveled.","After a long while, Nie Yizhou asked in an unprecedentedly low voice.","\"What should we do now?\"","They had been searching for an entire week - inside and outside the city, thousands of miles in all directions, they had searched everywhere, almost turning the earth upside down, but still couldn't find Yun Xiaoxiao.","This made everyone's mood very heavy.","\"If we can't find her, we keep searching until we can't move anymore.\"","Lu Chen stared into the distance, his voice deep, his gaze determined.","\"If we can't find her here, we'll expand our search area. I refuse to believe we won't find her even if we search the entire eastern region!\"","\"Yes, Brother Chen is right, let's continue searching!\"","Everyone seemed to have made some kind of resolution.","\"However, someone needs to watch over the base. Mu Yang, you should go back,\" Lu Chen looked at Mu Yang.","Mu Yang's face showed conflict - he didn't want to go back, he wanted to stay and search too.","But Yun City was also the little one's heart and soul - if she came back to find Yun City in decline, she would definitely be unhappy.","Yun City must be protected!"]},{"number":320,"title":"Chapter 320: Where Is She","paragraphs":["After a long silence, he finally spoke with difficulty.","\"Alright, I'll go back.","Take care of the little one for me.","You must promise me that you'll bring her back safely!\"","Their eyes met, and in each other's gaze, they saw an unyielding determination.","\"Alright!\"","They refused to believe that Yun Xiaoxiao had met with an accident.","They were convinced that she was trapped in some unusual situation and was still alive.","As long as she was alive, they would see her again someday!","---","At the border between the central and eastern regions, there was a range of mountains.","Among these mountains stood a peak shaped like a giant serpent.","At the base of the peak flowed a mountain stream, though it had now frozen solid.","On the left side of the stream, hidden beneath a large tree on the cliff, was a cave.","Inside the cave was a giant eagle.","At that moment, it was dozing.","In its nest of dried grass lay a human girl.","The girl's eyes were closed, her face pale and devoid of color.","If not for the faint rise and fall of her chest, one might have thought she was already dead.","Her body was covered with a mess of dried grass, leaving only her head exposed.","Just then, the girl's eyelids twitched slightly.","The grass covering her body trembled faintly.","After a while, her eyes slowly opened.","The girl shook her dizzy head and forced her eyes open.","She glanced around, her expression confused.","Where was she?","Let’s rewind to seven days ago.","That day, she had gone to the Blue Sea Orphanage.","Bored from waiting, she heard a loud noise and, curious, went to investigate.","Following the sound, she found two groups of people in a fierce fight, seemingly over some supplies.","She casually sat on a nearby tree to watch the spectacle.","When the fight ended and she was about to leave, she unexpectedly noticed a bird’s nest in the tree.","Inside the nest was a round egg.","About the size of a regular chicken egg.","Curious, she leaned in and picked up the egg.","But before she could examine it closely, her system issued a danger alert.","She immediately threw the egg away.","However, the moment she did, the egg suddenly burst open, releasing a massive surge of energy that rushed toward her.","The energy was followed by a powerful shockwave.","It all happened too fast. Before she could even teleport away, she was knocked unconscious.","As it turned out, the egg had hatched into an eagle, which had evolved—not just once, but twice.","And poor Yun Xiaoxiao had been caught in the crossfire.","Fortunately, the eagle had imprinted on her as its \"mother\" upon hatching.","Instead of harming her, it gently picked her up with its beak and flew away.","It carried her all the way from the easternmost part of the eastern region to the border of the central region.","This was why Lu Chen and the others couldn’t find her—she was no longer in the original location.","Once her eyes adjusted to the dim light, Yun Xiaoxiao finally got a clear look at her surroundings.","Was this a cave?","And that massive creature beside her... was that an eagle?!","The eagle was taller than a grown man.","Its feathers were jet black, and its beak was sharp.","Even while asleep, it held its head high, exuding an air of majesty.","Memories slowly returned.","Yun Xiaoxiao twitched her lips. Had this eagle been the one to knock her out?","Just as she was observing the giant eagle, it suddenly woke up.","Yun Xiaoxiao instinctively closed her eyes and pretended to be asleep.","Her body tensed, ready to react at any moment.","If the eagle tried to harm her, she’d fight back with everything she had, even if it meant plucking its feathers!","But then, she felt a shower of dried grass fall onto her body, covering her completely once again.","She was stunned.","Was the eagle... concerned about her? Trying to keep her warm?","As she puzzled over this, she felt something soft and furry brush against her face.","If she wasn’t mistaken, that was the eagle’s head!","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!!","She was so shocked that she opened her eyes.","The eagle paused mid-nuzzle.","Then, the two of them—one human, one eagle—locked eyes.","The scene was both bizarre and... well, bizarre.","At that moment, Little Cute and Little Flower also appeared, crowding around her with concern.","The giant eagle didn’t seem fazed by their presence.","It seemed the three of them were already familiar with each other.","Yun Xiaoxiao checked herself over and, aside from some soreness, found no other issues. She pushed herself up and stood.","She walked to the cave entrance, where a cold breeze greeted her.","Only then did she realize they were on a high cliff.","If she had taken a careless step forward, she would have plummeted to her death.","\"Little Enemy, how long have I been asleep?\"","[Host, you’ve been unconscious for seven days.]","\"Seven days!\"","Sister Yun and the others must be worried sick!","Yun Xiaoxiao immediately decided to leave.","She had Little Flower and Little Cute shrink into their miniature forms, then summoned a gust of wind to carry her out.","But just as she was about to take off, the giant eagle approached her, lowering its body and looking at her expectantly.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ???","\"Do you want me to ride on your back?\" she asked tentatively.","The eagle nodded.","Yun Xiaoxiao studied it for a moment before climbing onto its back.","In the next second, with a whoosh, the giant eagle shot forward.","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!!","As her body plummeted downward, her feet instinctively stiffened.","But the intense feeling of weightlessness only lasted a moment before the eagle spread its massive wings and soared into the sky.","The wind whipped against her face.","Looking down at the breathtaking scenery below, Yun Xiaoxiao felt a surge of exhilaration.","She had her own mount now!","This was way cooler than a helicopter—and it didn’t even need fuel!","After flying for a while, she spotted a group of people fighting in the distance.","To be precise, a small group was being surrounded by a much larger one.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes lit up.","People!","Perfect. She could ask for directions and figure out where she was so she could make her way back.","\"Little Eagle, take us down.\"","\"Little Eagle\" was the name she had given the giant eagle.","Simple and easy to remember.","With a piercing cry that echoed across the sky, the eagle swooped down toward the ground.","The two groups in the midst of battle suddenly heard the shrill cry from above and looked up.","When they saw the majestic figure of Little Eagle, their eyes widened in terror.","What the hell is that?!","Some were so shocked that they forgot they were in the middle of a fight.","In their distraction, they were struck by their opponents.","\"Damn it, you sneaky bastard!\""]},{"number":321,"title":"Chapter 321: Do You Know Me","paragraphs":["The two sides engaged in battle once again.","The eagle descended to the ground and crouched low.","Yun Xiaoxiao watched the fierce battle with a leisurely attitude.","Being reasonable, she thought it wouldn't be appropriate to suddenly demand they stop fighting when they were so intensely engaged.","So she reluctantly decided to wait until they finished before asking her question.","She lay back on the eagle's back, hands behind her head, legs crossed, watching the scene unfold with complete ease.","As she watched, she couldn't help but yawn.","\"Growl~\"","Just then, her stomach made a hungry sound.","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly realized she hadn't eaten anything for seven days.","\"Little Di, how come I haven't died from starvation?\" she asked mentally.","[Host, your body is now connected to the Spirit Spring. When you lack nutrition, the Spirit Spring water automatically nourishes your body, maintaining your basic life signs.]","So that's how it worked.","After learning the reason, Yun Xiaoxiao marveled again.","This system must be her mother reincarnated.","She quietly pulled out a large chicken leg and started munching on it leisurely.","Before long, the surrounded group was defeated and subdued.","A fierce-looking man had his foot pressed down on a seven or eight-year-old boy.","\"You little brat! That's what you get for running!\"","As he spoke, he deliberately ground his foot into the boy's chest.","The boy let out a muffled groan and started coughing violently.","The boy's companions were furious and struggled desperately.","\"Damn it, stay still!\"","The man roared, signaling his subordinates with his eyes.","His men immediately began pummeling their captives' stomachs.","\"Are you finished fighting now? Because I have a question - where is this place?\"","Suddenly, a clear, sweet voice rang out.","It was soft and tender, very pleasant to hear.","Everyone looked toward the voice and finally noticed there was someone on the giant eagle!","And it was a little girl!","She appeared to be only five or six years old and was quite adorable.","The boy pinned to the ground struggled to raise his head and look in the same direction as everyone else.","His eyes flashed with surprise.","It was her!","The little girl who had been grilling meat by the roadside!","Everyone was stunned by Yun Xiaoxiao's question.","No one answered.","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at the boy pinned to the ground.","\"You tell me. If you answer correctly, I might consider saving you,\" she said with an impish wink.","She had heard the boy's thoughts earlier.","Though she didn't remember meeting him before.","At her words, everyone was taken aback.","Especially the man stepping on the boy - his face turned frighteningly dark.","He glared at Yun Xiaoxiao as if trying to bore holes through her with his eyes.","To speak like that right in front of him - wasn't she completely disregarding his presence?!","The boy's eyes suddenly widened.","Without hesitation, he replied, \"This is the suburban area of Zhongnan City in the Central Region.\"","Central Region? Zhongnan City?","Yun Xiaoxiao searched for this place in the map of China etched in her mind.","She quickly found the general location of the area.","She was surprised - hadn't she been at the easternmost part of the Eastern Region?","How did she end up in the Central Region?","She quietly glanced at the docile eagle.","Well, it was probably responsible for this situation.","\"Since you answered honestly, I'll save you this once.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao said with a casual smile, as if saving him was no big deal at all.","This really provoked the man opposite them.","He sneered, \"Little girl, you're far too arrogant!\"","She was just one person - even with that big eagle, so what?","They had over twenty people!","Surely they could handle her!","\"Arrogant?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned in confusion, appearing to seriously consider the accusation.","Suddenly, she raised an eyebrow and smiled at the man.","\"But I'm just stating facts, because... you're too weak.\"","The man: !!","There's only so much one can endure!","The man felt his dignity was being trampled under Yun Xiaoxiao's feet, and it made him furious.","\"Brothers, get her! Tear her mouth apart!\"","But as soon as he finished speaking, a black scorpion suddenly jumped down from Yun Xiaoxiao's shoulder.","It rapidly grew until it was taller than a person.","Its black, glossy shell was as hard as armor, and its tail with its sharp barb raised high, emanating an imposing presence.","It crouched on the ground, looking down at them.","While they were still shocked by this sight, a giant morning glory appeared on the ground.","Though the flower was beautiful, it emanated an intense aura of danger.","At the same time, the giant eagle took to the sky.","It spread its powerful wings and soared above everyone, cutting a magnificent figure.","\"Little Cutie, Little Flower, Little Eagle, go! Kill them!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into an innocent, adorable smile.","However, her words made everyone's scalps tingle.","When the group of men heard Yun Xiaoxiao's words, they wanted to laugh at first - such big talk from such a little girl!","But watching Little Cutie, Little Flower, and Little Eagle advancing toward them with predatory intent, they couldn't laugh anymore.","Not only could they not laugh, they felt an urge to turn tail and run.","When facing powerful people, they could at least try their luck - at least they were human and wouldn't cause such a strong visual impact.","But these three enormous creatures before them were far beyond their comprehension.","Just the sight of them inexplicably filled them with a strong sense of inferiority.","While they were still in shock, Little Cutie and the others had already charged toward them at incredible speed.","\"What are you standing there for, attack!\"","The man stomping on the boy roared in anger.","The group snapped back to their senses and hurriedly tried to defend themselves.","At this moment, the boy's captured companions also seized the opportunity to fight back.","The battle was intense, but the situation had completely reversed.","Before long, the previously aggressive group lay dead on the ground.","Yun Xiaoxiao beckoned, calling Little Cutie and the others back.","Just as she was about to leave, someone called out to her.","\"Little sister, we meet again. Thank you so much for helping us just now.\"","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao about to leave, Mo Xing quickly stepped forward to express his gratitude.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised her eyebrows slightly, \"You know me?\"","Mo Xing shook his head, \"Not really, but I've seen you once before. You were grilling meat by the roadside late at night, and it smelled delicious.\"","The memory was so vivid that he had never forgotten that scene.","That's why he recognized Yun Xiaoxiao the moment he saw her.","However, what was strange was that he remembered she had a large tiger beside her at that time, in addition to the black scorpion.","But now, the tiger was gone, replaced by a giant eagle and a man-eating morning glory."]},{"number":322,"title":"Chapter 322: The Fighter of Scumbags","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao was taken aback.","It seemed like there was indeed such an incident.","At that time, she was collecting supplies everywhere, and when she passed through the central region, she did roast some meat by the roadside.","Little Cutie and Big Beauty even \"thoughtfully\" tasted the food for her.","However, Big Beauty was now deeply in love with its tigress, staying snugly in the base, so naturally, it wasn’t with her.","At that moment, the roar of a car engine sounded not far away.","Mo Xing and the others looked up.","Upon seeing the familiar car, Mo Xing exclaimed joyfully,","\"Big sister is here!\"","Not long after, the car approached.","The car had been modified; instead of tires, it had something like inflatable cushions touching the ground.","Clearly, it was designed specifically for snowy terrain.","The car came to a sudden stop, and Mo Chun stepped out.","She hurried over to Mo Xing, checking him over from head to toe.","Only after confirming that Mo Xing was unharmed did she let out a sigh of relief.","But in the next second, her gentle eyes suddenly turned stern.","\"Mo Xing! Who told you to run off like that! Do you have any idea how worried Mom, Dad, and I have been?\"","Though her words were scolding, it was evident that her tone was harsh out of deep concern.","Mo Xing, knowing he was at fault, lowered his head.","\"I’m sorry, big sister. I didn’t mean to worry you all.\"","\"Mo Xing, I’m not just saying this, but you’re already eight years old. You need to be more responsible. Do you know how frantic Uncle and Auntie were? And you made so many people come out in this freezing weather to look for you!\"","At that moment, another woman, heavily made-up, stepped out of the car.","Following her was a tall, well-dressed man who looked refined and polite.","\"That’s right, Mo Xing. You can’t keep acting like a child. It’s time to grow up,\" the woman chimed in.","At the sight of the two, Mo Xing’s expression immediately darkened.","He seemed furious.","Hearing their words, Mo Xing couldn’t hold back any longer, glaring at them angrily, his fists clenched tightly.","\"It’s all because of the two of you!\"","\"Because of us?\"","The woman pointed at herself, baffled.","Mo Xing glared at her, \"Stop pretending! Last night, I saw you and Yao Shengwei sneaking around behind the granary, doing... doing that kind of thing!","You two are shameless!\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the scene fell into complete silence, as if the air itself had frozen.","Mo Chun was stunned. She looked at her cousin and her fiancé, and from the fleeting panic in their eyes, she understood everything.","She and Yao Shengwei had been betrothed by their parents since childhood.","Although arranged marriages were no longer common in this day and age,","they had coincidentally ended up at the same university.","Yao Shengwei had suddenly started pursuing her fervently.","Having never been in a relationship before, she somehow found herself agreeing to be with him.","Later, thinking that their parents wanted them together anyway, she tried to make herself fall for him.","After the apocalypse, both families ended up in the same base.","Her family of four had all awakened supernatural abilities, while Yao Shengwei’s family of three had none.","Still, she hadn’t looked down on him and treated him as she always had.","She had even agreed to move up their wedding date to accommodate his feelings.","But she never expected that he would secretly get involved with her cousin.","Heartbroken? Not exactly.","But disappointed? Definitely.","\"Ah Chun, let me explain. It’s not what you think,\" Yao Shengwei hurriedly tried to explain.","\"That’s right, last night Shengwei and I were just discussing some matters. It was so dark, Mo Xing must have mistaken what he saw,\" the woman added, panicking.","She was an orphan, relying on her uncle’s family for a comfortable and stable life.","If her uncle found out about this, given his temperament, he would surely kick her out!","Watching the two of them flustered and ridiculous, Mo Chun’s expression remained calm, her eyes indifferent.","It was as if they were nothing more than strangers passing by.","\"Yao Shengwei, I’m letting you know that tomorrow’s wedding is canceled. We’re done.","And congratulations to you and my cousin. May you two stay together forever.\"","Yao Shengwei and the woman: !!!","\"Wait, marriage isn’t a joke! You can’t just call it off like that!\"","Yao Shengwei was now utterly frantic.","\"Even if something did happen between me and your cousin, it’s just a mistake any man could make. Can’t you forgive me?","At the end of the day, you just don’t love me!","We’ve been together for so long, and you won’t even let me kiss you.","I’m a normal man with normal needs, isn’t that understandable?!\"","If she canceled the wedding, his plans would be ruined!","This wedding had to happen!","Little did he know, Yun Xiaoxiao had overheard everything.","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t stand it anymore.","This scumbag was truly the worst of the worst.","Not only had he cheated, but he was also plotting to harm her for her wealth.","\"Pretty big sister, you must not marry him. He’s after the jade pendant in your possession and your father’s position. If you marry him, your fate will be tragic.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao’s words were shocking, leaving everyone present stunned.","Only then did Mo Chun notice Yun Xiaoxiao and the three massive creatures behind her!","What...","She was inwardly shocked.","What were these things?","Why were they so huge?!","Earlier, she had been too worried about Mo Xing, her focus entirely on him.","Then, after her brother’s accusation against Yao Shengwei, she hadn’t noticed Yun Xiaoxiao and the creatures.","Now that she saw them, she was thoroughly frightened.","However, despite her inner turmoil, she showed little of it on her face.","Seeing her sister’s puzzled expression, Mo Xing quickly explained.","\"Big sister, they came with the little girl. It was her who had them help us escape danger earlier.\"","Hearing this, Mo Chun immediately looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with gratitude.","Before she could express her thanks, a flicker of recognition crossed her eyes.","\"Have... have I seen you somewhere before?\"","She stared at Yun Xiaoxiao’s face, feeling a sense of familiarity.","But she couldn’t quite place where she had seen her.","\"Big sister, don’t you remember? On our way home, we passed by this little girl. She was roasting meat by the roadside,\" Mo Xing reminded her.","With that, Mo Chun immediately recalled.","\"So it’s you!\"","She smiled gently, exuding a warm and serene aura.","She expressed her gratitude profusely.","Yun Xiaoxiao waved her hand, \"No need to thank me. Your brother helped me too, so we’re even.\"","Mo Chun thanked her again.","Then, she remembered what Yun Xiaoxiao had said earlier.","\"Little girl, what did you mean by what you said earlier?\"","\"Just... exactly what I said. In short, don’t marry him. If possible, it’s best to kill him. He has ill intentions toward you and even your family.\"","\"Little girl, don’t slander me! You have no proof. How can you say such things about me!\"","Yao Shengwei glared at Yun Xiaoxiao furiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, \"I say what I want. Scumbags like you deserve to be called out. You’re not innocent.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","Mo Chun knew Yun Xiaoxiao meant well. After all, she and Yao Shengwei had never met before, so there was no reason for her to deliberately harm him.","This little girl must have some extraordinary ability to see through people’s true nature.","What she said was undoubtedly true.","However, killing Yao Shengwei wasn’t a realistic option.","Their families had been close for generations.","Both sets of parents were well-acquainted and held positions of power in the base.","Killing him without cause would be hard to justify.","This matter needed to be discussed with her father and the others first.","(PS: Dear readers, I’ve revised the first three chapters.","Last night, I noticed a sudden influx of messages in the backend and was curious about the comments. Upon checking, I realized many of you were unhappy with the amnesia plotline.","So, I stayed up late revising the story outline, removing the amnesia element.","The new outline won’t affect the overall story direction, so you can continue reading with peace of mind.","Love you all~","Feel free to revisit the first three chapters!)"]},{"number":323,"title":"Chapter 323: Encountering an Air Raid","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao had no right to interfere with Mo Chun's thoughts.","She had done her part by reminding her, and whether or not Mo Chun listened was entirely up to her.","After all, the outcome had little to do with Yun Xiaoxiao.","After bidding each other farewell, Yun Xiaoxiao took out a small, round compass, determined the direction, and flew onto the back of the little eagle, where she sat cross-legged.","The eagle spread its wings and soared into the sky in an instant.","Watching the shrinking figure in the distance, Mo Chun and the others finally looked away.","She took her younger brother, Mo Xing, and returned to the car.","Yao Shengwei and the others tried to get in as well, but Mo Chun slammed the door shut with a loud *bang*.","Yao Shengwei's face fell immediately.","Left with no choice, they had to get into another car.","---","Yun Xiaoxiao directed the little eagle to fly toward the easternmost part of Hua Country.","At that moment, she was in the northern part of the central region.","Behind her, a fighter jet was approaching in the air, heading in her direction.","Inside the cockpit, Bai Ruo was scanning the surroundings with a pair of binoculars.","Bai Hongting, concerned about the survival of ordinary people in the extreme cold, had dispatched numerous teams to search for those in need of help.","Bai Ruo, eager to establish her authority among the people, had volunteered for the task.","Her assigned area was near the central region.","As she scanned the horizon, she suddenly caught sight of a giant eagle flying swiftly ahead of her.","Her eyes widened in shock.","The eagle was enormous!","Just as she was marveling at its size, she noticed Yun Xiaoxiao sitting on the eagle's back.","It was her!","Though she only saw her profile, Bai Ruo recognized Yun Xiaoxiao immediately.","What was she doing here?","And why was she alone?","Bai Ruo's mind raced.","Recently, she had come across a photo of her mother from her childhood.","At first glance, the photo had seemed oddly familiar.","Upon closer inspection, she realized that the girl in the photo bore a striking resemblance to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Not a 100% match, but at least 90% similar!","It was then that she remembered—when she had swapped her mother's biological daughter years ago, the nurse had returned too quickly, and she hadn't had the chance to kill the child.","By her calculations, the girl would be around five or six years old now.","Could it be that this brat was the one who had survived?","No wonder she had felt an inexplicable dislike for Yun Xiaoxiao from the very first moment she saw her.","So that was the reason!","Whether or not Yun Xiaoxiao was her mother's biological daughter, today, she was as good as dead.","A cold smile curled on Bai Ruo's lips, and a flash of malice flickered in her eyes.","The timing, the location, and the circumstances were all perfect—this was the ideal moment to eliminate her.","With a sneer, she immediately issued an order.","\"There's a giant monster over there. Attack it now!\"","\"Yes, ma'am!\"","The subordinate obeyed without hesitation, turning the aircraft toward the direction of the eagle.","Two air-to-air missiles shot out from the wings, speeding toward Yun Xiaoxiao and the eagle with devastating force.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had been lounging comfortably, suddenly heard two unusual sounds.","Her keen sense of danger made her turn her head sharply.","She saw two missiles hurtling toward them, carrying an overwhelming destructive power.","It was unimaginable—if they were hit, neither she nor the eagle would survive.","Her pupils contracted in alarm.","\"Little Eagle, dodge now!\" she shouted.","Fortunately, she had noticed in time, and the eagle swiftly avoided the missiles.","They narrowly escaped the attack, but the eagle's tail feathers were singed, and its tail was slightly burned.","No sooner had they dodged the missiles than two more came hurtling toward them.","It was clear that they were being deliberately targeted.","A fierce killing intent flashed in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes.","She immediately stored the eagle in her spatial storage and let herself freefall.","After evading the missiles, she used her wind manipulation ability to soar back into the air.","Her icy gaze locked onto the silver-gray fighter jet in the distance, her eyes filled with murderous intent.","Bai Ruo, who had been watching through the binoculars, suddenly met Yun Xiaoxiao's cold, piercing stare. An inexplicable sense of panic washed over her.","Damn it, she hadn't managed to kill her!","\"What are you waiting for? Fire the missiles!\" she barked.","She had a gut feeling that if she didn't eliminate Yun Xiaoxiao today, she would be in grave danger.","\"But... that seems to be just a child over there,\" the subordinate hesitated.","He had fired without hesitation earlier because he had only seen the giant eagle.","But now, there was a child in the line of fire.","She posed no threat to them, and he couldn't understand why they needed to continue the attack.","\"I gave you an order! Just do it!\" Bai Ruo snapped, glaring at him.","The man pursed his lips but said nothing more. After a brief moment of hesitation, he pressed the launch button.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao deftly dodged every missile.","With her spatial storage as a cheat tool and her heightened awareness of the danger, there was no way she would be hit.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao unharmed and rapidly closing the distance, Bai Ruo's expression darkened like a storm cloud.","\"Why aren't you attacking?!\" she demanded angrily.","The subordinate sighed. \"Ma'am, we're out of missiles.\"","\"What? Out of missiles?!\"","Bai Ruo was stunned. The memory of Yun Xiaoxiao's cold, piercing gaze sent a chill down her spine.","\"Useless!\" she shouted furiously.","\"Get us back to the base immediately! If she catches up, you'll be dead a thousand times over!\"","\"...\"","The subordinate was exasperated, but what could he do? She was the base leader's daughter.","No matter how angry he was, he had to endure it. He had a family to support.","The fighter jet quickly turned around and sped toward the northern base.","Seeing their attempt to flee, Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes turned as sharp as ice blades.","In her mind, she had already sentenced them to death.","She gathered all the energy within her, alternating between her wind manipulation and teleportation abilities. Her figure flickered rapidly through the air.","Soon, she was keeping pace with the fighter jet, even gaining on it slightly.","As the distance closed, Yun Xiaoxiao pulled out a long-range sniper rifle from her spatial storage.","While flying, she aimed the rifle at the tail of the fighter jet.","Her expression was calm and focused, like a predator locking onto its prey.","\"Boom!\"","A bullet shot out with incredible speed, striking the tail of the fighter jet.","The aircraft immediately lost balance, wobbling in the air.","\"Ahhh!\"","The sudden instability made Bai Ruo scream.","She quickly steadied herself and looked back.","Her face turned pale with fear.","\"She's catching up! Hurry, go faster!\" she urged the pilot.","\"Don't let her get any closer! Go, go, go!\"","(PS: A quick reminder for those who haven't noticed—the first three chapters have been revised.","Last night, I saw a sudden influx of messages in the backend and was curious about what everyone was commenting on. Upon checking, I realized many readers were bothered by the amnesia plotline.","So, I stayed up all night revising the story outline, removing the amnesia element.","The new outline won't affect the overall direction of the story, so feel free to read on without worry.","Love you all~","You can revisit the first three chapters if you'd like.)"]},{"number":324,"title":"Chapter 324: I Know Who Your Biological Parents Are","paragraphs":["She commanded the others inside the aircraft.","The group exchanged uneasy glances.","But they had no choice but to obey.","From the beginning to the end, they had no idea what Bai Ruo was so worked up about.","It was almost laughable—she had initially wanted to kill someone, but in the end, she was the one being chased.","How could someone as wise and formidable as the base leader have such a foolish daughter?","And so, a new round of pursuit began.","Yun Xiaoxiao remained calm and composed, deftly dodging incoming attacks while seizing opportunities to deliver powerful strikes.","She managed to hit both wings of the fighter jet.","The already unstable aircraft began to wobble precariously.","However, the pilot was clearly an experienced hand.","Despite the dire situation, they managed to keep the plane airborne until it neared the northern base before it finally crashed.","As the plane went down, a signal flare shot into the sky.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned, realizing that the other side was calling for reinforcements.","She wanted to stop it, but it was already too late.","With a cold expression, she swiftly moved toward the crash site.","Bai Ruo and her companions had jumped out of the aircraft the moment it started to fall.","They tumbled several times on the ground before finally regaining their footing.","\"Stop her!\" Bai Ruo shouted in panic as she saw Yun Xiaoxiao approaching.","Her subordinates exchanged glances.","Though Bai Ruo wasn’t much to speak of, she was, after all, the base leader’s only daughter.","The base leader was someone they respected and looked up to.","If it weren’t for him, they and their families would have perished long ago.","So, his only daughter couldn’t be allowed to come to harm!","The group immediately stepped in front of Yun Xiaoxiao, assuming a defensive stance.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s gaze darkened as she stared at Bai Ruo behind them, a cold smile forming on her lips.","So, it was her!","No wonder there was such intense hostility.","From the very beginning, this person had been intent on killing her.","She clicked her tongue in disapproval.","Though Bai Hongting had left a decent impression on her, it was a shame.","He had ended up with a daughter like this.","Now, no one’s face would save her.","If you want to kill me, you’d better be prepared to be killed in return!","Not even the heavens could interfere!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curled into a smirk as she made a throat-slitting gesture toward Bai Ruo.","The provocation was blatant, exuding a wild, untamed arrogance.","Paired with her innocent, doll-like face, it made her seem like a little devil.","Bai Ruo’s heart skipped a beat.","For some reason, she felt an overwhelming sense of suffocation.","It was as if Yun Xiaoxiao would strangle her and snap her neck in the next second.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced coldly at the people blocking her path.","\"Step aside, and I won’t kill you,\" she said.","She knew these people were merely following orders.","She wasn’t one to kill indiscriminately.","But if they insisted on standing in her way, she wouldn’t hold back.","\"Little girl, you should leave now. The signal flare has been fired. The base leader will be here soon, and you’re no match for him,\" the pilot who had launched the missile earlier said, his tone tinged with pity.","Another chimed in, \"Yes, taking on the entire northern base isn’t wise. You still have time to leave.\"","Though she knew they meant well, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but laugh.","\"How do you know I’m not a match for him?\"","Bai Hongting was indeed powerful, but based on his previous strength, he wasn’t her equal.","Still, to avoid unnecessary trouble, Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t want to cross paths with Bai Hongting.","So, she decided to end things quickly.","Though these people were innocent, aiding and abetting evil meant they weren’t entirely blameless.","She unleashed her full power, attacking them without warning.","They scrambled to defend themselves.","In the midst of the chaos, Bai Ruo actually ran away on her own!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes darkened, and she couldn’t help but sneer.","How bold!","While others were protecting her, she had the nerve to sneak off!","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly summoned her little companions, Xiao Keai and Xiao Huahua, to keep the group occupied.","Once free, she darted after Bai Ruo.","As soon as she got close, she whipped out a vine, wrapping it around Bai Ruo’s neck and yanking her backward.","Bai Ruo was dragged into the air and then slammed onto the snowy ground.","Before she could get up, Yun Xiaoxiao pressed a blade to her throat.","Bai Ruo’s breath hitched, her pupils dilating in terror.","Feeling the intense murderous intent in Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes, she panicked.","She couldn’t die!","She didn’t want to die!","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao raised her blade, ready to strike, Bai Ruo screamed, \"You can’t kill me! I know who your real parents are! If you kill me, you’ll never see them again! Besides me, no one else in the world knows your true origins!\"","In truth, Bai Ruo wasn’t entirely sure if Yun Xiaoxiao was her parents’ biological daughter.","But the resemblance was uncanny, and the age matched.","She was gambling.","Of course, she didn’t want Yun Xiaoxiao to reunite with her parents.","But with her life on the line, she couldn’t afford to care about that anymore.","Besides, she was only trying to buy time.","The signal flare she had fired was unique to her. Her father and his subordinates would recognize it and come rushing over.","As long as they arrived, she would be saved!","Her plan was crystal clear.","Yun Xiaoxiao did pause momentarily at her words.","She was puzzled. How did Bai Ruo know about her having biological parents?","She distinctly remembered telling them that she had no parents, that she was born of the heavens and raised by nature.","Could Bai Ruo actually know something?","However, she soon overheard Bai Ruo’s internal monologue.","Her parents’ biological daughter?","If Bai Ruo’s father was Bai Hongting, then...","\"You’re not Bai Hongting’s biological daughter?\"","Though Yun Xiaoxiao phrased it as a question, her tone was certain.","Bai Ruo’s head snapped up, her face filled with shock.","She hadn’t mentioned her father’s name!","How did Yun Xiaoxiao know?","Though Bai Ruo didn’t respond directly, Yun Xiaoxiao had already deduced the truth from her reaction.","No wonder Bai Ruo harbored such intense hostility toward her.","This was the root cause.","\"Now that you’ve said your piece, it’s time for you to... die.\"","Noticing the approaching helicopter in the distance, Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes narrowed. She raised her blade and thrust it toward Bai Ruo’s neck.","This strike was merciless, aimed squarely at ending her life.","But just as the blade was a hair’s breadth away from Bai Ruo’s throat, a bullet struck the hilt of the knife.","The impact knocked the blade slightly off course, and it only grazed Bai Ruo’s shoulder.","\"Ah!\"","Blood seeped from Bai Ruo’s shoulder, staining her torn clothes.","She winced in pain, her entire body trembling.","For a moment, she had truly believed she was about to die at Yun Xiaoxiao’s hands.","Thankfully!","Thankfully, the reinforcements had arrived.","\"Dad, save me!\" she screamed at the top of her lungs."]},{"number":325,"title":"Chapter 325: You, Fail","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes and immediately shot out a green vine with her other hand.","Her movements were cunning and swift, aiming straight for Bai Ruo's chest.","But just as the vine was about to strike, a strange force suddenly blocked its path.","The force was powerful, matching the strength of the vine.","Watching Bai Hongting quickly descend from the helicopter via a rope, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned deeply.","It seemed that during their time apart, he had also encountered some extraordinary experiences.","And these experiences had significantly boosted his abilities.","Although she had never faced Bai Hongting directly before, she was well aware of his previous strength.","In terms of supernatural abilities, he had been far inferior to her.","But now, not only had he awakened a second ability, but his overall power level had also risen several tiers.","Especially that absolute defense he had just used—it had even managed to block her green vine!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s gaze turned sharp, and she vanished from her spot.","While Bai Hongting and the others were still in shock, she suddenly reappeared behind Bai Ruo.","Pulling out a small pistol, she aimed it at Bai Ruo’s chest and fired.","One of Bai Hongting’s subordinates, quick on his feet, yanked Bai Ruo out of the way just in time.","The bullet only grazed her arm.","\"Ahhhhhh!\"","Bai Ruo let out a scream, her face contorted in pain.","\"Dad, save me! If you don’t stop her, she’s going to kill me! It hurts so much!\"","Bai Hongting furrowed his brow slightly. He wasn’t entirely sure what was going on.","He had been about to leave when he saw Bai Ruo’s distress signal and immediately rushed over with his men.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao was a child he admired, Bai Ruo was still his daughter and the orphan of his comrade.","He couldn’t just stand by and watch her die.","His first instinct had been to save her.","But now, upon reflection, Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t seem like the type to kill without reason.","He turned to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Xiaoxiao, is there some kind of misunderstanding here?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao sneered, \"Misunderstanding? Your precious daughter tried to kill me. Is that a misunderstanding?\"","\"Ruo Ruo tried to kill you?\" Bai Hongting was stunned.","What on earth was going on?","Yun Xiaoxiao tilted her chin toward the few people lying on the ground, barely clinging to life after being taken down by her companions.","\"Ask them.\"","Bai Hongting frowned and immediately sent two of his men to interrogate them.","While he was distracted, Yun Xiaoxiao secretly gathered an ice ball in her right palm and hurled it at Bai Ruo.","Bai Ruo, who had been on guard the whole time, screamed and dodged the moment Yun Xiaoxiao moved.","\"Ahhhhh! Help me!\"","The ice ball froze Bai Ruo’s left arm, shattering it into pieces in an instant.","\"Ahhhhhh! My arm!\"","Bai Ruo’s lips turned pale from the pain.","Her agonized screams echoed through the empty surroundings.","\"You!\"","Bai Hongting was startled, his heart skipping a beat at Yun Xiaoxiao’s ruthlessness.","He quickly pulled Bai Ruo behind him, conjuring a defensive shield to protect her.","Meanwhile, more than a dozen well-trained military superhumans surrounded Yun Xiaoxiao, their eyes filled with caution.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at them indifferently, her eyes darkening.","It seemed she wouldn’t be able to kill Bai Ruo today.","But one day, she would make sure to end her!","Yun Xiaoxiao lowered her gaze and gave Bai Hongting a thumbs-up, then flipped it upside down.","She looked him straight in the eye and whispered softly,","\"You get a failing grade.\"","Whether or not he was her biological father, after today, they were officially enemies!","Hearing this, Bai Hongting’s heart trembled.","A sharp pang of pain shot through him.","In Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes, he saw deep disappointment.","But he couldn’t understand where this inexplicable emotion came from.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced once more at Bai Ruo, who was hiding behind Bai Hongting, and made a slashing motion across her neck.","\"I’ll let you off today. Clean your neck and wait for me to come collect it!\"","With that, she vanished in a flash, reappearing beside her companions and leaving with them.","Although she hadn’t managed to kill Bai Ruo today, severing her arm was enough to make her suffer.","And knowing that Yun Xiaoxiao could come for her at any moment, Bai Ruo would likely live in constant fear, plagued by nightmares.","This daily torment seemed like a fitting punishment.","At that moment, the two men Bai Hongting had sent to gather information returned.","They recounted how Bai Ruo had ordered a missile strike on Yun Xiaoxiao in detail.","As Bai Hongting listened, his brows furrowed deeply.","So, everything the girl had said was true.","Had Bai Ruo really tried to kill her without provocation?","No wonder Yun Xiaoxiao had been so determined to take her life.","\"Commander, should we pursue her?\" one of his subordinates asked.","Bai Hongting shook his head lightly. \"No.\"","Bai Ruo had been the one to strike first, and she was in the wrong.","Yun Xiaoxiao had only been seeking justice, and she wasn’t wrong to do so.","\"Dad, she cut off my arm! Go catch her! I want her torn to pieces!\"","Bai Ruo, now half-crazed, grabbed Bai Hongting’s sleeve with her remaining hand, her eyes bloodshot.","The pain from her wounds made her whole body tremble, and even her voice shook.","\"Let’s get you treated first.\"","Bai Hongting ignored Bai Ruo’s demands and had her carried onto the helicopter.","When Bai Ruo regained consciousness after treatment, she felt the emptiness where her left arm should have been and flew into a rage in the hospital room.","\"Ahhhhh! That bitch!\"","\"Wuwuwu, my arm! I’ll never have it back!\"","\"Ahhhhh! I’ll kill her! I’ll kill her!\"","When Bai Hongting and Sheng Shuya entered the room, they were met with Bai Ruo’s frenzied state.","In their memories, Bai Ruo had always been gentle and well-behaved.","This side of her was something they had never seen before.","It was as if she had become a completely different person.","The two exchanged a glance and slowly approached the bed.","When Bai Ruo saw Bai Hongting, her eyes filled with resentment.","\"Dad, why didn’t you catch that brat back then?!\"","She shouted at him.","Bai Hongting’s voice remained calm. \"Then can you tell me why you tried to kill her in the first place?\"","Bai Ruo froze.","Why had she tried to kill that brat? It was because she was afraid Yun Xiaoxiao might be her parents’ real daughter!","But she could never say that out loud.","She lifted her chin, her eyes red, tears streaming down her cheeks.","\"There was a giant eagle, massive and terrifying. I was worried it might pose a threat to humans, so I ordered an attack.","I didn’t know Yun Xiaoxiao was on its back.","By the time I realized she was there, she had already started relentlessly pursuing us, so we had no choice but to fight back.","We didn’t even harm her, but she came straight for my life!\""]},{"number":326,"title":"Chapter 326: I'm Going to Get Stronger, Wait for Me to Return","paragraphs":["Bai Ruo was screaming and pounding on the bed with all her might.","\"Dad, you saw it too. She raised a giant eagle, a giant scorpion, and even a terrifying man-eating flower. She's narrow-minded, vengeful, and so cruel. Someone like her is a cancer, a ticking time bomb waiting to explode! If we don't get rid of her, she'll become a huge threat in the future!\"","This version of Bai Ruo felt utterly unfamiliar to Bai Hongting and his wife.","Bai Hongting sighed silently in his heart.","He had already inquired about the specifics of the incident.","There was indeed a giant eagle, but even after Yun Xiaoxiao appeared, Bai Ruo stubbornly insisted on killing her.","At the time, Yun Xiaoxiao hadn’t done anything extreme.","It was Bai Ruo who refused to let her go.","It was only after being provoked that Yun Xiaoxiao retaliated against them.","When you looked at the whole situation, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t really at fault.","Given her personality, how could she possibly let something like this slide after being deliberately targeted?","\"You're injured. Rest well. I'll have people stationed around the hospital to protect you.\"","Bai Hongting didn’t say anything to reprimand her.","Bai Ruo was emotionally unstable right now, and he didn’t want to lecture her at this critical moment.","He’d wait until she recovered and calmed down before addressing it.","Seeing that Bai Hongting hadn’t promised to settle the score with Yun Xiaoxiao, Bai Ruo’s face darkened immediately.","\"At the end of the day, it’s because I’m not your biological daughter that you’re treating me like this, right?!\"","Bai Ruo gritted her teeth, her voice hissing through them.","\"If I were your real daughter, would you still ignore me like this? Would you still be indifferent even after I lost an arm?!\"","The moment these words left her mouth, Bai Hongting and Sheng Shuya both looked at her in disbelief.","Sheng Shuya’s lips trembled. \"You... you knew?\"","\"Hah, you thought you hid it well, didn’t you? I’ve known for a long time!\"","Bai Ruo glared at Sheng Shuya. \"You’re always thinking about my sister. When have you ever cared about me?!\"","\"And you!\" She turned to Bai Hongting. \"My real dad saved your life, but you couldn’t even protect his daughter. Where’s your conscience?!\"","She had secretly uncovered everything long ago.","Turns out, she was the child of her father’s comrade-in-arms. Her biological father had sacrificed himself to save Bai Hongting during a mission.","Out of gratitude, Bai Hongting had taken her in and raised her.","Originally, she hadn’t planned to reveal this.","Doing so would shatter the stability of their current lives, and there would inevitably be a rift between her and her parents. She wouldn’t be able to play the role of their daughter anymore, acting spoiled and carefree as she pleased.","But now, she couldn’t care less.","The look in Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes before she left told Bai Ruo that she would definitely come back for revenge.","That murderous gaze haunted her, sending chills down her spine every time she thought about it.","The image of Yun Xiaoxiao’s relentless desire to kill her lingered in her mind, like a nightmare that wouldn’t let go.","She didn’t want to die!","She absolutely couldn’t die!","The only way to make Bai Hongting take her seriously was to guilt-trip him, to bind him with a sense of moral obligation so he’d protect her with everything he had.","Forget family ties—she didn’t need them anymore!","If Yun Xiaoxiao really were their biological daughter, that would be even better.","She’d love to watch them turn on each other.","Hahaha, that would be so satisfying!","Bai Ruo laughed coldly in her heart, already picturing Bai Hongting shooting Yun Xiaoxiao dead.","The thought of that bloody scene filled her with a strange sense of excitement.","Bai Ruo’s accusations brought back memories of how her father’s comrade had saved him.","Bai Hongting’s mood grew heavy.","Seeing the empty space where Bai Ruo’s left arm used to be, waves of guilt and self-reproach washed over him.","Yes, he had failed. He hadn’t protected Bai Ruo.","But wrong was wrong, and right was right.","Bai Ruo had struck first, and losing an arm was her punishment.","Even without an arm, he would take care of her for the rest of her life.","But if Yun Xiaoxiao still wanted to take Bai Ruo’s life, he wouldn’t stand by and do nothing.","Her father had sacrificed himself to save him. How could he not protect his only daughter?","What kind of person would that make him?!","Sheng Shuya sat silently beside them, saying nothing.","Her thoughts drifted to Yun Xiaoxiao, and her eyes flickered with emotion.","Ever since Yun Xiaoxiao left, Sheng Shuya had been dreaming of her at night, seeing her smile in her dreams.","Her face looked so much like hers when she was young.","She had even dug out her old childhood photos, and the resemblance was uncanny.","Sigh... if she didn’t know that her little Xiaofan had already passed away, she might have thought Yun Xiaoxiao was her.","Seeing Bai Ruo and Yun Xiaoxiao at odds like this left her with mixed feelings.","Originally, she had even considered adopting Yun Xiaoxiao as her goddaughter.","But now, it seemed that hope was gone.","Meanwhile, after Yun Xiaoxiao left, she found a secluded spot and entered her space.","Her little eagle had been injured on its tail. She washed the wound with spirit spring water and applied some ointment.","Before long, the little eagle was back to its lively self.","Aside from the bare patch on its tail, which looked a bit unsightly, the injury hadn’t caused any serious damage.","Yun Xiaoxiao watched it, her brows furrowed in thought.","Before this incident, she had thought her abilities were already quite strong. But now, she realized something crucial.","She wasn’t the only one in this world with extraordinary opportunities.","If she didn’t keep improving, if she didn’t strive to stand at the very top of the pyramid, she would often find herself at the mercy of others, unable to act as she pleased.","Sometimes, she might even be forced to endure attacks passively.","That wasn’t what she wanted.","She had to grow stronger!","Stronger than anyone else!","She decided not to tell Lu Chen and the others about this.","While their help might make things easier, this was her revenge to take.","Once you started relying on others, you were doomed.","Yun Xiaoxiao was determined to be her own ruler.","So, she abandoned the idea of going back.","Life at the base was safe and comfortable, but... it wasn’t time for her to relax just yet.","Progress through battle, transformation through crisis—that was what she needed to do!","On a quiet night, she mounted her little eagle and flew to the Blue Sea Orphanage.","She slipped down and left a letter at the entrance, placing it in the most visible spot and weighing it down with a stone.","After finishing, she disappeared without a trace.","As for the evolution serum, she had already left plenty in the base’s storage, so there was no need to worry about running out anytime soon.","The next morning, the orphanage staff found the letter.","After reading its contents, they breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Quick, let’s inform Captain Lu Chen and the others!\"","By the time Lu Chen and his team received the news, a day had already passed.","\"Is it really from that kid?\" Nie Yizhou quickly walked over.","Lu Chen unfolded the letter. It contained just one line:","\"I’m going to get stronger. Wait for me to return!\"","—Yun Xiaoxiao"]},{"number":327,"title":"Chapter 327: Snowmelt Zombies","paragraphs":["At the bottom of the letter, there were cute cartoon drawings of Little Cutie, Little Flower, Big Beauty, and Little Eagle. Inside the envelope was also a hairpin belonging to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Is this really written by the little ghost?\" Nie Yizhou expressed some doubt.","Lu Chen nodded, \"The handwriting is definitely hers, and these drawings... only she could draw like this.\"","The others: \"......\"","Fair enough.","\"What kind of shock did the little ghost go through to suddenly decide to get stronger?\"","Everyone shook their heads.","No idea.","Nie Yizhou pointed at the drawing of Little Eagle on the letter.","\"Huh, did the little ghost adopt another mutated chicken?\"","Xiao Feng's mouth twitched, \"What kind of eyes do you have? How does that look like a chicken?\"","\"If it's not a chicken, then what is it?\"","Xiao Feng turned his head away, \"I don't know.\"","\"Tch, you're no better than me.\"","\"Ling Jing, take a look, what is this?\" Nie Yizhou pointed at Little Eagle and asked.","Ling Jing glanced at it, \"An eagle.\"","Nie Yizhou's eyes widened, \"An eagle? How can you tell it's an eagle?\"","Ling Jing pointed at the claws and beak.","Nie Yizhou began to question his life.","Really?","Does it look like one?","Well... maybe not...","The debate over Little Eagle ended without a conclusion.","\"So what should we do now? Should we keep looking for her?\" Nie Yizhou frowned at the letter.","Lu Chen shook his head calmly, \"No, she probably doesn't want us to look for her.","If she's getting stronger, we can't just sit idle either.","When she needs us, we'll be her strongest support.\"","Lu Chen's eyes gleamed with determination.","Hearing this, Ling Jing and the others' expressions also changed.","Yes, getting stronger!","Although they didn't know what kind of shock their little one had gone through, they wanted her to know that she wasn't alone—she had them!","If she wanted to get stronger, then they would all get stronger together.","Strong enough to fear no one or nothing, strong enough to let her do as she pleased!","What Yun Xiaoxiao didn't know was that this letter of hers would make Yun City rise to fame within just a year.","It became a name that major bases across Hua Country would mention with awe, calling it \"untouchable.\"","Of course, that's a story for later.","After leaving the Blue Sea Orphanage, Yun Xiaoxiao began to think about where to go next.","Back then, the major bases in the four regions—east, west, south, and north—were all responding to the Zombie Extermination Plan.","Only the central region showed no signs of activity.","So, Yun Xiaoxiao decided to start from the central region.","Although the heavy snow and freezing weather made travel inconvenient, and most people preferred to stay indoors, this was also the best time to deal with zombies.","Most of them would be frozen stiff, making their movements even slower than usual.","Of course, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't about to kill zombies one by one—that would be too time-consuming and exhausting.","Besides, ordinary zombies posed no challenge to her at all.","The evolution serum made from their crystals wouldn't do much for her either.","If she was determined to improve her strength, she needed to find some tougher \"big guys.\"","No risk, no reward, right?","So, Yun Xiaoxiao deliberately sought out places with large groups of zombies.","And she specifically targeted high-level zombies for battles.","Time flew by, and a month and a half passed.","One day, Yun Xiaoxiao arrived at a city near the central base.","The city's name was Mo City.","Under the blanket of snow and ice, the city looked even more desolate and rundown.","Yun Xiaoxiao sat on Little Eagle's back, circling above the city.","On the streets below, most of the zombies were buried under the snow, with only half their bodies or heads sticking out.","But a few were still moving stiffly.","The whole scene was lifeless and somewhat oppressive.","Just then, a scream suddenly rang out not far below Yun Xiaoxiao to her left.","In an instant, the zombies on several nearby streets erupted into a frenzy.","They howled, shaking off the snow covering them, and stumbled out of the snow pits, rushing madly toward the source of the scream.","Yun Xiaoxiao happened to be flying right above that area.","She saw several women struggling to fight a giant zombie covered entirely in white.","Is that... a Snowmelt Zombie?","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Although she hadn't fought a Snowmelt Zombie in her past life, she had seen Lu Chen battle one.","The Snowmelt Zombie was wrapped in a layer of ice and snow, as if the snow was part of its body.","Just getting within a meter of it would make you feel temperatures dozens of degrees colder than normal.","The most terrifying thing about it was that any part of your body that came into contact with it would instantly freeze.","And it would take that opportunity to shatter the frozen part.","Like the woman now lying on the ground in agony.","Her right foot had already been crushed into ice shards by the Snowmelt Zombie.","Her left hand was also frozen.","Just as the Snowmelt Zombie was about to stomp down again, the other women were desperately trying to save her.","Three women teamed up to attack the Snowmelt Zombie, while the other two dragged the injured woman away from its feet.","But at that moment, awakened zombies began pouring in from both ends of the street.","\"This is bad! The zombie horde has been alerted!\"","\"Find a way to get out of here, quick!\"","The two women fighting the Snowmelt Zombie shouted in panic.","Another woman quickly shot a vine toward a nearby high-rise building, hoping to escape with her injured companion.","But the windows of the building were suddenly shattered.","A dense swarm of zombies jumped out of the windows.","Some of them grabbed onto the vine.","Under their weight, the vine snapped instantly.","Now, the women were completely trapped.","In front of them was the formidable Snowmelt Zombie, and behind them was a terrifying horde of zombies.","They were surrounded!","However, they didn't give up and were still trying to find a way to survive.","But the harsh reality left them struggling even to catch their breath.","Just as they thought they were doomed, a shrill cry suddenly echoed from the sky.","In an instant, a massive creature swooped down from one end of the street.","A powerful gust of wind followed.","The strong impact knocked a large group of zombies to the ground.","At the same time, a giant scorpion and a huge trumpet flower appeared at the other end of the street.","As soon as they appeared, they began slaughtering zombies left and right.","They killed while also digging out zombie crystals.","Their movements were smooth and natural, as if they had done this countless times before.","What surprised the women the most was a little girl, bundled up like a dumpling, floating in front of the Snowmelt Zombie.","She was dressed in a bright red cotton-padded jacket, with a fox hat that covered her ears and a white scarf around her neck.","At that moment, she was wielding a large machete, hacking away at the zombies with a flurry of strikes.","Her moves were unique, and her strength was astonishing, forcing the Snowmelt Zombie to retreat repeatedly!"]},{"number":328,"title":"Chapter 328: Acid Rain Descends","paragraphs":["The women exchanged glances, each seeing a glimmer of hope in the others' eyes.","They nodded at each other and immediately joined the battle.","The snow-melting zombie was initially stunned by the sudden appearance of Yun Xiaoxiao but quickly regained its composure.","It roared furiously, reaching out with its icy, massive hand to grab Yun Xiaoxiao.","But Yun Xiaoxiao twisted her body and soared upward.","Then, with her blade pointed directly at the top of its skull, she dove down at incredible speed.","The blade pierced through the zombie's skull with a loud *crack*, shattering its head.","Lord Slasher effortlessly cleaved it in two.","This snow-melting zombie was indeed formidable, but it had a fatal weakness—the very top of its head.","While the rest of its body was incredibly tough, this spot was fragile.","To kill it completely, one had to strike precisely there.","In her past life, Lu Chen had spent an entire hour in battle before finally discovering this weakness.","Yun Xiaoxiao used the tip of her blade to extract the zombie's crystal core, washed it clean with spiritual spring water, and then picked it up.","A level-five crystal core—not the highest, but not the lowest either.","It would do.","She casually stuffed it into her pocket, though in reality, she stored it in her spatial storage.","In the next moment, she charged toward the zombies on the street.","Like a god of slaughter, her speed was unmatched, and her lethality was terrifying.","With a single swing of Lord Slasher, encased in ice, she decapitated a large group of low-level zombies.","Corpses fell in droves, piling up in heaps.","The commotion on this side left the women on the other side utterly astonished.","Were zombies really this easy to kill?!","Why didn’t they feel that way?","Just as they were locked in a desperate struggle with the zombies, their reinforcements arrived.","To their surprise, the reinforcements were all women as well!","They erected barriers, blocking the majority of the zombies.","“Hurry, get in the car!”","One of them shouted toward the group.","The five women quickly helped their injured companion toward the vehicle.","Noticing that Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t following, one of them anxiously called out, “Little girl, hurry up! Zombies from all over the city are heading this way. If we don’t leave now, it’ll be too late!”","“Oh, really?”","Instead of being frightened, Yun Xiaoxiao’s face lit up with excitement.","This reaction left the woman who had called out to her utterly baffled.","“Hurry, we really don’t have time!”","The woman urged again.","But Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head. “You go ahead. I’m staying.”","The woman: “...”","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao was still slaughtering zombies with no intention of leaving, the group of women exchanged glances. They decided to send a few to escort the injured woman away while five others stayed behind.","Yun Xiaoxiao was somewhat surprised when she noticed the five who remained.","“Why didn’t you leave?”","One of them, fending off an attacking zombie, shouted back, “You helped us. How could we just run off and leave you here alone? That wouldn’t be right!”","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips, faintly impressed.","They were quite loyal.","About ten minutes later.","A cold raindrop landed on the tip of Yun Xiaoxiao’s nose.","It stung slightly.","She looked up in shock, staring at the sky.","Tiny raindrops, mixed with snowflakes, were falling intermittently.","She quickly flew into the air, discreetly plucking a leaf from her spatial storage.","When a raindrop landed on the leaf, the surface immediately began to shrivel, as if an invisible flame was scorching it.","In no time, a small hole formed where the raindrop had fallen.","Yun Xiaoxiao froze in place.","This was... acid rain?!","But acid rain wasn’t supposed to appear for several more years!","Why was it happening now?!","This acid rain was different from the usual kind.","Not only was it highly corrosive, but it also carried an unknown energy.","In her past life, after the acid rain, all plants and animals underwent drastic mutations.","A tiny ant could grow larger than an elephant.","A small loach could become thicker than a python.","A single touch-me-not plant could drain a living person of all their flesh and blood, leaving behind nothing but a skeleton.","And if humans were exposed to too much of this acid rain, they could develop severe skin diseases or even die outright.","Of course, a little exposure wouldn’t cause much harm.","But Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t understand why the acid rain had arrived so much earlier in this life.","The zombie crisis wasn’t even over yet, and now there was the extreme cold. Before the cold could pass, acid rain had arrived.","It was as if the world was determined to wipe out humanity!","In the extreme cold, crops were practically impossible to grow.","Food was already scarce, but at least people could dig up roots or scavenge other things from the snow to survive.","But with this acid rain, any plants left exposed would rot almost instantly.","Plants drenched in acid rain would be completely inedible.","This meant that many survivors who relied on digging up roots or foraging for fruit would soon face starvation.","Meanwhile, countless animals that had been hiding in the forests would mutate into creatures as terrifying as zombies—or perhaps even more so.","Human survival would become even more precarious!","Yun Xiaoxiao took a deep breath. There was no time to dwell on it.","She quickly conjured two layers of ice barriers to block the zombies at both ends of the street.","Then, at lightning speed, she killed the zombies closing in on them.","She summoned Little Eagle and flew onto its back.","“Get on, quick!”","As she recalled Little Cutie and Little Flower, she shouted to the five women.","At the same time, she helped fend off the zombies that were closing in on them.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao had finally decided to leave, the five women didn’t hesitate and quickly climbed onto Little Eagle’s back.","However, they were unaccustomed to the experience.","They were afraid of stepping too hard and hurting Little Eagle, fearing it might get angry and throw them off.","So they sat cautiously, not daring to move.","“Where do you live?”","As Little Eagle took off, Yun Xiaoxiao asked without hesitation.","A woman in her forties with tanned skin pointed to a tall clock tower not far in the city.","“Over there.”","As soon as she spoke, Little Eagle soared toward it.","The rushing wind whistled past their ears, and the women nearly screamed in shock.","One of them even had her hat blown off by the strong wind.","They had never imagined that one day they would be flying through the sky on the back of a giant eagle!","The sensation was absolutely thrilling!","“Why did it suddenly start raining?”","“Wait, this rain feels strange. It’s burning my skin a little.”","“It’s true! It stings!”","Finally, they began to notice something was wrong.","“It’s acid rain. Too much exposure... can kill you.”","A soft, childlike voice came from the front of Little Eagle.","It was Yun Xiaoxiao, sitting near the eagle’s neck.","Hearing this, the women’s eyes widened in shock.","What?!"]},{"number":329,"title":"Chapter 329: My Face Itches So Much","paragraphs":["Fortunately, their location wasn’t too far from the clock tower, so they arrived shortly after.","None of them had been drenched too much by the acid rain.","After placing the women in a safe spot, Yun Xiaoxiao recalled her little eagle back into her spatial storage and quickly disappeared.","The entire process took less than a second.","The women were left bewildered, almost convinced they had hallucinated.","Where did she go?","Wasn’t she just here?","How could she vanish in the blink of an eye?","Yun Xiaoxiao left so swiftly because she was deeply concerned about Yun City.","In her memories, the acid rain wasn’t supposed to arrive for several more years.","Because of this, she hadn’t warned Lu Chen and the others in advance.","She made her way to an empty room on the top floor of a building near the clock tower, where she retrieved her radio equipment and voice modulator.","The reason she didn’t notify Lu Chen directly was that, although they treated her like a younger sister, everyone had their secrets.","Aside from Lu Chen, no one else knew she was a reincarnator.","She didn’t want them to see her as a monster.","So, she avoided revealing too much whenever possible.","Besides, warning everyone would serve as a wake-up call.","If more people could survive, then so be it.","Humanity was already struggling enough.","With practiced ease, she put on the voice modulator and turned on the radio...","“Acid rain is falling. It is highly corrosive. Prolonged exposure can cause skin diseases or even death. After the acid rain, plants and animals will undergo widespread mutations. Be cautious. Also, avoid drinking untreated water, as water sources have been contaminated.”","After recording the message, she set it to loop.","She hoped...","that as many people as possible would hear it.","She had done all she could.","The rest was up to them.","She walked over to the large floor-to-ceiling window and gazed out at the acid rain falling steadily outside.","The already desolate city looked even more bleak and sorrowful.","From her vantage point, she could see the clock tower clearly.","Aside from the main structure, there was also a modest-sized courtyard and a long corridor.","At that moment, the corridor was packed with people.","Around thirty or so.","All of them were women.","Their ages ranged from a few years old to over sixty.","Not a single man was in sight.","They watched the rain falling in the courtyard with a mix of curiosity and concern.","“Look at the rose over there!”","A teenage girl pointed in surprise to the left side of the courtyard.","There, a lone rose had been blooming.","But now, under the corrosive effects of the acid rain, it was rapidly withering.","The once vibrant pink petals twisted and shriveled.","Soon, they turned black and oozed a thick, putrid liquid.","The branches, leaves, and weeds in the courtyard fared no better, gradually losing their color and vitality.","Everyone’s expression grew grave as they witnessed the scene.","Just then, a middle-aged woman began scratching her face.","“What’s wrong?”","Someone beside her asked.","The middle-aged woman shook her head while continuing to scratch vigorously.","“I don’t know. It just feels really itchy.”","They didn’t have a radio, so they hadn’t heard Yun Xiaoxiao’s earlier warning.","At this point, they still hadn’t grasped the severity of the situation.","Meanwhile, acid rain was falling across the globe.","In places where the radio message had been received, people adopted a “better safe than sorry” attitude.","After all, the anonymous prediction of the extreme cold had already come true.","So, they stayed indoors, avoided drinking untreated water, and suffered minimal casualties.","But those in areas without radios weren’t so lucky.","Apart from those who disliked rain or were naturally cautious, most people didn’t notice anything unusual about the sudden downpour.","Some even used buckets or basins to collect the rainwater.","After all, in many water-scarce regions, water was the essence of life.","And in areas covered by snow and ice, the destructive power of the acid rain wasn’t immediately visible.","So, they didn’t perceive it as a threat.","By the time they realized the danger, it was too late.","Many people, after prolonged exposure to the acid rain or consuming contaminated water, suffered from severe skin ulcers, festering sores, and ultimately died.","Those who managed to survive often endured unbearable itching, peeling skin, hair loss, and disfigurement.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned slightly as she watched the middle-aged woman scratching her face.","This woman was one of the five who had stayed behind with her earlier.","From the looks of it, she had already been affected.","Without timely treatment, her condition would only worsen.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out a bottle of spirit spring water from her spatial storage.","If the spirit spring water could accelerate the healing of wounds,","then perhaps it could also neutralize the effects of the acid rain?","She wasn’t one to hesitate.","Once the thought crossed her mind, she acted.","In the next moment, she appeared at one end of the clock tower’s corridor.","Her sudden appearance startled everyone once again.","“It’s you, little sister!”","The scratching woman quickly recognized her.","After some explanation, the others learned that Yun Xiaoxiao had been the one to rescue them earlier.","They had gone out to search for winter supplies but had the misfortune of encountering snowmelt zombies, which nearly wiped them out.","If it hadn’t been for Yun Xiaoxiao’s timely intervention, the consequences would have been dire.","So, they were all deeply grateful to her.","Yun Xiaoxiao watched as the middle-aged woman thanked her with a smile while continuing to scratch her face.","She handed over the bottle of water.","“Auntie, this is for you.”","The middle-aged woman was momentarily stunned, unsure why Yun Xiaoxiao was giving her a bottle of water.","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to her face.","“Wash your face with this. See if it still itches.”","“Oh, oh, alright.”","The woman quickly accepted the bottle, murmuring her thanks.","Knowing Yun Xiaoxiao meant well, she didn’t want to dismiss her kindness.","Though she wasn’t sure if a bottle of water would help her face, it was worth a try.","She hurried to find a basin and poured the spirit spring water into it.","Then, she gently splashed the water onto her face.","It felt cool and soothing.","She continued to pat her face with the water.","The others gathered around to watch.","“Little sister, you said earlier that prolonged exposure to acid rain can be fatal. Is that true?”","Someone asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the withered rose in the courtyard.","“Didn’t you see for yourselves?”","Following her gaze, the others immediately understood what she meant.","“So, does that mean we can’t drink well water anymore?” someone else asked.","No one answered, but they all knew the answer was yes.","For a long time after this, water-based abilities would become highly sought after in every major base.","What was once considered a relatively useless ability would suddenly become invaluable."]},{"number":330,"title":"Chapter 330: I want you to leave here immediately","paragraphs":["“Huh, it really doesn’t itch as much anymore.”","After a while, the middle-aged woman lifted her head from the washbasin, her face filled with surprise.","Everyone looked over curiously.","The red scratches on her face had faded significantly, and the swelling had also gone down.","“It really works!”","Everyone marveled at the effect.","Just then, another woman raised her red, swollen right hand.","“My hand accidentally got hit by some of the rain, and now it’s getting itchier and itchier. Will it work if I use this too?”","“Then hurry up and give it a try.”","The middle-aged woman, Huang Yan, quickly handed over the washbasin.","But the woman with the swollen right hand hesitated, a hint of disgust in her eyes.","“You’ve already used this water. Won’t the effect be weaker?","And what if the toxins you washed off your face are still in the water? If I use it too, won’t that just make things worse?”","“Well...”","Huang Yan was momentarily stumped by her words.","The woman with the swollen hand turned to Yun Xiaoxiao, her face plastered with a fake smile.","“Little girl, do you still have that water? Can you give me a bottle too?”","Yun Xiaoxiao quietly glanced at her, then shook her head indifferently.","“No, I don’t.”","As soon as she said this, a flash of anger quickly crossed the woman’s eyes.","But she hid it well, immediately replacing it with an overly fake smile.","“How can you not have any? You’re lying, aren’t you?","Children shouldn’t tell lies.","If you have it, just give it to me. Don’t be so stingy. One bottle or two, it’s all the same. My hand is really itchy.”","“Hu Ling, don’t be like this. The little girl already said she doesn’t have any.”","Huang Yan shook her head at her.","The others didn’t know how capable Yun Xiaoxiao was, but they had just witnessed it.","She was worried that Hu Ling might cross the line and offend Yun Xiaoxiao, leading to an unpleasant situation.","But Hu Ling completely missed Huang Yan’s hint, her mouth twisting in anger.","“Sister Huang Yan, your face is fine now, so of course you’re not in a hurry.","But my hand is unbearably itchy. What if it gets worse?","I think she’s just being selfish and doesn’t want to share!","So narrow-minded at such a young age.","It’s just a bottle of water. Why be so stingy?”","As she spoke, she kept glancing at Yun Xiaoxiao, her tone dripping with sarcasm, as if Yun Xiaoxiao owed her something.","Huang Yan was about to say something, but Yun Xiaoxiao spoke up first, her voice calm and icy.","“You’re right. I do have it, but what can I do? I just don’t want to give it to you.”","“What?!”","Hu Ling was infuriated by Yun Xiaoxiao’s tone.","“Why?!”","She glared at Yun Xiaoxiao, her temper flaring as the itch in her hand grew worse.","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged. “No reason. I just... don’t like you.”","Hu Ling: !!!","“How dare you! Do you know who I am?!”","She roared in anger.","No one had ever dared to treat her so disrespectfully!","“Alright, Hu Ling, just come and wash your hand already.”","Huang Yan quickly tugged at her sleeve.","Others also chimed in, “Yeah, Lingzi, don’t be like this.”","But Hu Ling not only refused to listen, her anger only grew.","“Sister Huang Yan, if it weren’t for my sister taking you in back then, you would’ve been bitten to death by zombies!","But look at you now, siding with some outsider to bully me!”","As she spoke, her eyes reddened.","“My sister’s dead, and this is how you treat me? How can you live with yourselves?!”","The others exchanged uneasy glances.","A girl in her teens, Little Dong, broke free from Huang Yan’s grip and stepped forward.","“If no one else will say it, then I will. I’ve had enough!”","She stared straight at Hu Ling. “We’re all grateful that your sister took us in.","But you’re not her.","Why should we treat you like royalty just because of what she did?","Everyone takes turns going out to find supplies, but not you!","We’ve let that slide.","But at least you could help out around here, right?","Instead, all you do is sleep and eat.","You don’t lift a finger.","And that’s not even the worst part.","Whenever things don’t go your way, you bring up your sister and act all high and mighty, like we owe you something.","We owe your sister, not you!","Besides, we’ve already done more than enough to repay you since your sister died.","We don’t owe you anything!”","The girl’s voice grew louder as she spoke.","“Oh, and let’s not forget—if you hadn’t been so reckless, ignoring Sister Huang Yan’s warning about the acid rain, and gone out to pick up your stupid high heels, you wouldn’t have tripped and fallen!","Sister Huang Yan wouldn’t have had to risk getting hurt in the acid rain to carry you back!","Her face wouldn’t have been injured!","If it weren’t for this little girl’s water, Sister Huang Yan’s face would’ve been ruined because of you!","And now, when Sister Huang Yan kindly offers you the water to wash your hand, you have the nerve to complain!","You should be grateful you even have the chance to use it!","If I were her, I wouldn’t give it to you either.","You’re so spoiled!”","As soon as Little Dong finished speaking, the room fell silent.","Everything she said was true.","But out of respect for Hu Ling’s late sister, everyone had kept quiet, choosing to endure her behavior.","Now that it was all out in the open, the atmosphere became awkward.","The truth was, Yun Xiaoxiao hadn’t given Hu Ling the water because she had seen what happened earlier.","Just after sending out the radio message, she had walked to the window and seen Hu Ling running into the rain in her high heels.","Huang Yan had tried to stop her, but Hu Ling shook her off.","After falling, Hu Ling threw a tantrum on the ground, forcing Huang Yan to rush out into the rain without any protection to bring her back.","Someone like that? Yun Xiaoxiao would never save her.","Not stabbing her was already an act of mercy.","Saving her?","Out of the question.","Her spiritual spring water wasn’t meant for just anyone.","Being publicly called out, Hu Ling’s mood darkened.","Her face was stern, and her fists clenched tightly.","Huang Yan, still soft-hearted and mindful of Hu Ling’s sister’s kindness, tried to smooth things over.","“Hu Ling, Little Dong is young. Don’t take her words to heart.","The water might’ve been used, but it should still work.","Wash your hand first, or the wound might get worse.”","She carried the washbasin over to Hu Ling, patiently persuading her.","But Hu Ling slapped the basin away, sending water splashing everywhere.","She glared at Huang Yan, her voice filled with rage.","“Hmph! I don’t need your fake concern!","Do you know how disgusting it is to see you acting all self-righteous?","It makes me sick!”","With that, she pointed at the door of the clock tower, her neck veins bulging.","“Now, I want all of you to get out of here immediately!”"]},{"number":331,"title":"Chapter 331: Regret","paragraphs":["Everyone exchanged uneasy glances.","Seeing this, Hu Ling sneered.","\"What, don't want to leave?\"","She already knew that with the terrifying acid rain pouring outside, these people wouldn’t dare to step out!","Hmph!","\"If you don’t want to leave, then apologize to me right now!\"","Hu Ling raised her voice, speaking with an air of superiority.","She then pointed a finger at Yun Xiaoxiao, her face smug. \"And you, hurry up and get me a new bottle of water... Ah!\"","Before she could finish her sentence, Yun Xiaoxiao lashed out with a vine from a distance, sending Hu Ling tumbling to the ground.","\"Has no one ever told you that I hate being pointed at?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao took two steps forward, looking down at Hu Ling, who was now trembling with fear.","\"And... don’t order me around, because... it makes me want to hit you.\"","A mischievous smile played on Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips, but it only made Hu Ling’s heart race with dread.","This kid was too strange!","Who just attacks without warning like that?","Huang Yan glanced over and shook her head slightly.","She turned to the others, who all nodded at her, as if they had made a decision.","Understanding their intentions, she said, \"Alright, everyone, go pack up and let’s leave.\"","Everyone nodded and quickly dispersed.","Hu Ling, still on the ground, was stunned.","She never expected that Huang Yan and the others would actually leave!","This shocked her even more than Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly hitting her.","Outside, the acid rain was pouring down—terrifying and deadly.","Prolonged exposure could cause severe itching and even death!","That’s why she had provoked them earlier.","She was sure they wouldn’t dare to leave and would eventually apologize to her.","But...","They were really leaving!","This was like a slap in her face.","Now, she felt a pang of panic.","She had no special abilities and was physically weak.","Huang Yan and the others had always been the ones to go out and find food, allowing her to live comfortably in the clock tower.","Thanks to her sister’s influence, no one dared to say anything to her.","She had grown accustomed to living like a spoiled princess here.","But now, these people were leaving.","What would she eat? Drink? Use?","And if zombies came, who would protect her?","The thought made her heart race with anxiety.","But the words had already been spoken, and she couldn’t take them back.","That would be too humiliating!","Hu Ling felt as if a lump of cotton was stuck in her chest, suffocating her.","Watching Hu Ling’s regretful expression, Yun Xiaoxiao simply stood to the side, coldly observing.","Heaven’s retribution can be avoided, but self-inflicted suffering cannot be escaped.","Huang Yan and the others, out of respect for Hu Ling’s sister’s past kindness, didn’t take all the supplies.","In truth, if they wanted to, they could have taken everything, and Hu Ling wouldn’t have been able to stop them.","They could have even forced her out.","But they chose not to.","Instead, they left her some supplies, armed themselves, and used large basins or discarded wooden doors to shield themselves as they prepared to brave the acid rain.","\"Xiaoxiao, are you going on your own, or are you coming with us?\" Huang Yan asked.","She knew Yun Xiaoxiao could come and go as she pleased, so she posed the question.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly. \"Auntie, it’s you who are coming with me.\"","Huang Yan and the others: ???","Before they could process what Yun Xiaoxiao meant, they felt a sudden dizziness.","When they regained their senses, they found themselves inside a tall building.","The space was wide, and the view was bright.","They: !!!","Within a minute or two, Yun Xiaoxiao had brought the rest of the group over as well.","Everyone exchanged looks, their eyes filled with awe.","What kind of incredible power was this?","They looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with gratitude and admiration.","Though it might sound strange to feel admiration for a child, it was the most genuine feeling they had at that moment!","This was the room next to where Yun Xiaoxiao had placed the radio equipment.","Aside from a desk, chair, and a sofa, the room was mostly empty, with plenty of space.","From here, they could clearly see the situation at the clock tower.","\"Sigh...\"","Huang Yan sighed softly as she watched Hu Ling yelling furiously in the courtyard.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, let out a light scoff.","Was this person stupid? The zombies were frozen, not dead.","Shouting like that was practically inviting the zombies to find her!","Sure enough, within moments, a few zombies emerged from the snow, staggering toward the clock tower.","Fortunately, these zombies weren’t very strong.","They were stopped at the clock tower’s gate.","The growls and the violent banging on the door nearly scared Hu Ling to death.","She immediately clamped her mouth shut, her face pale.","At the same time, she felt her hands itching even more.","She scratched furiously, breaking the skin and drawing blood.","She cursed under her breath.","Then, her eyes fell on the water basin left on the ground—the one Huang Yan had used earlier.","Her gaze darkened, and she dipped her hands into it.","\"Tsk...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but smirk at the sight.","If only she had thought of this earlier.","Huang Yan and the others also exchanged wry smiles.","They hadn’t expected Hu Ling, who had been so disdainful earlier, to end up using it after all.","\"Xiaoxiao, you must be hungry. Here, have this sweet cake I made earlier.\"","Huang Yan handed Yun Xiaoxiao a palm-sized cake, smiling warmly.","The cake was pale yellow, topped with a generous amount of sugar.","It looked quite appetizing.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head and politely declined, \"Thank you, but I have my own food.\"","With that, she pulled out a donut from her small backpack.","It was from a bakery in Yun City.","She had found it delicious and stored some in her space.","Though Huang Yan and the others seemed trustworthy and hadn’t shown any red flags, it was always better to be cautious.","After all, they had only known each other for a few hours.","Eating something from them felt too risky.","Seeing this, Huang Yan took the cake back, but she didn’t feel offended.","Instead, she thought Yun Xiaoxiao was being considerate and mature.","This little girl must have noticed their limited food supply and was trying to save it for them.","She was... too good!","Yun Xiaoxiao had originally planned to return to Yun City to check on things.","But over the radio, Mu Yang had immediately sent a message, assuring her that the base was safe.","It seemed he had guessed her intentions and wanted her to stay put, not risking a return.","Knowing the base was fine, Yun Xiaoxiao felt relieved.","The acid rain continued for three days.","During this time, plants withered on a large scale, and animals either shed their fur or died.","The world became even more desolate and bleak.","The sky seemed to take on a lifeless hue."]},{"number":332,"title":"Chapter 332: Don't Worry, Sister Will Take You to Eat","paragraphs":["Through Huang Yan and the others' casual conversation, Yun Xiaoxiao finally learned the backstory.","It turned out that the Bell Tower was the property of Hu Ling's parents.","Her parents had died at the beginning of the apocalypse, leaving only Hu Ling and her older sister.","Hu Ling's sister was a kind-hearted person who had been sheltering survivors fleeing the chaos.","Initially, both men and women lived in the Bell Tower, totaling over a hundred people.","With so many people, conflicts were inevitable.","A few of the men, in particular, would secretly harass the pretty girls.","Hu Ling's sister, along with Huang Yan and the others, decided to expel them all.","However, those men weren’t willing to accept it. One night, they broke into the Bell Tower and lured a zombie inside.","This led to many innocent lives being lost.","In the effort to drive the zombie out, most of the remaining men sacrificed themselves.","Hu Ling's sister also died in the process.","To eliminate the threat once and for all, the remaining men stepped up to deal with those scoundrels.","But after leaving, they never returned.","The scoundrels never caused trouble again either.","To prevent such incidents from recurring, the Bell Tower stopped accepting men from that point onward.","The thirty or so survivors had been supporting each other ever since.","\"Big Sister Huang Yan, where are we going next?\"","Late at night, Little Dong sat on the floor, hugging her knees, her eyes filled with confusion as she asked.","Huang Yan glanced out the window.","\"The Central Base.\"","In fact, she had wanted to lead the group to the Central Base half a year ago.","Firstly, it was the largest base in the central region, offering greater safety.","Moreover, it wasn’t too far from their current location—just two days away if everything went smoothly.","Secondly, her sister and brother-in-law’s family might also be there.","The reason they hadn’t gone yet was because Hu Ling had always refused to leave the Bell Tower.","Out of gratitude for Hu Ling's sister, Huang Yan couldn’t bring herself to abandon Hu Ling.","So, the plan had been put on hold.","Now, with no more reservations and nowhere else to go, it was only natural to head there.","\"What about Sister Xiaoxiao?\"","Little Dong glanced at the wall.","Huang Yan was momentarily stunned before she smiled.","\"She... probably won’t be coming with us.\"","For the past three days, Yun Xiaoxiao hadn’t stayed with them.","Instead, she had been living alone next door.","But they knew that she went out every day.","On the first day, she had cleared out all the zombies in their building.","On the second day, she had cleaned out the zombies in the buildings across from them.","On the third day, which was today, no one knew where she had gone, but she had left early in the morning and only returned after dark.","In short, she hardly seemed to rest.","Huang Yan had tried to bring her food a few times, but Yun Xiaoxiao had refused, even giving them some supplies in return.","She was a lone wolf—cautious yet kind, utterly unique.","Huang Yan had never met a child with such a distinct personality before.","On the fourth day, the rain finally stopped.","Huang Yan and the others began gathering supplies, preparing for their journey.","Yun Xiaoxiao, meanwhile, was busy hunting down the zombies in the city that had caught her \"eye.\"","It seemed like everyone had almost forgotten about Hu Ling.","But on the morning of the sixth day, a piercing scream erupted from the Bell Tower.","Hearing it, Huang Yan and the others were startled and rushed to the floor-to-ceiling windows.","\"My God, what... is that monster?!\"","Little Dong’s eyes widened in disbelief as she stared at the rose bush in the Bell Tower’s courtyard, which was nearly half as tall as the tower itself. Her face was filled with terror.","At that moment, Hu Ling was bound head to toe by the thorny rose vines and lifted into the air.","The thorns pierced through her coat and dug into her flesh.","Blood streamed down the thorns but was quickly absorbed by the greenish vines.","Hu Ling screamed in agony, her face twisted as if she were being tortured.","Huang Yan couldn’t bear to watch and wanted to save her.","But just then, Hu Ling shouted.","\"Ahhh! Huang Yan, you heartless people, come save me already!\"","\"My sister took you in out of kindness, and now you’re leaving her sister to die? You ungrateful wretches, you’ll die horrible deaths, ahhh!\"","Since the distance between their building and the Bell Tower wasn’t far, and Hu Ling’s voice was loud, her words reached Huang Yan and the others clearly.","They hadn’t been hiding their presence these past few days, so Hu Ling knew they were in the building.","Her words were clearly meant for them.","Huang Yan, who had been about to rush to her rescue, froze in her tracks upon hearing this.","If Hu Ling hadn’t said those things, she would have gone over immediately.","No matter how dangerous it was, she would have tried to save her—out of respect for Hu Ling’s sister.","But now, after hearing those words, she no longer wanted to.","This person’s character was completely different from the strong and decisive girl she remembered.","They didn’t seem like sisters at all!","Everything about Hu Ling felt like a stain on the memory of that wonderful woman.","In that case, it might be better if she... just died!","A flicker of indifference passed through Huang Yan’s eyes.","If Huang Yan didn’t want to save her, the others certainly had no intention of doing so either.","Not only was there the terrifying, human-sized rose bush, but Hu Ling’s words had completely extinguished any desire to help her.","Next door, Yun Xiaoxiao sat leisurely in a recliner, munching on an apple and warming herself by the fire, calmly watching Hu Ling being drained of blood.","In fact, she had been the first to notice.","She had spotted the rose bush beginning to mutate earlier but hadn’t intervened.","Instead, she had sat back and enjoyed the show.","She had no reason to save someone she didn’t like.","Over at the Bell Tower, Hu Ling’s screams grew weaker.","Her face visibly paled as the life drained from her body.","Yun Xiaoxiao absently stroked the flower bracelet on her wrist.","\"Do you think you can handle eating that rose bush?\"","The little flower bracelet immediately grew larger, glanced in the direction of the mutated rose bush, and nodded excitedly.","It then tried to climb out the window to head over.","Yun Xiaoxiao held it back.","\"Don’t rush. Wait a bit. I’ll take you over to eat it soon.\"","A meaningful smile flickered in her eyes.","While her little flower and beasts had previously grown stronger through spirit spring water and evolution liquid, their best nourishment wasn’t those things.","It was... their own kind—other creatures with mutated genes!","She was curious to see what changes would occur after her little flower devoured the rose bush.","Just as Hu Ling took her last breath, a small figure suddenly appeared on the Bell Tower courtyard’s wall.","\"Hey, isn’t that Sister Xiaoxiao?\"","\"Why is she over there?\"","Huang Yan and the others were puzzled.","But the next second, they saw a morning glory vine, even thicker than the mutated rose bush, emerge. Its flower bud opened wide and... swallowed the rose bush whole!"]},{"number":333,"title":"Chapter 333: Battle Against the Queen Bee","paragraphs":["Everyone: !!!","Originally, they all thought the mutated rose was already vicious and powerful, but they never expected there would be something even more terrifying.","This flower was even more ferocious!","It would start eating without hesitation.","And it did so with such efficiency.","The mutated rose didn’t even have time to resist before it “gloriously sacrificed” itself.","Strangely, despite its ferocity and enormous size, the trumpet flower rubbed against Yun Xiaoxiao’s face as if seeking praise.","This left Huang Yan and the others utterly dumbfounded.","But what surprised them even more was that the trumpet flower’s vines suddenly sprouted many sharp thorns, as if they had been transplanted from the rose.","Had it... fused with it?","Over there, Yun Xiaoxiao was also pleasantly surprised by the changes in Little Flower.","She stroked its petals, a smile curling at the corners of her lips.","“Not bad. From now on, big sister will take you to eat more delicious things.”","Little Flower immediately swayed its branches and leaves joyfully.","Hu Ling was dead.","All the blood in her body had been drained, leaving her corpse as dry as a mummy.","In the end, Huang Yan and the others couldn’t bear to leave her body exposed, so they dug a hole in the flower bed near the bell tower and buried her.","Over the next few days, the group worked even harder to prepare supplies and equipment for their migration.","Finally, the day of departure arrived.","“Xiaoxiao, even though you’re strong, you still need to be careful when you’re alone,” Huang Yan reminded her with concern.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and nodded. “Got it.”","Only then did Huang Yan and the others lower their voices and quietly make their way out of the city.","They had already scouted the route in advance over the past few days.","Although it was a bit longer, it allowed them to avoid most of the frozen zombies.","Plus, Yun Xiaoxiao had already taken out many powerful zombies in recent days, so their plan to leave the city went relatively smoothly.","Once they were gone, Yun Xiaoxiao threw herself back into her mission of hunting and killing zombies.","However, she soon encountered an unexpected situation.","While she was battling a high-level, sixth-tier mutated zombie, a swarm of mutated bees suddenly surged toward her from her diagonal rear.","There were so many of them, and they were enormous.","Especially the queen bee, which was as big as a pigeon!","The stinger on its tail was long and sharp, dripping with dense venom.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao assessed the situation and chose not to confront them head-on, instead teleporting into her space, one of the venomous bees still managed to strike.","It stung her left eyelid.","Within seconds, her eyelid swelled up.","When she looked in the mirror, she almost exploded with anger.","Her left eyelid was as swollen as a steamed bun, both painful and itchy.","Her once-pretty face now looked like something out of a horror movie.","Little Cutie, Little Flower, Little Eagle, and Big White all tilted their heads, looking at her curiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao twitched her lips.","“Turn around. Don’t look at me.”","The little ones immediately turned their backs in unison.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly immersed herself in the spirit spring.","The itching and pain in her eyelid finally eased a little.","Two days later, the swelling completely subsided.","Yun Xiaoxiao geared up, covering herself from head to toe.","Even her eyes were protected by a pair of wraparound sunglasses.","Behind the lenses, her eyes sparkled with a sharp, determined light.","“Let’s go. Time for revenge!”","She teleported out of her space and appeared on the rooftop of a tall building.","In the center of the rooftop, she placed an oil drum.","Then, she took out many pots of brightly blooming flowers from her space and arranged them around the oil drum.","These were flowers that Big White had planted to beautify the space.","Now, the colorful blossoms stood out starkly against the white snow, creating an eerie yet beautiful scene.","In addition, she sprinkled some sugar and honey on the snow around the flowers.","After setting everything up, she teleported to a room on the top floor of the building across the street.","The wind howled, and everything seemed eerily calm.","About twenty minutes later, a faint buzzing sound grew louder and louder, approaching from the distance.","The sound became more intense and closer.","In the distant sky, a large cluster of black dots appeared.","The dots grew larger and larger, gradually revealing their true forms.","A giant queen bee led a massive swarm of bees as they flew toward the rooftop with the flowers and honey.","One by one, they descended, enjoying the feast laid out just for them.","However, what they didn’t notice was that while they were happily indulging, a small figure quietly raised her right hand.","In an instant, a massive pillar of flame shot out, streaking across the street and hitting the oil drum on the opposite rooftop.","“Boom!”","A deafening explosion rang out.","The oil drum was blown apart, and the rooftop was engulfed in thick smoke and flames.","Debris flew in all directions, crashing and tumbling from the height.","The swarm of mutated bees was instantly reduced to ash.","However, the queen bee managed to escape.","Seeing the queen bee swiftly flying out of the smoke, Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes and quickly stepped forward.","In a few moments, she intercepted it.","“Buzzzzz...”","The queen bee’s wings vibrated rapidly.","Its large, black eyes, which looked like they were wearing oversized sunglasses, stared straight at Yun Xiaoxiao, as if expressing its displeasure.","In the next second, it attacked.","It flew toward Yun Xiaoxiao at incredible speed, its movements agile and unpredictable, trying to catch her off guard and sting her.","But its plan failed.","Yun Xiaoxiao had already prepared for this and wasn’t about to let it succeed.","She unleashed waves of fire from within her, forcing the queen bee to retreat repeatedly.","It was smart, though. Seeing that the situation was unfavorable, it tried to escape.","But Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t going to let it get away.","With a combination of fire and ice, she cut off all escape routes.","A fierce blast of fire burned off the queen bee’s wings, causing it to plummet toward the ground.","Yun Xiaoxiao whipped out a vine, wrapping it around the queen bee’s dying body and quickly pulling it up, tossing it into the air.","“Little Cutie, here’s a snack for you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Little Cutie suddenly grew larger and swallowed the queen bee in one gulp.","After eating it, Little Cutie swayed a few times, as if it were drunk.","For a moment, Yun Xiaoxiao thought it might have been poisoned.","But soon, it proudly waved its antennae and raised its stinger high.","It even playfully dripped a drop of liquid onto an abandoned wooden stool.","In the next moment, the legs of the stool rotted away at an astonishing speed.","Yun Xiaoxiao was delighted.","It worked!","Little Cutie’s stinger already contained potent venom.","Now, after consuming the venomous queen bee, its toxicity had reached a whole new level.","“Clap, clap, clap...”","Just then, a series of clapping sounds came from not far behind Yun Xiaoxiao.","She frowned and quickly turned her head.","There, standing on the water tower of a tall building, was a girl about her age, clapping and smiling at her."]},{"number":334,"title":"Chapter 334: Qu Xiaobei and the Old Taoist Priest","paragraphs":["The girl had her hair tied up in a high ponytail and was dressed in a thick, floral-patterned jacket.","Her eyebrows arched slightly upward, and the corners of her lips curled into a smile.","What stood out the most was the teardrop-shaped mole near her right eye, resembling a tiny heart.","She raised her hand and pointed at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"You're amazing. I like you.\"","Her words were bold and straightforward, spoken without hesitation.","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips twitched slightly.","She couldn't understand why she had suddenly been \"confessed\" to.","But she knew the girl wasn't lying.","The intimacy level between them was already at 95%.","Curious, Yun Xiaoxiao observed the girl more closely.","She was also an ability user.","And her abilities were quite unique—three in total: Damage Transfer, Wind Element, and Replication.","Damage Transfer was somewhat similar to Zhao Rongyan's Retribution ability.","It meant that any harm directed at her wouldn't directly affect her but would instead be transferred elsewhere.","Wind Element was straightforward—it allowed her to manipulate wind, creating lethal attacks or enabling her to fly through the air.","As for Replication...","Yun Xiaoxiao was particularly intrigued.","Even in her past life, she had never encountered someone with a Replication ability.","According to the Scumbag Detection Panel, this ability allowed the user to duplicate something.","But how exactly it worked and what could be replicated remained a mystery.","\"My name is Qu Xiaobei. What's yours?\"","Qu Xiaobei flew over to Yun Xiaoxiao, tilting her head as she examined her curiously.","\"Yun Xiaoxiao.\"","\"Wow, that's such a pretty name! I'm almost seven years old. How about you?\"","\"Just turned six.\"","\"Really? That's great! Now I have a little sister!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"......\"","Who said anything about being your little sister?","\"Dad said I'd meet my best friend for life today, and he was absolutely right!\"","Qu Xiaobei smiled, her expression one of satisfaction.","Her face was lively and animated.","When she smiled, she gave off the vibe of a carefree, cheerful girl.","\"Dad?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","\"Yeah, oh, right, you haven't met him yet.\"","Qu Xiaobei pursed her lips, then covered her mouth and whispered with a wink, \"Actually, he's just an old charlatan.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyebrow twitched.","What...","\"Come on, let's go! We've got steamed buns at home. They should be ready by now. Let's hurry back and eat.\"","With that, Qu Xiaobei grabbed Yun Xiaoxiao's hand and flew toward the edge of the city.","This was the opposite direction of the clock tower.","The clock tower was located in the easternmost part of the city, while they were now heading west.","Yun Xiaoxiao knew Qu Xiaobei meant no harm and was genuinely curious about the Replication ability, so she didn't resist.","After flying for about twenty minutes, they arrived at a... temple in the suburbs.","The temple was perched on a low hill on the outskirts of the city.","It looked dilapidated, as if it might collapse at any moment.","The left wall near the entrance was propped up by a large wooden beam, barely holding it together.","Inside, the temple was empty and deserted, resembling an abandoned shrine.","\"Wow, I can already smell it! The buns must be ready!\"","Qu Xiaobei excitedly stared at the only roof emitting smoke and pulled Yun Xiaoxiao toward it.","Passing through an arched gate, they finally reached a slightly cleaner courtyard.","The snow in the yard had been swept away.","Directly ahead was the main hall, with smaller halls on either side.","At that moment, thick smoke was billowing from the roof of the building on the right.","\"Cough, cough, cough...\"","Suddenly, a coughing sound came from inside the building.","The voice was muffled and slightly hoarse.","A moment later, an old Taoist priest in a gray robe came running out of the smoke-filled room.","Inside, there was a loud \"bang,\" as if something had exploded.","\"Dad, where are my buns?\" Qu Xiaobei asked, tilting her head.","The soot-covered old priest, still hunched over and coughing, pointed inside.","Before he could say anything, Qu Xiaobei cheerfully dashed inside.","She moved as fast as the wind.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't even have time to stop her.","Within seconds, Qu Xiaobei came rushing back out at the same speed.","Standing next to the old priest, she coughed uncontrollably.","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"......\"","What kind of bizarre duo were these two?","She stood quietly to the side, waiting for them to finish coughing.","\"Dad, you blew up the pot again!\"","Qu Xiaobei caught her breath, wiped away the tears caused by her violent coughing, and glared at the old priest with her hands on her hips.","The old priest straightened up, panting, and waved his hand with a smile.","\"An accident, just an accident.\"","\"But this is your 108th accident!\" Qu Xiaobei pouted.","\"Heh, it's not the 109th yet, is it? Don't worry, next time, I promise I'll make the buns for you.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really, as true as gold.\"","The old priest's eyes gleamed with a hint of guilt as he smiled.","He then turned and noticed Yun Xiaoxiao standing in the courtyard.","\"And who is this?\"","He studied Yun Xiaoxiao, raising an eyebrow curiously.","\"Dad, don't you remember? You said if I flew east today, I'd meet my best friend for life. Well, here she is! I brought her back!\"","Qu Xiaobei proudly ran over to Yun Xiaoxiao and linked arms with her.","The old priest raised an eyebrow, stroked his non-existent beard, and nodded repeatedly.","\"Hmm, not bad, not bad. Judging by your faces, the two of you do share a deep bond.\"","After this cryptic remark, he suddenly changed the subject and looked at Qu Xiaobei.","\"Xiaobei, the rice jar is empty.\"","\"Huh? No rice left?\"","\"Just one grain.\"","\"Oh, okay, that's good.\"","Listening to their conversation, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't sure how to react.","She understood every word, but when put together, it made no sense.","Was one grain of rice supposed to be a good thing?","Was it even enough to fill a tooth?","Before she could figure it out, Qu Xiaobei clamped her mouth shut, covered her nose, and rushed back into the building.","A moment later, she emerged.","In her hands was a large plastic basin.","She opened her other hand, revealing a single plump, glistening grain of rice.","Then, she clenched her fist around the grain.","When she opened it again, one grain had become two.","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"!!!\"","She stared in shock.","Qu Xiaobei repeated the action.","Two grains became four.","Over and over, the large plastic basin was soon filled to the brim with rice.","Even Yun Xiaoxiao, who usually remained unflappable in the face of chaos, couldn't help but show a rare expression of surprise.","So this was... the Replication ability?","But...","She had assumed it was used to replicate other people's abilities.","Never did she imagine it would be used to replicate rice!","While duplicating food was undeniably impressive, it also felt a bit... underwhelming?"]},{"number":335,"title":"Chapter 335: Is it really that poor","paragraphs":["“Can you duplicate this?”","Yun Xiaoxiao, genuinely curious, handed a high-level fifth-grade crystal core, which had not yet been processed into evolution serum, to Qu Xiaobei.","Qu Xiaobei was momentarily stunned, then her eyes sparkled with excitement.","“Wow, what a beautiful stone!”","Yun Xiaoxiao: “......”","“This is called a crystal core. Haven’t you seen one before?”","Qu Xiaobei shook her head.","...Alright then.","“So, you want to make more of this?” Qu Xiaobei asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao: “Yes, can you do it?”","“I’ll try!”","With that, Qu Xiaobei excitedly took the crystal core and clasped it tightly in her palm.","Yun Xiaoxiao watched with anticipation.","A few seconds later, Qu Xiaobei opened her hand.","The crystal core remained unchanged, still just one.","“Ahem, don’t worry, let me try again.”","Qu Xiaobei chuckled awkwardly and clenched her hand once more.","This time, her expression turned serious, her brows furrowing slightly.","After about ten seconds...","Still no change.","“Um... it seems like it’s not working,” Qu Xiaobei said, scratching her head sheepishly.","“I’m sorry. As your good friend, I couldn’t even help with such a small thing.”","Yun Xiaoxiao: “...It’s fine. It was just an experiment. Success or failure doesn’t matter.”","Seeing that Qu Xiaobei seemed genuinely bothered, Yun Xiaoxiao took out a piece of chocolate from her bag.","“How about trying to duplicate this instead?”","“Okay!”","Qu Xiaobei immediately took it.","This time, it was a success. One piece of chocolate became two.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes flickered with realization.","It seemed that this duplication ability only worked on food.","Well, that wasn’t so bad. At least in this food-scarce post-apocalyptic world, they wouldn’t starve.","Noticing Qu Xiaobei swallowing hard as she stared at the chocolate, Yun Xiaoxiao handed both pieces to her.","“Here, you can have them.”","“Really?!” Qu Xiaobei’s eyes lit up.","“Yes.”","“Then I’ll make two more for you!”","With that, she duplicated two more pieces and handed them to Yun Xiaoxiao, keeping two for herself.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but smile faintly.","The smoke from the kitchen hadn’t cleared, so the old man brought the pot outside, cleaned it, and set up a small stove with bricks to cook.","Although his attempt at making steamed buns had failed, he managed to cook the rice properly.","At least... it didn’t explode.","As for the side dish...","It was just boiled white radish, eaten with dipping sauce.","Extremely... humble.","“Is this what you’ve been eating all this time?”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched slightly.","She noticed that the house seemed to have only four edible items: rice, flour, radishes, and two bottles of dipping sauce—one spicy and one mild.","There weren’t even any other seasonings.","She couldn’t help but wonder why, despite Qu Xiaobei’s ability to duplicate food, their meals were so meager.","This... left her speechless.","If they had just gone out to find more food, they wouldn’t be living like this... so impoverished.","“Yeah, these radishes are really tender!”","Qu Xiaobei picked up a boiled radish and handed it to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Then she took one for herself, skillfully peeled it, dipped it in sauce, and started eating.","After a few bites, she took a mouthful of rice.","She looked utterly content.","Yun Xiaoxiao stared at the white radish in her hand and ate the simplest dinner she’d had since her rebirth.","While eating, Qu Xiaobei and the old man suddenly became very quiet, fully focused on their meal.","Their movements were synchronized, as if they feared the food would disappear if they didn’t eat quickly.","They ate with such enthusiasm.","Yun Xiaoxiao also observed the eccentric old man with curiosity.","He had no supernatural abilities.","His words and actions were also quite cryptic.","Could he really just be a charlatan?","Had everything he told Qu Xiaobei been divined?","“Old man, can you tell fortunes?”","She asked tentatively.","The old man nodded while munching on his radish.","“Yes, yes, of course I can.”","“Then... can you tell mine?”","“Wait a moment, I’m almost done eating.”","“...Alright.”","After a while, the old man finally put down his bowl and chopsticks, letting out a satisfied sigh.","“I’m full.”","He turned to Yun Xiaoxiao, “Give me your hand.”","Yun Xiaoxiao held out her hand.","The old man studied her palm intently, then carefully examined her face.","After a moment, he began muttering something under his breath while making hand gestures, as if calculating something.","His voice was too soft for Yun Xiaoxiao to hear clearly.","Finally, he stopped and frowned slightly, looking puzzled.","“Young lady, your fate is quite unusual. You were destined to die before the age of sixteen, but for some reason, your destiny has been altered.”","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes widened.","Die before sixteen?!","In her previous life, hadn’t she died at fifteen?","It seemed the old man truly had some skills.","In this life, her soul was from her previous life, and she had a system. Could that be the reason her fate had changed?","“However, you still face a calamity in your fate—a deadly one. If you can’t resolve it properly, you might not even live to see your tenth birthday.”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s brows furrowed.","A deadly calamity?","Then she chuckled lightly.","“I believe in the power of human will. Even if there’s a destined calamity, I’ll break through it!”","Her life was hers to control!","The old man looked at Yun Xiaoxiao and slowly smiled, as if relieved of a burden.","He turned to Qu Xiaobei, who was still munching on her radish.","“Xiaobei, from now on, you’ll follow your good friend here. Remember, always trust her.”","Qu Xiaobei looked up, confused.","“Are we both going with Xiaoxiao?”","“No, just you.”","“Huh? Why?”","Qu Xiaobei immediately sat up straight, even putting down her radish.","Yun Xiaoxiao was also surprised. Why was the old man saying this?","The old man looked up at the distant sky, his voice tinged with melancholy.","“My time is up. I’ll soon be meeting our ancestors.”","He had long foreseen his impending death and had been searching for a protector for Qu Xiaobei.","In truth, he hadn’t divined that Yun Xiaoxiao was Qu Xiaobei’s destined lifelong friend.","He had only sensed that in that direction lay a future powerhouse of the world.","He had said what he did to make it easier for the carefree Qu Xiaobei to naturally befriend her.","“Where are the ancestors? I want to go too!”","Qu Xiaobei completely missed the underlying meaning of his words.","But Yun Xiaoxiao understood.","The old man was making his final arrangements.","Yet, he looked perfectly fine. How could he be nearing death?","But the next moment, the old man suddenly began coughing violently.","Blood spattered from his mouth.","Both Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei were startled.","“Old man, what’s wrong?”","Qu Xiaobei’s eyes instantly reddened, and she rushed to his side, crying.","The old man coughed for a while before catching his breath.","He forced a weak smile. “I’ve been ill for a long time. Now... I’m afraid I can’t hold on much longer.”"]},{"number":336,"title":"Chapter 336: Yun Xiaoxiao's Comfort","paragraphs":["Qu Xiaobei helped her father sit down on a chair.","The old man was breathing heavily, his mental state clearly deteriorating.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out a bottle of spirit spring water.","\"Drink a little,\" she said, handing it to him.","Although she knew the spirit spring water wasn't a cure-all, it was worth a try.","The old man took it, drank a couple of sips, and then began coughing again.","This time, the coughing was more violent than before, and more blood flowed.","\"Dad, don't scare me!\" Qu Xiaobei's tears streamed down her face.","The once lively eyes now filled with fear.","Yun Xiaoxiao also furrowed her brow.","It seemed the spirit spring water had no effect.","The old man patted Qu Xiaobei's shoulder and forced a weak smile.","\"Little Bei, don't cry. You need to be strong from now on, and don't be so naive anymore.","Always remember to trust your good friends.\"","Trust is the foundation of friendship.","Only then can you earn their true sincerity.","Once you have the genuine care of a powerful ally, you'll always have some form of protection.","The old man smiled faintly and turned his gaze to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Young friend, I entrust my Bei to you.","Although you're younger than her, I believe you're much wiser.\"","Qu Xiaobei, standing nearby: \"...\"","The old man continued, \"If she ever does something wrong, you can scold or even hit her, but please... don't abandon her. This... this is my gift to you.\"","He fumbled in his pocket and pulled out a small triangular pouch, trembling as he handed it to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned slightly.","Although she wasn't fond of being suddenly entrusted with someone, she didn't reject it outright.","Given Qu Xiaobei's special abilities, keeping her around would only be beneficial as long as her nature wasn't malicious.","She took the pouch but didn't open it immediately.","Because the moment she accepted it, the old man began coughing violently again.","This time, he never recovered.","\"Dad, why are your eyes closed? Open them!\"","\"Wake up, please wake up, Dad!\"","\"Are you leaving me? Wuwuwu...\"","Qu Xiaobei cried so hard she could barely breathe, her eyes swollen from tears.","She kept shaking her father's lifeless body, panicked and lost.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao was accustomed to death, the sound of Qu Xiaobei's heart-wrenching sobs still moved her.","She silently stayed by her side until Qu Xiaobei cried herself to sleep.","With a sigh, Yun Xiaoxiao carried Qu Xiaobei to a room in the main hall.","Thankfully, she had strength-based abilities; otherwise, she wouldn't have been able to carry Qu Xiaobei's weight.","After settling her, she took a white cloth from her space and covered the old man's body.","They would bury him tomorrow after Qu Xiaobei woke up.","His death had been so sudden, leaving even Yun Xiaoxiao unprepared.","She sat under the eaves, lit a candle, and opened the small pouch the old man had given her.","Inside were only three talismans.","She stared at them for a while but couldn't decipher what was written on them.","In both her past and present life, she had never seen anything like this.","Naturally, she had no idea what they were for.","She casually put them in her backpack and then disappeared into her space.","The next morning, she was awakened by the sound of crying.","Exiting her space, she saw Qu Xiaobei kneeling beside her father's body, weeping.","To prevent her from crying herself unconscious again, Yun Xiaoxiao stepped forward to comfort her.","\"Stop crying. No matter how much you cry, he won't wake up.\"","Qu Xiaobei glanced at her with tear-filled eyes.","Then, she cried even harder.","\"Wuwuwu! Dad, wake up!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"...\"","She rubbed her aching temples, resisting the urge to knock her out.","Well, considering she had just lost a loved one, she decided to be gentler.","\"If you keep crying, your dad will start to smell.\"","Hearing this, Qu Xiaobei immediately stopped crying.","\"Really? Dad hated bad smells.\"","\"Really.\"","\"Then... then I won't cry anymore.\"","Qu Xiaobei sniffled and wiped away her tears.","\"Should we bury Dad now?\" she asked.","When she was little, she had seen farmers bury their dead in coffins and then place them in the ground.","It was called \"resting in peace.\"","\"Yes, but we need to cremate the body first,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said.","Qu Xiaobei was stunned. \"What? Why? Shouldn't we put him in a coffin and bury him?\"","\"Nowadays, animals and plants are mutating. If we bury him directly, his body might get destroyed, and then your dad won't remain whole,\" Yun Xiaoxiao explained.","\"You mean... if we bury him, something might eat him?\"","\"Something like that.\"","\"So we have to burn him?\"","\"Yes, at least this way, his body will remain intact.\"","\"Then... okay.\"","And so, with a fire, the old man's body was reduced to ashes.","Qu Xiaobei went inside and found a small gray urn, carefully placing her father's ashes inside.","She sealed the urn with a lid, cloth, and wax, then placed it in a bamboo basket and carried it on her back.","\"Let's go,\" she said to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the urn on her back and twitched her lips.","\"Are you planning to carry that around forever?\"","Qu Xiaobei nodded firmly.","\"Yes. It's too lonely to leave Dad here. His dream was to travel and see the world. Since he can't do that anymore, I'll take him with me.\"","\"...Alright.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao had originally planned to take Qu Xiaobei back to Yun City before continuing her own journey.","But Qu Xiaobei insisted on staying with her.","She said that as her friend, she also wanted to grow stronger.","Only then could she be worthy of being her companion.","Yun Xiaoxiao had no reason to refuse someone who wanted to improve themselves.","In fact, she was quite pleased with her determination.","And so, the two girls set off—one with a small backpack, the other carrying an urn of ashes.","Time flew by, and before they knew it, another month had passed.","One day, Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei were roasting a mutated bird they had caught under a half-built, abandoned building.","The bird weighed over fifty pounds, and after plucking its feathers, it looked plump and juicy.","As it roasted over the fire, oil dripped from its body, filling the air with a mouthwatering aroma.","Qu Xiaobei couldn't stop swallowing her saliva, while the little creatures in Yun Xiaoxiao's space were practically drooling.","Just then, footsteps approached from a distance.","\"Sigh, ever since the Central Base changed leaders, life has gotten harder and harder.\"","\"Tell me about it. Two-thirds of everything we bring back gets confiscated. It's inhumane!","If it weren't for my family, I'd have left long ago.\"","\"Just endure it for now. It's not the right time to leave yet.\"","\"Hey, do you smell something delicious?\""]},{"number":337,"title":"Chapter 337: This Steamed Bun Really Gets Worse the More You Eat It","paragraphs":["“It really is!”","“I smell it too, the aroma of roasted meat!”","“It seems to be coming from that building over there.”","“Let’s go check it out.”","The group of curious individuals walked over.","As they approached the abandoned building, they saw two little girls sitting by a fire at the base of the building.","One was smaller than the other.","They were roasting a large bird.","By now, the bird was almost fully cooked, emitting a mouthwatering fragrance.","It looked incredibly tempting.","The group couldn’t help but swallow their saliva.","It had been a long time since they last had meat!","One of them took a step forward, eager to approach Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","But another person grabbed his arm.","“Don’t go.”","“Bro, they’re just two little kids. Are you saying we grown men can’t handle them?”","“Have you noticed what kind of bird that is?”","“What bird?”","“That’s a sparrow.”","“Huh? But its size is clearly...”","“Exactly. A sparrow that big is obviously not normal. It’s probably mutated.","These two little girls are calmly roasting a mutated sparrow in the middle of nowhere. Do you really think they’re just ordinary children?”","The man’s words left the others stunned for a few seconds.","“Are you saying... they’re not ordinary people?”","“When you’re out in the world, you must never underestimate anyone. Haven’t I told you that before?","Don’t assume someone is weak just because they’re young.","This isn’t the pre-apocalypse world anymore. We need to be cautious.”","“Yeah, got it.”","“But it’s almost dark, and there are no other buildings around. We can’t sleep on the snow tonight, can we?”","“...Let’s go inside, but don’t provoke them.”","“Alright.”","The group walked into the abandoned building, but instead of approaching Yun Xiaoxiao, they headed straight to a corner diagonally across from her.","In truth, Yun Xiaoxiao had noticed them before they even got close.","But since they didn’t make any moves, she didn’t bother with them.","She had vaguely overheard their conversation.","She couldn’t help but give the most perceptive man among them a second glance. He was clearly a sharp thinker.","“Here, take this.”","She tore off a crispy, juicy bird leg and handed it to Qu Xiaobei.","“Wow, can I eat it now?”","Qu Xiaobei happily accepted it.","“Yes.”","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao nodded, Qu Xiaobei immediately took a big bite.","It seemed like she had been waiting for this moment.","“Wow, so delicious! It’s amazing!”","She finished one bite and quickly took another.","During their time together, Yun Xiaoxiao had discovered that Qu Xiaobei’s ability to replicate food had many limitations.","For example, she couldn’t replicate animals, energy cores, or people.","She also couldn’t replicate cooked food.","She could only replicate small items like vegetables and rice.","And she couldn’t replicate too much at once; it had to be done bit by bit.","Yun Xiaoxiao tore off another leg and started eating as well.","Inside her space, Little Cutie and Little Eagle were drooling.","“Come out, I’ll share some with you.”","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao spoke, three massive creatures appeared.","Although Little Flower wasn’t particularly interested in the meat, it loved being part of the excitement and decided to join in.","The sudden appearance of the three large creatures startled the group, who were in the middle of clearing a spot to sit down.","They froze, staring wide-eyed in their direction.","Then, they all patted their chests in relief.","Thank goodness they hadn’t rashly tried to take the food.","These two kids were definitely not ordinary!","Just those three massive creatures alone would have been enough to deal with them.","The group immediately became much more “well-behaved.”","Seeing that Little Cutie and the others didn’t show any signs of attacking, they exchanged glances and finally relaxed.","They took out their own rations from their bags—some hard, dry buns.","They started a small fire and used their only pot to boil some water.","They tore the buns into pieces, soaked them in hot water to soften them, and began eating.","The tantalizing aroma of roasted meat wafted over from not too far away.","As they chewed on their buns, the taste suddenly felt like sawdust in their mouths.","The more they ate, the worse it tasted.","Before, they had thought having buns to eat was already a blessing.","But now, they couldn’t believe how hard it was to swallow them.","As they ate, their eyes kept drifting toward Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei.","Watching them chew on the meat with their cheeks full, the group’s mouths felt increasingly tasteless.","So, they tried to distract themselves by chatting.","“You know, the Mo Family really had the worst luck, running into the Yao Family like that. What was supposed to be a joyous wedding turned into a disaster, with deaths and injuries all around.”","“Hey, don’t say that out loud. If the Yao Family hears you, you’ll lose your head.”","“There’s no one else around here. What’s the harm in talking?","I just can’t keep it in.","Back when the Mo Family and the Yao Family were both in power, our lives weren’t as bad as they are now.","But ever since the Yao Family pushed the Mo Family out, look at how we’ve been living!”","“The Mo Family really got the short end of the stick. They were so strong, but the Yao Family outsmarted them.”","“What happens at the top isn’t for us to worry about. We should just focus on surviving.”","“Are you talking about the Mo Family and the Yao Family from the Central Base?”","As they were chatting, a soft, childlike voice suddenly spoke up from behind them.","Startled, they turned around to see Yun Xiaoxiao standing there, having approached without them noticing.","They exchanged wary glances, their eyes filled with caution.","“Uncles, don’t worry. I’m a good person.”","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled sweetly, putting on an innocent expression.","The group: ......","Since when do good people announce they’re good?!","Yun Xiaoxiao turned back and brought over some roasted meat.","“Uncles, here’s some for you to eat.”","The group: !!!","Their throats involuntarily moved as they swallowed.","Saliva instantly filled their mouths.","“Can you tell me about the Mo Family and the Yao Family?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked with a smile.","One of them couldn’t resist and took a piece of meat, biting into it.","“Actually, it’s not much of a secret. Everyone in the base knows about it.”","He spoke while chewing, his words slightly muffled.","The others wanted to stop him, but it was too late.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao truly meant no harm, they finally let their guard down and joined in eating.","As they ate, they filled in more details.","Yun Xiaoxiao learned that after she had parted ways with Mo Chun and Mo Xing, so much had happened at the Central Base.","These events had directly led to the downfall of the Mo Family.","And behind it all was that scumbag family—the Yao Family!"]},{"number":338,"title":"Chapter 338: Encountering a Scumbag Again","paragraphs":["For some reason, Mo Chun, who had initially decided not to marry that scumbag Yao Shengwei, ended up going through with the wedding as planned.","On the day of the wedding, Mo Chun's parents were conspicuously absent from the ceremony.","This struck many as odd at the time.","But what was even stranger was that Mo Chun showed no signs of hesitation throughout the entire event, quickly completing all the wedding rituals.","The couple didn’t even attend the banquet. Once the ceremony was over, the bride and groom disappeared.","Many people joked that the newlyweds were so deeply in love that they couldn’t wait until nightfall to consummate their marriage.","And so, the base remained peaceful for half a month.","Then, one day, the Yao Family suddenly announced that Mo Chun and Mo Xing’s parents had both died in an accident, and that the Yao Family would now take over the entire central base.","This sudden turn of events left many in shock.","Although the base had always been jointly managed by the Yao and Mo Families, the Mo Family had always been the backbone of the operation.","While everyone was surprised and uncomfortable with the change, there wasn’t much they could say.","The Yao Family had always been one of the main governing families, and now the Mo Family was left with only two siblings—Mo Chun and her younger brother Mo Xing, who was still a child. With Mo Chun married to Yao Shengwei, it seemed only natural for the Yao Family to take over.","Moreover, Mo Chun had been present when the announcement was made.","She had kept her head down the entire time, offering no objections.","Though some of the Mo Family’s supporters were displeased, they had no choice but to keep their mouths shut.","A few days later, rumors spread that Mo Chun had gone mad, unable to cope with the loss of her parents.","Her younger brother, Mo Xing, ran away from home once again.","It was only then that people realized they hadn’t seen the Mo siblings around the base for quite some time.","Everyone felt sorry for the kind and gentle Mo Family’s eldest daughter.","How could she have gone mad so suddenly?","It seemed like misfortune never came alone.","As for Mo Xing’s disappearance, people weren’t too surprised.","After all, this wasn’t the first time he had run away from the base on his own.","At first, everything seemed normal, and aside from feeling pity for the siblings, no one noticed anything unusual.","But then, some time later, a group of women suddenly arrived at the base and took the “mad” Mo Family’s eldest daughter away.","That night, chaos erupted throughout the base.","Everyone mobilized, searching house by house, both inside and outside the base, determined to find Mo Chun.","After all, the Mo Family had done many favors for the people of the base.","Now, Mo Chun was the only remaining member of the family.","Even though she had gone mad, no one wanted anything bad to happen to her.","But after a night of searching, she was nowhere to be found.","Two days later, something strange happened.","One morning, everyone woke up to find crumpled pieces of paper scattered all over the streets of the base and even outside its walls.","Curious, people picked them up and read the contents.","What they found shocked everyone.","The papers claimed that the Yao Family had poisoned Mo Chun’s parents, held them captive, and used them as leverage to force Mo Chun to go through with the wedding.","After the wedding, they had continued to hold Mo Chun captive.","The antidote they had promised to give her parents was never delivered, and they had even threatened the siblings’ lives, forcing their parents to commit suicide.","The Yao Family had then lied, claiming their deaths were accidental.","As for Mo Xing, he hadn’t run away—he had been fleeing for his life.","Why hadn’t Mo Chun spoken up when the Yao Family announced their takeover of the base?","Because the despicable Yao Family had threatened her with her brother’s safety, forcing her to keep silent.","She hadn’t gone mad, either.","The Yao Family had been laying the groundwork for her eventual death, making it seem less abrupt when they announced it later.","The contents of the papers were identical, and there were so many of them.","Although the Yao Family immediately ordered the papers to be confiscated and banned anyone from reading them, the news slowly spread throughout the base.","It seemed the Yao Family had anticipated that the Mo Family’s supporters would eventually rebel, so they had quietly dismantled the Mo Family’s core influence beforehand.","Some people had even been forced to leave the base.","But no one had realized it at the time.","It was only when the papers appeared that people connected the dots and realized the Yao Family had been playing a long game.","Though many were disgusted by their actions, most were too afraid to resist or leave, especially those with families to support.","After hearing the full story from the group, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but frown.","If Mo Chun had listened to her and killed that scumbag Yao Shengwei earlier, would things have turned out differently?","As for the group of women who had caused the turning point, Yun Xiaoxiao guessed they were likely Huang Yan and her companions from Mo City.","“Do you know where the Mo siblings are now? Any news?” she asked.","The group shook their heads.","“No idea. We haven’t heard anything.”","“These matters aren’t something us lowly folks can easily find out.”","“But I’ve heard the Yao Family has sent people out to search for them.”","Though Yun Xiaoxiao felt sympathy for the Mo siblings’ plight, she wasn’t one to meddle in others’ affairs.","She had her own problems to deal with and didn’t have the time to worry about others.","Once she had learned what she wanted to know, she returned to her original spot by the fire.","It was only then that she noticed all the roasted meat was gone!","Qu Xiaobei, along with Little Cutie and Little Eagle, all turned to look at her in unison, their mouths smeared with grease.","“Xiaoxiao, I didn’t mean to steal the food. It’s just that these two were so quick, and I barely managed to grab the last piece. Do you want it?”","Qu Xiaobei held out a piece of meat she had already taken a bite out of, offering it to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Though she asked if Yun Xiaoxiao wanted it, her eyes betrayed her reluctance.","Her gaze was practically glued to the meat.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched.","“No—”","Before she could finish, Qu Xiaobei quickly pulled the meat back and stuffed it into her mouth.","With a mouthful of food, she grinned happily and said, “I knew you wouldn’t want it, Xiaoxiao.”","Yun Xiaiao: ......","She swore to herself that from now on, whoever wanted to eat could roast their own food.","If they wanted her to cook for them, they could forget it!","That night, the two groups stayed peacefully in their respective spots.","The next morning, the other group bid farewell and left.","Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei packed up and set off as well.","But to her surprise, they ran into Yao Shengwei along the way.","From a distance, they saw him passionately kissing a woman.","The woman wasn’t Mo Chun, nor was it Mo Chun’s cousin, with whom he had previously cheated. It was a completely unfamiliar woman.","His subordinates had all turned their backs, deliberately looking away."]},{"number":339,"title":"Chapter 339: It's Her","paragraphs":["Yao Shengwei flinched violently.","He turned around in panic and suddenly found himself staring into a pair of cold, mocking eyes.","\"Ahhh! When did you get here?!\"","He couldn't help but shout in panic.","The car, due to his unstable emotions, swayed wildly on the snow, tracing an 'S'-shaped path.","\"Just a moment ago,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a leisurely smile.","But this did little to alleviate Yao Shengwei's fear.","On the contrary, it only intensified his dread.","Because Yun Xiaoxiao's smile was truly terrifying!","He had no supernatural abilities.","All he had was the backing of his family's power to flaunt his arrogance.","Now that all his bodyguards had been subdued by Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei, he was left alone, like a general without troops.","\"Don't kill me.\"","He slammed on the brakes and, very wisely, raised his hands in surrender.","\"You can have anything I have. My father can give you houses, cars, endless supplies. Whatever you want, as long as you don't kill me.\"","\"Truly anything?\"","\"Yes, yes.\"","\"Alright then.\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled lightly, \"I'll take the supplies and... your life.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","Before he could resist, a vine wrapped around his entire body.","Except for his feet, which were still able to move, his entire body was bound tight.","Yun Xiaoxiao casually grabbed a dirty rag from the car, which she stuffed into his mouth.","\"Mmm! Mmm! Mmm!\"","Yao Shengwei protested loudly, but it was all in vain.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't even bother to acknowledge him.","Then, as if leading a little dog, she pulled him out of the car by the vine and quickly returned to Qu Xiaobei and the others.","She scanned the group and picked out one who had a less severe injury, someone who could still walk at least.","\"You, go back to your base and tell his father to bring supplies to redeem him.","No more than five people can come with the supplies.","If even one more person comes, I'll cut off one hand. If there are no more hands, I'll take a foot. Body parts will do.","If his father wants to see his son in one piece, he'd better bring exactly the number of people and supplies as required.","As for the supplies...","Half of your base's stored food will do.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao said it so casually, but the person on the other side was nearly scared out of his wits.","Half of the base's supplies?!","That was outrageous!","Would the base leader agree to that?","And bringing one extra person meant cutting off hands or feet? That was downright brutal!","She was worse than a bandit!","Just as the man was trembling with fear, Yun Xiaoxiao spoke again.","\"I'll kindly remind you, you'd better tell your base leader not to try anything funny. Half means exactly half.","Later, I might visit your base myself. If I find out the supplies aren't exactly half, I might get very angry~\"","Her smile, though seemingly gentle, sent a chill down the man's spine.","Goodness, don't smile like that.","It's terrifying!","\"You can use that car to get there. You have... two hours. For every minute you're late, I'll cut off one of his fingers.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to the car Yao Shengwei had been driving, then pointed to his fingers.","At this, Yao Shengwei struggled even more violently.","\"Mmm! Mmm! Mmm!\"","[Crazy! I don't want to have my hands or feet cut off! I don't want to lose my fingers!]","Yao Shengwei's inner voice screamed in panic.","But no one could hear it.","Except for Yun Xiaoxiao.","But Yun Xiaoxiao simply ignored him.","Soon, the man sprinted crazily to the car, hastily got in, and sped away in the modified snow vehicle.","Yun Xiaoxiao, meanwhile, walked over to Yao Shengwei and leisurely looked at him.","As she looked, she rubbed her chin.","\"Tsk tsk, I guess looks really do reflect one's inner nature. You're so vile, and your face is just as ugly.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","\"Xiaoxiao, you're right. This uncle really does look a bit ugly.\"","Qu Xiaobei stepped forward, nodding in agreement.","Yao Shengwei: ......","\"Right? You think so too. Honestly, just looking at him makes my eyes hurt.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded in agreement.","In the next moment, she raised her hand, centering her palm on Yao Shengwei's heart.","\"Since that's the case, I might as well go the extra mile today and rid the world of a pest.\"","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's words and seeing her readying an attack, Yao Shengwei was so scared that he wet himself.","\"Mmm! Mmm! Mmm!\"","He struggled violently.","[Ahhh! What are you doing? Didn't you say my father can redeem me with supplies? If you kill me, my father won't give you anything!]","\"You've been living off your family all this time; did you really think I'd let you go?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smirked, looking at Yao Shengwei as if he were an idiot.","\"Mmm! Mmm! Mmm!\"","\"[You killed me, my father won't let you off the hook, and neither will the entire Central Base!]\"","\"Don't worry, if your father dares to come, I'll send you two father and son to reunite.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","\"Oh, and by the way, I'll gladly take the supplies.","As for the other half of the supplies...","Isn't there still your father to act as hostage?","I wonder, with you and your father, along with your main faction, all absent from the base, whether the remaining people in your base would still be willing to use the only half of the supplies to save you?","Do you think they might just abandon saving your father and seize power for themselves instead?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at Yao Shengwei with an innocent, inquiring smile, her appearance as pure as could be.","She didn't directly demand all the supplies from the entire base, as she knew the other party would definitely refuse.","Perhaps they would just abandon Yao Shengwei altogether.","After all, in the apocalypse, for some individuals, their own son might be less valuable than power and supplies.","Secondly, she wanted to use a series of interconnected plans.","If the other side didn't bring the supplies, that was fine.","But if they really did come, the stage would be set for a truly entertaining show.","She was genuinely curious—if someone took the opportunity to usurp power, would their subordinates also seize the chance to stage their own coup?","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's words, Yao Shengwei was utterly stunned.","If his father really brought the supplies and trusted aides to rescue him,","that would mean no one would be in charge at the base.","Not to mention the ever-watchful Mo Chun lurking in the shadows, even the factions within the base that had previously been loyal to their family might take this golden opportunity to rebel!","\"Mmm mmm mmm mmm!!!\"","[Then what was the point of you saying earlier that if one more person comes, you'll cut off my limbs, and if they're even a minute late, you'll chop off a finger of mine?!]","After several previous instances, Yao Shengwei had already confirmed that Yun Xiaoxiao could accurately read his thoughts.","He raged inwardly, his mind screaming in fury.","Yun Xiaoxiao crossed her arms, looking completely unconcerned.","\"Killing you doesn't stop me from cutting off your limbs and chopping off your fingers.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","[Ahhh! You're breaking your promises!!]","\"Ah, but I'm just a child, you know? How can my words be taken seriously? Don't you think... isn't that right?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a smile, her dimples endearing and lively, her dark eyes glinting with cunning mischief.","Yao Shengwei: !!!","Ahhhhhhhh!","He was going mad.","Why had he provoked such a little devil?","If only he had known, he should have run away as far as possible the moment he first laid eyes on her!","But hindsight is invaluable, and now it was all too late..."]},{"number":340,"title":"Chapter 340: Ahhh You didn't keep your word","paragraphs":["Yao Shengwei's entire body trembled violently.","He turned around in terror and suddenly locked eyes with a pair of cold, mocking eyes.","\"Ahhh! When did you get here?!\"","He couldn't help but scream in panic.","The car, affected by his unstable emotions, swerved left and right in the snow, tracing an 'S' curve.","\"Just now,\" Yun Xiaoxiao replied with a leisurely smile.","But her smile did nothing to ease Yao Shengwei's fear.","On the contrary, it intensified his dread.","Because Yun Xiaoxiao's smile was truly terrifying!","He had no supernatural abilities of his own.","His arrogance was entirely dependent on his family's influence.","Now that all his bodyguards had been subdued by Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei, he was left as helpless as a commander without an army.","\"Don't kill me,\" he pleaded, slamming on the brakes and raising his hands in surrender.","\"I'll get my father to give you whatever you want—houses, cars, endless supplies? Anything, as long as you spare my life.\"","\"Really, anything?\"","\"Yes, yes, anything!\"","\"Alright,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a light chuckle. \"Then I'll take the supplies... and your life.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","Before he could even resist, a vine wrapped around his entire body, binding him tightly.","Only his legs were left free to move.","Yun Xiaoxiao casually picked up a dirty rag from the car used for cleaning windows and stuffed it into his mouth.","\"Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","Yao Shengwei protested, but it was useless.","Yun Xiaoxiao completely ignored him.","Then, like leading a dog on a leash, she tugged on the vine and dragged him out of the car, quickly returning to Qu Xiaobei and the others.","She scanned the group and picked out one of the less severely injured men who could still walk.","\"You, go back to your base and tell his father to bring supplies to ransom him.","No more than five people can come.","For every extra person, I'll cut off one of his hands. If I run out of hands, I'll take his feet, or even his organs.","If his father wants to see his son in one piece, he'd better come with the exact number of people and the supplies as agreed.","As for the supplies...","Half of your base's stockpile will do.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao spoke as if it were the most casual thing in the world, but the man listening was on the verge of wetting himself.","Half of the base's supplies?!","That was an outrageous demand!","Would the base leader even agree?","And cutting off hands or feet for every extra person? That was beyond cruel!","She was worse than a bandit!","Just as the man was reeling in shock, Yun Xiaoxiao spoke again.","\"A friendly reminder, you'd better tell your base leader not to try anything funny. When I say half, I mean exactly half.","I'll be paying a visit to your base later. If I find out you didn't deliver the full amount, I'll be very upset~\"","Her smile, though sweet and innocent, sent a chill down the man's spine.","Please, miss, stop smiling.","It's terrifying!","\"You can take the car. You have two hours. If you're even a minute late, I'll chop off one of his fingers.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to the car Yao Shengwei had been driving, then to his fingers.","At her words, Yao Shengwei struggled even more violently.","\"Mmmph! Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","[You're insane! I don't want my hands or feet cut off! I don't want my fingers chopped!]","Yao Shengwei screamed internally, but no one could hear him.","Except Yun Xiaoxiao.","But she didn't care.","Soon, the man scrambled to the car and drove off in the modified snow vehicle, panic written all over his face.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao walked up to Yao Shengwei and studied him leisurely, rubbing her chin.","\"Tsk tsk, as they say, the face reflects the heart. You're so vile, it's no wonder your face is so ugly.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","\"Xiaoxiao, you're right. This uncle really is kind of ugly,\" Qu Xiaobei chimed in, nodding in agreement.","Yao Shengwei: ......","\"Right? Just looking at him makes my eyes hurt,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said, nodding as well.","The next second, she raised her hand, palm aimed directly at Yao Shengwei's heart.","\"In that case, I'll do a good deed today and rid the world of this scum.\"","Hearing her words and seeing her prepare to strike, Yao Shengwei was so scared he wet his pants.","\"Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","He struggled violently.","[Ahhh! What are you doing? Didn't you say my father would bring supplies to ransom me? If you kill me, he won't give you anything!]","\"Have you been eating for nothing all these years? Did you really think I'd let you go?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smirked, looking at Yao Shengwei as if he were an idiot.","\"Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","[If you kill me, my father won't let you off! The entire Central Base will come after you!]","\"Don't worry, if your father dares to come, I'll make sure you two reunite.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","\"Oh, and I'll still take the supplies.","As for the other half...","Your father will be my hostage.","But I wonder, with you, your father, and your main forces gone, will the people left in your base even be willing to use their remaining half of the supplies to save you?","Do you think they might just abandon your father and seize power for themselves?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled innocently, as if seeking Yao Shengwei's opinion.","She didn't demand the entire base's supplies outright because she knew they would never agree.","They might even abandon Yao Shengwei altogether.","After all, in this apocalyptic world, for some people, power and resources were more valuable than their own children.","This was also part of her plan.","If they didn't bring the supplies, so be it.","But if they did, things would get very interesting.","She was curious—if the subordinates of those who had seized power got the chance, would they stage a coup of their own?","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's words, Yao Shengwei was completely stunned.","If his father really brought the supplies and his trusted men to rescue him, it would mean the base would be left leaderless.","Not to mention Mo Chun and others who had been lurking in the shadows, even the factions within the base that were loyal to their family might seize this perfect opportunity to rebel!","\"Mmmph! Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","[Then why did you say you'd cut off my hands and feet if they brought extra people, or chop off my fingers if they were late?!]","After what had happened earlier, Yao Shengwei was certain Yun Xiaoxiao could read his mind.","He raged internally.","Yun Xiaoxiao crossed her arms, her posture relaxed.","\"Killing you doesn't mean I can't cut off your hands and feet or chop your fingers.\"","Yao Shengwei: !!!","[Ahhh! You're going back on your word!!]","\"Ah, but I'm just a child. How can you take what I say seriously? Right?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a smile, her dimples showing and her dark eyes sparkling with mischief.","Yao Shengwei: !!!","Ahhhhhhh!","He was going insane.","Why had he crossed paths with this little demon?","If only he had run as far as possible the moment he saw her!","But hindsight was worthless. It was all too late now..."]},{"number":341,"title":"Chapter 341: Losing Both People and Money","paragraphs":["As Yao Shengwei was filled with endless regret, Yun Xiaoxiao raised her hand once more.","This time, it was swift and decisive.","Yao Shengwei didn’t even have time to let out a muffled protest before his eyes closed forever.","His subordinates, who were still clinging to life, stared in terror at Yun Xiaoxiao, the merciless killer, their hearts trembling with fear.","They were worried that they would be next.","And they weren’t wrong—Yun Xiaoxiao had indeed planned it that way.","With a flip of her palm, a burst of icy energy shot out.","In an instant, the group of men turned into human-shaped ice sculptures.","This time, their faces were also covered, completely frozen into icy figures.","They looked like grotesque, meticulously carved works of art.","About an hour and forty-five minutes later, the sound of several vehicles suddenly echoed from a distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao lifted her gaze, a faint smile curling at the corners of her lips.","They’re here!","Not long after, the vehicles drew closer.","Five people stepped out one after another.","Leading them was a man in his fifties.","His appearance bore some resemblance to Yao Shengwei.","His expression was grim as he glared at Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei.","Finally, his gaze settled on Yun Xiaoxiao.","“So, you’re the little girl who kidnapped my son and demanded a ransom?”","The informant had already described Yun Xiaoxiao’s appearance and clothing in detail.","Thus, Yao Guangguo recognized her at a glance.","“I’ve brought what you asked for. Where’s my son?”","He asked in a low, steady voice.","His eyes darted around, but he couldn’t see his son or any of his son’s subordinates.","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged and pointed to a towering mound of ice that resembled a burial mound.","“Well, isn’t he right there?”","At her words, Yao Guangguo’s brow twitched violently.","He shot Yun Xiaoxiao a venomous look before rushing toward the ice mound.","The four men behind him hurried over as well, helping to dig through the ice.","While they were distracted, Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes flickered, and she swiftly slipped into one of the vehicles.","In just a minute or two, she had ransacked all the supplies from the cars.","It seemed Yao Guangguo truly cared about his son.","He hadn’t tried anything underhanded.","However...","She glanced into the distance, her lips curling into a faint smile.","He still wasn’t entirely honest...","But that suited her just fine.","She was quite curious whether the Central Base would be thrown into chaos because of this.","“Awei!”","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was casually surveying the distance, Yao Guangguo suddenly let out a disbelieving cry.","His eyes were bloodshot.","Yao Shengwei’s chest and the center of his forehead were both covered in blood.","Though it had already dried, the sight was still horrifying.","It was clear that he had suffered two fatal blows—one to the chest and one to the head.","Whoever killed him had no intention of letting him live.","“You killed Awei?”","He turned, his eyes locked on Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao blinked playfully.","“Congratulations, you’re correct. But... there’s no reward.”","Yao Guangguo: !!!","“You said you’d release him once you got the supplies!”","He roared, glaring at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, her expression calm.","“I never specified whether I’d release him alive or dead. Here, your son’s body is all yours.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Guangguo’s face darkened as if it could drip with ink.","His rage was palpable, as though he wanted to tear Yun Xiaoxiao apart.","“You insolent brat, you deserve to die!”","He bellowed, waving at his four subordinates while pulling out a flare gun and firing it into the air.","Yun Xiaoxiao let out a cold laugh, grabbing the still-dazed Qu Xiaobei and vanishing from sight in an instant.","The four men lunged forward but found nothing but empty air.","They exchanged bewildered looks, forced to accept the reality of the situation.","“Base Chief, those two kids... they’re gone.”","Yao Guangguo stared at the empty, snow-covered ground, his fists clenched so tightly that his nails nearly pierced his palms.","He glanced at the nearby ice sculptures. He hadn’t paid much attention earlier, but now, upon closer inspection, they clearly resembled human figures.","And their number matched the exact count of his son’s subordinates.","Yao Guangguo’s chest heaved with rage, veins bulging on his forehead.","But with no outlet for his fury, he could only seethe in silence.","Mindful of maintaining his composure in front of his men, he refrained from any outburst, though he nearly choked on his own anger.","He left the ice sculptures untouched, simply carrying Yao Shengwei’s body with a grim expression as he walked toward the lead vehicle.","“Open the back.”","He ordered one of his men.","The man hurried to the rear of the vehicle, unlocking the door with a key.","But as soon as he opened it, he froze in shock.","Where were the supplies?","No matter how hard he looked, the compartment was completely empty.","“What’s wrong?”","Yao Guangguo frowned when he saw his subordinate blocking the door instead of fully opening it.","The man turned in panic, swinging the door wide open.","“Base Chief, it’s bad—all the supplies are gone!”","As he stepped aside, Yao Guangguo finally saw the situation for himself.","The compartment was empty, save for a single trash bag.","Yao Guangguo’s pupils contracted sharply. Realizing something, he immediately ordered his men to check the other vehicles.","“Base Chief, this one’s empty too!”","“Base Chief, there’s nothing here!”","“This one’s empty as well!”","“Same here!”","Four voices rang out in quick succession.","With the last report, Yao Guangguo was so enraged that he spat out a mouthful of blood.","After taking a moment to recover, he waited until the rest of his men, stationed farther away, arrived. Then, through gritted teeth, he said,","“Let’s return to the base. Issue a bounty poster. We must capture that wretched girl!”","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei reappeared in a clearing.","Yun Xiaoxiao summoned her eagle companion.","The two of them climbed onto its back.","In the next moment, the eagle soared into the sky with a majestic flap of its wings.","“Xiaoxiao, where are we going now?”","Qu Xiaobei asked, holding onto Yun Xiaoxiao’s waist.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled. “The Central Base.”","“You mean where those people live?”","“Mhm.”","“But they’re probably furious right now. They might be searching everywhere for us. Going to their base would be like delivering ourselves to their doorstep, wouldn’t it?”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched. “You mean walking into a trap?”","“Well, same difference!”","Yun Xiaoxiao: ...Not really...","She glanced at the map in her hand, directing the eagle’s flight path.","Then, her eyes gleamed with amusement.","“They still have half their supplies left. It’d be a waste not to use them. I’ll do them a favor and put them to good use.”","“Huh?”","Qu Xiaobei tilted her head, not quite understanding Yun Xiaoxiao’s plan.","But her father had told her to trust Yun Xiaoxiao unconditionally, so she would.","Even if he hadn’t, Yun Xiaoxiao was amazing—who else would she trust?","She’d just follow her lead!"]},{"number":342,"title":"Chapter 342: Doing Things Unconventionally","paragraphs":["Central Base.","Two children arrived at the main gate.","The guards, upon seeing them, exchanged strange glances.","These two little girls were... unusual.","Both of them were so young.","One of them was even carrying what looked like an urn.","How had they survived until now?","\"Kids, are you trying to get inside?\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","\"Well, you'll need to pay an entry fee,\" one of the guards said matter-of-factly.","He didn’t show any special treatment just because they were children.","He didn’t expect them to have anything of value anyway.","This was just an excuse to send them away.","\"Sir, we’re here to deliver a message,\" Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly spoke up.","The guard was taken aback and looked at her.","\"A message? What kind of message?\"","\"The base leader sent us to collect the remaining half of the supplies in the base.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao said it casually, but the guard’s heart skipped a beat.","The implications of her words were staggering.","What did she mean by \"the remaining half of the supplies\"?","Did that mean the base only had half of its supplies left?","Why would the base leader send someone to collect the supplies?","What was he planning to do with them?","Yao Guangguo had indeed kept quiet about using the supplies to save his son.","Although he was in charge of the base, the supplies were vital to everyone.","Even he couldn’t just take whatever he wanted without consequences.","So, only his closest confidants knew about this.","He had made up a random excuse to take the supplies out of the base, keeping it hidden from others.","Now, with Yun Xiaoxiao revealing this, the guard she was speaking to was stunned.","The other guard, who was one of Yao Guangguo’s underlings, immediately stepped forward to cover for him.","\"Kid, what you’re saying is baseless. Why should we believe you?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao immediately took out a pendant and held it up for them to see.","They recognized it instantly.","It was something Yao Shengwei always wore.","\"This is your base leader’s son’s personal item. He offended someone and got captured. Your base leader took half of the base’s supplies to rescue him, but the supplies disappeared. Without the supplies, the captors won’t release him. We happened to pass by, and your base leader asked us to deliver a message: prepare the remaining supplies and hurry to save him.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao spoke with a mix of truth and lies.","Yao Guangguo’s underling wanted to say more, but the first guard cut in.","\"This is a serious matter. I need to report it.\"","He wasn’t directly under Yao Guangguo but belonged to another faction within the base.","In a large base like this, with so many people, various factions inevitably formed behind the scenes.","\"Your base leader and his group are badly injured. They’re in a terrible state. You’d better hurry, or their lives might be lost.\"","The speaker had an agenda, and the listeners understood.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s words quickly reached the ears of those with ulterior motives.","\"If he’s being ruthless, then we don’t have to be fair either. How can he use all the base’s supplies to save his useless son?\"","\"I’ve never supported the Yao Family’s rise to power, and now he’s pulling this stunt. We can’t let him touch the remaining supplies.\"","\"Exactly. His son keeps causing trouble, and now we’re left cleaning up his mess. That’s not fair.\"","\"I say, since they’re already badly injured, why don’t we...\"","\"Are you suggesting we take the opportunity to...\"","One of them made a slashing motion across their neck.","The others immediately understood.","They all saw the same idea reflected in each other’s eyes.","\"Right, let’s do it!\"","\"First, gather some people and go check it out. Since they’ve left the base, they shouldn’t come back.\"","One of them had a glint of ruthlessness in his eyes.","He had been saved by the Mo Family and had always been grateful to them.","After the Mo Family was betrayed by the Yao Family, he had bided his time, not rushing to seek revenge like others.","Instead, he had waited for the perfect opportunity to avenge the Mo Family.","This was it.","\"Also, send someone to check the storage room. Make sure no one touches it today!\"","The Yao Family’s lackeys want to take the supplies? Dream on!","While they were discussing this in a room, they didn’t realize someone was eavesdropping.","Yun Xiaoxiao had overheard everything.","With Qu Xiaobei in tow, she quietly followed the group heading to the storage room.","After they checked the supplies and locked the door, she slipped inside.","When she came out, the storage room was empty.","Yun Xiaoxiao clapped her hands.","Who would’ve thought she’d be doing what Nie Yizhou did in her past life?","It felt pretty good.","\"Xiaoxiao, what do we do now?\" Qu Xiaobei asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao smirked. \"Distribute the supplies.\"","With that, she and Qu Xiaobei strolled casually through the Central Base.","While most of the base’s factions were busy chasing Yao Guangguo and his group, Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei arrived at a quiet, open area.","Piles of supplies appeared out of thin air.","Then, Yun Xiaoxiao took out a loudspeaker, cleared her throat, and started recording.","\"Free supplies! Free supplies! Everyone gets a share!\"","After recording, she turned the volume up to maximum and set it to loop.","Soon, people passing by were drawn to the sound.","An elderly man and a teenage boy approached, astonished by the mountain of supplies.","\"Kids, is this... for real?\" the old man asked.","His clothes were faded, and he looked frail, clearly undernourished.","The boy beside him wasn’t much better off.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled. \"Yes, it is.\"","She then rummaged through the supplies, pulling out a 20-pound bag of rice, some biscuits, and winter clothes, handing them over.","\"These are for you.\"","\"Really? For us?!\"","The two of them took the items hesitantly, unable to believe it.","\"You’re holding them in your hands. How could it not be real?\"","\"But... why?\" they asked, still skeptical.","In these times, free supplies? And so much at once?","\"Why?\" Yun Xiaoxiao tapped her chin, then smiled.","\"Just because I feel like it.\"","The old man and the boy stared at her in disbelief.","But regardless, they could finally have a decent meal today.","They thanked her repeatedly before leaving with their supplies, overjoyed.","What they didn’t know was that with Qu Xiaobei’s \"treasure trove\" ability, Yun Xiaoxiao could give away as much as she wanted without it affecting her own stash.","After they left, news of the free supplies spread like wildfire.","Soon, the area was swarmed with people from the base, all eager to get their share."]},{"number":343,"title":"Chapter 343: The Mantis Stalks the Cicada, Unaware of the Oriole Behind","paragraphs":["On the other side.","When Yao Guangguo and his men were just a kilometer away from the central base, they were suddenly stopped.","The ones who intercepted them were none other than the various scattered factions within the base.","The two sides met, and Yao Guangguo's expression turned grim.","He scanned the aggressive group before him, his eyes darkening.","\"Why aren't you guarding the base? What are you all doing out here?\"","The opposing group was surprised to see that Yao Guangguo and his men were unharmed.","But with the situation at a critical point, this was the best opportunity to eliminate Yao Guangguo, and they couldn't bear to let it slip away.","To be honest, the entire Yao Family was useless.","Having him as the base leader was something they couldn't accept.","Moreover, not long after he took power, he had turned the base into a chaotic mess, making life unbearable for everyone.","If he were allowed to continue ruling, who knew how much worse things would get?","Everyone knew this.","Even though Yao Guangguo and his men didn't seem seriously injured, they were determined to eliminate him today.","The leaders exchanged glances and nodded subtly at each other.","Without answering Yao Guangguo's question, they launched a fierce attack simultaneously.","Yao Guangguo's eyes widened in shock.","\"Have you lost your minds? Are you rebelling?!\"","He roared in anger.","Having just lost his only son, he never expected that upon returning to the base, these people would be so treacherous as to ambush him.","The composure he had tried to maintain was now completely shattered.","\"Rebellion? Isn't that something you're very familiar with?","Didn't you seize the position of base leader in the same way?","What, you can scheme to kill your own sworn brother and his family, but others can't rebel against you?\"","One of them sneered.","Yao Guangguo's face turned beet red.","Realizing they were determined to oppose him, he said nothing more.","He signaled his men to eliminate these treacherous individuals.","Although his men were more skilled, the opposing side had brought out all their forces.","Yao Guangguo, on the other hand, had only brought a few key personnel.","In terms of numbers, the opposition outnumbered him by twofold.","For a while, the two sides were locked in a fierce battle.","Behind a small snowdrift.","Mo Chun watched the intense fight with cold eyes.","If Yun Xiao had been present, she would have noticed that while Mo Chun's appearance hadn't changed, her demeanor and gaze had undergone a significant transformation.","Gone was the gentle, refined air of a well-bred lady.","Now, she exuded an aloofness that kept others at a distance.","Huang Yan and the others were also crouched behind the snowdrift, quietly observing.","\"Mo Chun, we've finally waited for this opportunity!\" Huang Yan's eyes glistened with tears.","Mo Chun nodded, \"Yes, Auntie.\"","\"Sister, they've started fighting. When do we make our move?\"","Mo Xing peeked out from behind.","He glared at Yao Guangguo, eager to charge forward and kill him.","\"Not yet. Let them wear each other down first, then we'll act,\" Mo Chun said calmly.","Mo Xing looked up, \"Is this what they call 'the mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind'?\"","\"Yes, you're clever,\" Mo Chun nodded approvingly.","After a while.","\"Mo Chun, it looks like they're about to collapse over there!\"","Huang Yan frowned as she observed the situation.","Mo Chun stood up, \"Let's go!\"","With a wave of her hand, the people behind her rose to their feet.","They drove their snowmobiles swiftly toward the battlefield.","Counting them, there were at least a hundred people on her side.","In addition to the twenty or so women Huang Yan had brought, there were also the Mo Family loyalists who had been driven out by Yao Guangguo.","Mo Chun, who had escaped and hidden in the shadows, had gathered them all together.","All this time, they had been biding their time, waiting for the perfect moment to deliver a fatal blow to the Yao Family!","In fact, they had noticed when Yao Shengwei and his men had left earlier that day.","They had set up an ambush on the route Yao Shengwei would take to return, planning to intercept him.","But to their surprise, Yao Shengwei didn't return. Instead, they saw Yao Guangguo and his men driving out.","So they held back, wanting to see what the Yao Family was up to.","What they didn't expect was that Yao Guangguo would end up clashing with the other factions within the base.","This was the perfect opportunity for revenge!","Just as the other factions had drained most of Yao Guangguo's strength and were on the verge of defeat, Mo Chun and her group arrived.","\"It's Miss Mo!\"","\"They've returned!\"","Some of the factions were neutral, while others were sympathetic to the Mo Family.","Now, as they were about to be overwhelmed by Yao Guangguo, Mo Chun's arrival gave them hope.","They were naturally overjoyed.","With Mo Chun's forces joining the fight, the tide of the battle turned once more.","It didn't take long for Yao Guangguo's side to be defeated.","\"Miss Mo, what should we do with this scum, Yao Guangguo?\"","A middle-aged man approached Mo Chun.","Mo Chun slowly turned and looked at Yao Guangguo, who was now subdued on the ground, her eyes icy.","\"Kill him.\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Mo Chun, don't kill me! I'm your Uncle Yao! Your father and I were close friends for years!\"","Facing death, Yao Guangguo finally felt fear.","Mo Chun coldly glanced at him, \"How dare you mention my father!\"","\"From the moment you secretly drugged him, stripped him of his strength, imprisoned him, and forced him to commit suicide, you lost any right to speak of him!\"","\"Kill him!\"","Mo Chun didn't want to waste another word.","Right now, all she wanted was to see this man dead!","The fact that someone as gentle and kind as Mo Chun could be driven to this point showed just how despicable the Yao Family's actions had been.","Yao Guangguo screamed for help, but with all his men dead, who could save him now?","Everyone must face the consequences of their actions.","\"Miss Mo, we found Yao Shengwei's body in the back of a vehicle.\"","\"He's dead?\" Mo Chun frowned.","Aside from Yao Guangguo, Yao Shengwei was the one she most wanted to kill.","But she hadn't expected him to already be dead.","\"Yes,\" the middle-aged man replied. \"He had fatal wounds to his chest and head, and his body appeared to have been frozen.\"","Mo Chun's brows furrowed slightly.","Who was the righteous individual who had taken care of this scum?","If possible, she would like to thank them in person.","After dealing with Yao Guangguo and his men, Mo Chun led her people back to the base.","The guards, seeing Mo Chun return with her forces, widened their eyes in disbelief.","Yao Guangguo's remaining followers were terrified, fearing that Mo Chun might decide to kill them on a whim.","\"What's going on here?\"","Mo Chun noticed the people in the base bustling about with smiles on their faces, carrying food and supplies, and was puzzled.","A guard quickly stepped forward, eager to please.","\"Miss Mo, two little girls arrived at the base. They're distributing supplies to everyone here.\""]},{"number":344,"title":"Chapter 344: Oh No, Here Comes the Zombie Horde","paragraphs":["\"Children? Distributing supplies?\"","Mo Chun was puzzled.","\"What exactly is going on?\"","After hearing the accounts from several people, Mo Chun and the others finally understood the sequence of events.","It turned out that when Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei arrived at the base's main gate, they left a few words before being taken to meet the leaders of the various factions.","Seeing how convincingly Yun Xiaoxiao spoke, those leaders believed that Yao Guangguo and his men were on their last legs, prompting them to call an emergency meeting.","But when they tried to find Yun Xiaoxiao again, she and her companion had already disappeared.","At that time, however, they were solely focused on intercepting Yao Guangguo and didn’t think much of it.","Now, upon hearing that two little girls were distributing supplies, the group suddenly had an epiphany.","They exchanged stunned glances.","One man slapped his thigh in frustration. \"Damn it, we’ve been tricked!\"","Seeing Mo Chun’s questioning look, he quickly explained.","After listening to him, Mo Chun furrowed her brows.","\"So, they claimed that Yao Guangguo and his men were severely injured, deliberately luring you to confront him?","But in reality, Yao Guangguo wasn’t injured at all. They wanted you to fight each other.","And now they’re publicly distributing supplies, so those supplies must be...\"","Almost simultaneously, everyone arrived at the same conclusion.","Mo Chun immediately sent someone to check the warehouse while she led the others to the location where Yun Xiaoxiao and her companion had been distributing supplies.","However, by the time they arrived, the place was deserted.","There was no trace of the little girls.","Mo Chun stopped a woman who was still lingering nearby.","\"Auntie, where are the little girls who were handing out supplies?\" she asked.","The woman, still visibly shaken, pointed tremblingly at the sky.","\"They... they flew away. They flew away on a giant eagle.\"","A giant eagle?!","Instantly, an image of a small figure flashed through Mo Chun’s mind.","Mo Xing and Huang Yan’s eyes also lit up with recognition.","They, too, had thought of the same familiar little girl from their memories.","There were only a handful of little girls in the world who could ride on a giant eagle.","Up until now, they had only ever seen one.","\"Sister, it sounds like it might be Xiaoxiao!\" Mo Xing said excitedly.","Mo Chun then asked a few people nearby about Yun Xiaoxiao’s appearance and finally confirmed it.","\"One of them was definitely her.\"","Connecting all the dots, the answer became clear.","\"I think Yao Shengwei was probably killed by her, and Yao Guangguo was also lured out by her.","And you...\"","She glanced at the leaders of the factions.","\"...were deliberately led out to deal with Yao Guangguo.","As for the supplies in the warehouse, half of what Yao Guangguo took out must have been taken by her.","The other half was distributed to the survivors in the base.\"","It had to be said, Mo Chun was incredibly sharp.","In just a short while, she had pieced everything together, and her conclusions were almost identical to the truth.","\"Should we go after those two little girls?\" asked the middle-aged man beside Mo Chun.","Mo Chun shook her head. \"She’s done us such a huge favor. Why would we chase her?\"","\"But the supplies...\"","\"Half of the supplies have already been distributed to the people in the base. The other half, as a token of gratitude, is more than fair.\"","Hearing this, the middle-aged man said nothing more.","Indeed, compared to eliminating Yao Guangguo and his vile followers, a few supplies were nothing.","If Yao Guangguo had remained in the base, their chances of victory would have been slim.","Many of the scattered factions in the base were neutral.","Unless their own interests were at stake, they wouldn’t lift a finger to help.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s clever scheme had perfectly divided and conquered, helping them eliminate Yao Guangwei and his remaining followers, allowing them to regain control of the base.","They truly owed her their gratitude.","\"Round up all of Yao Guangguo’s remaining underlings. Not a single one... is to be spared,\" Mo Chun ordered.","At this moment, she exuded the commanding presence of a seasoned leader.","Having experienced the loss of her family, she had changed profoundly.","\"Yes!\"","The middle-aged man left with his team.","Mo Chun gazed up at the distant sky, her eyes filled with guilt and regret.","If only she had been more decisive back then, when the little girl had urged her to kill Yao Shengwei, her parents might not have died such tragic deaths.","But there was no cure for regret.","No matter how much she dwelled on it, it wouldn’t change a thing.","What she hadn’t expected was that the person who ultimately helped her would be the little girl she had only met twice.","If she ever had the chance to see her again, she would make sure to thank her properly.","\"She really is a remarkable little girl,\" Huang Yan couldn’t help but remark.","\"Auntie, do you know Xiaoxiao?\" Mo Xing asked curiously, looking up.","Huang Yan then briefly recounted what had happened at the clock tower.","Both Mo Chun and her brother were astonished.","Fate could be truly mysterious.","That enigmatic little girl had, without them even realizing it, helped their family so many times.","\"Bad news! A large group of unidentified entities is approaching the base from the east. It looks like... a horde of zombies!\"","Suddenly, the screech of brakes echoed as a man frantically jumped out of a vehicle, his voice trembling.","Hearing this, everyone present turned pale.","\"Are you sure you saw correctly?\" Mo Chun raised an eyebrow.","The man nodded vigorously, almost as if his head might fall off.","\"Take us to see.\"","The group hurriedly made their way to the city walls.","Mo Chun took the binoculars handed to her by a guard and peered into the distance.","There, on the pristine snow-covered ground, a massive swarm of zombies was stumbling and staggering toward them.","From afar, they looked like an endless, seething mass.","With a grim expression, she passed the binoculars to Huang Yan.","Huang Yan, the middle-aged man, and the others took turns looking, each of their faces growing increasingly somber.","\"Why are so many zombies migrating in this heavy snow?\"","\"The numbers are terrifying. If they all reach us, can we hold them off?\"","\"I never thought the reports of zombie sieges on the radio were actually true!\"","\"Sigh, if only Yao Guangguo hadn’t stubbornly opposed it back then, we could’ve joined forces with other bases to deal with the zombies.","Maybe we wouldn’t be in this situation now.\"","Back then, bases in the east, west, south, and north regions had all responded to the zombie eradication initiative.","They had united with all the bases in their respective areas, actively clearing out the zombies in their territories.","The goal was to reduce the chances of a zombie horde besieging their own base.","Only the central region had refused to participate.","The reason was that the Yao family had vehemently opposed it.","They argued that zombies from distant areas couldn’t possibly threaten their base.","Why waste so much manpower, resources, and funds to eliminate such dangerous creatures?"]},{"number":345,"title":"Chapter 345: At the Moment of Life and Death","paragraphs":["At that time, the Mo Family and the Yao Family jointly managed the base.","Although Mo Chun's father advocated for the eradication of zombies, he had been friends with Yao Guangguo for many years and didn’t want to strain their relationship over this issue.","Moreover, once the plan was initiated, it would indeed involve numerous aspects and require extensive preparation.","Thus, the plan was shelved.","Later, when heavy snow blanketed the world, the plan became even more impossible to implement.","Little did they expect that the crisis would truly come to pass!","As they gazed at the endless horde of zombies surging toward them, everyone’s mood grew heavy.","Indeed, those who fail to plan for the future will inevitably face immediate troubles.","Only when danger truly looms before them do people realize the severity of the situation.","Mo Chun quickly ordered the base alarm to be sounded.","There was no escaping now.","With so many people in the base, even if they wanted to flee, there weren’t enough means of transportation.","They could have left on their own, but...","The sense of responsibility and integrity she had learned from her parents since childhood made it impossible for her to abandon others and save herself.","If they were to live, the entire base would live together.","If they were to die, they would all die together!","This was a moment of life and death for the base, and everyone had to contribute to have even a sliver of hope!","“Uncle Li, go send out a radio message and seek support from other bases.”","“Auntie, take some people and organize those without combat capabilities to carry stones or other heavy objects to the city walls.”","“...”","Mo Chun remained calm in the face of danger, issuing orders one after another.","However, if one looked closely, they could notice her uneven breathing and slightly trembling hands.","Due to Yao Guangguo’s previous actions, the base had lost many capable individuals.","For example, Mo Chun’s parents and some of the Mo Family’s trusted aides.","Although Yao Guangguo’s subordinates had followed the wrong leader, they were still somewhat capable.","But now, they too had all perished.","In other words, the base’s strongest combat forces were nearly depleted.","Mo Chun clenched her fists.","Why did it have to happen at this moment?","Clearly, they were about to face a brutal battle!","Fortunately, the base had previously placed great emphasis on defensive structures, so the outer walls were built high and sturdy.","They could only hope to hold out a little longer.","Hold out until reinforcements arrived.","She took a deep breath and began organizing personnel to defend the walls.","Though Mo Xing was young, he appeared remarkably mature at this moment.","He assisted Mo Chun in organizing the personnel, doing so with competence.","Thus, people’s growth sometimes happens in an instant.","The entire central base, accompanied by the piercing sound of the alarm, sprang into action.","Though panic was evident on their faces, there was no chaos.","They struggled to overcome their fear and busied themselves according to Mo Chun’s arrangements.","As time passed, the zombie horde quickly arrived.","What was terrifying was that, in addition to zombies, there were also countless zombie cats, zombie dogs, and other zombie animals mixed within.","At a glance, their numbers were uncountable.","The sight was utterly horrifying.","Seeing the scene before them, everyone gasped in shock.","Zombies were difficult enough to deal with, but now there were zombie animals too.","It seemed as though they were being given no chance to survive!","“Uncle Li, any response from the other bases?”","Mo Chun turned to the middle-aged man who had returned.","Li Feng shook his head with a grave expression.","“So far, none of the major bases in the central region have responded. It seems they’re unlikely to lend a hand.”","If even the bases in their own region were turning a blind eye, there was no hope for those in other regions.","Even if they were willing to help, by the time they arrived, it would be too late.","“However...” Li Feng paused, then added, “The base leader of the northern base was once my comrade. I’ve already sent a distress signal to him. Hopefully, he’ll see it and come to our aid.”","Although the central base was located in the middle of Hua Country, its distance to the four major bases in the east, west, north, and south varied.","The closest, naturally, was the northern base.","If they were to pin their hopes on external reinforcements, the northern base was their only option.","As the two conversed, the zombie horde had already reached the base’s walls.","Everyone’s nerves were on edge.","“Everyone, prepare to attack!”","Mo Chun shouted.","Immediately, the sounds of cannons and bombs erupted, creating large craters in the ground before the base.","Many zombies were blown to pieces, their limbs scattered.","But compared to the zombies that were killed, even more managed to evade the bombs and cannons, reaching the base of the walls.","They began clawing their way upward, one atop another, like a macabre game of human stacking.","Their expressions were ferocious, mouths gaping wide as if waiting to feast on fresh meat.","Each one was frenzied and deranged.","“Don’t let them climb up!”","At the command, large stones were hurled one after another at the zombies attempting to scale the walls.","Gunfire rang out continuously, aimed at the heads of the zombies leading the charge.","Supernatural abilities were also unleashed in abundance.","“Is the oil ready?”","Mo Chun frowned, looking behind her.","“It’s here, it’s here!”","“Quick, pour it down!”","She directed people to pour the collected oil, including petroleum, over the areas with the densest zombie clusters.","With their lives on the line, no one cared about future oil shortages.","Survival was the top priority.","The oil flowed down the walls, drenching the zombies below.","Mo Chun coldly shouted, “Light it up!”","Instantly, flames erupted, like a fiery serpent, engulfing the zombies stacked against the walls.","The outer walls of the base seemed to rain zombies, as one after another fell from mid-air.","But soon, new zombies would rush forward to replace them.","It felt as though they were endless, creating a sense of helplessness and suffocation.","Yet, no one dared to relax for even a moment.","Because the moment they let their guard down, the zombies would breach their defenses.","And then, the entire base would be doomed.","“Someone, help! We can’t hold out much longer!”","A sudden cry for help came from the right side of the wall.","Mo Chun quickly turned to look.","She saw that the zombies on that side had nearly reached the top of the wall!","From a distance, it looked as though a wall of zombies, like a grotesque ivy, had completely covered the surface.","To make matters worse, a gaunt zombie cat leaped forward, screeching as it lunged at a guard on the wall.","Fortunately, the guard reacted quickly and managed to knock the zombie cat down.","But dealing with the zombie cat had diverted his attention, leaving less time to fend off the other zombies.","As a result, the zombie horde, already close to the top, inched even closer.","Seeing this, several nearby individuals rushed over to help deal with the zombies in that area.","But just as the crisis on the right was averted, cries for help erupted from the left.","Breaches in the defense line kept appearing.","They were constantly patching one hole while another opened, leaving no time to catch their breath.","What was more fatal was that their ammunition was running low.","Their stamina was also gradually depleting.","In other words, if reinforcements didn’t arrive soon, even if they fought with their lives, they wouldn’t be able to hold out much longer.","For a moment, panic spread through everyone’s hearts."]},{"number":346,"title":"Chapter 346: Who Can Save Us","paragraphs":["\"Ahhh, I'll fight you to the death!\"","A man shouted, lunging forward and leaping onto the city wall. He grabbed two zombies that were about to breach the defenses and jumped off the wall with them.","\"Stop!\"","Another man beside him frantically reached out to pull him back but failed to even catch a piece of his clothing.","The man who had tackled the zombies and jumped down with them let out a blood-curdling scream before falling into the horde of undead below.","Countless zombies swarmed over him, tearing him apart and devouring his flesh.","Witnessing this, tears welled up in everyone's eyes.","He had sacrificed himself to prevent the defenses from being breached!","He had used his own body to halt the advance of the zombie horde!","\"Oh heavens, is there anyone who can save us?\"","\"We really can't... hold on much longer!\"","Even though everyone had tried every possible method and exhausted all their strength, the zombie army seemed endless.","They were frantically scaling the walls, while others relentlessly battered the city gates.","Panic spread through the base, and the hope on everyone's faces grew dimmer and dimmer.","Perhaps no one was coming to their rescue.","Perhaps, soon, the zombie horde would break through.","And then... it would all be over.","It wasn't that they didn't want to live—they had fought desperately for survival.","But living... was just too hard.","\"Ahhh! I'd rather die than let you harm my family!\"","\"Go to hell!\"","One by one, people sacrificed themselves to protect their homes, willingly perishing alongside the zombies.","But it was like trying to put out a wildfire with a cup of water.","As soon as one zombie fell, another took its place.","Despair was consuming everyone's hearts.","Even Mo Chun and the others were preparing for the worst.","Just as everyone was about to lose all hope, a piercing screech tore through the sky from the rear of the base.","People couldn't help but take a moment to look up.","In the distance, a massive eagle was rapidly approaching, its wings spread wide and its head held high, exuding an imposing aura.","On its back, a small figure could be seen standing upright against the wind.","The gusts blew strands of hair across her forehead, making her appear both spirited and heroic.","\"That's...\"","Mo Xing's eyes widened.","Once he got a clear look, he instantly became excited.","\"It looks like Xiaoxiao!\"","\"It's Xiaoxiao!\"","Huang Yan's eyes also lit up.","\"Didn't she leave? Why is she back?\"","Indeed, Yun Xiaoxiao and Qu Xiaobei had left earlier.","And they had gone in the opposite direction of the zombie horde's movement.","During that time, the two had even killed a fifth-tier mutated zombie.","But as they set off again, intending to head elsewhere, they noticed something unusual in the distance.","Though far away, the thick black smoke rising from the base caught Yun Xiaoxiao's attention.","She had used that method many times before.","Such a massive plume of smoke could only mean something serious was happening.","And the direction pointed straight to the Central Base.","So, she guessed that the Central Base must be in trouble.","While she wasn't some saint who saved everyone she met, she was currently searching for a worthy opponent.","If the Central Base was under attack, perhaps she would find what she was looking for there, saving her the trouble of searching elsewhere.","\"Wow, there are so many zombies over there!\"","Qu Xiaobei tilted her head, peeking out from behind Yun Xiaoxiao with a curious expression.","She stared at the swarming zombies outside the base, her face full of astonishment.","She looked like someone who had never seen such a sight before.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, wore an expression that said, \"I knew it.\"","But she was also puzzled.","Logically, in such cold weather, most zombies should have been frozen.","Even if they weren't, they shouldn't be moving in such large numbers.","So what was going on now?","Suddenly, Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze shifted to the city wall.","She raised an eyebrow in surprise.","She saw familiar faces—Mo Chun, her brother Mo Xing, and Huang Yan, among others.","It seemed that a lot had happened at the Central Base in the short time since they had left.","The battle was intense.","Although the arrival of the eagle was awe-inspiring, no one had the luxury to focus on it.","They couldn't pin all their hopes on a child and an eagle.","\"I can't hold on any longer!\"","A man struggled to push a zombie off the wall, only for two more to lunge at him.","Just as he was about to be overwhelmed, two ice spikes shot out from behind him, piercing the zombies with precision.","The two zombies were instantly struck and sent tumbling backward.","The man was startled and quickly turned to look behind him.","There, floating slightly behind him, was a little girl in a red coat and a white hat. Her eyes were sharp and cold.","She didn't spare him a glance, instead launching more ice spikes in different directions.","Each one struck a zombie directly in the center of its forehead, just as it was about to climb over the wall.","\"Uncle, if you keep spacing out, I won't be able to save you,\" a sweet, childlike voice chimed.","The man snapped out of his daze and quickly turned back to face the zombies.","Yun Xiaoxiao arrived at the edge of the city wall.","Looking down at the sea of zombies clinging to the wall, she furrowed her brow.","In the next moment, she extended her right hand, and a thick vine shot into the ground, as if taking root.","Then, she grabbed the vine and began running swiftly along the wall.","After covering some distance, she suddenly leaped off the wall.","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","Mo Xing, who had been watching her, was startled by her actions and shouted in concern.","But the next second, he was stunned.","The vine Yun Xiaoxiao was holding acted like a giant scraper, sweeping entire rows of zombies off the wall.","Zombies that had been about to reach the top fell to the ground one after another.","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was about to hit the ground, she soared back up in an instant.","Her movements were swift, and soon she had cleared another section of the wall in the same manner.","After repeating this several times, the immediate crisis was averted.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","They looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with immense gratitude.","The battle had been raging for an hour, and they could finally take a brief rest.","Their limbs felt like they didn't belong to them anymore.","But they didn't dare celebrate too much.","Because the zombies on the ground were already starting to climb the walls again!","\"This can't go on!\"","\"Yeah, there are just too many zombies!\""]},{"number":347,"title":"Chapter 347: Negotiating Terms","paragraphs":["Mo Chun approached Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Xiaoxiao, I won't waste words on thanks. The situation is urgent. I was wondering if you could stay and help our base get through this crisis?\"","Asking a child who was only a few years old for help might seem absurd.","But even Mo Chun herself had felt a moment of despair, and Yun Xiaoxiao's arrival had given her a glimmer of hope.","There was no doubt that Yun Xiaoxiao was special.","She couldn't be treated like an ordinary child.","Mo Chun thought that if anyone could turn the tide of this battle, it would be Yun Xiaoxiao.","It had to be said, Mo Chun was smart.","And she had found the right person.","For Mo Chun and the others, even though they were adults, they had never experienced a zombie siege before.","Whether it was strategic planning or actual combat, they were lacking in many areas.","But Yun Xiaoxiao was different.","In her past life, she had gone through this kind of situation multiple times.","She already had experience.","In this life, she had also led people to kill zombies in many cities.","Moreover, her individual strength alone made her the most powerful among them.","With her help, it wasn't an exaggeration to say that they might not wipe out all the zombies in one go, but the battle wouldn't be as hopeless as before. There was still a chance for victory.","Naturally, Yun Xiaoxiao didn't mind helping.","Her purpose in returning was to use this battle to further enhance her own strength.","However, she never did anything that wasn't worth her while.","After all, she and Mo Chun had only just met by chance, with no deep emotional connection.","She wasn't the type to selflessly sacrifice herself for others.","She needed to make things clear.","She raised her eyes and looked at Mo Chun.","\"Sister, I can help, but I have a few conditions.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"First, for the zombie cores we collect from this battle, I'll take 70%, and you'll get 30%. That is, I'll take seven out of every ten cores.\"","\"No problem.\"","As long as they could save the lives of everyone in the base, even if Yun Xiaoxiao took all the cores, they wouldn't complain.","But obviously, Yun Xiaoxiao was quite considerate.","She hadn't demanded everything and was even willing to leave them 30%.","Just this alone made Mo Chun think highly of Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Second, the Central Base will become a subsidiary of Yun City.","However, even as a subsidiary, you will retain your rights and enjoy a high degree of autonomy.\"","This second condition made Li Feng, the middle-aged man behind Mo Chun, frown.","Wasn't this essentially handing over the base?","Mo Chun also thought of this.","But she nodded without hesitation. \"Agreed.\"","Truthfully, she had no ambition for power.","Killing Yao Guangguo was just about avenging her parents and the innocent people who had died.","Staying here was only because she didn't want to watch everyone in the base perish.","As for who would lead the base in the future, she didn't care.","Besides, the base wasn't exactly a prize at the moment.","First, all the supplies in the base had been emptied, leaving it as nothing more than a shell.","Second, this shell was on the verge of collapse, about to be overrun by the zombie horde.","She, her brother, her aunt, and the others just wanted to survive in this apocalyptic world.","Who the base belonged to didn't matter to her; she just wanted to live.","For everyone to live.","Moreover, she quite liked Yun Xiaoxiao.","Despite her young age, she was brave, resourceful, and incredibly strong.","Even in a position of absolute power, she didn't take everything for herself, as seen with the 70-30 split.","So becoming a subsidiary of Yun City probably wouldn't be so bad.","And Yun City...","That name sounded familiar.","Suddenly, a light flashed in her eyes.","Wasn't that the place mentioned on the radio, where they had evolution fluid and could exchange for various supplies?","She looked at Yun Xiaoxiao in surprise.","So, she was from Yun City!","Yun Xiaoxiao...","Yun City...","Mo Chun suddenly understood.","At this moment, she felt that her earlier decision was absolutely correct.","\"Are there any other conditions?\"","Seeing the zombies climbing the walls again, ready to launch another attack, Mo Chun couldn't help but ask urgently.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head. \"No, just these two.\"","After saying this, she placed a finger to her lips and let out a sharp whistle.","In the next second, the little eagle circling in the sky swooped down.","As soon as it landed on the wall, Qu Xiaobei lost her grip and fell.","\"Ouch!\"","Qu Xiaobei rubbed her bottom and glared at the little eagle.","The little eagle ignored her, tucking its wings and standing obediently by the wall.","Yun Xiaoxiao scanned the wall and pointed to the right.","\"Little eagle, you guard that spot. Kill any zombies that come up. Don't let a single one through, understand?\"","The little eagle nodded and immediately flew to the spot Yun Xiaoxiao had indicated.","Yun Xiaoxiao then summoned Little Cute and Little Flower, assigning them to guard other areas.","\"Xiaoxiao, Xiaoxiao, what about me?\"","Qu Xiaobei pointed at herself with a grin, worried that Yun Xiaoxiao might forget her.","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to the spot where she was standing.","\"You guard here.\"","Qu Xiaobei immediately patted her chest, looking serious.","\"I'll complete the mission!\"","Her earnest expression was both amusing and endearing.","Then, Yun Xiaoxiao turned to Mo Chun and the others.","\"There are too many zombies, and your combat strength is too weak, so you can't charge out directly. Instead, you'll have to hold the wall and take down the zombies one by one.","But this will take a lot of time.","Earlier, I've already stationed my forces at four key positions.","Now, you need to divide your people into three teams.","The first team will be on the front lines, with two people stationed every 0.5 meters.","These two will support each other—one will focus on stopping the zombies from harming people, while the other will focus on killing them.","The second team will serve as backup, stepping in when the first team is overwhelmed.","The third team will rest.","Then, rotate shifts every half hour.","In addition, logistics must be prepared.","Have food and water ready to replenish the fighters' energy.","Also, the non-combatants can't just sit idle.","Have them cut pieces of cloth, wrap them around charcoal, and soak them in alcohol, wax, or oil to create makeshift firebombs. Then bring them to the wall.","Sister Mo Chun, Aunt Huang Yan, and you, you...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed out a few people.","Then she continued, \"Make sure to conserve your strength.\"","Usually, during a zombie siege, the first wave consists of low-level zombies.","The real threats often appear later.","If the strongest fighters exhaust themselves early on, the defense will crumble when the high-level zombies show up."]},{"number":348,"title":"Chapter 348: Feeling Confident","paragraphs":["After giving her instructions, Yun Xiaoxiao demonstrated how two people could cooperate to kill zombies with minimal effort.","Watching her, everyone had an epiphany.","This was different from facing zombies head-on on the ground.","On the city wall, they actually had an advantage in fighting zombies.","Most importantly, this method could also utilize those without supernatural abilities.","Yun Xiaoxiao's method was simple: one person would hold a long pole or similar object and use it to block the zombie the moment it appeared, preventing it from pouncing.","The other person could then seize the opportunity to deliver a fatal blow.","Of course, they could adapt to the situation; the first person didn't necessarily have to block the zombie—if they could kill it directly, that would be even better.","This required excellent coordination between the two.","However, with the second team as backup, any mistakes could be quickly rectified.","While Little Cutie and the others began dealing with the first wave of climbing zombies, Mo Chun took the opportunity to quickly assign roles.","The members of the first and second teams were soon in position.","Those in charge of weapons distributed them to the first team members as quickly as possible.","Though the weapons—hoes, machetes, brooms, mops, and wooden sticks—seemed strange, they were surprisingly effective.","Compared to the earlier chaos where everyone exhausted themselves fighting zombies, this method was much more organized.","It also gave everyone time to rest, preventing them from becoming too exhausted to catch their breath.","Mo Chun, Huang Yan, Li Feng, and others acted as mobile units, not stationed in one fixed spot.","They went wherever they were needed most.","As for Yun Xiaoxiao, she flew alone to a spot in mid-air in front of the city wall.","The next second, she spotted a direction and flew toward it.","There, a high-level fourth-tier mutated zombie was wreaking havoc.","Yun Xiaoxiao wielded Lord Slasher, and as she approached the zombie, she gripped the weapon with both hands and brought it down in a vertical slash.","The mutated zombie seemed to sense the impending danger, roaring as it shoved other zombies aside to evade the attack.","But Yun Xiaoxiao had anticipated its reaction. With a slight lift of her brow, she stepped onto the head of another zombie, using it as leverage to twist her body and redirect Lord Slasher.","\"Crunch!\"","The sharp blade split the mutated zombie's head in two.","Brain matter splattered, covering the surrounding zombies.","With a flick of her wrist, Yun Xiaoxiao sent the crystal core flying into the air.","She lightly tapped her foot, soaring into the air just as the zombies reached out to grab her.","She quickly condensed water to wash the crystal core before catching it in her hand.","In less than five minutes, she had killed a high-level fourth-tier mutated zombie.","This was absolute strength!","A result of her repeatedly risking her life and honing her skills through countless battles.","After dealing with this zombie, Yun Xiaoxiao began searching for her next target.","The others watched as she darted through the dense horde of zombies, taking down one powerful zombie after another—zombies that were clearly different from the ordinary ones.","With such a formidable role model in front of them, the group's morale was subtly boosted.","Combined with Little Cutie's dominating performance on the city wall, everyone's fighting spirit grew stronger.","For example, Little Cutie would climb onto the outer wall and use its spikes to pierce the heads of zombies, one after another, with speed and precision.","Little Flower would swallow a zombie whole and spit out a shriveled corpse.","Moreover, its thorny vines were incredibly effective.","Sometimes, it could simultaneously restrain several zombies and hurl them off the wall.","Other times, its thorns would elongate, piercing through zombie skulls.","The area around it became a massive zombie slaughterhouse.","As for Little Eagle, it was even more impressive.","With a single flap of its massive wings against the wall, the zombies clinging to it would rain down like sifted grains.","It also used its sharp beak and talons to send any zombies attempting to reach the top straight to their doom.","As for Qu Xiaobei...","She seemed to be doing nothing.","But at the same time, it felt like she was doing something.","She simply sat on the city wall, swinging her legs, enthusiastically cheering for Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","She also acted as a living decoy, attracting many zombies.","But the strange thing was, whenever a zombie touched her, it would be repelled before it could grab her, losing control and falling to the ground.","So, while her area had the most zombies, not a single one managed to climb to the top.","This bizarre phenomenon left everyone both shocked and reassured.","As long as the zombies couldn't get up, that was all that mattered.","Compared to the initial panic, disorganization, and uncertainty, everyone now felt a sense of confidence.","It was as if, as long as they held on, victory would eventually be theirs!","\"Brothers, kill them all!\"","\"That's right, let's do this!\"","\"Avenge our fallen brothers and sisters!\"","\"Kill!\"","Their spirits were high, and the earlier sense of defeat had vanished. They fought with increasing vigor.","For over an hour after that, not a single person was injured or killed.","This outcome was almost unbelievable.","But as time passed, night began to fall.","Mo Chun looked up at the sky, which was now tinged with darkness.","He then glanced at the frenzied horde of zombies still surging below the wall, his brow furrowed.","Nighttime was far more dangerous than the day.","And tonight was destined to be sleepless.","\"Quick, bring all the generators from the base up here, along with wires and light bulbs. Try to find ones with higher wattage so it's brighter.\"","Zombies could attack chaotically, but they couldn't afford to.","If they couldn't even see the zombies, how could they dodge or attack?","Even the slightest scratch from a zombie could be fatal!","They couldn't afford to be careless in the slightest.","As the generators were being brought up to the wall, Yun Xiaoxiao also returned.","\"Are the cloth-made incendiary devices ready?\" she asked.","Mo Chun pointed to several bamboo baskets placed nearby.","\"Some are done, and everyone is still working on more.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at them and nodded.","\"Let's use these for now.\"","In the next moment, she tied the ropes of several baskets together and lifted them all in one hand.","Everyone: !!!","That had to weigh at least a hundred or two hundred pounds.","And she... lifted it with one hand?","Ignoring the stunned expressions, Yun Xiaoxiao flew into the air, heading toward the area with the densest zombie concentration.","Under the astonished gazes of everyone, she released the ropes of one of the baskets."]},{"number":349,"title":"Chapter 349: The Brothers Have Arrived","paragraphs":["The basket plummeted straight down.","Just as it was about to crash into the horde of zombies, it burst into flames with a loud *boom*.","Then, as if exploding, it went *bang bang bang* several times.","The nearby zombies were all blown away.","The raging fire instantly engulfed the zombie horde in a sea of flames.","Yun Xiaoxiao repeated the same method, dropping baskets into several areas densely populated with zombies.","Each time, the zombies crackled and burned.","Under the dark night sky, it was as if several massive bonfires had suddenly ignited, illuminating the entire sky.","In truth, if Yun Xiaoxiao really wanted to deal with these zombies, she had faster methods.","After all, she still had unused oil and gas canisters in her storage space.","But she didn’t plan to use them on a large scale.","First, she couldn’t bear to.","These were scarce resources, and if she didn’t have to use them, she wouldn’t.","Besides, if the zombie cores were burned, they’d be gone forever—what a waste.","Additionally, if this crisis were solved too easily, she wouldn’t get a good opportunity to train herself.","And the people of the Central Base wouldn’t be as grateful to her.","Helping others without expecting anything in return is a noble virtue.","But she didn’t need that.","In this apocalyptic world, such virtues weren’t even worth a bag of rice.","Since she wanted the Central Base to become a subsidiary of Yun City, it was better for the people there to be as grateful to her as possible.","So, the zombies had to be killed slowly.","Let everyone experience the difficulty of fighting zombies firsthand.","At the same time, they could improve their combat skills together.","They needed to understand that only by strengthening their own abilities could they truly survive.","The zombies burned in several areas, the firelight illuminating a large section of the area in front of the city walls.","Not only did it eliminate some zombies, but it also brought light to the people on the city wall.","The zombie slaughter continued!","The battle raged on for several hours.","Everyone persevered, continuously killing zombies.","The fight seemed endless.","At a little past 3 a.m., several helicopters flew in from the distance.","Everyone looked up in surprise.","“Look, helicopters are coming!”","“Are they here to help us?”","“From that direction, they don’t seem to be from the Northern Base. They must be from the west.”","“Who could it be?”","The arrival of the helicopters instantly chased away everyone’s drowsiness.","Yun Xiaoxiao also glanced in that direction, raising an eyebrow slightly.","However, she didn’t have much time to focus on the situation over there.","Because she was facing a relatively tricky situation herself.","Below her, a mutated zombie dog was glaring at her menacingly.","Yun Xiaoxiao locked eyes with it.","Suddenly, the corner of her mouth twitched.","It’s just a dog.","She couldn’t have any weaknesses!","Today, she had to take it down!","In an instant, she dove down, attacking the mutated zombie dog.","But the zombie dog was exceptionally agile, dodging swiftly.","It was also extremely ferocious, baring its teeth and leaping at Yun Xiaoxiao to bite her.","The moment it jumped, Yun Xiaoxiao felt both a psychological and physiological reaction, instinctively wanting to dodge.","Goosebumps even rose on her skin.","But she overcame the discomfort, speeding up her movements.","Finally, after several rounds of pursuit, she successfully decapitated the mutated zombie dog.","“Kid! You really are here!”","Just as she caught her breath, she heard the familiar voice of Nie Yizhou from afar.","She turned sharply and saw Nie Yizhou waving excitedly at her from the top of the city wall.","Beside him stood Xiao Feng, Lu Chen, Mu Yang, and Ling Jing, all in a row, looking at her.","Each of them had a slight smile on their faces.","Well, except for Lu Chen.","Though he wasn’t smiling, his expression showed the same sentiment as the others.","There was also a sense of relief and reassurance in his demeanor.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Why were they here?","Before she could react, Lu Chen and the others sprang into action.","Powerful energies erupted from their bodies, and wherever the energy landed, zombies fell in droves.","It was like a grand scene from a fantasy movie, with overwhelming force and lethality.","The spectacle was breathtaking.","Yun Xiaoxiao could clearly see the shock and delight on the faces of people like Mo Chun.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched.","Well, she had wanted to take things slow, but with these guys here, that plan was out the window.","As expected, with their intense attacks, the battle was completely over in less than two hours.","When the last zombie fell, the people of the Central Base, who had been fighting all night, collapsed onto the city wall.","“It’s finally over!”","“Yeah, it really feels like we’ve survived a disaster.”","“It’s good to be alive.”","“We really owe it to them. Who knows how this would’ve ended otherwise.”","As they rested, everyone’s gaze turned to Lu Chen and Yun Xiaoxiao, who was flying toward them.","“Big brother, why are you all here?”","Yun Xiaoxiao flew directly in front of Lu Chen and the others, asking curiously.","Before Lu Chen could answer, the talkative Nie Yizhou jumped in.","He was grinning, with a hint of smugness.","“Haha, didn’t expect us, did you?","When we got the distress call from the Central Base, Brother Chen guessed you might be here.","So, we all came together.”","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at Lu Chen. “Why did you think I’d be here?”","She was genuinely curious.","She hadn’t told anyone where she was going.","With the vastness of the world, why did he assume she’d be at the Central Base?","Lu Chen remained calm. “The central region of the country is the most chaotic. Chaos means more challenges, and since you want to grow stronger, the central region would naturally be your first choice.”","“Big brother, you’re so smart!”","Yun Xiaoxiao gave Lu Chen a thumbs-up, impressed.","His reasoning was exactly what she had thought back then.","With her brothers here, Yun Xiaoxiao naturally felt much more at ease.","She was about to ask about the situation in Yun City when Qu Xiaobei came over.","“Xiaoxiao, who are these handsome big brothers?”","Qu Xiaobei tilted her head, looking at Lu Chen and the others with great interest.","Yun Xiaoxiao introduced them one by one.","“Wow, they’re so good-looking, each more handsome than the last. This brother is even prettier than a beautiful sister.”","Qu Xiaobei pointed at Ling Jing excitedly.","Nie Yizhou tried hard to hold back his laughter.","Ling Jing’s mouth twitched.","He bent down and wagged a finger in front of Qu Xiaobei.","“Kid, you’ve got it wrong. This is called being handsome, got it? If you keep saying nonsense, you might get a spanking.”","There was a hint of mischief in his eyes, and his tone was half-serious, half-joking.","“I think you’d better not spank her,” Yun Xiaoxiao advised.","The others were puzzled. “Why not?”"]},{"number":350,"title":"Chapter 350: Encountering Bai Ruo Again","paragraphs":["Looking at Nie Yizhou, who seemed the most intrigued, a hint of slyness flashed in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes.","She cleared her throat lightly and said, \"Brother Yizhou, why don't you give it a try?\"","\"Isn't that a bit...?\"","Nie Yizhou glanced at the adorably clueless Qu Xiaobei. While his mouth said it wasn't appropriate, his curiosity was bubbling up uncontrollably.","\"Maybe I'll just give it a light tap?\"","He asked tentatively.","Yun Xiaoxiao struggled to keep her expression neutral and nodded calmly.","Qu Xiaobei also stretched out her small hand, as if she had been waiting for this moment all along.","Her eyes held a natural innocence, as if she were eagerly anticipating Nie Yizhou's strike.","Nie Yizhou looked at the two of them suspiciously.","He couldn't shake the feeling that something was off.","But his curiosity was simply too overwhelming.","Lu Chen and the others stood quietly to the side, watching him without a word.","Soon, Nie Yizhou extended his right hand, blew on it, and raised it high before bringing it down with a slap.","\"Smack!\"","\"Ouch!\"","The moment his hand made contact, it bounced back reflexively, and he let out a cry of pain, his face contorted.","\"Ha ha ha ha! You fell for it!\"","Qu Xiaobei burst into laughter, doubling over with amusement.","She turned to Yun Xiaoxiao excitedly, \"Xiaoxiao, this is so much fun!\"","Seeing this, even Lu Chen and the others were taken aback.","\"Little one, is her ability to reflect damage?\" Mu Yang couldn't help but ask curiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded, \"Something like that.\"","Hearing this, everyone's expressions turned to surprise.","Now they finally understood why Yun Xiaoxiao had advised against hitting Qu Xiaobei.","It wasn't about harming her—it was pure self-inflicted pain!","\"Xiaoxiao...\"","Just as everyone was still processing the shock, Mo Chun approached.","\"Who are these people?\"","Mo Chun casually glanced at Lu Chen and the others.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave a brief introduction.","Mo Chun and the people behind her, including Li Feng, were visibly surprised.","\"They're from Yun City?!\"","Although they knew Yun Xiaoxiao was from Yun City, she had always acted alone before, so they assumed she had come by herself this time as well.","Only Qu Xiaobei was with her.","And Yun City was very far from here.","They had sent out a call for help, but they never expected that the first to arrive would be people from Yun City.","What's more, Yun Xiaoxiao's strength alone was already terrifying.","Qu Xiaobei's ability was both strange and fearsome.","And now, the newcomers were no weaklings either—each one was astonishingly powerful on their own.","This was downright terrifying!","Just what kind of formidable place was Yun City?!","Mo Chun snapped out of her daze after a moment.","She thanked Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen's group repeatedly.","Her demeanor was neither submissive nor overly flattering, striking just the right balance that reflected her grace and poise.","At that moment, the distant night sky was filled with the roar of several helicopters.","Everyone turned to look.","Who else was coming this time?","Compared to the arrival of Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen's group, when the people of the Central Base had awaited them with the anticipation of saviors, this time their mood was much calmer.","After all, whoever was coming, the battle was already over.","The purpose of their arrival... seemed rather insignificant now.","After a while, fifteen helicopters landed inside the Central Base.","Mo Chun, Yun Xiaoxiao, and the others descended from the walls and walked over.","Bai Hongting was the first to step out of the lead helicopter.","When Yun Xiaoxiao saw him, her eyes darkened slightly, a complex emotion flickering in their depths.","The observant Mu Yang immediately noticed her change in expression.","He couldn't help but scrutinize Bai Hongting.","This man had visited their base before, so he naturally recognized him.","Wasn't he the leader of the Northern Base?","Why did Xiaoxiao look at him like that?","Almost as if he were an enemy.","Could it be that Xiaoxiao's sudden departure had something to do with him?","Mu Yang kept his guard up, silently preparing for any trouble.","No one was allowed to bully their little Xiaoxiao!","Lu Chen and Ling Jing's expressions also shifted subtly.","Only the carefree Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng remained oblivious.","When Bai Hongting saw Yun Xiaoxiao, his steps faltered for a moment.","He had intended to greet her, but after seeing the look in her eyes, he decided against it.","The young girl seemed to really dislike him.","He subtly shifted his body to the side.","This small movement did not escape Yun Xiaoxiao's notice.","She narrowed her eyes and looked toward the second-to-last helicopter.","Sure enough, the next moment, Bai Ruo stepped out of that helicopter.","The left arm that Yun Xiaoxiao had crippled before had somehow grown back!","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","What was going on?","She had definitely destroyed that arm—how was it fine now?","At the same time, Bai Ruo also noticed Yun Xiaoxiao.","Her eyes instantly filled with madness and hatred, as if she wanted to tear Yun Xiaoxiao apart on the spot.","This look was naturally caught by Lu Chen and the others.","Their eyes turned cold, a flash of killing intent passing through them.","Even the usually carefree Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou were no exception.","\"Hey, if you keep looking at my girl like that, I'll gouge your eyes out and feed them to the dogs!\"","Xiao Feng growled, his temper flaring.","Bai Ruo had never been treated like this before.","As the daughter of Bai Hongting, the leader of the Northern Base, she was always treated with reverence.","But Xiao Feng had immediately confronted her, and her face darkened at the insult.","\"You're asking for death!\"","\"Enough, Ruo Ruo! Remember what you promised me!\"","Just as Bai Ruo was about to attack Xiao Feng, Bai Hongting stepped in front of her and shouted sternly.","Originally, he could have arrived earlier.","But Bai Ruo had secretly joined the team, causing a delay.","\"Dad, he—!\" Bai Ruo protested.","The other party had been so rude—why wasn't her father standing up for her?","\"Go back to the helicopter and wait!\"","Bai Hongting's voice was cold and unyielding.","While it seemed like he was siding with outsiders, he was actually protecting Bai Ruo.","He had clearly seen the intense killing intent in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes and those of her companions.","He had experienced Yun Xiaoxiao's strength before.","And he had witnessed the power of her companions during the early days of the zombie-clearing operations in the western region.","After all this time, their strength had likely reached even more terrifying levels.","Although the Northern Base had recently experienced a stroke of luck, boosting their overall strength significantly, he didn't want to risk his men facing such an unpredictable group because of Bai Ruo's actions.","If it came to a fight, given Yun Xiaoxiao's relentless and ruthless nature, there was no telling what might happen this time."]},{"number":351,"title":"Chapter 351: Poor Acting","paragraphs":["However, he never expected that no matter how much he cared for his adopted daughter, she would never appreciate his efforts.","Because, deep down, she had long been hoping for a confrontation between him and Yun Xiaoxiao.","How could she possibly let go of such a golden opportunity?","Ever since Bai Ruo had her arm crippled, she had been venting her frustrations in her room every day, consumed by hysteria.","Bai Hongting tried countless methods, even procuring a prosthetic arm and consulting doctors to help her.","But Bai Ruo despised the lack of flexibility in the prosthetic and threw another tantrum.","To make Bai Hongting and Sheng Shuya pay more attention to her, she dismissed her caretakers and sneaked out of the base.","Of course, she wouldn’t just disappear without a trace.","Before leaving, she deliberately left behind some clues so that Bai Hongting and the others could find her.","However, this trip outside led her to an unexpected encounter.","This encounter not only restored her arm but also elevated the strength of Bai Hongting and the others.","Now, she felt it was the perfect time to kill Yun Xiaoxiao.","If she missed this chance, given Bai Hongting’s upright nature, he would never seek revenge for her.","She had to push him into action!","Not long after Bai Hongting finished speaking, a cold and calculating glint flashed in Bai Ruo’s eyes.","Without a word, she charged straight at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao had long wanted to kill her, and seeing her recklessly charging forward, she didn’t hesitate to shoot an ice spike.","She might not have been able to break through Bai Hongting’s defense shield before, but that didn’t mean she feared them!","The ice spike shot out with incredible speed and force, aimed directly at Bai Ruo’s heart.","If it struck, it would kill her instantly.","As the ice spike was about to pierce her chest, Bai Ruo’s breath hitched.","But upon seeing Bai Hongting’s anxious expression and the defense shield quickly forming in front of her, she subtly pursed her lips.","Then, she deliberately fell to the ground, screaming in fear.","“Dad, she’s trying to kill me! I was just trying to make peace with her, but you saw it! She didn’t give me a chance and went straight for the kill!”","Her acting was crude, and most people could see through it.","Bai Hongting, of course, knew as well.","He sighed inwardly.","This daughter of his was truly not well-raised.","As the saying goes, a child’s misbehavior is the parent’s fault.","It was up to him to settle this matter.","However, he was also surprised by Yun Xiaoxiao’s progress. Her strength had improved significantly compared to a few months ago!","If he hadn’t experienced that accident a month ago, perhaps his defense shield would have been broken by her!","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned slightly as her attack missed.","Her opponent’s strength had also improved greatly!","The atmosphere grew tense.","As Bai Hongting blocked Yun Xiaoxiao’s attack, Lu Chen and the others also moved.","They quickly stood by Yun Xiaoxiao’s side.","Seeing this, Bai Hongting’s subordinates also closed in.","The two sides formed a standoff, ready to fight to the death.","“Everyone, we’re all friends here. Can’t we settle this peacefully and talk things out?”","Li Feng, the middle-aged man behind Mo Chun, stepped forward to mediate.","“These are friends from Yun City. Thanks to their timely help, our central base was able to survive the recent zombie siege.”","He introduced Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","Then he introduced Bai Hongting and his team.","“They’re friends from the northern base, who came all this way to help us.","This is Bai Hongting, my comrade from my military days.","We’re all good-hearted people. Why not talk things out instead of fighting and ruining the harmony?”","As soon as Li Feng finished speaking, Yun Xiaoxiao let out a cold laugh.","“Uncle, do you have the wrong idea about what ‘good-hearted’ means?","We from Yun City are never the kind-hearted type.","We act purely on our whims.","So, you’d better step aside and stop playing mediator, or you might get hurt later.”","Li Feng: “...”","He hadn’t expected Yun Xiaoxiao to be so blunt.","Bai Hongting, on the other hand, looked at her with even more admiration.","This girl’s temperament really suited his taste.","But still...","“Xiaoxiao, I know you haven’t let go of what happened before, but Bai Ruo is my daughter. I can’t just stand by and let you kill her.”","“Then what’s the point of wasting words?”","Yun Xiaoxiao snorted coldly and immediately raised her hand.","“Wait!” Bai Hongting quickly called for a pause.","Yun Xiaoxiao shot him a sidelong glance. “What? Speak up if you have something to say, and hurry up! Honestly, I’ve never seen anyone take a breather during a fight.”","Her tone and expression were filled with impatience.","Bai Hongting was momentarily speechless, both amused and exasperated.","He composed himself and said, “I know you have no reason to lie. Bai Ruo must have offended you first, but you’ve already crippled her arm and left her severely injured.","If you’re still angry, how about this?","Our northern base will offer crystals and supplies to resolve this conflict. You can name the amount.”","Bai Hongting expressed his utmost sincerity.","His tone wasn’t submissive but rather one of negotiation.","He had no intention of antagonizing Yun Xiaoxiao.","Firstly, he genuinely admired her and found her personality appealing.","He also felt an inexplicable sense of closeness to her.","Secondly, a fight today would involve two bases.","Both he and Yun Xiaoxiao were leaders of their respective bases.","If this turned into a life-and-death battle, at least one base would be left leaderless.","In the worst-case scenario, both bases could fall into chaos.","This wasn’t just about him and Yun Xiaoxiao anymore.","It would affect the lives and livelihoods of many people.","As a soldier, Bai Hongting was a man of great integrity.","No matter the circumstances, he never forgot his sense of responsibility.","Even in this apocalyptic world, he deeply loved his country and wanted to protect more of its people.","He knew that in times like these, unity among the people was crucial.","After all, the world didn’t consist solely of their nation.","If resources became scarce or other factors came into play, neighboring countries might set their sights on them.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were incredibly strong.","If they were to fight to mutual destruction over his daughter, it would be a terrible loss.","So, he decided to resolve the matter peacefully.","Once things settled down, he would stay at the base and properly educate Bai Ruo.","Hearing Bai Hongting’s words, Bai Ruo dug her nails into her palms.","She glared resentfully at his back.","How infuriating! Why wouldn’t Dad just kill that wretched girl!"]},{"number":352,"title":"Chapter 352: Deliberately Provoking War","paragraphs":["“Dad, she wasn't hurt before, yet she cruelly crippled my arm and severely injured me. Isn't that enough? Why do we have to compensate her with crystals and supplies?”","She yelled furiously.","“Because you were the one who provoked her first,” Bai Hongting sighed.","“You’re just cowardly, afraid to fight them! Hehe, who would have thought that a big base like ours would be scared of a small one? What will others think of our Northern Base? It’s a joke!”","After Bai Ruo’s wild rant, seven long tentacles suddenly sprouted from her back. At the same time, her left arm rapidly elongated, transforming into a shape identical to the tentacles. Eight tentacles immediately lunged fiercely at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Bai Ruo’s eyes gleamed with ruthlessness.","Hmph, don’t want to make the first move, huh?","Well, I’ll do it myself!","Whether you want to fight or not, this fight is happening today!","Seeing the seven tentacles emerge behind Bai Ruo, Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","She finally understood why Bai Ruo’s severed arm ‘regrew.’","It wasn’t regrowth; she had fused with a mutant octopus!","There’s a special case among mutant animals where they merge with their host’s body.","Certain features of the animal not only appear on the host but their attack skills can also be shared.","Anyone fused with a mutant animal experiences a significant boost in strength.","In her past life, she had seen someone fused with a mutant fish.","That person had faint fish scales, which provided excellent defense.","They could breathe underwater, hold their breath for a long time, and swim incredibly fast.","Plus, their bite force was outstanding.","Bai Ruo must have fused with an octopus, which explained why her broken arm wasn’t regrown but replaced by the octopus’s tentacles.","Earlier, she was wearing gloves, so Yun Xiaoxiao hadn’t noticed.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curled slightly.","It seems Bai Ruo really wants her and Bai Hongting to clash...","Initially, after hearing Bai Hongting’s words and catching a glimpse of his true thoughts, she had thought about giving him face and making a deal.","But seeing how Bai Ruo was practically courting death, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but feel the urge to slice her head off.","She’s seen dumb people before, but never someone this dumb.","Her father, a base leader, has already bent over backwards for her.","Yet this idiot insists on digging her own grave. Well, that’s not going to be her fault now, is it?","After all...","If someone wants to die, denying them that seems a bit unreasonable, doesn’t it?","She’s always been rather 'helpful' that way.","As the eight tentacles lunged at her, Yun Xiaoxiao unsheathed her blade while smirking.","“Big Brother, hold back Base Leader Bai and the others.”","She hadn’t planned to rely on her brothers.","But given the current situation, she’d have to borrow some of their strength.","“Got it,” Lu Chen replied without hesitation, immediately blocking Bai Hongting’s path.","Ling Jing leisurely moved over, pulling his hands out of his pockets with an elegant gesture.","“Don’t worry, little one. Leave this side to us.”","“Yeah, kid. With your brothers here, they won’t be able to interfere with your... killing.” Nie Yizhou smirked.","Xiao Feng and Mu Yang didn’t speak, but they quickly moved to block Bai Hongting’s subordinates.","Xiao Keai and Xiao Huahua instantly grew in size.","Xiao Yingying let out a loud screech, flapping its massive wings.","Qu Xiaobei crossed her arms and walked to the front.","Mo Xing tugged on Mo Chun’s sleeve, and Mo Chun immediately understood his intent.","After mulling it over for two seconds, she stepped forward.","Seeing this, Mo Xing’s face lit up with a smile and quickly followed.","Huang Yan and the others didn’t hesitate either, immediately moving to assist.","Only Li Feng felt deeply regretful.","He shouldn’t have sent that message to the Northern Base.","Ugh, this is just a mess!","The atmosphere on-site had grown even more intense than before.","After all, Yun Xiaoxiao was now engaged in a real battle with Bai Ruo!","Without Bai Hongting’s protection, Bai Ruo, despite her fusion with the octopus, was no match for Yun Xiaoxiao.","As Bai Ruo’s screams echoed, half of her tentacles were sliced off, and Bai Hongting’s brows furrowed so tightly they could’ve crushed a fly.","He understood that Bai Ruo was forcing him to take action.","But he couldn’t just stand by and watch Bai Ruo die.","In the end, he sighed heavily in his mind, his face full of helplessness.","A second later, he issued a cold order to attack.","“Go!”","At his command, everyone behind him moved.","Lu Chen and the others’ expressions also changed.","They hadn’t been lounging idly at home during this time.","Now, it was the perfect opportunity to test their progress!","The two sides immediately clashed.","The ordinary citizens of the Central Base, who had been standing to the side, hurriedly retreated dozens of meters upon seeing such a huge commotion.","They were afraid the intense battle might spill over into them.","Emotionally, they naturally supported Yun Xiaoxiao’s side.","Not only were Yun Xiaoxiao and her team their saviors,","but from just a short while, they could tell that Bai Ruo had deliberately instigated this.","A fight that could’ve been avoided...","After just surviving a major battle, everyone was exhausted, longing for rest, not eager to see such chaos.","Besides, that chaos was happening right in their base.","With the immense destructive power of an awakened, who would take responsibility if the base’s facilities were damaged?","So, everyone was very straightforward in their disdain for Bai Ruo.","“Was that girl stupid or something? I can’t understand what she was thinking.”","\"Well, she's the daughter of the Northern Base leader, so I guess she has the privilege to be spoiled.\"","\"Pfft~ Our Pure Miss was also a base leader's daughter, but she wasn't as spoiled and unruly.\"","or","\"pfft~ Our Pure Miss was also a base leader's daughter, but she wasn't as spoiled or reckless.\"","\"People are just different. If everyone were the same, it’d be weird.”","“I hope Yun City’s side wins!”","“Definitely! They’re our saviors; of course we’re rooting for them!”","The crowd watched avidly.","The battle on the field was equally fierce.","Bai Hongting kept trying to reach Bai Ruo, who was screaming horribly as Yun Xiaoxiao battered her, but with Lu Chen and Ling Jing blocking his path, he couldn’t make any progress.","His strongest ability was a defense shield.","But it only protected and didn’t attack, ensuring his and his team’s safety.","To attack others, his other abilities were no match for Lu Chen’s crew.","“Ahhhhh! Dad, please save me!”","On the other side, Bai Ruo shrieked in terror.","Accompanied by her scream, her last tentacle was also severed by Yun Xiaoxiao.","Blood spilled all over the ground, and she was in such pain that she was shivering, her face ghostly pale."]},{"number":353,"title":"Chapter 353: Xiao Xiao Injured","paragraphs":["She won't survive, and neither will anyone else.","Bai Ruo thought this, but the next moment, her mouth opened uncontrollably.","\"That's because you look very much like my mother when she was a child, and since you're from Rongcheng and are the right age, I suspected you might be my parents' biological daughter. That's why I hated you the moment I saw you and just wanted you to disappear from this world!\"","These words left everyone present stunned.","Especially Bai Hongting, who was being controlled by Lu Chen.","He hadn't expected the reason to be this.","But...","\"Your sister is already dead, right? How could Xiaoxiao possibly be my biological daughter with your mother?\"","He blurted out.","Although Xiaoxiao had inexplicably made him feel a sense of familiarity, and he and his wife had considered adopting her as their daughter.","But their biological daughter had already died shortly after birth, how could she still be alive?","No matter how many times they had wished their daughter were still alive, reality was reality.","\"Hahaha... dead? Who told you that?\"","Bai Ruo burst into laughter.","Her expression twisted into something extremely grotesque.","At that moment, it felt as if there were two people fighting inside her mind.","One was trying desperately to stop her from saying anything further.","The other was raging with an intense desire to reveal everything.","In the end, the second person prevailed.","Bai Ruo's expression turned frenzied as she continued, amidst Bai Hongting's shocked gaze.","\"I wish she were dead, but before I had the chance to kill her, she was taken away. So, to be precise, I don't actually know if she's still alive.\"","Back then, after she had switched the newborn from the neighboring bed with her parents' biological daughter, she had been about to kill her parents' daughter by smothering her with a pillow.","But then the nanny caring for the neighboring pregnant woman returned.","She couldn't make her move.","Later, the pregnant woman was taken away by her family due to severe bleeding and needed to be transferred to another hospital.","Her parents' biological daughter was taken away as well.","\"Ruo Ruo, what exactly is going on?\"","Bai Hongting's expression froze.","He had a bold conjecture in his mind.","But he didn't dare to pursue it further.","He hoped that the truth wasn't what he was imagining.","But since this involved his own biological daughter, and his wife had never truly been happy for the past few years because of their lost daughter, often waking up in tears during the night.","So, he was still eager to know what Bai Ruo meant.","What did she mean by 'didn't have the chance to kill her, she was taken away?'","What did she mean by 'didn't know if she's still alive?'","Could it be that their daughter, Little Tomato, is still alive?!","Thinking of this, he couldn't help but glance at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Bai Ruo sneered, \"Back then, I unintentionally overheard you and mom talking in the room, and I found out that I'm not your biological daughter.","At that moment, I was scared. I was scared that once my sister was born, you wouldn't love me anymore.","So...\"","She confessed everything about how she had switched the babies.","Including how she had smothered another infant to death with a pillow.","The more they listened, the more shocked everyone became.","Their expressions toward Bai Ruo grew increasingly bizarre.","\"I never thought she could be so vicious. How could she bring herself to kill such a young baby?\"","\"Right, it's all jealousy that drives people to do evil.\"","\"Bai Base Commander really raised a living viper.\"","People whispered among themselves, as Bai Ruo's revelations were just too astonishing.","Bai Hongting stood there frozen, his mouth opening and closing a few times without a sound coming out.","He stared at Bai Ruo in disbelief, his eyes filled with complex emotions.","So, their adopted daughter, without their knowledge, had wanted to kill their biological daughter out of fear that their love for her would diminish.","Although she didn't succeed, she had still killed another innocent baby.","Their biological daughter had been lost outside for over six years!","And they had been completely unaware of it!","At this moment, he suddenly remembered Bai Ruo mentioning earlier.","How she wanted to kill Yun Xiaoxiao because Xiaoxiao looked very much like his wife when she was young.","His eyes widened, and he suddenly looked at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Why hadn't he noticed before!","Now, the more he looked, the more similar they seemed!","Although it's normal for people to look alike, what about that inexplicable sense of familiarity?","Could it be that Xiaoxiao is really his biological daughter?!","His eyes instantly lit up with excitement and anticipation.","But when he saw the scar on Yun Xiaoxiao's cheek from a bullet wound, his heart clenched in pain.","If Xiaoxiao really was his daughter...","He had hurt her.","Would she ever forgive him?","'You...minus points!'","He suddenly remembered what Yun Xiaoxiao had said to him before, and his mood instantly plummeted.","If she had already given him minus points back then, and now he had hurt her.","Maybe she really wouldn't forgive him.","\"You all think I'm vicious, don't you?\"","Listening to the surrounding murmurs, Bai Ruo laughed and cried at the same time.","Her appearance was like that of a madwoman.","She angrily pointed at Bai Hongting.","\"My biological father died saving him, and my biological mother committed suicide because of my father's death!","It's all because of him that I became an orphan.","Don't they owe me compensation for that?","Shouldn't they give me all their love?","But they still wanted to have their own child.","That would mean half of their love would be taken away from me. Why, why should that happen?!","If my biological parents were alive, they would definitely give me all their love!\"","\"That's just twisted logic. Even if your biological parents were alive, they might still have another child, maybe even more than one.\" Someone immediately rebutted.","Others chimed in.","\"Exactly. And your mother's suicide was because of her own weak mentality, it has nothing to do with Bai Base Commander.","And even though your biological father died saving him, Bai Base Commander didn't abandon you, did he?","Didn't he still take you in and raise you well?","Just because he raised you, doesn't mean he can't have his own children.","In the end, it's just you being selfish!\"","\"Ahhh, you're all lying! Shut up! Shut up!\"","Bai Ruo couldn't stand hearing the truth.","She screamed hysterically, her expression ferocious.","Seeing this, Bai Hongting sighed again.","\"I'm sorry for what happened to your father...\"","\"Hey, have you all said enough? If you have, then it's time...to go.\"","Before Bai Hongting could finish his sentence, Yun Xiaoxiao interrupted him.","But as soon as her voice fell, another voice rang out.","\"Hey, Hongting, could this girl be Hai Chao's daughter?\"","At this moment, Li Feng, who had been silently pondering for a while, spoke up.","\"You must be mistaken, she isn't Hai Chao's biological daughter. She was conceived from Hai Chao's wife cheating with another man behind his back.\"","Everyone: !!!","What another shocking revelation?!"]},{"number":354,"title":"Chapter 354: Truth","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao paused her movements.","Silently, she retracted her knife and waited quietly for Li Feng to continue. At the same time, she glanced at Bai Hongting, who was completely stunned, and Bai Ruo, who was equally incredulous.","\"What are you talking about?! My mother loved my father dearly. She was so heartbroken after learning of his death that she died of grief, wasn't she?\" Bai Ruo retorted, struggling to maintain her composure.","Bai Hongting, although remaining silent, conveyed similar disbelief through his eyes. According to what he knew, Bai Ruo's version was indeed the truth.","Li Feng ignored Bai Ruo and turned his gaze to Bai Hongting.","\"Back then, we went to Hai Chao's home together to offer our condolences to his family.","At first, the information I had was the same as yours.","We all believed that Hai Chao's wife had committed suicide out of grief, leaving behind a young orphan.","You, out of gratitude, took the orphan in to raise.","My mother-in-law's hometown is in the neighboring village of Hai Chao's family.","A month before the apocalypse, my wife and I went back to her hometown to relocate the ancestors' graves.","Remembering Hai Chao, I decided to visit his home again, thinking of paying my respects.","It was during this visit that I learned the truth.\"","Li Feng took a moment to gather his thoughts before continuing.","\"When I arrived at his home, it was covered in thick dust, like a haunted house.","There was an indescribable feeling of sadness, as if the house had been abandoned. It was truly desolate.","So, I rolled up my sleeves and began cleaning.","I thought, no matter what, I had to restore some semblance of a home to Hai Chao's house, even if just for a short while.","While cleaning, I stumbled upon a wooden cabinet under the bed.","Opening it, I found two letters inside.","I shouldn't have pried, but somehow, I opened one of them.","It was a letter from Hai Chao to his wife.","In the letter, he detailed how he had discovered his wife's affair with another man.","Initially, he was just suspicious.","To avoid wronging his wife, he once claimed that the army had urgent business and left early.","In reality, he didn't leave; instead, he returned secretly.","That time, he witnessed his wife in the arms of another man.","Heartbroken, he wrote that letter, stating that since their love was gone, they should get a divorce.","He said that the next time he returned from the army, they would go and finalize the divorce.","After reading the contents of the letter, I was shocked and immediately opened the other one.\"","As Li Feng spoke, his eyes filled with anger.","\"That letter was also from Hai Chao.","It was written a month later.","From the letter, it seemed that after Hai Chao sent the first letter, his wife had replied.","In her letter, she confessed that the other man had abandoned her, and she had nowhere to go.","She begged Hai Chao to forgive her for the sake of their child and promised to live a good life with him.","Hai Chao's response was firm: they must divorce!","He couldn't tolerate betrayal. The fact that he hadn't exposed her affair to everyone was already his greatest respect for her.","Moreover, he had no desire to raise someone else's child.","He had calculated the timeline and found that the birth of his child, even accounting for premature delivery, didn't add up.","In other words, his wife's pregnancy didn't align with the time he had been home, indicating that she was already pregnant two months before his return!","To avoid any misunderstandings, he even conducted a paternity test.","The results confirmed that the child wasn't his!","From Hai Chao's words, one could deeply feel his anger and despair.\"","After finishing, Li Feng glanced at Bai Hongting.","\"Hongting, do you remember how Hai Chao's mood was off during the time before our last mission?\"","Bai Hongting's expression changed abruptly as the memories came back to him.","At the time, their usually cheerful comrade had become unusually silent.","He would often sit alone, staring into space, as if burdened by some great trouble.","Bai Hongting had asked him about it, but Hai Chao had brushed it off with a few vague words.","Knowing that Hai Chao didn't want to talk, Bai Hongting hadn't pressed further.","\"That period coincided with the time when Hai Chao wrote the last letter, so I suspect that he sacrificed himself to save you.","On one hand, he truly wanted to save you.","On the other hand, he didn't want to live anymore. Knowing that saving you would cost him his life, he made that choice without hesitation.","It's not so much that he died as he sought release...\"","Hearing Li Feng's analysis, Bai Hongting's face turned ghastly pale, and his breathing became irregular.","In other words, the daughter he had raised for so many years wasn't actually his comrade's biological child.","But rather, the product of his wife's infidelity with another man.","Was this the trigger that indirectly led to his comrade's death?","Realizing this, Bai Hongting's eyes reddened.","If this was true, how could he ever face his comrade?","That child was a stain on his comrade's legacy, and he had raised it out of gratitude.","If his comrade knew this from the afterlife, how frustrated he must feel!","And because of this, he had almost killed his own biological daughter!","Although he hadn't undergone a paternity test, ever since learning that his biological daughter was still alive, he had instinctively felt that Yun Xiaoxiao was his daughter.","Previously, he had thought his biological daughter was dead and had never considered that possibility.","But now, with the truth laid bare, it all made sense.","\"Hahahaha...\"","Bai Ruo suddenly broke into a hysterical laugh.","\"I'm a bastard child, hahahaha, I'm actually a bastard child, wuuu...\"","She laughed until she cried.","After fighting for so long, she realized she didn't even have the right to fight.","How utterly laughable.","The heavens were so unfair. Why did her background have to be like this?","Seeing Bai Hongting immersed in his own world, filled with remorse, she laughed until tears streamed down her face.","In the end, she didn't even have a father.","Even this father was gone.","What was the point of her existence?","Glancing at Yun Xiaoxiao, who stood nearby, calmly watching her, she smiled bitterly.","Rather than being killed by someone else, it would be better to...","She focused all her energy in her dantian.","\"Boom!\"","With a loud explosion, Bai Ruo's body self-destructed.","Like ancient cultivators, an ability user's dantian was different from an ordinary person's.","If all the energy in the body was concentrated in that area, the dantian couldn't withstand the pressure and would explode.","Externally, the body wouldn't show any changes, but internally, the organs would be obliterated by the shockwave of the explosion.","This signified that the person was as good as dead.","Upon hearing the sound, everyone turned to look at Bai Ruo's direction.","Yun Xiaoxiao showed no emotion.","She had already deduced from Bai Ruo's thoughts that she intended to end her own life.","But she didn't stop her.","She had no reason to intervene.","It was better this way, sparing her the trouble of dirtying her own hands."]},{"number":355,"title":"Chapter 355: Settled","paragraphs":["Bai Hongting's expression wavered slightly.","After all, Bai Ruo had been his child for over ten years.","Seeing her choose to self-destruct, he couldn't help but feel a pang of emotion.","But he didn't step forward.","Perhaps...","This was the best outcome.","This scene took everyone by surprise.","The crowd lamented.","\"Alas, no one expected the truth to turn out like this.\"","\"The poor Bai base chief, I imagine he's feeling quite distressed right now.\"","\"Even the cruel can have their moments of pity—she chose to self-destruct, perhaps she truly no longer wished to live.\"","\"It's all her doing, I have no sympathy for her.\"","\"I'm curious, though, whether the kind-hearted girl who distributed grain to us and helped us fight the zombies was truly the biological daughter of the northern base chief.\"","\"That's unclear.\"","Surrounding people whispered their thoughts.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned to Mo Chun beside her.","“Mo Chun sister, is there a place to rest?”","She yawned, stretching her arms.","\"I'm so sleepy.\"","\"Yes, I'll have Mo Xing show you there.\"","Mo Chun waved to Mo Xing, \"Xing, take Xiaoxiao and the others to rest.\"","\"Sure, sis.\"","Mo Xing nodded eagerly.","\"Xiaoxiao, you all go ahead and rest. I'll come get you once the crystals are all collected.\"","\"Okay.\"","Afterward, Yun Xiaoxiao signaled to Lu Chen and the others.","\"Brothers, let's go rest for now.\"","With the guilty parties punished, there was no need to strain relations with the northern base any further.","Bai Hongting had been right about one thing.","After the apocalypse, not just China was in turmoil—so were other countries.","No one knew if others would invade China.","Thus, it was essential to retain capable individuals.","Bai Hongting wasn't all bad, besides being blind and misguided.","As the leader of a major base, he'd done well.","He cared for the people, had good leadership abilities, and his subordinates were loyal.","\"Let's go.\"","Ling Jing affectionately ruffled her hair.","Lu Chen and the others withdrew.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao leave, Bai Hongting called out urgently,","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","He wanted to explain, to apologize.","But words failed him, and in the end, he could only utter three words,","\"I'm sorry.\"","He apologized again for hurting her.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, acted as if she hadn't heard, continuing to walk ahead.","But others had heard; how could she not have?","A hint of disappointment flashed across Bai Hongting's face.","He knew Yun Xiaoxiao was deliberately ignoring him.","She had no desire to speak with him.","Ling Jing walked a few steps before pausing.","He casually approached Bai Hongting, handing over a strand of hair.","Bai Hongting was stunned, looking at the hair in his hand.","\"This is...?\"","Ling Jing nodded towards Yun Xiaoxiao's retreating figure.","He grinned, \"No need to thank me.\"","This was something he'd taken during their earlier interaction.","Bai Hongting's eyes widened in realization.","Xiaoxiao's hair?!","If they conducted a DNA test with this, they could determine if she was his biological daughter!","Once more, he looked up to see Ling Jing had left.","Ling Jing, with his back turned, had a smirk on his face.","Heh, daring to hurt the little one...","Let him regret it for the rest of his life.","He knew Yun Shaokai and Jiang Ruian weren't Yun Xiaoxiao's biological parents.","Her true parents remained a mystery.","Given Bai Hongting and Bai Ruo's reactions, he suspected Yun Xiaoxiao might indeed be Bai Hongting's daughter.","The thought intrigued him, wondering how Bai Hongting might feel upon discovering Yun Xiaoxiao was his daughter.","Would he be so regretful his insides turned green...","Hmm, he looked forward to it.","Ling Jing smirked and quickly caught up to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Li Feng sighed, approaching Bai Hongting, who looked utterly dejected.","\"Sorry about this, Hongting. I only found out about this recently.","I had planned to tell you in person,","But with the zombie virus outbreak and being unable to leave, and communication being severed,","I couldn't inform you in time.\"","Bai Hongting shook his head, \"It's fine, not your fault.\"","He should have investigated more thoroughly.","When he visited his comrade's hometown, seeing the comrade's wife dead from pesticide, he assumed she had killed herself out of grief.","Who knew the truth was something else entirely.","Looking at Li Feng, he asked, \"Can your base do a DNA test?\"","\"No,\" Li Feng apologized, shaking his head.","Despite their large base, the medical facilities were lacking.","Outdated equipment and few doctors.","And even those present were inexperienced young practitioners.","This was an area they needed to focus on improving.","Bai Hongting frowned, immediately summoning his subordinates,","\"Take Bai Ruo's body out and bury her properly.\"","Despite the truth, Bai Ruo had been his daughter for so many years.","He'd genuinely treated her as such.","He couldn't have no feelings, couldn't leave her body exposed.","Giving her a proper burial was necessary.","After the order, he turned back to Li Feng,","\"Thank you for telling me all this.\"","\"No problem, I should have told you sooner. Otherwise, things wouldn't have escalated like this.\" Li Feng expressed his regrets.","Bai Hongting then led his men to bury Bai Ruo. Later, he boarded a helicopter without delay.","Before leaving, he glanced once more at the central base,","As though seeing the small figure through it.","He tightly clutched the plastic-wrapped strand of hair.","After a long while, he said,","\"Let's go, back.\"","Helicopters lifted one by one into the sky, speeding off into the distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, was unaware of this and cared little about it.","Whether Bai Hongting was her biological father meant nothing to her.","She had always proclaimed she was born of nature, without parents.","Having her brothers and her Yunzhong City was enough for this lifetime.","Anything else? Irrelevant.","She slept until around 4 PM.","Awakening, perhaps due to the light, she felt an ethereal sense of disorientation.","Sigh, too much sleep does hinder clarity.","A knock sounded at the door.","Yun Xiaoxiao got out of bed, opened the door.","Xiaoxiao, all the crystal cores have been collected and cleaned. Do you have time now to count them?","\"Yes, let's go.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao adjusted her hat and followed Mo Chun out."]},{"number":356,"title":"Chapter 356: Xiao Xiao's Hair","paragraphs":["Bai Hongting's expression slightly wavered.","After all, Bai Ruo was the child he had raised for over a decade.","Seeing her choose to self-destruct, his heart couldn't help but feel a bit unsettled.","However, he did not step forward.","Perhaps...","This was the best outcome.","This scene was something no one had anticipated.","Everyone was in hushed amazement.","\"Ah, who could have guessed that the truth would turn out to be like this.\"","\"Poor Bai Base Commander, I reckon he must be feeling really bad right now.\"","\"Even the most detestable people have their sympathetic side. She chose self-destruction, probably because she truly didn't want to live anymore.\"","\"It's all her own doing; I don't feel the least bit sorry for her.\"","\"I wonder, though, if the kind-hearted girl who distributed food to us and helped us fight off the zombies was actually the biological daughter of the Northern Base Commander.\"","\"That, I'm not so sure about.\"","The surrounding people whispered their speculations.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked toward Mo Chun beside her.","“Sister Mo Chun, is there a place to rest?”","She yawned, stretching her arms above her head.","\"I'm so sleepy.\"","\"Yes, there is. I'll have Mo Xing take you there right now.\"","Mo Chun waved to Mo Xing, \"Xing, take Xiaoxiao and the others to rest first.\"","\"Alright, sister.\"","Mo Xing nodded happily.","Little Xiaoxiao, you all go ahead and rest. I'll come get you once we've collected all the crystal cores.","\"Okay.\"","With that, Yun Xiaoxiao signaled to Lu Chen and the others.","\"Brothers, let's go rest for now.\"","She had fulfilled her desire for vengeance, so there was no need to strain the relationship with the Northern Base.","One thing Bai Hongting was right about was that after the apocalypse, not only was Hua Country in chaos, but so were other countries.","No one knew if people from other countries might invade Hua Country.","Therefore, it was crucial to keep capable people in the country.","Bai Hongting, aside from being blind and biased, wasn't all that bad.","After all, as the leader of a major base, he did a pretty good job.","He cared for the people, his various abilities were commendable, and those under him were very loyal.","\"Alright, let's go.\"","Ling Jing affectionately rubbed her head.","Lu Chen and the others also stopped what they were doing.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao leaving, Bai Hongting anxiously called out.","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","He wanted to hold on to her and explain.","But when the words reached his lips, he didn't know what to say.","In the end, he only managed three words.","\"I'm sorry.\"","He apologized once again for hurting her.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, acted as if she hadn't heard, continuing to walk forward without stopping.","But everyone else had heard him, so how could she not have?","Bai Hongting revealed a disappointed expression.","He knew Yun Xiaoxiao was deliberately pretending not to hear him.","She simply didn't want to interact with him.","Ling Jing walked a few steps, then paused.","With his hands in his pockets, he casually walked over to Bai Hongting.","He handed him a strand of hair.","Bai Hongting was stunned, looking at the hair in his hand.","\"This is...?\"","Ling Jing lightly nodded toward Yun Xiaoxiao's back.","He squinted with a smile, \"No need to thank me.\"","This was something he had taken while stroking Yun Xiaoxiao's head earlier.","Bai Hongting's eyes widened in shock.","Xiaoxiao's hair?!","If he used this for a paternity test, he could clearly determine if she was his biological daughter!","He looked up again, only to see Ling Jing had already left.","Ling Jing, with his back turned, had a mischievous smile flickering in his eyes.","Heh, dared to hurt that little one.","Let him regret it.","He knew that Yun Shao Kai and Jiang Rui'an weren't Yun Xiaoxiao's biological parents.","Which meant Xiaoxiao's biological parents were someone else.","And from Bai Hongting and Bai Ruo's reactions, he felt the likelihood of Yun Xiaoxiao being Bai Hongting's daughter was very high.","He was genuinely curious.","Would Bai Hongting regret it so much that his stomach would turn green upon discovering Yun Xiaoxiao was his daughter...?","Hmmm, he was quite looking forward to it.","Ling Jing leisurely raised an eyebrow and quickly caught up with Yun Xiaoxiao.","Li Feng sighed and walked over to the disoriented Bai Hongting.","\"Sorry about that, Hongting. Actually, I only recently found out about this.","I was originally planning to tell you in person.","After all, this matter isn't something that can be explained in a few words.","But who knew, the zombie virus outbreak happened, and I couldn't get away.","Then communications were cut off, so I wasn't able to inform you in time.\"","Bai Hongting shook his head, \"It's fine. It's not your fault.\"","It was his own fault for not investigating further.","When he went to his comrade's hometown, seeing his comrade's wife die from pesticide at home, he had assumed she couldn't bear the loss and chose to commit suicide out of grief.","Who knew the truth would turn out like this.","He looked at Li Feng, \"Can your base perform a paternity test?\"","\"No.\" Li Feng regretfully shook his head.","Although their base was quite large, unfortunately, the medical aspect lagged behind.","The medical equipment in the base was outdated.","And there were very few doctors.","Most were young, average-skilled ones.","This was an area they would need to focus on improving in the future.","Bai Hongting frowned, immediately summoning his subordinates.","\"Take Bai Ruo's body outside and bury it somewhere.\"","Despite the truth, Bai Ruo was someone he had raised for so many years.","He had truly treated her like a daughter.","He couldn't have no feelings for her.","It was impossible for him to let her corpse just lie there.","Burying her properly was also a form of closure for himself.","After instructing his subordinates, he turned back to Li Feng.","\"Thank you for telling me all this.\"","\"No problem. I should have spoken up earlier. Otherwise, things wouldn't have escalated to this point.\" Li Feng also felt somewhat apologetic.","Afterwards, Bai Hongting and his people buried Bai Ruo, then boarded the helicopter.","Before leaving, he glanced once more at the Central Base.","As if through the base, he could see that little figure.","He tightly gripped the strand of hair, wrapped in a plastic bag.","After a while, he spoke.","\"Let's go, return.\"","One helicopter after another ascended into the sky, quickly flying toward the distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, didn't know and didn't care.","Whether Bai Hongting was her biological father or not, she didn't care in the least.","She had once said she was naturally born and raised, without parents.","For this life, having her brothers and Yun City was enough.","Everything else, who cares about it.","She woke up at around 4 PM that afternoon.","After waking up, perhaps due to the color of the sky,","She felt a sense of disorientation, as if unsure of what year it was.","Indeed, one shouldn't sleep for too long.","It makes one prone to getting silly.","\"Knock knock knock~\"","The door was knocked on.","Yun Xiaoxiao got out of bed and walked to the door, opening it.","Xiaoxiao, all the crystal cores have been collected and cleaned. Do you have time now to go and count them?","\"Yes, let's go.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao adjusted her hat and followed Mo Chun out."]},{"number":357,"title":"Chapter 357: Xiao Xiao Doesn't Recognize Me, Let's Get a Divorce","paragraphs":["Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao exchanged a glance.","They didn't recognize this woman, nor did they understand why she was so eager to see their little base leader. However, they could tell that she seemed to care a lot about their little base leader. Seeing the slightly red eyes of the woman, both of them found it hard to refuse.","Liu Tao pointed to the guest house on the left side of the gate.","\"Foreigners can only stay in the guest house. The daily fee is two level one crystals. If you need food or other supplies, you'll need to pay the corresponding amount of crystals.\"","\"Alright, I'll pay now.\"","Sheng Shuya finally showed a faint expression of relief.","She turned her head to look at the female warrior beside her, \"Xi Xiao, where are the crystals?\"","Xi Xiao immediately took out a bag of crystals and handed it to Tao Mi'er.","\"Please count them.\"","After confirming the number of crystals, Tao Mi'er led the two to the guest house. After settling them in and giving them some instructions, she left.","Alone in the room, Sheng Shuya came to the window.","Looking at the towering city wall in the distance, she silently shed tears.","Sometimes she smiled, sometimes her face showed pain.","This was where Xiaoxiao lived.","It was truly remarkable for such a young age to become the leader of a base.","But how much hardship must one endure to achieve such a feat?","Originally at an age where one should enjoy parental love, she had matured enough to take charge of a base.","The hardships involved were simply heart-wrenching to think about.","Before, she didn't know, but from now on, she would definitely make up for this daughter.","She owed her too much.","As she thought about it, Sheng Shuya once again sank into her own world.","Due to the intense emotional fluctuation, her old disease, which she hadn't experienced for a long time, resurfaced.","She quickly took out the medicine she carried with her and took two pills, which eased her somewhat.","That was close. Just now, she almost fell back into that terrible abyss.","She couldn't afford to have an accident now; she had so much to make up for with her daughter.","Sheng Shuya waited in the guest house until noon the next day, but Yun Xiaoxiao still hadn't appeared.","Instead, she was met with Bai Hongting, who had rushed over.","Bai Hongting brought out a paternity test report, only to be coldly chased out of the room by Sheng Shuya.","\"Leave. Don't wander around here.\" Sheng Shuya's tone was full of disdain.","\"Bang!\"","The door slammed shut.","Bai Hongting, blocked outside, rubbed his nose in frustration.","\"Shuya, I also want to stay and properly apologize to Xiaoxiao.\" Bai Hongting sounded somewhat helpless.","From inside the room came Sheng Shuya's displeased voice.","\"Do you think your apology would be of any use?","I'm telling you, Bai Hongting, if my daughter refuses to acknowledge me because of you, I won't let this go!\"","Bai Hongting: ......","After a long silence, he sighed silently.","His wife was right. If he showed up now in front of Xiaoxiao, she would probably get angry just seeing his face.","That might only backfire.","Maybe...","Everything should just be left to time.","He gave a few instructions, telling Sheng Shuya to take care of her health, and conveyed some messages to Xi Xiao.","Then he went to the city gate of Yun City.","Today, the guards were Flower White and Flower Leaf, two brothers.","The two brothers had already dealt with Bai Hongting once before.","They were puzzled as to why he had come back when they had already told him that their little base leader hadn't returned.","Just as the brothers were wondering, they saw Bai Hongting put his hand down.","In the next moment, bags and bags of items suddenly appeared.","There were so many that they almost piled up into a small hill.","When it finally stopped, the two brothers looked at Bai Hongting in confusion.","\"What are these things?\"","Bai Hongting didn't explain what they were, only said calmly, \"Please help me pass these things on to your little base leader.\"","After saying this, he turned around and left with his people.","\"Hey, what's your name?\"","Flower Leaf called out.","Bai Hongting's footsteps paused, and then he slowly spoke.","\"It doesn't matter what my name is. What matters is that all of these are for your little base leader.\"","His voice sounded a bit low.","Seeing Bai Hongting's departing figure, Flower White and Flower Leaf exchanged a glance.","Flower Leaf pouted, \"What a strange man.\"","\"So, what do we do with these things?\" Flower White looked at the pile with some worry.","\"Let's have someone move them back for now. We'll wait until the little base leader returns.\"","\"Yeah, that's all we can do for now.\"","---","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had not yet returned to the base, was standing at the entrance of a dense forest with Lu Chen and others.","\"Little ghost, why did you bring us here?\"","Nie Yizhou looked at the dense forest in front of him in confusion.","This dense forest was located in the west's most remote mountain range.","It was about as primitive as it could get.","With the current mutation of animals and plants, coming here might be a bit dangerous, right?","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly.","\"We're here, of course, to find partners.","The world to come won't just be about humans.","So, in addition to continuously growing stronger ourselves, we also need to find some lovely 'comrades.'\"","Just like Little Cute, Little Flower, and Little Eagle.","Although she had them, Lu Chen and the others didn't.","Now, during the initial phase of animal and plant mutations, those mutated creatures are still at their most primitive stage of strength.","That is to say, this is the best time to tame them.","But many people are still in a state of confusion and haven't realized this yet.","Those who manage to gain mutated animal or plant companions at this time mostly do so by chance.","So, she wanted to take advantage of this period to take her brothers here for some reconnaissance.","On one hand, she hoped they could find their own mutated companions.","On the other hand, they could gain some experience.","Later, they could bring others from the base.","Their base didn't have many people, so they would aim for quality.","Aim to ensure that every person who went out could stand on their own.","Together, they were a blazing fire; apart, they would be twinkling stars!","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's explanation, everyone immediately understood her intentions.","This time, their gaze toward the forest also changed.","\"Then what are we waiting for? Let's go and meet the big treasures inside.\"","Nie Yizhou rubbed his hands excitedly, feeling ready to try.","Previously, seeing Yun Xiaoxiao followed by Little Cute and the others, he felt it was very cool.","If he could also have a group of them following him, it would be so exciting!","\"Wait a moment.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao took out a small combat suit and handed it to Qu Xiao Bei.","\"Xiao Bei, put this on.\"","All the brothers had one, only Qu Xiao Bei didn't, so she chose one for her.","Qu Xiao Bei curiously took it, \"What is this?\"","\"This, when worn, can provide a bit of defense.\" Yun Xiaoxiao explained briefly.","Qu Xiao Bei immediately thanked her and happily hid in a bush to put on the suit.","After everything was ready, the group stepped into the dense forest."]},{"number":358,"title":"Chapter 358: Is Apologizing Useful","paragraphs":["In the dense forest, both the ground and the trunks of the trees were blanketed with snow.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the group continued to move forward, delving deeper into the forest.","The snow-covered mountain path was difficult to navigate, but they were no ordinary travelers, so they weren't afraid.","Every time they traveled a certain distance, they would pause to rest.","It was less of a rest and more of a deliberate attempt to make noise, drawing the attention of nearby mutated plants and animals.","To say they were bold would be an understatement.","They were the epitome of audacity!","If those who were too scared to venture out due to the snow, zombies, or mutated creatures were to find out, they would surely give them a thumbs up and exclaim, \"Absolutely incredible!\"","Thirty minutes later, they arrived at the base of a massive tree.","No sooner had they landed when a rustling sound suddenly echoed from the tree above.","The group's expressions changed, and they quickly moved away.","In the next moment, a massive green snake slithered down from the dense foliage, its triangular head emerging, flicking its forked tongue as it coldly gazed at them.","Its round eyes, like the depths of a chilling abyss, made everyone feel uneasy.","Suddenly, the snake's head darted swiftly toward the nearest Yun Xiaoxiao, its mouth wide open, ready to strike.","It was ferocious, with no hesitation at all.","Before Yun Xiaoxiao could react, Lu Chen and the others had already stepped in front of her.","In the next instant, they all attacked simultaneously.","The giant snake was torn into several pieces.","Yun Xiaoxiao's mouth twitched.","\"Weren't we here to help you find your companions?\"","Was it a bit too hasty to just kill it like that?","\"It was going to bite you, so it couldn't be spared,\" Lu Chen stated bluntly.","Mu Yang nodded, smiling, \"Lu Chen is right. We'll find a more suitable one. Maybe the next one will be even better.\"","Looking at the bloodied, dismembered snake, Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged.","Alright, it seemed they would have to eat snake meat now...","The meat of mutated animals was incredibly nourishing.","Especially for those with special abilities, it not only strengthened the body but also helped in consolidating their powers.","And...","Yun Xiaoxiao walked over to the snake's head, bent down, and took out a knife, swiftly stabbing it into the snake's heart. After stirring it a few times, she pried out a blood-covered, shiny object.","\"This is...\" Nie Yizhou looked surprised. \"It looks a bit like a crystal core.\"","\"It's similar to a crystal core, but it doesn't need to be specially processed into an evolution liquid. It can be washed and consumed directly, which can enhance an ability user's powers.","However, the effect would be less pronounced compared to other mutated animals consuming it.\"","After speaking, Yun Xiaoxiao picked up a section of snake meat from the ground and began skillfully slicing open its belly, removing the internal organs, then cleansing the meat with spiritual spring water.","Seeing her actions, Qu Xiaobei immediately moved closer, her eyes glowing with anticipation.","She even swallowed a gulp of saliva, looking very eager.","Xiao Keai and Xiao Yingying also obediently lay on one side, drooling slightly.","Seeing this, Nie Yizhou was quite curious.","\"Hey, what are you doing now?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, busy with her task, smiled faintly. \"Grilling snake meat.\"","Since it was about time for a meal, the snake meat couldn't be wasted.","\"Is... it edible?\" Nie Yizhou expressed some skepticism.","Before Yun Xiaoxiao could answer, Qu Xiaobei quickly interjected, \"It's delicious! Xiaoxiao's grilled meat is amazing!\"","She felt that as long as it wasn't a zombie or a human, Xiaoxiao could probably grill it and make it taste delicious.","Just thinking about it made her mouth water.","\"Really?\"","Xiao Feng raised an eyebrow in surprise.","He remembered that Xiaoxiao was a genuine disaster in the kitchen.","Yun Xiaoxiao rolled her eyes and glanced at him. \"Although I'm not good at cooking dishes, I can still grill some decent meat.\"","\"I believe you.\"","Mu Yang smiled warmly, his eyes filled with affection.","Then he added, \"Let me help.\"","Afterward, Xiao Feng, who could cook, also joined in.","Grilling such a massive snake was time-consuming and labor-intensive.","But all the effort and waiting were worth it.","Even before it was fully cooked, the intense aroma of the grilled meat filled the air, making their mouths water.","\"Hey, is it done yet?\"","Nie Yizhou was getting impatient.","Smelling the aroma, his hunger had grown despite not feeling particularly hungry before.","\"Almost, just a few more minutes,\" replied Yun Xiaoxiao as she sprinkled some cumin and pepper powder on the snake meat.","This made the aroma even more irresistible.","Even the usually aloof Lu Chen couldn't help but open his eyes.","\"Chen, are you hungry too?\"","Nie Yizhou noticed this and couldn't help but tease Lu Chen.","With his eyes closed, Lu Chen replied coolly, \"No.\"","\"Hehe, Chen, you...\"","Nie Yizhou was about to say a few more words to tease him, but before he could finish, he suddenly spotted a shadow in the distance.","His eyes widened.","\"Is that... a wolf?!\"","At that moment, near a tree to the east, a lone wolf stood tall, staring at them from afar.","Its fur was a deep gray, its body robust and muscular, with eyes that were deep and piercing.","It exuded an aura of pride and danger.","Yun Xiaoxiao also looked over and pursed her lips.","\"I think this wolf is pretty good. Guys, who wants to try taming it?\"","Wolves were usually social animals, but since there was only one here, there were two possibilities.","Either this wolf had strayed away from its pack by accident.","Or, all the other wolves were dead or had turned into zombie wolves, leaving only this lone wolf.","But regardless of which scenario, this wolf had managed to survive the apocalypse and grow so strong, making it a tough character in the wolf world.","Moreover, although it hadn't grown larger in size, it was a high-level second-tier mutated wolf.","This was just the beginning stage of mutated animals, and its potential for development was immeasurable.","\"Not me. That thing looks like a dog. I'm not interested,\" Nie Yizhou quickly waved his hands.","He wasn't considering anything that resembled a dog.","The others also showed no particular interest.","Surprisingly, the usually quiet Lu Chen stepped forward.","\"I'll go.\"","After speaking, his figure flashed, and he quickly left.","The lone wolf had come attracted by the smell of the meat. Upon seeing people, it had stopped, wary.","Now, seeing Lu Chen rapidly approaching, it immediately turned and sprinted into the forest.","\"I'll go take a look to make sure nothing goes wrong,\" said Ling Jing as he followed after them.","With him and Lu Chen around, there shouldn't be any issues.","The others stayed behind, grilling the meat and waiting."]},{"number":359,"title":"Chapter 359: Arrogant by Nature","paragraphs":["Over the course of about twenty minutes.","\"Lu Chen and the others have been gone for so long, why haven't they come back yet? Should we go check on them?\" Nie Yizhou voiced his concern.","As he said this, Xiao Feng chimed in, \"They're back.\"","Following his gaze, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also looked in that direction.","In the fast-moving figures of Lu Chen and Ling Jing, the solitary gray wolf that had been so proud just moments ago was now racing after them.","When they reached the group, the gray wolf paced over to Lu Chen and stood silently beside him, like a most loyal guard.","Seeing this, Nie Yizhou's curiosity was piqued.","\"Chen Ge, how exactly did you tame it?\"","At this, Lu Chen clenched a fist and lightly coughed into his hand.","\"It’s nothing special. Is the meat ready?\"","He skillfully changed the subject.","His demeanor was a bit suspicious.","While Lu Chen went to fetch the roasted meat, Nie Yizhou quietly moved over to Ling Jing.","He nudged Ling Jing's arm and whispered, holding a hand over his mouth.","\"Bro, what really happened? I’m dying of curiosity here. You definitely know, so tell me, please.\"","\"Not telling.\"","Ling Jing shook his head.","Nie Yizhou looked surprised. \"Why not?\"","\"Do you have roasted meat?\"","Ling Jing glanced at him and then pushed him away, striding over to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Nie Yizhou: ......","He secretly glared at Lu Chen, then glanced at Ling Jing.","And finally, he came to a conclusion.","Hmm, something definitely happened that they don’t want to talk about.","Otherwise, why did he feel there was some unspeakable intrigue between the two of them...","Truthfully, Ling Jing didn’t say anything simply because he didn’t want to share the \"interesting\" details of what Lu Chen was up to with Nie Yizhou.","The process of Lu Chen taming the lone wolf was indeed... a bit of an ordeal.","When the two pursued the wolf, despite its speed, it was no match for theirs.","Soon enough, they caught up to the wolf.","Since it was Lu Chen who had taken a liking to the wolf, Ling Jing stayed back.","With Lu Chen's abilities, he could have easily knocked the wolf down in a matter of minutes.","But he said that wolves were proud creatures.","They lived in packs, respecting the wolf king.","Each wolf fought for the position of king through battles, becoming stronger through these relentless physical confrontations and expressing reverence and absolute obedience to the wolf that defeated them.","Therefore, Lu Chen didn’t want to just use his formidable energy to force the wolf to submit.","Instead, he wanted to do it through combat, so the wolf would develop a sense of respect for him.","Although the goal was the same, the underlying meaning was different.","He was looking for a companion, not just an animal that would cower in fear and try to escape at any moment.","So, relying solely on his martial prowess, Lu Chen began to engage in a fierce battle with the wolf on the snowy ground.","He transformed into a ferocious beast, relentlessly attacking the wolf.","Realizing it couldn’t outrun Lu Chen, the wolf adopted a fighting stance, countering and defending.","Man and wolf struggled on the snowy forest ground.","The result, of course, was Lu Chen’s victory.","However, the final scene was a bit...","At the end, Lu Chen had managed to subdue the wolf by pinning it down with his legs wrapped around it.","When Lu Chen said he wouldn’t harm it and wanted the wolf to follow him in the future, the wolf seemed to understand and submitted.","But just as Lu Chen was about to get up and let the wolf free, the wolf got up a bit too quickly, accidentally shifting upward a little.","It was clear to Ling Jing that Lu Chen’s expression immediately changed.","It was a pain that only a man would understand.","Recalling the scene, Ling Jing couldn’t help but curl his lips in amusement.","This young man, always so serious, had an unexpectedly adorable side that was quite amusing.","\"Mmm, it smells so good. Kid, how do you make meat so delicious? Whew, whew, it’s so hot!\"","Nie Yizhou was eating from his own plate when he saw Xiao Feng’s newly fetched portion looked tempting, so he quickly leaned over to take a bite.","To his surprise, the meat was too hot and started to dance around in his mouth.","Xiao Feng gave him a sidelong glance. \"You already had some on your plate, yet you still steal mine. I guess you were a hungry ghost in your past life. Serves you right!\"","Nie Yizhou was about to retort to Xiao Feng when he suddenly heard four unusual sounds.","He quickly turned his head and saw that in front of Yun Xiaoxiao, Qu Xiaobei, the adorable creature, and Eagle Eagle, the bones were already piled high.","All four of them were devouring the meat at an extremely fast pace.","Their mouths practically worked like meat grinders.","\"Wow, papapa, papapa!\"","\"Dudem, when did y'all eat so much?!\" Nie Yizhou was shocked.","The two humans and two beasts simultaneously glanced up at him but didn’t say a word. Afterward, they went back to eating.","Nie Yizhou: ......","What Nie Yizhou didn’t know was that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others had already perfected this skill.","And they had come to a conclusion.","When eating, just shut up and eat.","Otherwise, you’ll soon find that you have nothing left on your plate.","Coming back to his senses, Nie Yizhou stopped talking and focused on devouring the meat.","Heck, spilling a single word would mean less food, did he dare to say more?","Right now, working on the meat was the priority!","Seeing the once-proud gray wolf eyeing the roasted meat greedily, Lu Chen took a large chunk from his portion of snake meat and placed it on the ground.","He said softly, \"Go ahead and eat.\"","The gray wolf, which seemed to trust Lu Chen completely, immediately started to ravenously eat.","After everyone was full and rested a bit, seeing no signs of any mutated plants or animals nearby, they decided to continue moving forward.","\"Chen Ge, have you named your wolf yet?\" Nie Yizhou hid behind Xiao Feng and pointed at the gray wolf beside Lu Chen.","Lu Chen raised an eyebrow. \"Lu Ying.\"","\"It has your last name?\" Nie Yizhou was surprised.","\"Is that a problem?\"","\"Heh, no problem, of course not. The name’s good, at least compared to...\"","Nie Yizhou glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao.","But the next second, he was met with a sweet but mischievous smile from her.","He froze immediately.","\"Uh... what I meant was, it’s much better than... mine, heh... heh...\"","He rubbed the back of his head awkwardly and laughed.","As they moved forward, chatting along the way without much concern for volume, suddenly, the snow on the ground exploded.","Snowflakes flew everywhere, landing on the group.","Right after, a large green leaf emerged from where the explosion had occurred.","The leaf was enormous, at least 1.8 meters long.","On one stalk, there were at least twenty narrow, sharp leaves, with jagged edges.","They resembled large green fans, wildly sweeping toward the group.","Qu Xiaobei and Nie Yizhou, who were closest, were quickly engulfed by two of the leaves."]},{"number":360,"title":"Chapter 360: Does It Take Your Surname","paragraphs":["The leaves continued to tighten inward, as if trying to crush the two of them to death.","However, within a second, one of the leaves loosened its grip and released Qu Xiaobei.","Qu Xiaobei immediately let out a yelp and fell to the ground.","Nie Yizhou wasn’t so lucky.","The leaves continued to tighten around him.","Muffled curses from Nie Yizhou could be heard from within the leafy confines.","Seeing this, the others rushed forward to help.","But the remaining leaves surged toward them, blocking their path.","The group unleashed their full power, shattering the obstructing leaves.","“What the hell is this thing? It’s stinging me all over!”","Nie Yizhou’s voice rang out from behind them.","He rubbed his body, muttering incessantly.","In the heat of the moment, he had forgotten to teleport.","By the time he realized it, he felt suffocated and tightly constricted.","Tiny thorns had pierced through his clothes and into his flesh.","Fortunately, his clothes were thick, or else he would have been turned into a pincushion.","In that brief moment, Lu Chen uprooted a green plant that had been embedded in the snow.","Instantly, the once-threatening leaves withered and shrank, retracting toward the main root.","“This plant looks like a fern, but I never expected it to become so terrifying after mutating,” Mu Yang remarked with a furrowed brow.","At that moment, Little Flower hopped out.","It swallowed the mutated fern in one gulp.","After finishing its meal, it bounced around contentedly, seemingly very pleased.","“Kid, your pet flower eats mutated plants too?” Nie Yizhou asked in surprise.","Yun Xiaoxiao patted Little Flower and proudly replied, “Yes, isn’t it amazing?”","“Heh, amazing indeed. I’m impressed,” Nie Yizhou said with a chuckle.","After this little incident, the group continued forward.","Soon, they arrived at a valley.","However, the stream in the valley was completely frozen over.","Steep cliffs rose on either side, with snow-covered trees slanting precariously from the rock faces, creating a unique landscape.","“Look over there!”","Suddenly, Nie Yizhou pointed toward a massive rock to the side, his face filled with astonishment.","The others followed his gaze.","There, a green mantis was locked in battle with a black spider.","The mantis had a sleek body, with forelimbs resembling two large blades, complete with a row of sharp serrations. The tips of its “blades” even had suction cups for climbing.","Despite facing a spider larger than itself, the mantis showed no signs of retreat. Instead, it displayed remarkable aggression.","It climbed to the top of the massive rock and then lunged at the spider, which was attempting to climb up.","The two “blades” clamped onto the spider’s head, slashing fiercely.","The spider wasn’t defenseless either, fighting back desperately to break free.","Just as it seemed about to escape, the mantis seized the opportunity, leaping onto the spider’s back and pinning it down in an even more aggressive stance.","In the end, despite being smaller in size, the mantis managed to kill the larger spider.","Witnessing this, the group couldn’t help but be impressed.","This mantis had formidable combat skills.","Mu Yang, in particular, seemed intrigued.","“This mantis looks pretty impressive,” he said.","“Yeah, it really does,” Yun Xiaoxiao agreed.","Sometimes, these smaller mutated insects could rival larger mutated creatures.","After all, each had its own strengths.","For example, an elephant could be killed in an instant by a swarm of venomous ants.","So, it was unwise to make sweeping judgments.","Her little pet was a perfect example.","Though it started out small, it had grown into something truly fearsome.","“Mu Yang, if you like it, go ahead and claim it,” Yun Xiaoxiao encouraged.","She wasn’t sure what mantises liked to eat, but she guessed it was similar to her pet—probably meat.","So, she generously offered some meat as bait.","Mu Yang took the meat and approached the mantis.","Nie Yizhou covered his mouth and snickered, “I feel like Brother Yang is about to lure it like a kidnapper.”","The others raised their eyebrows.","Though crudely put, it did seem somewhat accurate.","They stood there, watching intently.","Somehow, after about fifteen minutes, Mu Yang returned with a smile on his face.","The once-ferocious mantis now rested obediently on the back of his hand.","“Wow, you actually succeeded in... persuading it!”","Nie Yizhou was amazed and reached out to touch it.","But as soon as his hand got close, the mantis raised its “blades” menacingly, causing Nie Yizhou to quickly pull his hand back.","Afterward, the group continued their search for suitable mutated plants and animals.","But as night fell, they hadn’t found anything else worthy of their attention.","They only encountered a few weaklings, which they dealt with casually.","With darkness setting in, they decided not to venture further.","They were confident but not reckless.","They knew when to push forward and when to hold back.","So, they found a nearby cave to rest for the night.","Nie Yizhou poked Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder. “Kid, what are we eating tonight?”","Seeing his expression, Yun Xiaoxiao knew he was craving something.","“Alright, what do you want to eat?”","“We haven’t had hotpot in a while. How about...”","Yun Xiaoxiao rubbed her chin, and under Nie Yizhou’s expectant gaze, she finally nodded.","“Fine, hotpot it is. But I’ll only provide the ingredients. I’m not cooking.”","Hotpot required too much preparation, and it was a hassle.","“No problem, that’s what our chef Xiao Feng is for!”","Nie Yizhou grinned and patted Xiao Feng’s shoulder.","Xiao Feng rolled his eyes. “If you want to eat, do it yourself. Don’t think you can slack off.”","“But I don’t know how. Can I at least help?”","“That’s more like it.”","And so, the two of them got to work.","Qu Xiaobei approached Yun Xiaoxiao and whispered, pointing at Ling Jing in the distance, “Xiaoxiao, why is that brother eating raw meat?”","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced over. Ling Jing was elegantly holding a fork, spearing a piece of bloody beef and placing it in his mouth. He even wiped his lips with a white napkin.","The shabby cave suddenly felt like a high-end French restaurant.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched.","He really was extra. Eating beef with such flair.","“Don’t mind him. He just has a taste for it. But it’s a secret, so don’t tell anyone, okay?” Yun Xiaoxiao winked.","“Don’t worry, I won’t say a word!”","Qu Xiaobei patted her chest in assurance.","Then, she sat by the fire and placed the urn behind her on the ground.","She took out an incense stick, lit it with the fire, and bowed three times toward the urn.","“Dad, it’s time to eat.”","After paying her respects, she stuck the incense into the ground in front of the urn."]},{"number":361,"title":"Chapter 361: Green Mantis","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao was not surprised by this at all.","Almost every day, Qu Xiaobei would light a stick of incense to offer to her \"Old Dad.\"","According to her, this was a rule.","After a person dies, their soul needs incense and offerings to survive.","That way, the soul can live comfortably in the underworld.","Even though Yun Xiaoxiao didn't quite understand it, she still respected the practice.","She even searched through her personal items and found some incense sticks and paper money.","She had no idea when she had collected these things.","It was strange that she even had such items.","While it didn't surprise her, Nie Yizhou and the others, who were witnessing it for the first time, couldn't help but glance over.","Especially Nie Yizhou, who was always curious about everything, immediately ran over.","He was carrying an unopened can of luncheon meat.","\"Hey, Xiaobei, what are you doing?\" he asked curiously.","Qu Xiaobei sincerely kowtowed three times before standing up.","She looked at Nie Yizhou and showed a sincere expression.","\"I'm offering incense to my Old Dad.\"","\"What? Offering incense?!\"","Nie Yizhou thought he had misheard.","But when Qu Xiaobei nodded, he realized he hadn't misheard at all.","He pointed incredulously at the urn, \"So, this urn contains human ashes? And you've been carrying it around with you?\"","\"Yes, what's the problem?\" Qu Xiaobei seemed puzzled.","Nie Yizhou chuckled awkwardly, \"No problem, it's just... a bit unusual.\"","He had noticed her carrying the urn before.","But he had simply thought it was some kind of food container.","Though it was strange to use a urn to store food.","He hadn't thought much about it.","After all, who would have imagined that during the apocalypse, a little girl would carry a urn of ashes around?","Now he realized that the world truly was full of the unexpected.","However, he also felt a bit sympathetic.","\"So, it's your father's ashes. Please accept my condolences. Don't be too sad. In fact, all of us here don't really have parents.","Don't worry, once you join our big family in the Yunzhong City, we'll all be like one family. You won't be lonely.\"","Nie Yizhou thought that, after all, she was just a poor child, and he ought to comfort her.","But after he finished speaking, Qu Xiaobei gave him a strange look.","Seeing her expression, Nie Yizhou twitched his mouth.","\"What's wrong?\"","Qu Xiaobei raised her head, \"You're wrong. Old Dad might be my Old Dad, but he's not my father.\"","\"Huh?\" Nie Yizhou was confused.","Even Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head to look.","Was Old Dad not her biological father?","Seeing everyone's curiosity, Qu Xiaobei explained, \"Actually, I don't know who my real parents are. Old Dad said he found me near the outhouse and thought I had a connection to Taoism, so he adopted me.\"","\"Oh, I see,\" Nie Yizhou nodded, \"So, do you want to find your parents?\"","Qu Xiaobei shook her head, \"No, I don't even know who they are. How can I find them? Besides, maybe they're already dead.\"","Nie Yizhou twitched his mouth.","What a... \"filial\" response...","That night, everyone gathered in the freezing cave, roasting by the fire, eating hot pot, and sharing stories about what had happened during their time apart. It was quite cozy.","Yun Xiaoxiao also learned that during the acid rain, because she had sent out timely warnings, the losses in the base had been minimal.","A dozen people had been injured by the acid rain because they hadn't managed to hide in time.","But under the care of Ye Shuyuan, Elder Zhong, and Mu Yang, they had gradually recovered.","The livestock and crops in the base, which had been housed in greenhouses built to withstand the extreme cold, had also suffered little damage.","Overall, while the acid rain had been frightening, it hadn't caused much harm to Yunzhong City.","Mu Yang also mentioned that, aside from Yunzhong City, many other places had fared much worse.","Some bases had sent messages asking for help.","These were bases that had participated in the battle against the zombies.","Mu Yang and the others hadn't chosen to ignore them but had organized a team to help.","However, they hadn't done it for free and had collected some compensation.","As they talked about the people and events in the base, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn't help but feel a bit homesick.","Her goal of becoming stronger had never changed.","But she didn't want to live like a ascetic.","Balancing work and rest was an eternal truth.","A short break didn't mean she wasn't getting stronger.","It was just a way to accumulate more energy to become even stronger.","So, she decided that once her brothers and Qu Xiaobei found their desired companions, they would head back home.","After they had eaten and were full, everyone wrapped themselves in quilts and went to sleep.","But in the middle of the night, a streak of fire suddenly flashed past the cave entrance.","The few who were alert immediately woke up.","Of course, that didn't include... Qu Xiaobei.","But everyone was too busy to wake her up and quickly rushed to the cave entrance.","\"What was that just now?!\" Nie Yizhou looked outside the cave.","Before he finished speaking, something suddenly swooped down from above.","It was surrounded by blazing flames, heading straight towards him.","\"Whoa!\"","Nie Yizhou let out a shout and quickly dodged.","Xiao Feng, who was beside him, immediately stepped in front of him and waved his hand, sending a wave of intense fire towards the unknown creature.","\"Yee!\"","In an instant, a strange high-pitched scream rang out.","The sound moved from far to near and then back again, quickly disappearing.","At the same time, the fire wave Xiao Feng had conjured dissipated.","Outside the cave, it was pitch black, and the wind howled.","It was like nothing had happened, like nothing had appeared.","The few remained on guard, staring outside.","But after a long while, the unknown creature still hadn't appeared.","Nie Yizhou couldn't help but wonder, \"That's strange. What exactly was that? All I saw was a flash of fire.\"","\"It was probably some kind of bird,\" Mu Yang speculated.","\"But what kind of bird is surrounded by flames? Wouldn't it turn into roasted bird meat?\"","\"You're always thinking about food. What a 'pig brain'!\" Xiao Feng rolled his eyes at Nie Yizhou.","\"If it's a fire-element bird that's mutated, of course it wouldn't be afraid of fire.\"","\"Hmm, that makes sense,\" Nie Yizhou pouted, \"But it seemed to be coming straight for us. Why?\"","\"This is its nest,\" Lu Chen suddenly spoke up. He bent down and picked up a feather that had fallen at the cave entrance.","It was then that everyone remembered seeing many feathers on the ground when they first entered the cave.","If that was the case, then everything made sense.","They had taken over its home, so naturally, it wanted to drive them out.","They waited for a while, but the strange creature never returned.","Ling Jing suggested that since he couldn't sleep anyway, he would take the first watch while the others got some rest.","By the next morning, after they had finished breakfast and left, the strange creature still hadn't reappeared.","However, as they walked, they began to feel something was off.","It seemed like something was following them at a distance..."]},{"number":362,"title":"Chapter 362: Unknown Creature","paragraphs":["Some exchanged subtle glances without a word.","Carefully, they slowed their footsteps.","The creature following them also slowed down.","It seemed quite intelligent.","Yun Xiaoxiao signaled to the others with her fingers, and they immediately understood her intention.","She silently counted down on her fingers in front of her chest: three, two, one.","As soon as she finished counting, she and Nie Yizhou vanished from their spots and appeared behind the unknown creature.","Lu Chen and the others quickly turned around and moved swiftly.","In just a few seconds, they had encircled the mysterious creature.","Only then did they realize that what had been following them was a large bird... blazing with fire.","Despite the flames surrounding it, the bird showed no signs of being burned.","Its feathers were a deep red, with a long neck and golden eyes that had dark pupils. Its sharp beak resembled a scythe.","It was like a beautiful and proud princess born of fire.","However, at the moment, it seemed a bit timid.","Its round eyes cautiously watched Lu Chen and Ling Jing in front of it.","\"So, it's this guy who's been following us all along?\" Nie Yizhou smirked.","He slapped his thigh.","\"Could it be that it was this bird that attacked me last night?\"","Just as he pieced it together, the firebird suddenly began to move, heading straight toward Xiao Feng.","Xiao Feng's eyebrows furrowed, and he lifted his hand.","Mu Yang quickly stopped him.","\"Don't rush. Wait. It doesn't seem like it wants to attack.\"","Hearing this, Xiao Feng paused his movements.","He then took a closer look at the firebird.","He noticed that the bird's gaze toward him was rather peculiar.","It seemed to carry a hint of joy and a touch of expectation.","Without showing any reaction, he stared directly at it.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also stopped their attack.","Soon, the firebird approached Xiao Feng and chirped twice.","Xiao Feng immediately frowned. \"I can't understand you.\"","\"Chirp! Chirp!\" the firebird repeated.","Xiao Feng: \"...\"","\"Stop chirping! I told you, I can't understand.\"","He was beginning to sound impatient.","Nie Yizhou couldn't help but chuckle.","This guy is really something, arguing with a bird.","The next moment, he received a sharp glare.","Nie Yizhou quickly clamped his mouth shut.","\"Why don't you try summoning some fire?\" Mu Yang suddenly suggested.","This bird doesn't seem interested in anyone else, but it took a liking to Xiao Feng. Maybe it's because Xiao Feng has fire-based powers, and the bird is covered in flames.","Hearing this, Xiao Feng, though puzzled, tried to conjure a small flame.","As soon as the bird saw the fire, it immediately flapped its wings excitedly, diving into the flames.","Its feathers became even more vibrant and transparent in the firelight.","Seeing how much it enjoyed it, Xiao Feng gradually intensified the flame's strength.","The bird became increasingly excited.","About half an hour passed.","Suddenly, the bird let out a sharp cry, spread its wings, and soared into the air.","The fire surrounding it had completely extinguished, leaving it looking like an ordinary bird.","But it seemed to enjoy this new state.","It chirped happily as it glided in circles above the cliff.","\"It seems that it might have been bothered by the fire before, and your attack last night probably gave it a way to change that. That's why it followed us today,\" Mu Yang said with a smile.","Xiao Feng also looked up at the bird flying freely in the sky. \"Maybe... that's it.\"","As they prepared to set off, the bird flew down again, staying a short distance behind Xiao Feng.","Nie Yizhou nudged Xiao Feng. \"Hey, it seems to like you. Maybe you should just give in.\"","He gave a mischievous wink.","This time, however, Xiao Feng didn't retort. Instead, he turned to look at the bird behind him.","He waved his hand, and the bird obediently flew down.","Extending his right arm, the bird grabbed his sleeve with its claws and perched on his arm.","Xiao Feng raised an eyebrow and flashed a triumphant smile.","\"From now on, your name is Firewing!\"","For the rest of the day, they didn't encounter any suitable companions.","Instead, they fought numerous aggressive mutant animals and plants.","The next morning, Qu Xiaobei went into the bushes to relieve herself and came back holding a centipede.","Nie Yizhou was startled. \"What are you holding?\"","\"You mean this?\" Qu Xiaobei pushed the centipede closer. \"I don't know what it is, but I think it's cute, so I brought it back.\"","Cute?","Guess you have a different definition of cute.","Nie Yizhou's mouth twitched.","Why are you just like those kids, interested in such strange things?","Speaking of which, here they come.","Yun Xiaoxiao soon appeared.","She was surprised when she saw the centipede in Qu Xiaobei's hand.","This centipede, though not abnormally large, was undoubtedly a mutated insect.","Moreover, it was a rather high-level mutated insect.","Judging by its ability to change shape freely, it might be similar to Xiaokaixin.","\"This centipede is quite cute. Take good care of it,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said.","Qu Xiaobei immediately beamed.","\"Right, Xiaoxiao? You think it's cute too, unlike him, who has no taste.\"","As she spoke, she nodded toward Nie Yizhou.","Accidentally insulted, Nie Yizhou was amused and annoyed.","He pointed at himself. \"Huh? I have no taste? Xiaobei, do you even know what you're saying?\"","\"Grow up. What's the point of arguing with a child?\" Xiao Feng's chilly voice came from behind.","Nie Yizhou immediately shifted his target and chased after Xiao Feng.","\"Hey, are you trying to pick a fight?\"","\"Not sure what you're talking about.\"","\"Stop right there!\"","\"...\"","As the commotion continued, the group ventured deeper into the dense forest.","\"Crunch~\"","Just as they reached the edge of a sinkhole, Mu Yang's foot suddenly stepped on something, producing a crisp sound.","Everyone turned to look.","Mu Yang slowly lifted his foot, revealing some sticky goo and crushed eggshells.","\"Yang, you just killed how many innocent lives~\" Nie Yizhou leaned in, enjoying the show.","Mu Yang's mouth twitched.","The eggs were hidden in the shrubs, and he hadn't noticed them at all.","Stepping on them was completely accidental.","\"Here's another one.\"","Ling Jing suddenly crouched down and pulled out another egg from the nearby bushes.","This one was much larger than the ones Mu Yang had crushed.","The previous ones were about the size of normal eggs, but this one required both of Ling Jing's hands to hold it."]},{"number":363,"title":"Chapter 363: From Now On, You Shall Be Called Firewing","paragraphs":["\"Crack... crack...\"","To everyone's surprise, as soon as Ling Jing picked it up, the egg suddenly began to hatch.","The large, pale egg cracked open with a small fissure.","The crack grew wider and wider until, with a loud \"crack,\" the shell shattered into pieces.","Everyone watched curiously, wondering what kind of egg it was.","Then, from the broken shell, a small, pale snake slithered out.","It affectionately climbed up Ling Jing's arm.","Finally, it reached the crook of his neck, nuzzled his face, and then coiled itself around his arm, closing its eyes as if... it were falling asleep.","\"It seems to think you're its mother,\" Nie Yizhou said, pursing his lips tightly.","It was clear he was trying hard not to laugh.","Ling Jing, however, ignored Nie Yizhou and instead looked at the little white snake coiled obediently around his arm.","Suddenly, a faint smile tugged at his lips.","\"This little thing isn't bad. I'll take it,\" he said.","\"Are you sure you don't want to pick another one? This one just hatched and doesn't seem like it has much fighting power,\" Nie Yizhou suggested.","Little did he know, he would later regret those words.","Ling Jing shook his head. \"No need. This one's fine.\"","Truthfully, he wasn't particularly interested in finding a companion.","Having one was fine, but not having one was also okay.","Still, this little white snake seemed to suit him.","He decided to keep it.","\"Well, now I'm the only one without one,\" Nie Yizhou said, looking around.","It seemed everyone else had found a companion they were satisfied with.","He quickly cheered himself up.","\"It's fine. Usually, the last one left is the best. I'm sure I'll find the most powerful one!\"","As he spoke, he seemed to imagine the glorious scene and chuckled to himself.","\"Or maybe the last one is the worst,\" a cool voice chimed in quietly.","Nie Yizhou immediately got annoyed. \"Xiao Feng, can't you say something nice for once?\"","\"I'm just stating the facts.\"","\"Hmph, you're just trying to pick a fight!\"","The two bickered again, as usual.","Everyone was used to it.","If these two went half an hour without arguing, something was definitely wrong.","A small argument every few minutes and a big one every half hour was the norm.","The group passed by the quarreling pair and continued forward.","But they hadn't gone far when the sound of rustling surrounded them.","It was as if something was moving quickly through the underbrush.","The trees here were much taller than those in the outer parts of the mountain, and the bushes were denser, limiting their visibility.","\"Snakes!\" Lu Chen said gravely.","\"We must have entered a snake's nest.\"","The group immediately formed a circle, back to back, and cautiously scanned their surroundings.","Lu Chen's gray wolf, Lu Ying; Mu Yang's mantis, Tang Tang; Xiao Feng's giant bird, Fire Wing; and Qu Xiaobei's centipede, Little Worm, all raised their heads, their eyes fixed on the surroundings as if ready to fight at any moment.","Only Ling Jing's little white snake drowsily opened its eyes, looking somewhat confused.","In an instant, four massive pythons burst out from different directions.","They were much faster and clearly more powerful than the one they had encountered earlier in the outer area.","Lu Ying, the gray wolf, was the first to charge. It lunged at the python in front of it, biting down on the back of its neck.","Despite the size difference, the wolf showed no fear, fighting like a true warrior.","It held on tightly, and blood immediately began to flow from the python's wound.","The python struggled violently, its massive tail thrashing and knocking over nearby branches and bushes.","The battle was fierce, and the other fights were no less intense.","Fire Wing, the giant bird, soared into the air, its body engulfed in flames, and let out a piercing cry as it dove down.","It circled around one of the pythons, and soon, parts of the snake's body were scorched, emitting the smell of roasted meat.","Mu Yang's mantis, Tang Tang, though small in size, was no less formidable.","It leapt onto the tail of one of the pythons and quickly crawled forward.","No matter how violently the python thrashed, the mantis steadily advanced.","Finally, it reached the python's vital point and began stabbing repeatedly with its sharp forelimbs.","After a few strikes, the python gradually stopped struggling.","Its head and body were severed, cut cleanly in two.","Qu Xiaobei's centipede, Little Worm, rapidly grew in size.","Originally small, it soon became taller than an adult human.","It crawled toward the nearest python and began biting into its flesh as if it hadn't eaten in days.","It was just like its owner.","Seeing this, the others who had been ready to fight paused.","Yun Xiaoxiao also held back her eager little companions, Little Cutie and Little Eagle.","She was curious to see how the new companions of her brothers and Qu Xiaobei would perform.","The loud hissing finally roused Ling Jing's little white snake.","It lifted its tiny head and looked around.","At that moment, three more giant pythons arrived.","They were behind Ling Jing.","Sensing the disturbance, the group turned around.","Ling Jing was about to act, but then the little white snake raised its head and let out a fierce roar at the three pythons.","Its tiny, tooth-baring face was surprisingly cute.","But in the next moment, the sleepy little creature slid off Ling Jing's arm and transformed, its body rapidly growing in size.","Soon, it was larger than any of the pythons present.","Its body was snow-white, and it had a pair of small horns on its head.","With a powerful swipe of its tail, it sent the three pythons tumbling to the ground.","It roared again, and this time, the sound was far more intimidating than before.","There was an undeniable aura of dominance in its roar.","The three pythons, hearing this, immediately stopped resisting and hastily slithered away.","The group was stunned.","What kind of mutated snake was this little white snake?","Its strength was astonishing.","Nie Yizhou couldn't help but feel envious.","\"I never expected this little snake to be so powerful!\"","Thinking back to how he had dismissed the snake earlier, he felt a pang of embarrassment.","\"You're really lucky,\" he said, giving Ling Jing another envious look.","Perhaps the little white snake's roar had an effect, as they didn't encounter any more mutated animals on their journey afterward.","Another day passed.","Nie Yizhou still hadn't found a companion he was satisfied with.","Seeing how powerful the others' companions were, he refused to settle for anything less.","He wanted to find one that was equally impressive.","That evening, the group found another cave to spend the night in.","This cave was different from the previous one.","It had a small pool of water inside.","The water in the pool wasn't frozen; it was warm.","Just as Nie Yizhou was about to scoop some water to wash his face, his eyes suddenly lit up.","\"An egg! There's an egg here!\""]},{"number":364,"title":"Chapter 364: Another Egg","paragraphs":["He happily picked up an egg by the edge of the water.","“This egg seems even bigger than the one Ling Jing found before!”","He was quite excited.","Previously, when Ling Jing found an egg, it hatched into an incredibly strong little white snake.","The one he found now was even larger. Could it contain something even more powerful than that little white snake?","He was overjoyed, already imagining the little creature inside wreaking havoc the moment it hatched.","He treated the egg like a precious treasure, carefully cleaned its surface, and cradled it in his arms.","“I’ve decided, this egg is mine.”","Ling Jing laughed and questioned, “Are you sure you don’t want to look around anymore? What if the little creature inside isn’t very strong?”","He was basically repeating the same words Nie Yizhou had told him earlier.","Nie Yizhou shook his head firmly. “Since it’s a future partner, I believe in it. I’m sure it’s incredibly strong!”","Maybe it would emerge as a king from the very beginning.","He thought to himself, his mood turning exceptionally bright.","Since Nie Yizhou was so insistent on keeping the egg, the group decided to stop searching and return to the base.","They had been out for quite some time, so it was about time to head back.","However, even after their return, Nie Yizhou’s egg still hadn’t hatched, but he cherished it dearly, never letting it out of his arms.","Two helicopters landed on the helipad of Cloud City.","Seeing the long-missed base, Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Finally, they were back.","As they alighted from the helicopters and headed toward the main entrance, they spotted a rusted snowmobile approaching from a distance.","None of them recognized the vehicle, clearly not belonging to anyone from the base.","“Little Chief, you’re back!”","Today happened to be Tan Meier and Liu Tao’s turn to be on duty.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, they were overjoyed.","“Yes, long time no see,” Yun Xiaoxiao replied with a sweet smile.","At that moment, the snowmobile arrived.","There were five people on the vehicle.","They were dressed in tattered clothes, their hair messy, and their faces dirty, making it hard to discern their true appearance.","“It’s you!”","Suddenly, one of them exclaimed as they got off the snowmobile.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao and the others’ puzzled expressions, the person quickly explained.","“In Rong City, you visited our school and saved us.”","Wu Yaping stared excitedly at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","When they mentioned the school, except for Ling Jing and Qu Xiaobei, Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen immediately remembered.","Previously, during their time in Rong City, they had indeed gone to a middle school.","At the time, a teacher and a group of students had been trapped inside.","After clearing out the school of zombies, they had indirectly saved those people.","It turned out that these individuals were the survivors from that school.","However, if memory served correctly, there had been about a dozen of them back then.","Now there were only five.","It seemed the rest had met with a grim fate.","“Why are you here? And in such a state,” Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","During their assault on Rong City, they didn’t see them.","Which meant they must have already escaped from the city.","Wu Yaping helplessly revealed a look of sorrow.","“You once told us that only by becoming strong could we survive in this apocalypse.","The methods you taught us, we’ve always kept in mind and diligently practiced.","We used the school as a base, trying to gather supplies from the surrounding areas.","We also exercised daily and honed our skills for killing zombies.","But one day, a large swarm of zombies suddenly stormed the school.","We had no choice but to hastily evacuate.","As we dodged the zombies, we tried to make our way out of the city.","During this process, we lost several students...”","As she spoke, Wu Yaping’s eyes reddened.","The other four students behind her also lowered their heads.","It seemed they were recalling the tragic moments when their companions died, all of them remaining silent with heavy expressions.","“In the end, we managed to escape the city and found a farmhouse in the outskirts.","There was a vegetable patch next to the house, and we lived off those vegetables and the remaining food in the house.","Of course, we also ventured out to look for food and supplies.","Thus, we lived there for several months.","But later, the weather turned cold, and two students contracted a severe illness.","The medicines we gathered were ineffective.","To save them, we had to set out to find a doctor.","So, we packed up everything we had and left that relatively safe environment.","Next, we arrived at a place.","After explaining our situation, they claimed they had a doctor who could definitely cure my students’ illnesses.","We believed them and stayed.","But it turned out... those people were just heartless scammers!","Not only did they not have any doctors, but they also imprisoned us, confiscated all our food and supplies, and even... buried the two sick students alive!”","Wu Yaping choked up, her voice filled with anger.","“To survive, I used a ruse to sow discord between two of the guards, creating an opening for us to escape.","With that chance, we stole one of their snowmobiles, and along with four of the others, fled.","Fearing they would catch up, we just kept driving, driving, not knowing where we were going.","It wasn’t until just now, seeing the towering walls of this place, that we decided to come here.","Originally, we were still uneasy, afraid this might turn out to be another hellhole.","But we had no food, no water, and had gone days without eating, cold and hungry, so we had no choice but to take a gamble.”","To their surprise, they encountered the very people who had once saved them.","At this moment, Wu Yaping’s previously anxious heart gradually calmed down.","“Boom~”","“They’re over there!”","Suddenly, the sound of an engine revving and several men’s shouts came from a distance.","“Oh no, it’s them! They’ve caught up!”","Wu Yaping and the others immediately tensed up.","They wanted nothing more than to get back on the snowmobile and flee, not wanting to cause trouble for Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Understanding their intentions, Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips.","From following her advice and relying on their own efforts to survive this long, it was clear that they had developed strong resilience and abilities, far beyond the average person.","And after so much time had passed, they still managed to reunite—clearly, it was fate.","She naturally wouldn’t stand idly by, letting them die.","She stepped in front of them.","“You don’t want revenge?”","The group exchanged glances.","Of course, they wanted revenge.","But...","How could they possibly be a match for those people?","“I have some guns here that I can lend you. If you manage to kill those men, you can stay in this base.”","She had already quickly assessed the situation.","Those chasing after them were truly despicable scum—their deaths wouldn’t be enough to atone for their crimes."]},{"number":365,"title":"Chapter 365: Return to the City of Clouds","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao handed over several guns to Wu Yaping and the others.","Wu Yaping and the group were momentarily stunned, then glanced at each other and nodded tacitly.","They already had a plan in mind.","The pursuing group quickly drew near.","Just as they were about to approach the gate, Wu Yaping and the others moved.","They raised their guns and began firing at the pursuers.","Although none of them had ever used a gun before, the memory of their fallen comrades, the humiliation of being locked up and beaten, and the arduous, starving life on the run empowered them with an instinctive skill. Gritting their teeth, they fired relentlessly at their enemies.","Their marksmanship was erratic, but the effect was surprisingly good.","The pursuers hadn't expected their prey, who had been powerless against them, to suddenly turn the tables.","Even more shocking was that Wu Yaping and the others now had guns.","For a moment, the pursuers could only scramble to dodge.","But outside the gate, there was little cover, and several were wounded.","Two even met their end on the spot.","These two died because the other three, in a desperate attempt to save themselves, used them as human shields.","The three who remained unharmed were ruthless characters, and one of them was an ability user, with one even having a mutated rat.","He quickly placed the mutated rat on the ground.","Although the rat was larger than an ordinary one, its speed was even faster.","Wu Yaping and the others could fire their guns, but since they had never used them before, their aim was far from accurate.","After several shots, none of the bullets hit the mutated rat.","As the rat was about to dash closer, a girl with a bun hairstyle next to Wu Yaping threw down her gun.","\"I'll take it on!\"","She lunged toward the mutated rat.","Her fists were as strong as steel; with one punch, she made a crater in the concrete floor.","But the rat was incredibly agile, dodging her attacks with ease.","It also disrupted the aim of Wu Yaping and the others.","The three remaining enemies, seeing this, initially feared Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, but noticing that they remained stationary and did not intervene, their confidence grew.","Seizing the opportunity, the three dodged the bullets and charged forward.","Except for the girl with the bun, Wu Yaping led the other three to meet the attackers head-on.","Earlier, when the enemy had the numerical advantage, they might have been outmatched.","But now, with only three foes, they were determined to fight to the death and take their enemies down with them.","Everyone mustered all their strength, their resolve unshakable, as they engaged in battle.","Yun Xiaoxiao finally understood why these people had survived until now.","At first glance, they appeared to be weak.","But in the heat of battle, their expressions transformed completely.","This was the look of those who had survived countless life-and-death situations.","It was unclear how long the fight lasted.","In the end, Wu Yaping and the others managed to kill the remaining three and the mutated rat.","The process was grueling, and by the time the enemies fell, they themselves were barely holding on, collapsing to the ground, gasping for breath.","But regardless, they had won.","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips slightly.","Her decision had been the right one.","\"Mi'er, take them inside to rest,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said to Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao.","\"Yes, Little Base Leader.\"","Tao Mi'er moved to help Wu Yaping and the others but suddenly noticed two figures.","Her movements paused.","\"Um... Little Base Leader, there's something I need to tell you.\"","\"What is it?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, with her back turned, hadn't noticed Sheng Shuya and Xi Xiao standing not far away.","Tao Mi'er pointed behind her.","\"That... the lady insisted on waiting here for you to return. She's been here for quite a few days.\"","\"Lady? Who?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao turned around and saw Sheng Shuya, her eyes red and brimming with tears, looking both excited and on the verge of breaking down.","She frowned slightly.","What was she doing here?","\"Oh, and the Base Leader of the Northern Base also came by earlier, leaving a lot of supplies before departing. We've stored them in the warehouse, but we're not sure how to handle them.\"","Bai Hongting had also come?","What did this couple want?","\"Xiaoxiao, you're finally back,\" Sheng Shuya quickly wiped away the tears about to fall, excitedly approaching.","Her face was filled with joy, her gaze towards Yun Xiaoxiao brimming with motherly affection.","She desperately wanted to embrace her.","But seeing the aloofness in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes, she felt a pang of hurt.","Still, she understood that Yun Xiaoxiao had no reason to feel close to her.","She didn't even know she was her mother.","And even if she did, what then?","Over the years, she hadn't fulfilled her responsibilities as a mother.","She hadn't cared for, nurtured, or guided her.","More importantly, she hadn't protected her in this dangerous apocalyptic world.","Her unfamiliarity and detachment were only natural.","The past was gone, but she would cherish every moment going forward, taking good care of her daughter.","\"What is it?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked coldly.","In fact, the moment she saw Sheng Shuya, she had vaguely guessed her intentions.","The woman's thoughts confirmed her suspicions.","It turned out she really was their daughter?","But she was curious: how did they find out?","\"Xiaoxiao, actually... I am your...\"","“Aunt Sheng, if it's not something urgent, please go back. I'm a bit busy right now,” Yun Xiaoxiao gave a fake smile.","What Sheng Shuya wanted to say next, she had already figured out.","But honestly, she wasn't interested in these unexpected biological parents.","Especially after what happened with Bai Ruo.","The term \"Sheng Ayi\" deeply pierced Sheng Shuya.","She can see Yun Xiaoxiao's cold, distant demeanor.","Sheng Shuya inwardly sighed.","It was all that Bai guy's fault!","He had hurt her daughter, causing her to dislike even her.","\"Xiaoxiao, listen... I have no relation to that Bai guy, the Northern Base Leader Bai Hongting. Please don't let him affect your opinion of auntie.\"","She realized that abruptly revealing their biological relationship would likely scare Xiaoxiao.","To Xiaoxiao, she was probably just a stranger she had met once.","And due to Bai's actions, possibly even less than that.","She understood this well.","Therefore, her only option was to gradually familiarize herself with Xiaoxiao, earning her acceptance over time.","As for whether Xiaoxiao acknowledged her or not, she didn't care, as long as she could stay by her side.","Thus, regarding Bai Hongting, the so-called \"obstacle\" to their reunion, she immediately distanced herself from him.","Hearing Sheng Shuya's words, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn't help but twitch the corner of her mouth.","She wondered how the \"Mr. Bai\" felt, knowing his wife was so disgusted with him.","Thousands of miles away, Bai Hongting, after slaying a mutated brown bear, suddenly felt an itch in his nose.","\"Achoo!\"","He frowned slightly.","Who was talking about him?"]},{"number":366,"title":"Chapter 366: A Meeting Between Mother and Daughter","paragraphs":["\"Auntie Sheng, I don't dislike you...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was about to persuade Sheng Shuya to return, but Sheng Shuya beat her to it, smiling and saying, \"Then can I stay in Yunzhong City for a while? I really like it here. You have no idea how unbearable it has become in Northern Base.\"","As she spoke, her voice choked up.","It was as if she had a million grievances.","Yun Xiaoxiao's brow twitched.","Please, you're not even good at pretending...","\"I'll pay for the accommodation and food, double the usual rate if necessary!\"","Sheng Shuya quickly added.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","To be honest, she didn't want to have too much interaction with Bai Hongting and Sheng Shuya.","Just as she was trying to figure out how to refuse, another voice came from behind.","\"Xiaoxiao, the teacher sent me to call you both over.\"","Ye Shuyuan walked over.","\"Is it about the virus vaccine?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","Ye Shuyuan nodded, \"Yes, there's been a new development in the vaccine research, but some issues have also emerged.\"","\"Okay, let's go.\"","After telling Ye Shuyuan, Yun Xiaoxiao turned to Sheng Shuya.","\"Auntie Sheng, we have something to attend to, you...\"","\"Xiaoxiao, is your base also researching the zombie virus vaccine?\" Sheng Shuya's eyes lit up.","\"I've been researching this with a team as well. I'm quite familiar with pharmaceuticals. Can I join and have a look? Maybe I can help.\"","\"You are...\"","Ye Shuyuan also noticed Sheng Shuya at this moment, her eyes revealing a hint of surprise.","\"Are you Sheng Shuya, the Deputy Director of the National Health Commission and a pharmaceutical expert?\"","\"You know me?\" Sheng Shuya pursed her lips.","Ye Shuyuan nodded, \"I've read your interview in a magazine before. Your understanding and application of pharmaceuticals are truly remarkable.\"","\"Xiaoxiao, do you know Ms. Sheng?\"","\"Yes, yes, I do.\"","Before Yun Xiaoxiao could speak, Sheng Shuya quickly answered.","\"That's wonderful. With your help, our research might make significant progress!\"","Their research had already achieved some results, temporarily able to slow down the widespread spread of the zombie virus in infected individuals.","But that was only addressing the symptoms, not the root cause.","They still couldn't eradicate the zombie virus in the human body.","Now, their research had encountered some new problems.","If they could add some capable researchers, perhaps they could find new directions.","\"I would be more than willing to help.\"","After saying this with a smile, Sheng Shuya glanced nervously at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Xiaoxiao, can Auntie stay for a while?\"","Looking into her sincere eyes, Yun Xiaoxiao felt a bit helpless.","What else could she say?","Sheng Shuya was paying for accommodation and food, and even helping with the virus vaccine research.","What reason did she have to refuse?","The research on the vaccine was of paramount importance.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao agreed, Sheng Shuya finally revealed a rare smile.","This was great; this way, she could live with her daughter every day!","At the hospital, Grandpa Zhong and the others explained the current predicament.","They mentioned that there was a drug that might be effective in the research, but it wasn't available in Yunzhong City.","This drug was already extremely rare in the market.","Unexpectedly, Sheng Shuya said that Northern Base had this drug.","Moreover, she had conducted research on it.","She had even developed an enhanced version of it.","However, there hadn't been an opportunity to release it into the market before the apocalypse began.","Upon hearing this, Grandpa Zhong was elated.","When Sheng Shuya said she would bring the entire vaccine research team from Northern Base, Zhong Mingsheng was overjoyed.","The more top-tier talents, the higher the chances of developing the vaccine.","In the end, Sheng Shuya didn't leave Yunzhong City.","Instead, she sent Xi Xiao back.","She stayed in the staff dormitory of the hospital.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao about to leave, she felt reluctant.","But she could only watch Yun Xiaoxiao go.","It's okay, she thought. She had already moved in, so there would be plenty of opportunities to see her daughter in the future.","After leaving the hospital, Yun Xiaoxiao walked around the base, arranging a place for Qu Xiaobei.","She didn't take her back to the villa where she lived.","That was because the villa only had a few rooms.","It was already occupied by her and her brothers, with no spare rooms.","She also didn't like sharing a room with others.","Moreover, the accommodation conditions in the community were not bad.","Qu Xiaobei was arranged to stay in the same building as Qin Zhi and Aunt Niu.","This way, she could also receive some care.","\"Xiaoxiao, how can I find you?\" Qu Xiaobei looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with puppy eyes.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out a phone.","\"Do you know how to use this?\"","Qu Xiaobei nodded, \"Yes, I've seen Old Man use it with others. This is a phone, right?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"This is much more advanced than the one Old Man used before.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao saved her number in the contact list of the new phone.","\"Inside the base, you can always call me.\" Yun Xiaoxiao handed the phone over.","Then, she added with a smile, \"But not too often. If you call too frequently, I might just block you.\"","Qu Xiaobei: ......","After arranging Qu Xiaobei's accommodation, Yun Xiaoxiao returned to her residence.","From afar, she saw a round and yellowish thing rushing towards her.","Yun Xiaoxiao's mouth twitched.","Why was Dapoliang (Big Beautiful) so fat?","Dapoliang ran up to Yun Xiaoxiao, happily circling her.","\"Roar~\"","It roared once, ran a few steps forward, and then roared again.","It seemed to want Yun Xiaoxiao to follow it somewhere.","Curious, Yun Xiaoxiao followed.","After winding around the villa, they arrived at the 'luxury park' specially built for Dapoliang and its mutant animals.","The mutant animals, seeing Yun Xiaoxiao, also excitedly surrounded her.","One by one, they had shed their past scraggly 'homeless' appearance, becoming plump, muscular, and majestic.","Dapoliang roared again.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked in the direction of the sound and saw Dapoliang's 'wife' lying on a haystack behind a large rock.","Beside her, there was a... just-born little tiger cub!","Yun Xiaoxiao was astonished.","Dapoliang was pretty quick.","She had only been away for a few months, and it had already had a baby.","Seeing the little tiger, as cute as a little striped cat, Yun Xiaoxiao also found it adorable.","After all, all the animals around her were big.","Such a tiny, soft, and fluffy little thing was rare.","She couldn't help but reach out to stroke it.","It was soft and warm, very comfortable.","The little tiger's eyes were still closed, but it nuzzled its small head against her hand.","Yun Xiaoxiao's heart melted.","\"Hmm, what should we name it?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pondered.","\"Little Dot?\"","Mu Yang walked up from behind.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao squatting on the ground, he pursed his lips.","\"You're really here.\""]},{"number":367,"title":"Chapter 367: Big Beautiful Has a Baby","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao stood up.","\"Brother Mu Yang, is there something on your mind?\"","Mu Yang nodded. \"Yes, there are some matters I need to discuss with you.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"It’s like this. Previously, weren’t you discussing the construction of the Central Base with its current base leader, Base Leader Mo? I was thinking that since there’s not much going on here, I’ll pick some people to head over there first and start building some infrastructure.\"","The reason Yun Xiaoxiao considered the Central Base as an affiliated base of Yun City was that she saw the potential in its large population for developing agriculture and industry.","\"Alright, you can arrange that.\"","She was better at offering reasonable suggestions and then... being a hands-off leader.","\"Oh, and Lu Chen and the others plan to take the guards in batches to train in the surrounding mountain ranges, while also looking for suitable companions for them.\"","\"That’s great! Go ahead.\"","\"Then, for the base here, you’ll have to watch over it alone.\"","\"Huh?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at herself. \"Just me? You’re all leaving?\"","Mu Yang chuckled at Yun Xiaoxiao’s expression.","He couldn’t help but ruffle her hair.","\"Yes, Ling Jing and I will go to the Central Base. Lu Chen, Xiao Feng, and Nie Yizhou will take the team to hunt mutated plants.\"","\"Oh, alright then.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao had no choice but to accept the reality.","\"When will you be leaving?\"","Mu Yang: \"Ling Jing and I will probably leave the day after tomorrow. Lu Chen and the others have decided to set off after lunch tomorrow.\"","\"Got it.\" Yun Xiaoxiao stretched lazily. \"I’ll take good care of the home.\"","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao refer to it as 'home,' Mu Yang’s eyes softened even more.","Yes, home.","This was their home.","Yun Xiaoxiao played with Little Hug for a while before heading back to rest.","That’s right, she had given Big Beauty’s newly born son a very cute name: Little Hug.","Once back in her room, Yun Xiaoxiao threw herself onto the soft large bed.","Ah~","Dear bed, long time no see, I miss you so much.","She turned on the air conditioner and heater, took a hot shower, and then fetched some delicious food. She picked a relaxing movie, snacking and watching, enjoying her leisurely life.","After eating her fill and finishing the movie, she took some calcium and zinc supplements, then stepped onto the weight and height scale in her room.","Immediately, she revealed a look of disdain.","How come after so long, I’ve only grown 5 centimeters?","Every day, I eat so much food, supplements, and milk—where is all that nutrition going?","How frustrating!","What’s the point!","So annoying!","Where are my long legs?!","\"Aahhh, it’s cracked! My egg has hatched!\"","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was feeling frustrated, Nie Yizhou’s excited voice suddenly rang out from downstairs.","Hearing the commotion, Yun Xiaoxiao instantly disappeared from her spot.","The next second, she appeared in the living room on the first floor.","At this moment, Nie Yizhou was full of anticipation, staring at the large egg on the dining table.","Xiao Feng also walked over.","Although Ling Jing was still lazily sitting on the sofa, his eyes were also fixed on the table.","Curious, Yun Xiaoxiao approached the dining table, seeing the egg cracking with a \"ka-cha ka-cha\" sound.","The crack widened, then the eggshell fragmented.","All eight eyes widened simultaneously.","On the broken eggshell lay a black... little turtle.","Nie Yizhou paused.","\"Why is it a turtle?\"","He hesitated for two seconds before self-comforting.","\"It’s fine, it’s fine. Even a turtle is good. Maybe it can grow big and become a super ferocious creature!\"","He extended his hand with full affection, wanting to pet the little turtle’s head.","But before his hand could get close, the turtle’s head quickly retracted into its shell.","Nie Yizhou: ......","\"Pfft~\"","Xiao Feng couldn’t hold back a chuckle.","Seeing Nie Yizhou glare at him, he quickly waved his hands.","\"Sorry, couldn’t hold back, pfft~\"","Nie Yizhou:!!!","\"Hmph, it’s just fresh out of the egg, still not used to it yet.","Maybe when it faces real danger, it’ll attack!\"","Nie Yizhou huffed unwillingly.","He refused to believe that his beast pet was a coward!","His must be a super battle turtle!","To avoid being looked down upon by Xiao Feng, Nie Yizhou decided to create a combat environment for his little turtle, forcing out its potential.","\"Xiaogui, can you call out your scorpion to fight my turtle?\"","He looked at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him. \"Are you sure?\"","Nie Yizhou nodded firmly. \"Of course, I’m sure!\"","\"Then... fine.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao spread her hand, and the next second, Xiao Keai (Little Cutie) appeared in her palm.","Due to the weather, Xiao Keai and the others preferred staying in the space; Yun Xiaoxiao rarely summoned them out.","The four went outside the villa.","Nie Yizhou gently placed the turtle shell on the snow.","Yun Xiaoxiao also instructed Xiao Keai, \"Go on, just don’t kill it.\"","Nie Yizhou’s mouth twitched.","In his heart, he silently encouraged his little turtle.","Fight on! Giant!","You must make me proud!","The four watched from the sidelines as, in the snow, Xiao Keai and Giant faced each other.","The size difference between the two was stark.","Xiao Keai was tall and mighty.","Giant was small and frail.","It was oddly mismatched.","Xiao Kei raised its sharp tail stinger, standing in front of Giant.","As soon as it extended its stinger, Giant quickly retracted its turtle head back into its shell.","Xiao Kei tilted its head in confusion, using its antennae to flip the shell.","\"Clang.\"","The shell fell heavily onto the snow, creating a dent.","The turtle head still hadn’t emerged.","Nie Yizhou: ......","\"Giant, come out!\"","He couldn’t help but shout, his voice revealing urgency and a hint of disappointment.","Yet Giant remained unmoved, hiding in its shell like it was playing dead.","Xiao Kei seemed to have found a new toy, repeatedly tossing Giant into the air and then dropping it.","The snow was pocked with small dents.","In the end, Nie Yizhou was almost out of patience.","Even Xiao Feng felt pity for him and stopped teasing.","Instead, he patted Nie Yizhou’s shoulder in consolation.","But this only deepened the emotional wound to Nie Yizhou’s ‘delicate’ heart.","He almost burst into tears.","Others find an egg and hatch a powerful beast.","What he got was a worthless coward.","It’s all eggs—why such a difference?","Sob, sob, why am I always the one hurt?","After Xiao Kei was recalled by Yun Xiaoxiao, several minutes passed before Giant’s head finally emerged.","Its tiny eyeballs swiveled around, finally locking onto Nie Yizhou, who had been sighing.","Extending its limbs, it slowly crawled over.","Seeing it move so sluggishly, Nie Yizhou sighed again.","Sigh..."]},{"number":368,"title":"Chapter 368: You Can Do It, Big Mac","paragraphs":["The next day after lunch, Lu Chen and their group left.","Mu Yang and Ling Jing also departed with their people the following morning.","Yun Xiaoxiao would make her daily rounds around the base and then retreat to her space, where she would spar with Little Cutie and the others.","She also brought Big Beauty and its minions into the space.","She alternated her training sessions with them daily.","Both she and Big Beauty, Little Cutie, and the others saw their combat skills improving day by day.","On this particular day, after her usual training, she lounged on a chair.","Da Bai brought over juice and snacks.","As Yun Xiaoxiao enjoyed her food, her gaze drifted to the green, thriving fruit saplings in the distance.","Under Da Bai’s meticulous care and the nurturing effects of the spiritual spring water, the saplings grew vigorously and produced abundant fruit.","Yun Xiaoxiao had sampled the fruit before, and although it could replenish spiritual energy like an evolution potion, the effect was minimal for her.","Thus, the fruit had been left unused.","Suddenly, an idea struck her.","For ordinary people, consuming evolution potions was ineffective and could even have side effects.","After all, evolution potions were extracted from zombie cores, which inevitably contained mutated virus elements.","Beings with special abilities could absorb the potions without harm, their strength increasing significantly as a result.","However, ordinary people were vulnerable to the intense energy, which could overwhelm them.","But what if the evolution potion was replaced with these fruit, which contained special energy?","Could ordinary people enhance their physique by consuming them?","If so, it would be a significant breakthrough for those without special abilities but desperately seeking to grow stronger!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s appetite vanished at the thought.","She conjured a small red basket and, with a flash, appeared among the fruit saplings.","Surrounded by the vibrant greenery and ripe fruits, she began picking them one by one until the basket was full, then she stopped.","She blinked out of her space and reappeared at the training ground near the base entrance.","“Captain Mo!”","The guards, already in training, greeted her enthusiastically upon seeing her.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded and pointed to one of the women.","“Sister, could you come over here for a moment?”","Yun Xiaoxiao remembered this woman had no special abilities.","However, she was incredibly diligent, sometimes even more determined than males.","Initially frail, she would add extra training sessions after completing her assigned tasks.","While others rested late into the night, she would repeatedly run and do squats.","Her unyielding desire to grow stronger had impressed even Yun Xiaoxiao.","In truth, nature did create some physical differences between men and women.","In the apocalypse, the elderly, children, and women were often considered weak.","Some women accepted their fate, enduring abuse or sinking into servitude.","Yet, many, like this woman, harbored an unyielding spirit and an intense longing for strength.","Yun Xiaoxiao held great respect for individuals like her.","Luo Yue approached Yun Xiaoxiao with a look of puzzled curiosity.","“Captain Mo, is there a mission?”","As part of the defense team, their duties often involved heading outside the base to complete various tasks.","Generally, beings with special abilities were given more opportunities to venture out.","She understood this was to reduce their chances of injury.","But she felt that being selected for missions was a sign of being recognized for her strength.","So, her gaze towards Yun Xiaoxiao held a hint of anticipation.","The next moment, Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head.","“No.”","At this, a flicker of disappointment crossed Luo Yue’s eyes before she quickly composed herself, her curiosity deepening.","“Then, is it...?”","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled mysteriously.","“Wait a moment.”","At that moment, a car drove up, stopping beside the training ground.","Ye Shuyuan, accompanied by two doctors carrying a first-aid kit, walked over.","Now, Luo Yue was even more confused.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, grinned and brought out the small basket behind her.","“Sister, these fruits might enhance your physical strength. But I can’t guarantee definite results. Would you be willing to try?”","Luo Yue paused, finally grasping Yun Xiaoxiao’s intentions.","Glancing at Ye Shuyuan and the others, she quickly nodded.","“I’m willing!”","Captain Mo had called in Ye Shuyuan and the doctors—what was there to worry about?","As long as it didn’t take her life, she was game.","If it could strengthen her, it would be an incredible boon for her!","Being chosen by Captain Mo was a blessing for her.","With that, Luo Yue took the basket and promptly picked a fruit, popping it into her mouth.","The others, hearing the fruit could enhance physical strength, gathered around curiously, watching intently.","After finishing one fruit, everyone fixed their gaze on Luo Yue.","“How is it? Any feeling?”","Yun Xiaoxiao was a bit nervous too.","After all, she wasn’t entirely sure whether the fruit would work on ordinary people.","It was all just her speculation.","That’s why she had called Ye Shuyuan and the others—in case something went wrong, they could intervene immediately.","Luo Yue carefully assessed her body’s changes before shaking her head.","Afraid she might disappoint Yun Xiaoxiao, she added, “Maybe one fruit isn’t enough for any effect. Let me eat a few more.”","Saying this, she grabbed a handful and shoved them into her mouth.","Initially, she appeared fine, but soon, her expression changed.","A searing, burning sensation erupted in her abdomen, agonizing and unbearable.","“Ugh~”","Unable to suppress it, she let out a painful groan, her face contorting.","Yun Xiaoxiao panicked.","Had she really gone wrong?","She quickly glanced at Ye Shuyuan.","“Doctor Ye, check on her, quick!”","Ye Shuyuan was about to step forward when Luo Yue raised a hand to stop her.","“No... no need. I think my strength is growing. Let’s... let’s wait a bit.”","Due to her insistence, Ye Shuyuan refrained from acting.","Everyone focused silently on her.","Bent over, she bore her discomfort with effort.","About twenty minutes later, she exhaled, wiping the thin sheen of sweat from her forehead, then straightened up.","A radiant smile lit her face.","“Captain Mo, it worked!”","With that, she turned to the punching bag and started throwing punches.","“Bang!”","With one powerful strike, the hanging punching bag exploded into fragments.","The crowd was astounded.","Everyone knew Luo Yue had no special abilities.","Yet, this person without powers had effortlessly shattered the punching bag with a single punch. What an incredible feat!","At least, Luo Yue hadn’t possessed that kind of strength just minutes earlier.","Had those fruits truly produced such a miraculous effect?","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes lit up with excitement.","She gave Luo Yue a thumbs-up.","“Sister, impressive~”"]},{"number":369,"title":"Chapter 369: The Magical Fruit","paragraphs":["Having confirmed her guess was correct, Yun Xiaoxiao was in high spirits.","Since her training tasks for the day were already completed and she had nothing else to do, she enthusiastically organized a competition.","The participants were naturally all members of the guard team.","They were divided into two groups: the Superhuman group and the non-Superhuman group.","Each group had several awards, including the top three, a challenge award, and a progress award.","The top three in each group would receive corresponding rewards, with higher placements earning more.","The challenge award was for voluntarily challenging someone of a higher level, and whether they succeeded or failed, they would receive a reward—more if they succeeded, less if they failed.","The progress award was self-explanatory.","As long as someone improved, they would receive a reward.","Even moving up just one rank would earn them a corresponding prize.","Yun Xiaoxiao did this to motivate everyone.","At that moment, it was the factory's off-duty time.","Hearing about the competition, no one was in a hurry to go home. Instead, they all rushed over to watch.","The training ground was soon surrounded by a dense crowd.","\"There's a competition! This is great, I’m so excited!\"","\"Exactly! Ever since the apocalypse, entertainment has been scarce. Although our base is much better off than other places, we haven’t had such a lively event before. I used to love watching sports competitions!\"","Because of Yun Xiaoxiao's instructions, every time Lu Chen and the others went out, they would record the outside situation and play it on loop in the base.","So even though most people in the base hadn’t been outside, they could still clearly understand what the outside world was like.","The outdoor temperature was extremely low, but it couldn’t dampen the excitement of the crowd.","Fortunately, everyone was dressed warmly.","Although the chill could still be felt, it was within bearable limits.","Soon, the competition began.","Watching the thrilling and intense battles on the training ground, the crowd erupted in cheers one moment and gasps the next.","Everyone was captivated by the tense atmosphere on the field.","Just as the competition ended and the awards ceremony was about to begin, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly frowned.","[Ding! Danger alert!]","[The base is about to be attacked by an air raid. Air defense activated!]","The mechanical voice of Little Enemy abruptly sounded.","Yun Xiaoxiao immediately went on high alert.","While everyone was still immersed in the excitement of the competition, she suddenly looked up at the sky.","She had been about to award the winners with evolution fluid and fruits, but her sudden pause caught everyone’s attention.","Ye Shuyuan and the others followed her gaze and also looked up.","Seeing this, the rest of the crowd gradually raised their heads as well.","Confusion filled their eyes.","What’s going on?","Why is everyone looking at the sky?","Is there something wrong up there?","\"There are a lot of flying insects heading toward the base!\"","At that moment, a shocked voice rang out.","The speaker was Liu Xiaohui.","She had the ability of X-ray vision.","She had always been working on weapons research in the base.","A typical homebody.","Today, she had been dragged out by Yang Xue and the others to get some fresh air because of the competition.","Now, she stood with Yang Xue, Han Bing, and Chong Ming, pointing in horror toward the northwest direction of the base.","Her words immediately caused a stir in the crowd.","\"What? Flying insects? And a lot of them?!\"","\"Oh no! Is that true?\"","\"This is bad! What if those insects get into the base?\"","Panic spread through the crowd as Liu Xiaohui’s words struck fear into everyone.","In just a few moments, a swarm of flying insects had already reached the sky above the base.","Then, more and more followed.","Dense and numerous, they formed a black net that almost blotted out the sky.","Everyone gasped in shock.","This was terrifying!","Many people’s legs began to weaken.","Suddenly, a large group of mutated flying insects at the center of the swarm dove rapidly toward the training ground.","\"Ah! Run!\"","Someone couldn’t help but scream.","The crowd began to scatter in chaos.","Many people rushed toward the nearest buildings.","Meanwhile, the guard team members stood firm, ready to fight.","A few seconds later, the expected swarm of insects didn’t descend. Instead, a series of ‘zapping’ sounds echoed above their heads.","\"Look up!\"","Someone shouted.","The others, puzzled, also looked up.","They saw that the flying insects, which had been about to attack, were blocked by something invisible.","Not only were they blocked, but they also seemed to be attacked by some mysterious energy.","The bodies of the insects recoiled as if hit by bullets, then lost their lives and began to fall.","However, they didn’t fall into the base.","Instead, they slid down strangely, as if there was an invisible barrier above the base.","The dead insects eventually fell outside the base’s walls.","Witnessing this, everyone except Yun Xiaoxiao was stunned, their mouths agape.","This phenomenon was beyond belief.","It was... surreal!","\"I feel like I’m hallucinating...\"","\"Don’t doubt yourself, you’re fine. I feel the same way.\"","\"What kind of magical place is our base?\"","\"I don’t know, but I feel incredibly lucky!\"","\"Same here!\"","\"Me too!\"","\"Count me in!\"","With the danger averted, everyone’s tense nerves relaxed.","Watching the insects being repelled and falling from the sky, the crowd couldn’t help but express their amazement.","It felt like watching a sci-fi blockbuster in real life.","Eventually, many of the insects died, while others, seeing the fate of their companions, fled in fear.","The base’s danger alert was completely lifted.","Yun Xiaoxiao finally felt a weight lifted off her chest.","Although she knew the base had air defense, she wasn’t sure if it would work.","When she saw the dense swarm of insects approaching, she had been worried.","But now, that worry was gone.","This defense system was impressive!","Yun Xiaoxiao assigned a team to follow her and clean up the insect corpses.","Looking at the ground littered with mutated insects, Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly.","She instructed her team to collect a portion of them.","\"Gather these insects and take them back. We’ll roast and eat them.\"","The others: !!!","Are these things even edible?","Has the little base leader gone mad from hunger?","That can’t be, there’s plenty of good food in the base.","Does she really lack food?","Seeing their expressions, Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled.","\"Don’t underestimate these insects. They’re highly nutritious. Eating them will only do you good, no harm.\"","The ones she selected were all mutated flying insects, and they were edible.","She had eaten plenty of them in her past life.","Anything mutated—whether plants, animals, or insects—was a great supplement for humans.","Now that these things had come to them on their own, it would be a waste not to eat them."]},{"number":370,"title":"Chapter 370: Base Under Air Attack","paragraphs":["If someone were to pass over the Sky City from above, they would notice that a grand banquet was currently being held there.","In a vast plaza, numerous large iron cauldrons had been erected, and fires burned brightly around the edges of the square.","People were stir-frying something in the cauldrons, sending up thick plumes of smoke that carried the rich aroma of freshly cooked food.","Some were dancing around the fires, while others sang songs.","The atmosphere was lively and jubilant.","Even in the biting cold of the snowy weather, the enthusiasm of the crowd could not be subdued.","Cheers and laughter reverberated throughout the air.","“Xiaoxiao.”","Yun Xiaoxiao, along with Qu Xiao Bei and Zheng Yun'er, had just finished listening to a ghost story told by Chong Ming and was deeply engrossed when she suddenly heard a familiar voice.","The voice was gentle, tinged with a hint of apprehension.","At the sound, Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head.","She saw Sheng Shuya smiling as she walked towards her, holding a beautifully wrapped gift bag in her hands.","In recent days, Sheng Shuya had occasionally appeared before her, bringing homemade dishes and desserts.","Initially, Yun Xiaoxiao had rejected them.","But she couldn’t bear the sight of Sheng Shuya’s teary eyes, on the verge of crying.","Yun Xiaoxiao had a sensitivity to others’ feelings—if someone showed her even the slightest unkindness, she would immediately distance herself.","However, if someone treated her kindly, she found it hard to remain indifferent.","Ultimately, Sheng Shuya hadn’t committed any grave mistakes.","The act of losing her had been orchestrated by Bai Ruo while she was unconscious, something Sheng Shuya had been unaware of.","As a result, Sheng Shuya had fallen into severe depression, haunted by guilt and regret.","Yun Xiaoxiao disliked ambiguity.","Although she had no intention of rekindling a familial bond, both Sheng Shuya and Bai Hongting had made their intentions so clear that she didn’t want to remain in the dark.","So, she had someone retrieve a strand of Sheng Shuya’s hair from the trash and had Ye Shuyuan conduct a paternity test.","The results confirmed that she was indeed Sheng Shuya’s biological daughter.","Upon receiving the news, she felt no strong emotions.","It was merely confirmation of something she had already anticipated.","However, Sheng Shuya’s genuine care and efforts to make amends over the past few days made it difficult for her to maintain a cold demeanor.","While she couldn’t emotionally relegate Sheng Shuya to the role of a mother, she could at least treat her as a normal elder within the base.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t one to confuse grievances.","Even though she disapproved of Bai Hongting’s previous actions, she wouldn’t unfairly transfer those feelings onto Sheng Shuya.","With a somewhat polite tone, Yun Xiaoxiao called out, “Auntie Sheng.”","Even though Sheng Shuya longed to hear Yun Xiaoxiao call her “Mom,” she understood that this was something that couldn’t be rushed.","That Yun Xiaoxiao no longer treated her with complete coldness was more than enough for her.","Smiling, Sheng Shuya handed the gift bag to Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Xiaoxiao, when I had some free time, I knitted you a scarf. I’m not sure if it suits you. Open it and see if you like it. If not, let me know what style you prefer, and I’ll knit another one.”","In truth, Sheng Shuya wasn’t very skilled at knitting.","It was just that one day, while seeing Granny Niu in the flower house knitting, she had suddenly felt inspired to make a scarf for Yun Xiaoxiao.","She had humbly sought guidance and found balls of wool in a shop on the street.","She hadn’t expected that even something as mundane as wool could be found in Sky City.","Following Granny Niu’s instructions, she had whittled down two wooden chopsticks to make knitting needles.","Whenever she had free time, she would seek out Granny Niu to learn.","She had made five scarves so far.","But the previous four had flaws, so she had unraveled them and started over.","This was the best one she had made so far.","Full of joy, she had brought it to Yun Xiaoxiao, hoping to see her daughter wear the scarf she had knitted with her own hands.","Yun Xiaoxiao opened the gift bag and saw a swath of white.","She took it out.","It was a simple yet beautiful scarf.","One end of the scarf was embroidered with a lovely teddy bear.","“What do you think? Do you like it?” Sheng Shuya asked, a bit nervously.","Seeing the expectant look in Sheng Shuya’s eyes, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","“Mm, it’s quite nice.”","Sheng Shuya let out a silent sigh of relief.","Liking it was good enough!","“Then... shall I put it on for you?” she asked cautiously.","“No, I’ll do it myself.”","As Yun Xiaoxiao spoke, she took off the scarf around her neck and replaced it with the one Sheng Shuya had knitted.","Though Sheng Shuya felt a slight disappointment, seeing Yun Xiaoxiao wear the scarf she had made filled her heart with contentment.","This... was more than enough.","Sheng Shuya tactfully found an excuse to leave.","While she dearly wished to stay and join in the fun with Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, she knew it wasn’t quite the right time.","“Shuya, come over here,” called out Qin Zhi with enthusiasm, gesturing with her hand.","Thanks to the treatment provided by Zhong Mingsheng and the others, her condition had fully stabilized.","She had emerged from the shadow of losing her daughter and become much more cheerful.","Working in the hospital cafeteria, she had befriended Sheng Shuya.","The two had surprisingly hit it off.","Although Sheng Shuya hadn’t mentioned her relationship with Yun Xiaoxiao, Qin Zhi’s keen sense had guessed at something.","No one would show such kindness to another without reason.","A mother’s gaze couldn’t be faked—she knew that feeling all too well.","She pulled Sheng Shuya over and handed her a fried cricket.","“Quick, try this. It’s so warm and fulfilling to eat, it seems to elevate your spirits.”","At the sight of the cricket, Sheng Shuya instinctively wanted to refuse.","It looked truly unappetizing.","But she didn’t want to disappoint Qin Zhi, so she took it and timidly bit off a leg.","Hmm?","It was... quite tasty.","She took another bite.","It was crunchily delicious!","In the end, she ate the entire cricket.","Still not satisfied, she took another.","“This thing looks frightening, but it’s actually quite good to eat.”","“Right? There’s plenty more here. If you like it, take these.”","Qin Zhi had noticed the sadness in Sheng Shuya’s eyes and had pulled her over to comfort her.","She said, “Some things can’t be rushed. It’s a matter of taking it slow.”","Sheng Shuya looked at her in surprise.","Qin Zhi smiled and patted her shoulder.","“You know, when I was still unwell, I once mistook Xiaoxiao for my daughter and kept calling her Nini.”","Qin Zhi chuckled at the memory.","She recounted the time she had met Yun Xiaoxiao in the madhouse.","Sheng Shuya listened intently.","But as she did, tears began to stream down her face.","This startled Qin Zhi.","“What’s wrong? Why are you crying all of a sudden?”","Qin Zhi frantically looked around for tissues to wipe Sheng Shuya’s tears.","Sheng Shuya shook her head.","“I’m fine, it’s just... listening to your story made me think of that scene.","How perilous it must have been for her, so young, wandering alone in a zombie-infested world.","I truly don’t deserve to be her mother!","When she needed me most, I wasn’t by her side.”","The more she thought about it, the more heartbroken she became, and the tears kept flowing."]},{"number":371,"title":"Chapter 371: How about it, do you like it","paragraphs":["Seeing Sheng Shuya so heartbroken, Qin Zhi didn't know what to say.","She silently patted Sheng Shuya on the back.","After a while, she said, \"The past is behind us; what's important is the future.\"","Sheng Shuya wiped away her tears. \"Yes, the future is what matters most.\"","That night, everyone had a great time.","They played to their heart's content and ate without holding back.","What's more, they all felt their bodies were somehow different from before.","Take resisting cold air, for instance.","Before, no matter how thick their clothes were, even with plenty of warming patches, standing outside still made them feel freezing cold.","But now, while there was still a slight chill, it was noticeably better than before.","Moreover, they felt an endless surge of energy within them.","In other words, they no longer felt dizzy or sore...","However, the next day, Yun Xiaoxiao announced:","Everyone in the entire base, except for those under two years old and over fifty-five, will be enlisted, regardless of gender!","Their schedules will be adjusted starting today.","Morning training, afternoon work, and evening rest.","Even those without special abilities must undergo training to practice combat skills.","Yun Xiaoxiao had been planning this ever since she incorporated the central base into Yun City.","Since the central base could handle production, the people of Yun City could become self-sufficient, easing the production pressure.","The extra time could then be utilized effectively.","What reminded her of the need for this plan was the reaction of the people when the flying insects attacked yesterday.","Apart from the guards, everyone else's first instinct was to flee at the sight of the insects.","What kind of chaos was that?","Although the base seemed secure and safe inside, nothing was ever certain.","And she hated that \"just in case.\"","Any potential threat to her, she wanted to eliminate beforehand.","To encourage everyone, she added several incentive programs.","Winners would receive extra points, fruits, and even mutated animal meat as rewards.","She still had plenty of mutated animal carcasses from the forest she had hunted in her space.","Thus, that morning, the entire Yun City was filled with groups of people running, practicing stances, and training in sword techniques.","Days passed.","One day, while Yun Xiaoxiao was leading a group in push-ups, Tao Mi'er approached.","\"Little Chief Yun, Bai Hongting from the northern base is here. He brought a lot of things and said... he wants to see you.\"","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao didn't stop her movements and didn't even look up.","She said coldly, \"I won't see him.\"","\"What about the things he brought?\" Tao Mi'er asked again.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned. \"Include what he sent last time; return everything to him.\"","\"Understood!\"","Tao Mi'er drove first to the warehouse, then to the hospital, and finally returned to the gate.","\"I'm sorry, Bai Base Chief, our Little Chief Yun is currently unavailable to see you,\" she stated professionally.","At this, Bai Hongting's eyes dimmed slightly.","In truth, he had anticipated this outcome.","Xiaoxiao still hasn't forgiven him.","\"Didn't I tell you not to come?\"","Just as he was feeling down, Sheng Shuya walked out.","Her tone carried a hint of disdain.","Since she wasn't a resident of Yun City, she didn't have to join the training like everyone else.","She spent her days at the hospital, continuing her vaccine research with her team.","Earlier, Bai Hongting had tried to enter the base but was stopped by Tao Mi'er.","Yun Xiaoxiao had previously instructed that the base chief from the northern base was not allowed inside.","So, unable to enter, Bai Hongting had asked Tao Mi'er to convey his desire to see Yun Xiaoxiao and to help call Sheng Shuya.","After delivering the message to Yun Xiaoxiao, Tao Mi'er first went to the warehouse to check the items and arrange for transportation.","Next, she headed to the hospital to inform Sheng Shuya.","Hearing his wife's disdainful tone, Bai Hongting let out an ironic chuckle.","What a failure he was.","His daughter didn't acknowledge him.","His wife disdained him.","With a wife and daughter, he lived like a lonely king.","He coughed lightly, leading Sheng Shuya to a corner away from others.","Then, with a pitiful expression, he said, \"Sister, haven't you thought of me?\"","Sheng Shuya nearly choked on her own saliva.","Bai Hongting had only used this tone with her when they were young and courting. In the years since, he rarely spoke to her like this.","They had had a May-December romance.","Bai Hongting had won her over by being tall, handsome, and serious in front of others but turning into a clingy and adorable puppy behind closed doors.","Hearing him call her \"sister\" after so long, Sheng Shuya felt a chill run down her spine.","\"Don't use that tone; it's embarrassing if someone hears,\" Sheng Shuya frowned.","They weren't young anymore.","What was once playful banter now felt...","She herself found it a bit repulsive.","Bai Hongting smiled and returned to his usual tone.","\"How have you been doing here recently?\"","He genuinely missed his wife.","Sheng Shuya nodded. \"Yes, it's pretty good.\"","With Xiaoxiao around, just seeing her made her happy.","\"That's good. Even though I'm not by your side, take care of yourself.\"","\"I know.\"","\"Here are some crystal cores; take them. If you need more, have Xixiao come back for them.\"","Bai Hongting handed a large bag of crystal cores to Sheng Shuya.","\"Okay.\"","\"That...\"","Bai Hongting hesitated but finally asked, \"Has Xiaoxiao acknowledged you yet?\"","Sheng Shuya sighed and shook her head silently.","\"This matter can't be rushed.\"","They chatted privately for a while longer.","Just as they were about to part, a truck drove out from inside the base.","\"Bai Base Chief, these are the things you previously sent. Our Little Chief Yun said for you not to send anything in the future. No merit, no reward; we're not close, so there's no need to bring gifts each time,\" Tao Mi'er conveyed, smiling politely.","At this, Bai Hongting's heart filled with melancholy.","What to do if his daughter wouldn't accept his gifts?","She didn't acknowledge him, but she even took away his chance to show her kindness.","This...","In this moment, he was overwhelmed with regret.","If only, back then, he hadn't blindly sided with Bai Ruo or harmed her, would things be different now?","Regrets are useless in hindsight.","It's all too late.","He sighed silently and looked at Tao Mi'er.","\"Can I use these crystal cores to purchase the evolution liquid instead?\"","\"This...\"","Tao Mi'er exchanged a look with Liu Tao beside her.","\"We'll need to ask first.\"","Although Little Chief Yun hadn't explicitly said the northern base couldn't buy the evolution liquid, it seemed she wasn't too fond of Bai Base Chief.","So, to be safe, they needed to check first."]},{"number":372,"title":"Chapter 372: Unpopular","paragraphs":["Finally, with Yun Xiaoxiao's permission, Bai Hongting exchanged the crystal nucleus for the corresponding evolution liquid, and after chatting with Sheng Shuya for a while, he left with his people.","The base returned to its usual calm.","In the apocalypse, peace was the ultimate happiness.","Time flew by, and in the blink of aneye, several months had passed.","During these months, Lu Chen, Xiao Feng, and Nie Yizhou took turns leading the guard team out to train.","Mu Yang also shuttled between the Central Base and Yun City, busy with the construction and production matters of the Central Base's factories.","Yun Xiaoxiao occasionally went out with Ling Jing and Qu Xiaobei to train and improve her skills.","Days went by one after another, and everyone's strength continued to grow.","During this period, with the help of the special medicines provided by Sheng Shuya, Zhong Mingsheng and Sheng Shuya's research had also made certain progress.","They developed a serum.","When this serum was injected into a person infected with the zombie virus, the virus cells would begin to autolyze, dissolve in the blood, and eventually disappear.","However, this process was very slow.","Under the phased treatment of this serum, the virus cells in Ling Jing's body were slowly decomposing.","Currently, his physical condition had improved significantly.","His craving for raw meat was no longer as intense.","He could occasionally try cooked food.","Ah Hao's condition also improved.","His consciousness was slowly returning.","Although his eyes were still dull and he couldn't speak normally, he could recognize people.","The teammates of Lei Ming were very excited about this.","They also repeatedly thanked and apologized to Ling Jing.","After all, if it weren't for Ling Jing biting Ah Hao that time, Ah Hao would have turned into a complete zombie long ago, and there would be no chance of being cured.","This serum had no effect on real zombies.","Although the virus vaccine had made a breakthrough, Master Zhong and the others were not entirely satisfied.","After all, not everyone could become like Ling Jing.","Not everyone had the good fortune of Ah Hao, who was bitten by Ling Jing and turned into a half-zombie, with a chance and time to be cured.","Most people, after being bitten by zombies, would completely turn into mindless, soulless walking corpses.","They could no longer be considered human.","Zombies were almost like beasts, just a bunch of frenzied creatures desperate to satisfy their appetites.","Therefore, although this serum was good, it couldn't be widely promoted.","It had no effect on ordinary people.","Even if the serum was injected into someone bitten by a zombie at the very first moment, it would be useless.","The person wouldn't be able to last until the serum dissolved the virus cells; they would have turned into a zombie by then.","So, Master Zhong and Sheng Shuya continued their research day and night.","They hoped to develop a serum that could suppress the zombie virus within seconds.","It was worth mentioning that during these months, the training of ordinary people in the base had also made significant progress.","With Yun Xiaoxiao's spiritual spring water, spiritual fruits, and mutated animal meat, ordinary people who knew nothing before could now match the combat power of a regular assassin who had undergone rigorous training.","They could handle low-level zombies or even cooperate to kill zombies or mutated plants and animals at levels three and below.","Moreover, this was only the result of a few months of training.","If they trained for a longer time, the results would certainly be even better.","So, everyone was full of confidence and believed that the future was promising.","\"Hey, did you notice that the snow seems to be melting?\"","One day, when people woke up from their sleep and prepared for the day's training, they suddenly noticed some subtle changes on the ground.","The once hard snow was now showing signs of moisture in some places.","This moisture suggested that the snow had likely begun to melt.","After someone pointed it out, others also looked around.","Immediately, everyone's faces lit up with delight.","\"Right! The snow really seems to be melting!\"","\"Actually, I felt the temperature rise a couple of days ago, but I didn't pay much attention to it, thinking it was just because of those fruit juices. Now it seems, it wasn't, but the temperature really rose!\"","\"That's great, finally we can shed these thick layers of clothes!\"","No one liked to be wrapped up like bears all day long.","It was much more comfortable to wear light and breezy clothes.","At the same time, people all over the world were celebrating the melting of the ice and snow.","The melting snow meant the revival of all things and the availability of food!","Especially for those who were always short of food, they hugged their companions, overcome with joy and relief.","They finally made it through!","Who knew what kind of gruesome things they had eaten every day to survive until now.","Those were things no human should eat.","But for the sake of survival, they had to swallow them with difficulty.","Fortunately, they held on.","The snow had melted, and food would finally be available!","They could also go out and find food!","While everyone was immersed in this joy, little did they know that this was merely a false pretense before a greater danger arrived.","The snow had melted, and the frozen zombies \"came back to life.\"","And their strength was even more terrifying than before they were frozen.","They had been hungry for a long time.","They were eager to eat meat.","Very, very eager!","So, they desperately searched for traces of humans.","They rushed forward, killed, bit, and vented their brutal desires.","But this wasn’t the most terrifying part.","The most terrifying thing was that the warming weather showed no signs of stopping!","The temperature continued to soar, rising from sub-zero temperatures to over 50 degrees in just one month.","The earth had turned into a giant oven.","The heat was scorching.","If you went out without any protection, within half an hour, a healthy person would be sunburned, even suffer from heatstroke and pass out.","At this point, far from expecting anything to grow, it was a miracle that anything hadn't been instantly scorched to death.","What's more, water resources became even more scarce.","Under the destructive influence of acid rain, many places' water was already unfit for direct consumption.","But even if it was distilled, it was still drinkable.","However, under the scorching heat, water continuously evaporated, large lakes became small, and small lakes dried up and disappeared.","Water was essential for the survival of humans and plants.","Therefore, in some places, water was sold by the bottle.","Many people died of thirst because they had no water to drink.","Originally, everyone had hoped that after the snow melted, crops would grow in the ground.","Now, that hope was dashed.","Under such high temperatures, the ground was almost dead; nothing could grow there.","A new round of disaster was quietly approaching.","The world had become even more chaotic."]},{"number":373,"title":"Chapter 373: Extreme Heat Weather Approaching","paragraphs":["Blazing sun overhead.","A convoy was speeding along a highway.","Suddenly...","\"Boom boom boom boom!\"","Several tires exploded one after another.","The cars immediately lost control, careening wildly towards the roadside guardrail.","The occupants inside were thrown around, dazed and bloodied.","Before they could even figure out what had happened, the windows were smashed by brute force, and someone opened their doors from the outside.","They hadn't even processed the situation when thick smoke began seeping into the vehicles.","The group began coughing uncontrollably.","Their faces changed drastically.","This smoke was not right!","They felt their bodies go weak and limp.","At that moment, figures wearing gas masks appeared.","They injected an unknown blue liquid into their bodies with syringes.","They tried to resist, but found that their supernatural abilities... were gone!","\"Who the hell are you?!\"","They panicked, gazing at the figures, only to be met with a powerful blow.","The next second, they were plunged into unconsciousness, oblivious to everything.","Of course, there were those who tried to resist.","But poisoned and stripped of their abilities, they stood no chance against their assailants.","In no time, they were subdued.","The captors quickly loaded the unconscious into hidden helicopters.","The helicopters soared into the sky, leaving only a scene of abandoned vehicles...","Similar events unfolded across different regions.","Many bases experienced the strange disappearance of supernatural beings.","However, at first, no one took it seriously.","After all, in the apocalypse, sudden deaths while out and about are commonplace.","Those who disappeared were automatically assumed to have met with accidents.","Aside from feeling regret, there was nothing more one could do.","That day.","Yun Xiaoxiao planned to go to the western mountains with Bai Hongting and Sheng Shuya for some training. Suddenly, she saw Nie Yizhou, covered in blood, being carried back by several members of the guard team.","In his arms was a tiny turtle on the verge of death.","Her eyes widened in shock, and she quickly darted over.","\"What happened?!\"","The weak Nie Yizhou grabbed Yun Xiaoxiao's hand, his emotions running high.","\"Save... please save Xiao Feng, you must save him!\"","Nie Yizhou's hand trembled uncontrollably, as if using every ounce of strength he had.","His condition was dire.","His face was ghastly pale, and there were multiple severe wounds all over his body.","Some wounds had already clotted, while others continued to ooze blood.","He was extremely weak, as if on the brink of collapse.","This was the first time Yun Xiaoxiao had seen Nie Yizhou in such a pitiful state.","Not to mention, under the unlimited supply of her spiritual spring water and evolutionary fluids, as well as the nourishment from various mutated animal meats, Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, and the others were undoubtedly among the top tier of fighters in all of Hua Guo.","So, who could have possibly injured him this badly?","And where was Xiao Feng?","The two of them had been sent to the southern region to deliver supplies.","A base there had contacted them, requesting evolutionary fluids and supplies.","That base had worked with them twice before.","Logically, nothing should have gone wrong.","Furthermore, they had encountered people with ill intentions on previous outings.","But with their formidable strength, anyone who dared to cause trouble would quickly learn their lesson.","Not only were they not to be trifled with, but Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Mu Yang, Lei Ming, Qu Xiaobei, Zhong Mingsheng... none of them were pushovers.","As time went on, Yun City's ruthless reputation spread far and wide.","Outsiders who saw the emblem of Yun City would immediately tuck their tails between their legs and behave themselves, not daring to entertain any other thoughts.","So, what kind of people could have possibly caused such harm to Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng this time?","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes darkened.","She glanced at the small turtle in Nie Yizhou's arms.","Its condition was equally dire.","Its head hung limply, its eyes barely open, as if it were moments away from death.","Nie Yizhou may have often complained about the little turtle, but he treated it well.","He never sought out other companions.","Seeing the turtle in such a weakened state, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly took it and tossed it into her space, immersing it in the spiritual spring.","Hopefully, it would help.","Nie Yizhou tried to say something, but merely parted his lips weakly before closing his eyes.","Yun Xiaoxiao's brows furrowed tightly.","He couldn't afford to have a single accident!","She grabbed Nie Yizhou's hand and instantly teleported away, bringing him to Ye Shuyuan.","Seeing Nie Yizhou's condition, Ye Shuyuan's eyes also flashed with surprise.","Without wasting any words, she immediately focused her healing powers to begin treating his wounds.","Yun Xiaoxiao vanished from the spot as soon as Ye Shuyuan started the treatment.","She fetched A Yi with her special ability.","A Yi was someone they had encountered during the campaign against the undead, while gathering gas cylinders.","Her ability was vitality.","She could extend the life of someone on the brink of death.","This was crucial for Nie Yizhou's current condition.","With Ye Shuyuan and A Yi's combined efforts, Nie Yizhou's life was temporarily saved.","\"How is he? Has he woken up?\"","Lu Chen and Ling Jing, who had heard the news, stood outside the ward, their expressions grave.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head.","A low pressure seemed to emanate from her.","At that moment, the ward door opened from inside.","Ye Shuyuan and A Yi, their faces somewhat pale, stepped out.","\"He should wake up soon,\" Ye Shuyuan said.","Upon hearing this, the three immediately entered.","They saw Nie Yizhou's eyelids gently twitching on the bed.","They approached the bedside and softly called his name.","Nie Yizhou, who was always talkative and never at rest, looked so silent and still that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others felt somewhat unaccustomed.","Although they didn't want to wake him, with Xiao Feng still unaccounted for, they didn't know what had happened and could only be merciless and rouse him.","After a while, Nie Yizhou finally opened his eyes.","At first glance, he seemed dazed.","As if unsure of the current time or place.","But in the next moment, his expression turned extremely agitated.","\"Xiao Feng was taken away by someone! You... you have to save him! Achoo... achoo... achoo...\"","The moment he blurted out a sentence, he started coughing violently.","Ling Jing quickly went to fetch a glass of water for him, which eased his coughing.","\"Don't rush. We need to understand what exactly happened to you, who took him, before we can go save him. Calm down and tell us slowly,\" Lu Chen's deep voice acted as a calming agent, and Nie Yizhou's agitated expression gradually stabilized.","He clenched his fists tightly, his face a mix of indignation and suffering.","\"It was all those foreigners!\""]},{"number":374,"title":"Chapter 374: Nie Yizhou on the Brink of Death, Xiao Feng Disappears","paragraphs":["Nie Yizhou briefly recounted the key events that had occurred earlier.","Originally, he and Xiao Feng had already completed the mission of delivering the evolutionary fluid and supplies.","But on their way back, they spotted a city below.","Thinking of hunting some zombies and gathering additional supplies, they decided to make a stop.","Everything went smoothly.","They had even killed several high-level mutated zombies.","By then, it was getting dark.","They found a high-rise building and planned to rest on the rooftop for the night before returning.","After eating, they went to sleep.","They had barricaded the door with tables and chairs, and the zombies outside had been cleared, so they felt secure.","Even if something unexpected happened, any noise would immediately wake them up.","But the unforeseen occurred.","It wasn't exactly an accident; someone had intentionally caused it!","While they were deep asleep, Xiao Feng first sensed something amiss in the air and woke Nie Yizhou.","It was then that the door was smashed open.","Several blonde foreigners with blue eyes strode in.","They seemed slightly surprised to see Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou awake.","For a moment, both sides froze.","But soon, they reacted and started attacking each other.","The foreigners appeared both surprised and delighted by their strength.","Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng also felt startled and puzzled by the foreigners' abilities.","\"Why did you find it strange?\" Ling Jing asked.","Nie Yizhou frowned, \"It's hard to explain. Their abilities felt strange.\"","He glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"It's somewhat similar to Xiao Gui, with multiple abilities at once. However, theirs are different. It's hard to describe, but it feels like those abilities were fused together.\"","After some thought, Nie Yizhou finally found a suitable description.","\"They had various abilities, but compared to me and Xiao Feng, they were still weaker.\"","\"Then how come...\"","Ling Jing didn't finish his sentence.","Nie Yizhou understood his implied question and continued, \"At that time, we had inhaled some kind of sleeping gas, leaving our bodies weak and our minds muddled. Our strength was greatly diminished.","There were about... nine of them.","One had mental abilities and could apparently control mutated animals.","Huoyi rushed forward and let out a horrifying scream, slamming into the wall in agony.","This development threw Xiao Feng into a panic.","He rushed to check on Huoyi's condition but was ambushed in his confusion, receiving a blue injection from behind.","Xiao Feng's abilities were instantly nullified.","They wanted to do the same to me.","But Xiao Feng snapped out of it and, with all his might, blocked the person coming at me, shouting for me to flee, saying the injection was dangerous.","He told me to come back to find you, but how could I abandon him?","So, I went all out to attack.","One of them subdued Xiao Feng, while the other eight focused on me.","I...\"","Nie Yizhou's eyes turned red as he spoke, gritting his teeth and hitting himself in frustration.","\"They used Xiao Feng's life to threaten me, continuously beating him to distract me.","With their numbers,","In the end, not only did I fail to save Xiao Feng, but I was also seriously injured.","If it weren't for Juwuba blocking the fatal blow for me, I wouldn't have made it back.","Realizing I couldn't save Xiao Feng in that situation and staying there would only result in both of us being captured or killed without anyone knowing, I had no choice but to escape.\"","After speaking, his emotions boiled over.","\"Let's go, we have to save him now!\"","Nie Yizhou tried to get out of bed, his expression frantic.","Hearing his story, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were deeply concerned about Xiao Feng.","Though they knew the group had probably moved on, they still wanted to check the area.","Any clues would be valuable.","\"Can you handle it?\" Ling Jing asked.","Nie Yizhou nodded, \"No problem.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"Alright, let's go now.\"","For safety, Yun Xiaoxiao brought Ye Shuyuan and Ayi along.","Given Nie Yizhou's description of the group's strangeness, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others remained on high alert.","Ci Wan, Longyi, Huabai, Huaye, and others were also called along.","As for Mu Yang, he was currently at the Central Base and couldn't join them.","Under Nie Yizhou's guidance, the group boarded a modified helicopter and sped toward the southern region.","After some time, they finally arrived at the location Nie Yizhou mentioned.","However, the place was now deserted.","Apart from messy footprints and some remaining bloodstains, there was nothing else.","Lu Chen and Yun Xiaoxiao carefully searched for clues.","They noticed multiple footprints on the dusty ground.","Following them to a staircase, the footprints suddenly disappeared.","Clearly, the group had someone with a teleportation-like ability.","They searched the nearby area further and discovered traces of a helicopter on a nearby rooftop, but nothing else.","The marks were recent, but that was of little use.","Once a helicopter reaches high altitudes, it leaves no trace.","Meaning, their leads... were lost.","Nie Yizhou slammed his fist against the wall, his eyes bloodshot.","They were too late!","\"Don't worry, the absence of a body is a good sign. Xiao Feng is likely still alive,\" Ling Jing comforted.","\"But where do we even start looking for him now? Those people clearly had ill intentions. They were so ruthless before, and if Xiao Feng is in their hands, I fear...\"","He couldn't bring himself to finish that thought.","Imagining those possibilities, his heart felt as if it were suffocating.","He only regretted his own lack of power.","Yun Xiaoxiao, leaning against the wall with cold eyes, quietly pondered.","In her previous life, until her death, she had never heard of incidents where foreigners kidnapped people in China.","That meant this was something unique to this timeline.","So, who exactly were they?","What did they want by abducting Xiao Feng?","Suddenly, Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes narrowed as if she had realized something.","\"I think... they are part of an organization. They abducted Xiao Feng probably due to his unique abilities.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Nie Yizhou asked, confused.","Yun Xiaoxiao explained, \"Didn't you say their abilities were strange and numerous, almost like fused together?\"","Nie Yizhou nodded.","That was correct.","\"It's already unusual for someone to have two abilities, but with several having five or six abilities each, their origins must be highly problematic.\""]},{"number":375,"title":"Chapter 375: Conjecture","paragraphs":["“So, you suspect that those people kidnapped Xiao Feng to strip him of his fire-based ability and transfer it to someone else?” Lu Chen frowned.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. “That possibility can’t be ruled out. We’re still not entirely sure what their exact goal is, but one thing is clear—their target isn’t just Xiao Feng.”","Her eyes gleamed with sharpness.","From Nie Yizhou’s description, it was evident that the attackers acted swiftly and methodically, suggesting they had done this many times before.","It was as if they had experienced such scenarios repeatedly.","Additionally, Nie Yizhou mentioned that the attackers seemed surprised when they found him and the others still conscious, unaffected by the knockout gas.","This implied that they had expected Nie Yizhou and his team to be unconscious.","Such confidence likely stemmed from their previous experiences in carrying out similar operations.","“We’ll head back now and send out messages to inquire with other bases to see if there have been similar incidents.”","If her suspicions were correct, then Xiao Feng wasn’t the only ability user who had been abducted.","Perhaps they could find some clues this way.","Only then could they follow the trail and rescue Xiao Feng.","Her only concern was whether they had enough time.","And then there were the other teams from the base who were out on missions.","She prayed that no one else would fall victim to these attacks!","The group hurried back to the base and went straight to the radio control room to send out the messages.","At the same time, they ordered all ongoing missions to be suspended immediately.","Everyone was to remain within the base and not venture out.","“How many people are still out there?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked a staff member in the office building.","All mission details were recorded here, including the purpose of the mission and the personnel involved.","Once they returned, they would check in, complete their tasks, and receive their reward points.","Thus, the records were meticulous.","The staff member flipped through the logbook and replied, “Apart from Brother Mu and his team, most of the other squads have returned. Only...”","He glanced at the names and continued, “Only the Thunder Squad, who went to deliver the evolution serum to the Eastern Base, and Zheng Yun’er and Qu Xiaobei haven’t returned yet.”","“How long have they been gone?” Yun Xiaoxiao’s brows furrowed.","The staff member answered, “According to the records, it’s been... four days.”","Four days?","Yun Xiaoxiao’s frown deepened.","The base’s helicopters, modified by Mu Yang, were incredibly fast.","The trip from Cloud City to the Eastern Base could be completed in a day at most.","Yet they had been gone for four days.","Even if they had encountered delays, they should have returned by now.","Their absence could only mean one thing—they might have met the same fate as Xiao Feng.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s heart sank.","With a grave expression, she returned to the radio room.","There, she saw Lu Chen and the others emerging from inside.","“Any responses from the other bases?” she asked.","Lu Chen nodded. “Yes.”","Judging by his expression, Yun Xiaoxiao already had an inkling of what he was about to say.","Lu Chen’s face was grim as he spoke. “It’s as we suspected. Many ability users from other bases have gone missing without a trace.”","“Little Base Leader, Captain Lu, the Northern Base has sent a separate signal!”","Before Lu Chen could finish, a staff member rushed over in a panic.","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly followed him inside.","They heard the voice of Bai Hongting coming through the radio, word by word.","His voice carried a tone of authority and gravity.","The gist of his message was that they had discovered foreign operatives entering the country and targeting domestic ability users.","He urged all bases to restrict personnel movement and avoid sending ability users out unless absolutely necessary.","Additionally, he mentioned that he had followed the trail and gathered some information about the perpetrators.","However, dealing with them would be challenging and required careful planning.","Thus, he requested that each base send capable leaders and strong individuals to the Northern Base immediately to discuss the matter.","To prevent the enemy from intercepting their plans and ambushing them en route, Bai Hongting had encrypted the signal sent to Cloud City, ensuring that only they could receive it.","Similarly, the messages sent to other bases were also encrypted.","Apart from Cloud City, he had notified several major bases across the regions.","He hoped that everyone would take this seriously and arrive at the Northern Base as soon as possible to devise a solution.","“Are we going?”","After hearing Bai Hongting’s message, Lu Chen and the others turned to Yun Xiaoxiao, waiting for her decision.","After all, they had deduced Yun Xiaoxiao’s relationship with Bai Hongting and his wife.","They also knew that Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t particularly fond of Bai.","But this matter was of great importance.","So, the decision rested with Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow. “We’re going!”","Of course, they were going!","Xiao Feng’s fate was unknown, and his whereabouts were a mystery.","If there was even the slightest chance of saving him, she wouldn’t let it slip away.","Whoever dared to abduct someone from Cloud City had some nerve.","This was a debt that had to be settled!","As they prepared to leave again, they ran into Lei Ming and Zheng Yun’er at the entrance.","Their condition was even worse than Nie Yizhou’s had been.","Lei Ming had passed out, and Zheng Yun’er was struggling to carry him.","The moment she saw Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, Zheng Yun’er collapsed, utterly exhausted.","Seeing them in such a state, everyone’s hearts sank.","“Did you run into those foreigners too?!” Nie Yizhou asked anxiously.","At his words, Zheng Yun’er’s expression changed dramatically, filled with shock.","Her reaction confirmed their suspicions.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s brows knitted together. “Where are the others?”","She was referring to Qu Xiaobei and Lei Ming’s team members.","Qu Xiaobei had grown bored staying at the base and had begged Zheng Yun’er to take her along on the mission.","So, she had joined them this time.","At Yun Xiaoxiao’s question, Zheng Yun’er’s eyes filled with pain.","Tears welled up as she said, “Xiaobei was taken by them. The others... their fates are unknown.”","At the time, the situation had been dire. Lei Ming’s teammates had sacrificed themselves to hold off the attackers, allowing Lei Ming and Zheng Yun’er to escape and bring back word.","They had planned to return with reinforcements.","But as they flew away in the helicopter, they heard agonized screams from behind.","The voices belonged to Lei Ming’s teammates.","Lei Ming had wanted to turn back, but Zheng Yun’er had knocked him out.","She knew that going back would mean certain death.","If they had returned, their teammates’ sacrifices would have been in vain.","The best course of action was to return and gather reinforcements.","Only then might there be a glimmer of hope for everyone."]},{"number":376,"title":"Chapter 376: Qu Xiaobei and the Others Have Also Run into Trouble","paragraphs":["\"How long did it take for you to fly back?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked with a serious tone.","Zheng Yuner: \"About an hour.\"","Hearing this, the expressions of Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen turned grim.","Zheng Yuner grew anxious. \"Let's hurry and save them.\"","\"It's too late to go now,\" Lu Chen stated bluntly.","\"Why?\"","\"We'll talk on the way.\"","Only then did Zheng Yuner notice that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others seemed ready to leave.","The group quickly boarded the helicopter again.","On the way, Ye Shuyuan treated Lei Ming and Zheng Yuner.","Nie Yizhou also recounted what had happened to him earlier.","It was then that Zheng Yuner understood why Yun Xiaoxiao and the others weren’t rushing to save Qu Xiaobei and the rest.","\"So, you're saying they planned and orchestrated this attack on us? Once they succeeded, they would quickly relocate?\"","\"Yes, exactly. Especially since some of us escaped, they wouldn’t stay in one place for long. It’s already been an hour since you returned. By the time we get there, they’ll likely be gone.\"","Once the helicopter took off, they essentially lost all sense of direction.","Finding them would be harder than finding a needle in a haystack.","So, even if they rushed over,","they’d likely come up empty-handed, just like before.","Rather than waste time, it was better to head to the Northern Base first, figure out who these people were, and then plan a rescue mission to their headquarters.","If their suspicions were correct, and these people were after the supernatural abilities within Xiao Feng and the others,","and if they were foreigners who had been abducting people across regions,","then Xiao Feng and the others should be safe for the time being.","They would likely gather all the abducted individuals and transport them back to their headquarters.","At the very least, during this transportation phase, their lives wouldn’t be in immediate danger.","And transporting them would take time.","With heavy hearts, the group flew toward the Northern Base.","The Northern Base looked much the same as Yun Xiaoxiao remembered.","As soon as they landed, they ran into many familiar faces.","Jiang Huai and Long Zhe from Rongsheng Base, Peng Shaowei and Hao Ren from the Western Base, Tang Jun and Tang Yanchi from Xiangrui Base—they all seemed to have just arrived as well.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, they came forward to greet them.","\"Xiaoxiao, long time no see!\"","Long Zhe waved at Yun Xiaoxiao with a smile.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded in response.","Truthfully, she wasn’t in the mood to smile.","Tang Yanchi glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao, seemingly wanting to say something, but he held back.","Then, he got angry with himself,","as if someone had provoked him.","His expression turned sour.","\"Everyone, please follow me to the conference hall.\"","A man with a military bearing, clearly from the armed forces, approached them.","So, everyone followed him toward the conference hall.","As they walked, they exchanged information.","From the conversation, they learned that their base had also experienced mysterious disappearances.","At first, they hadn’t paid much attention,","thinking those people had simply met with accidents.","It wasn’t until the Northern Base sent them a secret message that they realized it wasn’t a coincidence.","Peng Shaowei and Jiang Huai were both soldiers.","Protecting the nation from external threats was a duty ingrained in their blood.","Faced with such a situation, they naturally came without hesitation.","After a while, they arrived at the conference hall.","It was a two-story building surrounded by tempered glass,","giving it a solemn and dignified appearance.","They made their way to the second floor.","\"Everyone, it’s right ahead,\"","the guide said, pointing to a room at the far end of the hallway with its double doors wide open.","\"Excuse me, where’s the restroom?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao felt a bit unwell and decided to ask.","Since some bases hadn’t arrived yet, the meeting wouldn’t start immediately.","It was better to take care of her \"urgent business\" first—after all, nature calls couldn’t be ignored.","\"Go straight down this hallway, turn left at the end, and it’s about fifty meters ahead,\"","the guide pointed in the direction.","\"Got it, thanks.\"","After thanking him, Yun Xiaoxiao waved to Lu Chen and the others as she walked away.","\"You guys go ahead. I’ll catch up later.\"","\"Be careful,\"","Lu Chen said, though he knew Yun Xiaoxiao was unlikely to run into trouble. Still, he couldn’t help but remind her.","\"Okay, I will.\"","With that, Yun Xiaoxiao hurried off.","She followed the directions she’d been given and soon found the restroom.","It was surprisingly clean.","Yun Xiaoxiao entered the women’s restroom, found an empty stall, and quickly went in.","Even she, like everyone else, had her moments of urgency.","As she was taking care of her business, she heard two flushes in quick succession.","Then, the doors of the stalls next to and across from hers opened.","Two female voices chimed in.","\"Honestly, the Northern Base is really impressive. Even their restrooms are fancier than ours.\"","\"Well, of course. It’s the largest base in all of China. If they didn’t have this level of sophistication, how could they claim to be the best?\"","\"Still, I’ve heard that there’s a base in the western region called Yun City. Supposedly, they have 24/7 automated water, electricity, and gas supply.\"","\"That’s got to be a lie. Even the Northern Base only has electricity for two hours in the morning, afternoon, and evening. The rest of the time, they shut it off to conserve energy.\"","\"Why would I lie to you?","Remember when our base went to Yun City to exchange for evolution serum?","People who’ve been there say they not only have water, electricity, and gas running all day, but they even have internet!\"","\"Internet?\" The other woman sounded shocked. \"I can’t even remember the last time I went online!\"","Her voice carried a hint of envy.","The other woman continued, \"Exactly! And Yun City has all sorts of shops and vendors selling everything you can imagine.","If it weren’t for the fact that we’re in the apocalypse, you’d think you’d traveled back to the pre-apocalypse era.","Plus, Yun City has farmland.","Huge greenhouses filled with fresh vegetables and fruits.","And all kinds of livestock—so many you can’t even count them.","But you know what the most amazing part is?\"","\"What?\"","\"Even the most ordinary person there can have white rice, fresh vegetables, and all kinds of meat with every meal!\"","\"You’ve got to be kidding me!\"","The other woman was in disbelief.","\"Meat, rice, and fresh vegetables with every meal?","That might’ve been possible before the apocalypse.","But this is the apocalypse we’re talking about!","First, there was the zombie outbreak, then the extreme cold, and now the extreme heat.","The land can’t even support farming anymore.","That means the rice we have now is from before the apocalypse.","Every grain we eat is one less grain we’ll ever have.","Nowadays, even having porridge once in a while is considered a luxury.","How could anyone have white rice, fresh vegetables, and meat with every meal? It’s impossible!\"","\"That’s exactly how I reacted at first, but it’s true. People have seen it with their own eyes. How could it be fake?\""]},{"number":377,"title":"Chapter 377: Forced to Listen to Gossip While Using the Restroom","paragraphs":["\"This Yun City is too amazing, how I envy those living inside!\"","The girl let out an envious voice.","As they chatted, they reached the sink and began washing their hands.","The sound of running water continued alongside their conversation.","\"And you know what, apparently, the leader of Yun City is just a few-year-old child.\"","\"Huh?\" the other one exclaimed in surprise. \"Don't joke around. How could a child lead a city? Their mind isn't even mature yet.\"","The development of Yun City is so successful, undoubtedly due to a highly capable leader.","How could it be a child of just a few years old?","What could a child that young accomplish?","Before, they'd still be playing in the mud, right?","Even with the current awakening of abilities, at best, they'd just be a prodigy with impressive talent, nothing more than a skilled little ability holder.","Managing and developing a city requires much more than just a bit of ability.","Even adults don't all possess such abilities, let alone a child of just a few years old.","\"If you don't believe me, that's fine. Yun City should have people attending this time, and then you'll see for yourself.\"","Just as this person finished speaking, the sound of a door opening echoed.","Yun Xiaoxiao walked out from the stall, her short legs moving steadily.","She reached the children's sink, turned on the faucet, and calmly washed her hands.","\"Little girl, you're so cute! Are you from the Northern Base?\"","One of the girls with her hair tied in a high ponytail, drying her hands with a paper towel, smiled at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned off the faucet. \"No.\"","\"Then where are you from?\"","\"Yun City.\"","\"Yun City!\" The other person's eyes brightened immediately.","She quickly stepped closer to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Hey, little girl, my friend mentioned that your city has a child as its leader. Is that true or false?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the two of them and nodded.","Then, she calmly walked away.","Behind her, the two voices continued.","\"See, I told you so, but you wouldn't believe me.\"","\"It really is true, I really want to meet that magical little leader. What do you think she looks like?\"","\"Wait, that little girl just now said she’s from Yun City, she's around the right age, and she's here at the Northern Base. Could she be the little leader?\"","One of them slapped her forehead, realizing the truth.","The other widened her eyes.","If it were true, that would be so awkward.","Just moments ago, they were discussing her, right in front of her.","Now, thinking about it, she felt like she could dig a hole with her toes.","When Yun Xiaoxiao returned to the conference hall, she saw that it was already full of people.","There were familiar faces and unfamiliar ones.","People gathered in small groups, talking among themselves.","Many had expressions of seriousness on their faces.","Before she even approached, she noticed several people surrounding Lu Chen and his group, lining up to shake hands and talk with them.","Faintly, she could hear their voices.","\"Your reputation precedes you. It's such an honor!\"","\"Famous indeed, truly a young and heroic figure!\"","\"Great to see you again. Thanks for the evolutionary serum and supplies. Otherwise, our base wouldn't have made it through last time.\"","\"....\"","Some were familiar with Lu Chen and his team, while others had only heard of their names.","Over this past year, whenever Lu Chen and his team ventured out, they inevitably encountered troublemakers trying to pick fights.","But none of them were easy targets.","They dealt with one after another, two at a time, and if a group came, they handled them all.","Sometimes, they even tracked down the offenders at their hideouts to settle scores.","As time went by, their reputation for strength and boldness spread far and wide.","Those coming to greet Lu Chen’s group included not only those who knew them and genuinely wanted to greet them but also those hoping to use this opportunity to befriend them, facilitating future dealings with Yun City for evolutionary serum and supplies.","Yun City's reputation had already spread far and wide, and more and more bases, not just from the western region but all over the nation, sought to trade with Yun City.","However, Yun City had a limited number of personnel available for deliveries, divided into several small teams, resulting in limited capacity.","Therefore, shipments were conducted one after another.","Apart from this, despite Yun Xiaoxiao not overcharging, who wouldn't want a better price if possible?","So, building a good relationship was crucial.","Perhaps they could secure a discount?","Some people came with this mindset, hoping to curry favor.","\"The discounts you mentioned, we aren't authorized to make those decisions.\"","Lu Chen's cold gaze swept across the group as he noticed Yun Xiaoxiao approaching.","He signaled to the others, \"The leader of Yun City is here. Ask her if you want to know more.\"","Lu Chen's move was essentially aiming to elevate Yun Xiaoxiao in everyone's eyes, ensuring no one dared to underestimate her.","All the people around Lu Chen followed his gaze.","They saw Yun Xiaoxiao, with her cute little face.","\"So, the leader of Yun City is really a little girl!\"","Some were astonished.","\"I doubted it before but now... I believe it.\"","\"You think maybe they've put her out there as a decoy? To confuse us?\"","\"That's uncertain.\"","As everyone observed Yun Xiaoxiao, Bai Hongting entered, dressed in military green combat gear.","Behind him followed six other fighters dressed similarly.","The group exuded confidence and determination, commanding immediate attention.","Their presence was overwhelming.","The chatting crowd soon seated themselves in their designated spots.","The conference hall resembled a university classroom, with a front section featuring a podium and large screen, followed by flat-seated chairs.","Bai Hongting moved to the front.","A subordinate quickly joined him, handing him a piece of paper to review and whispering a few words before stepping back.","Nodding in acknowledgment, Bai Hongting scanned the hall.","His gaze paused slightly upon spotting Yun Xiaoxiao but quickly moved on.","Currently, his expression was grave.","His serious demeanor naturally exuded authority.","\"Since everyone's here, we'll jump straight into today's main topic without further ado.\"","The powerful resonance in his voice rang out clearly.","He gestured to another combat-attired subordinate.","The man complied, promptly pulling out a laptop.","After a few keystrokes, the giant screen at the front lit up.","Displayed were the images that comprised the day's main subject matter.\")"]},{"number":378,"title":"Chapter 378: What an Awkward Situation","paragraphs":["The photo was taken from a bird's-eye view, and the distance was quite far, making the image somewhat blurry.","However, one could still roughly make out the silhouettes of the people in the photo.","There were five foreigners with blond hair and blue eyes.","Three men and two women.","They were dragging three Chinese people out of a modified car and transferring them to a helicopter.","The three Chinese people seemed to be unconscious.","“This photo was taken a couple of days ago,” Bai Hongting began, pointing to the image on the screen.","His face was stern, and his gaze was sharp.","“We happened to pass by that area and noticed the strange behavior of these five individuals. We thought about the previous disappearances of our base’s ability users and decided to investigate further.”","Bai Hongting then briefly recounted what had happened after they went down.","He had taken a fully armed team of combat ability users with him, around twenty in total.","The moment those foreigners saw them, they attempted to flee.","Bai Hongting realized something was amiss and ordered their capture.","A fierce battle ensued.","Eventually, his team managed to capture the five foreigners and successfully rescued the three Chinese individuals.","After finishing his account, he signaled one of his subordinates.","The subordinate then went to the door and said something to someone outside.","Shortly after, two men and one woman walked in.","“Tell us about what happened back then,” Bai Hongting instructed the three.","Everyone recognized them as the three Chinese individuals from the photo who had nearly been abducted by the foreigners.","One of the women nodded.","She glanced at the crowd in front of her before slowly speaking.","“We’re from Wanbao Base in the northern region. That day, we were out collecting supplies and were on our way back when the tire suddenly burst unexpectedly.","The car then went out of control and crashed into a tree.","We were all knocked unconscious, and before we could react, the car window was smashed from the outside.","A large cloud of smoke then seeped into the car.","The smoke was toxic; as soon as we inhaled it, we felt weak and powerless.","We tried to resist, but then a few people wearing gas masks suddenly injected something into our bodies with syringes.","Instantly, our abilities disappeared.","We were like fish on a chopping board, completely defenseless.","Fortunately, Base Leader Bai arrived just in time to rescue us.”","She finished her account and gratefully glanced at Bai Hongting.","“What about the five foreigners?” someone immediately asked.","Bai Hongting furrowed his brows and spoke in a deep voice.","“They’re dead. They blew themselves up.”","Those individuals were like suicidal commandos.","No sooner had they been captured than they chose to self-destruct without hesitation.","“If they’re all dead, then doesn’t that mean we’ve lost all leads?”","Thinking of this, everyone’s mood sank.","“If the leads are gone, then we find new ones,” Bai Hongting said calmly.","“And this time, we didn’t walk away empty-handed.”","As soon as he finished speaking, one of his subordinates brought over a large storage box.","Bai Hongting pulled out a syringe about the thickness of two fingers from it.","The woman and Nie Yizhou immediately recognized it.","“That’s it. It’s the thing that suppressed our abilities!”","“Exactly,” Bai Hongting affirmed.","“At that time, four of my comrades were affected. Their abilities were rendered useless on the spot.","Even until today, they’ve only recovered about 60% of their abilities.","Furthermore, those individuals also had a type of drug that could induce unconsciousness in a short period.”","Bai Hongting then pulled out another item.","These were all recovered from the bodies of the five foreigners.","“This drug has a strong dosage, and almost anyone who comes into contact with it will be affected.","And then there’s this.”","Bai Hongting held up five diamond patterns.","Each one featured a plant that looked like a flower and a grass, white in color against a black background.","Besides that, there were no words or marks on them.","“These were taken from the shoulders of their clothing. Each of them had such a symbol on them, which I believe is the emblem of their organization.","Based on what I’ve learned, this group is already spread across the entire country, though the exact number is unknown.","Their distribution is widespread, and they are very cautious.","Once they subdue someone, they quickly move them elsewhere.","We don’t yet know where they are being taken.","As for their intentions, I have some speculations.","At that time, I noticed that their abilities were quite peculiar.","I suspect that they abduct people specifically for their abilities.","Perhaps they are conducting some kind of research.","Something that allows them to transfer one person’s abilities to another, granting that person multiple abilities at once.","That is the surface explanation.","But if you think deeper, if they were to sneakily capture most of our country’s ability users and disable their abilities,","then our country’s combat strength would be severely compromised.","What would they do next?”","“They’d come with their people, take our supplies by force!” someone immediately retorted.","Bai Hongting nodded at the person.","“Exactly. Currently, not only are we suffering from the zombie virus, mutant animals, and extreme weather, but the same is true abroad.","They, like us, are in desperate need of supplies.","But China is a large country with a significant population. Even after all the losses we’ve suffered, our overall numbers still outweigh those of other countries.","So they don’t dare to invade our territory and seize our resources directly.","However, if our main fighting force, the ability users, were to be drastically reduced to a critical level, then that might change.”","For thousands of years, whether domestically or internationally, whenever there’s a dispute over interests, conflicts arise.","When the other side’s strength reaches a certain level, and our fighting force becomes pitifully small, even if we have millions of ordinary citizens, they would be no match for those invaders.","They would freely enter the various bases, abduct people, and seize supplies!","After all, in this apocalyptic world, when faced with the prospect of having no food, for some individuals, even human beings become a form of sustenance!","“Unforgivable! Those people have quite the ambition!”","“They’re probably aiming for global domination!”","“They’re truly ruthless and cunning!”","The people present immediately voiced their indignation.","“That’s why I’ve gathered all of you here today to discuss and come up with a plan to root out these individuals.","If anyone has any good suggestions, now’s the time to speak up. Let’s work together to find a solution.”","Bai Hongting scanned the room, his gaze solemn.","There was a moment of silence as everyone seemed to be deep in thought.","This was a matter of great importance, and it required a foolproof plan!","At that moment, someone raised their hand.","“Base Leader Bai, I have a suggestion.”"]},{"number":379,"title":"Chapter 379: The Ambition of Wolves","paragraphs":["“Go ahead and speak.”","Bai Hongting gestured for the person to present their suggestion directly.","The man stood up, indignation boiling over as he harrumphed.","“This group is too brazen! We absolutely must teach them a lesson!","I think we should form an alliance. Once we spot any of their members, we should kill them without hesitation!","Let them know that Hua Country is not to be trifled with!”","This proposal was met with support from many.","Their bases had each lost comrades to this group, and the urge for revenge was almost impossible to suppress.","However, dissenting voices quickly emerged.","Peng Shaowei immediately voiced his concerns.","“Forming an alliance is all well and good, but how can we guarantee that after we kill one batch, they won’t send another?","Moreover, we currently have no way of ascertaining their whereabouts.","Even if we wanted to kill them, we don’t know where to find them.","During this time, wouldn’t even more of our people fall victim to them?”","Peng Shaowei’s words cast a pall over the room once again.","Jiang Huai chimed in, “Exactly. After all, we don’t know which country they’re affiliated with, how many members they have, or how large their organization really is.","Simply forming an alliance and running around, expending time and effort to kill small fry who merely follow orders, would undoubtedly waste our resources.","Furthermore, many of our countrymen have been captured by them, and their fates remain unknown.","We must find a way to save them!”","Jiang Huai’s own base had lost seven people to this group!","“You both raise valid points, but... how do we even gain any extra leads about this organization? How can we hope to locate their headquarters?” Li Feng furrowed his brow.","Li Feng had been sent from the Central Base this time.","Mo Chun, however, did not attend.","“That’s easy,” someone immediately responded. “Just capture one of them and force a confession.”","This was swiftly shot down by others.","“Don’t you remember? Bai Base Head just said it earlier.","Once those people are captured, they self-destruct.","Perhaps these individuals are what we call ‘death warriors’ for that organization.","Orders from above mandate that upon capture, they must take their own lives to prevent any information from leaking.","Which means, even if we did manage to capture one, we wouldn’t get a single shred of information about the organization from them.","So, this plan simply won’t work.”","“Then what do we do?” the person asked, his brows knitting in frustration.","“Miss Yun Xiaoxiao, do you have any good ideas?”","At this moment, Peng Shaowei suddenly spoke up, directing his question toward Yun Xiaoxiao, who had been deep in thought.","His voice drew the attention of everyone in the room to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Peng Shaowei, as the commander of the Western Base and the nominal leader of the ‘Slaughter Corpses’ campaign, was well-known to most present.","Several regions had joined the campaign under his leadership.","While some people had already learned of Yun Xiaoxiao’s identity, others remained in the dark.","Even those who knew of her position doubted her true capabilities.","They suspected that she was merely a figurehead pushed forward by Yun City to mislead public perception.","The real power in Yun City was believed to lie with Lu Chen and his ilk.","After all, believing that a child—especially one so young—could truly lead a base was difficult to swallow.","However, seeing Peng Shaowei—a respected figure—ask Yun Xiaoxiao for her opinion with such cordiality, everyone began to wonder.","Could this little girl truly possess something extraordinary?","Undaunted by the collective gaze, Yun Xiaoxiao remained composed.","Her brows arched slightly, and her demeanor was calm and collected.","“There’s a method. That is: lure the snake out, trap it in the den, and then annihilate it in one swoop!”","Some were puzzled and asked, “What do you mean?”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s gaze darkened.","“Since the enemy is after our ability users, then we’ll be generous and give them exactly what they want.","Once they capture someone, they’ll naturally transport them back to their headquarters.","And there, we’ll pinpoint their lair.","With the lair revealed, we can plan accordingly and take them down in one fell swoop.”","Her words sparked a sudden awakening among the crowd.","Of course!","Why hadn’t they thought of that?","If there were no leads, then they would create them themselves.","Working backward from the chain of information, they’d trace the enemy’s hiding place.","Instantly, the way everyone looked at Yun Xiaoxiao changed.","Bai Hongting, too, surveyed her with appreciation.","Not bad—this was exactly what he had initially considered.","However, the practical implementation posed certain challenges, which was why he hadn’t immediately proposed it.","He brought up his concerns to Yun Xiaoxiao, looking directly at her as he asked, “Even if we’re to lure the snake out, who would be the bait? How can we ensure the safety of this bait?”","He had considered himself, but as base head of the Northern Region, he wasn’t sure whether the organization had gathered intel on him.","If they recognized him and he ventured too boldly, wouldn’t it raise suspicion?","Such action might scare the snake away before it was fully out of its hole.","Moreover, as bait, one had to possess exceptional strength, intellect, and the ability to disguise and observe.","They needed to be capable of collaborating from within while under threat.","Such talents weren’t abundant.","Most critically, this person faced the real risk of luring danger—possibly losing their abilities or their life.","Thus, the cost was immense, and finding volunteers wouldn’t be easy.","As everyone pondered Bai Hongting’s concerns, Yun Xiaoxiao surprised them all by pointing at herself with profound tranquility.","“I’ll go.”","“No!”","“Absolutely not!”","“You can’t!”","“!!!”","Her declaration was met with immediate, almost unanimous protest.","Bai Hongting’s face grew stern.","“You can’t go. We have plenty of adults here. How could we possibly let a child like you take such risks? This is no joking matter!”","Most importantly, he couldn’t allow his own daughter to step into such danger.","She had only just been found, and he hadn’t yet earned her forgiveness or properly acknowledged their relationship.","She couldn’t have an accident now.","No matter what, this was out of the question.","Lu Chen and the others were even more vocally opposed.","“If someone needs to be the bait, then it’s me,” Lu Chen stated coolly, his expression hard.","As a professional assassin, he believed he had unparalleled experience in surviving without abilities.","Ling Jing lazily raised an eyebrow. “With that poker face of yours, you’d only scare the snake off. Acting is my forte. This bait—I’ll take it.”","“You all can stop arguing. I’m the one who will act as bait!” Nie Yizhou spoke with unwavering determination.","It was he who had lost Little Fengzi, and this time, he was resolved to find him."]},{"number":380,"title":"Chapter 380: Who Will Be the Bait","paragraphs":["Immediately following this, several other members from different bases stood up, volunteering to act as the bait.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, cut straight to the point. \"Alright, everyone, stop arguing. This task, you can't handle it.\"","It wasn't that she was being arrogant, but this mission was extraordinarily unique, and not just anyone could fulfill it.","\"You're all adults, which would make those people more suspicious.\"","\"Then let me go!\" Long Zhe stood up.","\"I'm not an adult, so they won't be as wary of me.\"","\"I'm even more suitable; I'm younger than you.\" Tang Yanchi also stood up.","His tone carried a hint of pride.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the two of them.","\"You're not suitable either.\"","\"Why not?\" The two spoke almost simultaneously.","Yun Xiaoxiao lightly parted her lips. \"Your strength isn't sufficient.\"","The two: ......","How frustrating!","Yun Xiaoxiao, being the straightforward woman she was, didn't care about their feelings and continued.","\"To act as bait means you'll be exposed to their smoke and injected with a substance that nullifies supernatural abilities.","If your supernatural abilities are really gone, then when facing those people, it's as good as losing the ability to resist.","Does anyone here have the confidence to escape their clutches and transmit a message to the outside world under such circumstances?\"","Her question left everyone speechless.","If they were truly in that situation,","with their own strength weakened and the enemy formidable, all under heavy guard,","they really weren't sure if they could complete the mission.","\"But we only need to locate their main base, right? We shouldn't need to transmit any messages.","As long as we place a tracker on the person acting as bait, we can know where he's taken.\" someone immediately suggested.","Bai Hongting was from the military.","Their special operations units usually had devices like trackers.","\"True, a tracker could help us find their location, but those people aren't fools.","Where there's a tracker, there's equipment to detect it.","What if they have such equipment and are very cautious?","If they discover the tracker at the beginning, midway, or even after reaching the destination, do you think the person acting as bait would survive?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's counter-question again left the one who asked stumped.","Bai Hongting frowned, \"So your suggestion is not to use a tracker?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him indifferently.","Although she had issues with him, she wouldn't deliberately oppose him at this moment.","She shook her head. \"Trackers are still necessary, but we need a more covert one, and it can't be placed on the person.\"","Everyone was confused by her explanation.","If it's not placed on the person, how would it track them?","\"Does Miss Yun mean that person needs to have space-type supernatural abilities?\" Peng Shaowei speculated.","\"Exactly. As long as the tracker is placed in the spatial dimension, those people won't detect it.\"","\"Luckily, I recently developed space-type supernatural abilities,\" she lied without batting an eye.","\"But if those people inject a substance that nullifies supernatural abilities, wouldn't the abilities fail? Would the tracker still work then?\" someone else raised a doubt.","\"Then simply don't get injected with the substance.\"","\"How is that possible!\" the person immediately denied, \"To be taken by those people, one must be a valuable supernatural being. And if it's a supernatural being, their method would surely involve smoke and injectable substances. How could they not be injected?\"","\"That's why I said only I can do it.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at the person who had just spoken.","\"Come out here.\"","The man was a twenty-something adult.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao asking him to step out, he felt a bit awkward.","\"What?\"","To be called out by a young girl like this was somewhat humiliating.","He wasn't some random person; how could he just step out when told?","\"You don't think it's possible not to be injected, right? Now I'll let you personally verify if it's possible.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled slightly.","However, her smile didn't reach her eyes.","\"Go ahead. We all want to see it.\"","\"Yeah, go out if you're asked.\"","The people around the man urged him.","Gritting his teeth, he agreed, \"Alright, I'll come out.\"","He wanted to see just what tricks this young girl had up her sleeve.","Yun Xiaoxiao approached Bai Hongting and pointed to the syringe containing blue liquid.","Then, she extended her hand.","\"May I borrow it?\"","Bai Hongting frowned, \"Are you planning to have him inject it into you?\"","He seemed to have guessed Yun Xiaoxiao's intention.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao didn't deny it, he immediately refused.","\"No way, that's too dangerous.\"","If that guy accidentally hurts his daughter, what then?","Yun Xiaoxiao nearly rolled her eyes.","Did he really just call her \"daughter\" so naturally?","Did she ever acknowledge him?","\"Give it here.\"","Her tone was domineering.","Bai Hongting continued to frown, \"But...\"","\"You're talking too much.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao directly took the syringe from the table.","It happened so fast, it was over in an instant.","Bai Hongting didn't even have time to stop her.","Watching Yun Xiaoxiao turn and walk away indifferently, Bai Hongting sighed inwardly.","Did he make her annoyed again?","The group of his subordinates behind him exchanged glances, looking at each other puzzled.","Some, unaware of the situation, were wide-eyed with surprise.","How could someone dare to say the base leader was being talkative and snatch something from his hands forcefully?","Most importantly, the base leader didn't immediately explode with rage!","That was incredulous!","Those who knew some of the truth whispered among themselves.","The base leader sure dotes on his daughter a lot!","Tsk tsk...","Ignoring everyone's expressions behind her, Yun Xiaoxiao walked straight to the man who doubted her earlier and handed him the syringe.","\"Now, use this to stab me.\"","At her words, the expressions of everyone present shifted slightly.","Even though Lu Chen and a few others looked uneasy, they didn't speak up to stop her.","Because they knew Yun Xiaoxiao didn't act recklessly.","There must be a reason for her actions.","For now, they'll just watch.","If she really gets hurt, they'll step in immediately!","The man held the syringe, hesitating.","\"Really have to stab?\"","\"Yes.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded slightly.","The man pouted, \"This is what you asked for, if I really stab you, I won't take responsibility.\"","\"Don't worry, even if I get hurt, I won't kill you.\"","The man: ......","What kind of guarantee is this?","\"Then I'm starting.\"","The man removed the small cap from the needle and raised it high, preparing to stab Yun Xiaoxiao.","Everyone held their breath watching.","Even though they knew it was Yun Xiaoxiao's own request and they were just demonstrating,","Seeing the real needle like this was still quite nerve-wracking."]},{"number":381,"title":"Chapter 381: Your Strength is Lacking","paragraphs":["If the needle really pierced her skin, Yun Xiaoxiao's supernatural abilities would be gone.","At the same time, everyone was curious to see what method Yun Xiaoxiao had mentioned to avoid being pricked by the syringe.","Obviously, she wouldn't use force.","After all, this method was ultimately meant to deal with those foreign agents.","If she resorted to violence, it would expose her.","So, they were even more curious.","What method could Yun Xiaoxiao possibly use?","Everyone focused their attention.","And then, just as the needle tip was about to touch Yun Xiaoxiao, it suddenly stopped.","The man’s eyes also looked a bit odd.","It was as if...","he had suddenly frozen.","His eyes didn't seem to move.","It was at this moment that Yun Xiaoxiao removed the syringe from his hand, quickly dripped the liquid onto the ground, and placed the empty syringe back into the man's hand.","She also looked into his eyes for a brief second.","The entire process took less than three seconds.","Suddenly, the man seemed to wake up from a dream.","He looked at the empty syringe and hurriedly stood up.","\"You said that even if you were pricked, you wouldn't do anything to me. You can't go back on your word!\"","Although he didn't know Yun Xiaoxiao's true strength, he had heard of the reputations of Lu Chen and the others.","From their attitudes earlier, he knew.","They cared deeply about Yun Xiaoxiao.","If they became angry and came to settle accounts with him, he would be in big trouble.","At this moment, he even regretted agreeing to prick Yun Xiaoxiao.","It was really a thankless task, with the added risk of being beaten.","How terrifying!","Seeing the man's panicked expression, everyone's expressions became strange.","\"Are you sure you injected the liquid into Miss Yun Xiaoxiao's body?\" Peng Shaowei asked sternly.","The man immediately nodded, \"Yes, I did.\"","He was puzzled as to why he was being asked this.","He had already injected the liquid.","The syringe was empty, wasn't it?","This revelation astonished everyone.","What just happened?","They all turned to Yun Xiaoxiao, hoping she could explain.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't want to waste time, so she said, \"Just now, you all saw that I can induce people to experience hallucinations that are completely opposite to reality.","This means that when I face those people, I can completely avoid being injected with the liquid that negates supernatural abilities, but they won't be aware of it.\"","In the past few months, due to her growing intimacy, she had gained several new supernatural abilities.","This hallucination ability was one of them.","\"Moreover, among all of us here, I am the youngest and most deceptive.","When facing me, the enemy's vigilance will be greatly reduced.","So, it's most suitable for me to go.\"","No one objected.","It seemed that her going was indeed the most suitable option.","Bai Hongting, while also worried about Yun Xiaoxiao, could tell.","Yun Xiaoxiao was a very determined person.","Once she made a decision, no one could stop her.","Not even him.","He had already been quite a nuisance to her.","So, he decided not to be the annoying one.","If she had decided, he would support her!","Of course, he would arrange everything in the background to ensure he could arrive promptly if she needed him!","\"Since you can confuse the enemy, perhaps we can send more people, which would greatly reduce the danger,\" someone suggested.","Yun Xiaoxiao coughedlightly, \"I can confuse someone, but only the person directly facing me.","Moreover, I must control them within three seconds, which is very mentally taxing.\"","This meant that the previous suggestion was not feasible.","\"Then, we can arrange some capable people to go with you. Even if their supernatural abilities are unusable, they can still support you if needed,\" Jiang Huai said.","Yun Xiaoxiao still shook her head.","\"The more people there are, the more loopholes there will be.","If the enemy detects something, they might self-destruct on the spot, and all our efforts will be for nothing.","It would also alert the enemy, causing us to lose out.","Don't forget, our ultimate goal is to find their base and wipe it out.","So, the only one who should know is me.","The others should be completely unaware.","The more genuine their actions, the more fear they show, the less suspicious the enemy will be.\"","Her words made sense, and no one could argue.","Finally, everyone decided that Yun Xiaoxiao would blend in with a group of ordinary supernatural ability users, who were unaware of the plan, to act as bait.","\"But we don't even know where they are now. How can we lure them out to set up an ambush?\" Li Feng's question stumped everyone.","\"This... we need to ask...\"","As soon as Li Feng finished speaking, Yun Xiaoxiao directed her gaze toward an older man sitting in the corner.","\"Him.\"","She smiled, but it was a cold smile.","Feeling all eyes on him, the middle-aged man's eyes flashed with panic.","But he quickly calmed down.","He chuckled dryly.","\"What are you talking about? Why ask me? I don't know anything.\"","He tried to look calm on the surface, but inside, he was panicking.","No way, he had been so careful.","No one else could possibly know.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head toward Ling Jing, \"Ling Jing, it's your turn.\"","Ling Jing immediately understood her meaning.","He raised an eyebrow at her.","\"Don't worry.\"","After saying that, he gestured with one hand, and a crow flew out from the dark mist.","Seeing this, Bai Hongting's eyebrows twitched.","He remembered this crow very well.","It could make people speak the truth!","Instantly, his gaze towards the middle-aged man became sharp.","From Yun Xiaoxiao's tone and attitude earlier, he vaguely guessed something.","The crow circled above the middle-aged man's head.","Ling Jing asked leisurely, \"What is your relationship with those foreign kidnappers?\"","The man blurted out, \"I don't know anything. I just work for them.\"","This statement caused an uproar.","There was a traitor among them!","“How do you work for them?” Ling Jing looked at the man with disgust.","The man, once again unable to control himself, answered, \"I planted informants in many bases. Whenever a supernatural ability user team goes out, the informant uses a secret radio to notify me, and I notify them.\"","\"You beast! Are you even human!\"","Someone immediately got angry and rushed over, punching the man in the face.","\"No wonder those people could find the exact locations of the teams so accurately. There really was a traitor!","How dare you turn on your own people like that!","You've betrayed our own brothers and sisters!","I'll beat you to death, you traitor!\"","One man after another pounded on the guy.","Two others also stepped up to vent their anger."]},{"number":382,"title":"Chapter 382: The Insider","paragraphs":["The man was the base leader of one of the southern bases.","It seemed that his rise to the position of base leader was also closely tied to those people.","Nie Yizhou couldn't hold back his anger and stepped forward to grab the man by his collar.","With a face full of fury, he demanded, \"So, the informant in Yun City was also set up by you?\"","\"Yun City?\"","The man hurriedly denied it.","\"I didn't plant any informants in Yun City.\"","He had thought about it, but he never found the right person for the job.","With so many bases nationwide, he couldn't have planted spies in every single one.","Yun City truly had no informants.","Nie Yizhou frowned.","So, something happened to them...","Right, they all met with trouble while returning from delivering supplies.","Which means, it was the bases they were delivering supplies to that were being watched.","That makes sense.","The man's wails continued to sound out.","The others all stood in place, unmoving.","He betrayed his own people; getting beaten to death was what he deserved.","But for now, he couldn't die.","So, when the man was beaten to the brink of death, Bai Hongting spoke up and had the others stop.","\"Where are they now?\" Bai Hongting asked.","\"I... I don't know. I really don't know.\"","The man shook his head like a rattle drum.","He was scared out of his wits.","Although he had powers, facing so many powerful figures, how could he dare to resist?","\"I usually contact them via radio.\"","\"Is your radio a special device, or can any equipment work?\" Bai Hongting asked again.","\"Any equipment will do, as long as the frequency is right.\"","\"Did you inform them about this conference we're holding?\"","Bai Hongting's voice became more serious, carrying a hint of sharpness.","\"Not yet...\" The man swallowed hard, fear evident in his voice.","At the time, his first thought was to contact those people and inform them about this.","But then he thought, the other side dislikes trouble, and without any substantial information, it might not be wise to tell them first.","So, he decided to wait until the content of the conference was set, and then contact them.","That way, he could score some points with them.","Thankfully, he hadn't said anything yet.","If these people found out, his current situation would be a hundred times worse.","The man shuddered at the thought.","Bai Hongting knew that under the influence of Ling Jing's ability, the man was telling the truth.","He furrowed his brows and thought for a few seconds.","Then, he said, \"Contact them and tell them that tonight at dusk, a team of enforcers will be leaving the northern base.\"","\"Remember, no tricks, or else...\"","\"Understood!\"","The middle-aged man hurriedly nodded.","The longer this dragged on, the greater the risk of the news leaking.","So Bai Hongting set the time for that very evening, which everyone understood.","The sooner this was resolved, the better.","Finally, the battered middle-aged man, with a swollen nose and bruised face, was taken away by Bai Hongting's subordinates.","The group then discussed the follow-up plans.","After finalizing the plan, Bai Hongting got up.","\"Ladies and gentlemen, please take a moment to rest in this conference hall. Bai will go and arrange the personnel for this mission. Once the plan proceeds smoothly, everyone is free to leave.\"","It wasn't that he was overly cautious, but it's always better to be safe than sorry.","If it wasn't for Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly pointing out the mole earlier, who would have known that such a major threat had been sitting among them?","If it hadn't been exposed at that moment, all the plans they had discussed today would have been known by that organization.","All their efforts would have been in vain.","This matter is of utmost importance, and his daughter is involved as well.","Therefore, every step must be executed flawlessly.","The information discussed today must not be leaked under any circumstances.","\"Young Brother Lu, please take care of things here.\"","He gave Lu Chen a significant look.","Lu Chen understood what he meant.","Although he, like Yun Xiaoxiao, didn't particularly like Bai Hongting, this matter concerned Yun Xiaoxiao's safety, so he couldn't sit idly by.","Without saying a word, he simply gave a slight nod.","With his assurance, Bai Hongting felt reassured and left.","The strength of Lu Chen and his group was something Bai Hongting had already experienced firsthand.","With them around, anyone else, even if they were displeased, couldn't cause any trouble.","Right now, the most crucial thing was to ensure the plan went smoothly.","As soon as he stepped out, he ordered his subordinates to fetch the small tracking device unique to their unit.","\"Xiaoxiao, I'll take you to the enforcers first. You should get to know them.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao had said that the people chosen to be decoys mustn't know their plan.","So Bai Hongting could only select from among those who weren't informed, and he needed a good excuse.","He led Yun Xiaoxiao to the training ground of the base.","The northern base was originally a military base, so the personnel there were particularly focused on personal training.","Even under the scorching heat, everyone continued to train with sweat dripping from their brows.","\"I want to pick the people myself,\" Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly said, glancing inside.","\"Alright,\" Bai Hongting nodded.","As long as his daughter was still willing to speak to him, anything was acceptable.","After observing for a while, Yun Xiaoxiao pointed out four people.","\"I'll take them.\"","Bai Hongting signaled to his subordinate beside him, who immediately walked in and called out the four men.","All four were young men.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't choose any women, nor did she choose older individuals—she had her reasons.","If they were caught by that organization, they might be beaten and tortured, and she couldn't bear to see older people or women suffer that way.","Moreover, who knows if there were any sadists among those people?","It wasn't safe to send women.","Based on her observation, these four had different personalities, which made them suitable for this mission.","The moment the four appeared, Yun Xiaoxiao put on an innocent and adorable smile.","She looked like a well-behaved child.","The expression was a stark contrast to how she had looked before.","Anyone who saw her for the first time would never guess she was a hidden force to be reckoned with.","They'd only think she was a sweet and innocent little girl.","If they were going to act, they might as well start from the beginning.","Even their own people shouldn't see through her disguise.","That way, they could successfully deceive those people.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao's new demeanor, Bai Hongting couldn't help but twitch the corner of his mouth.","He maintained a composed expression and briefly briefed the group on their mission.","\"A level three mutated animal has been spotted outside the base. Only Xiaoxiao knows its location. You will go with her to capture it.\"","\"Yes!\"","The men stood at attention and responded with full vigor.","However, they were also curious.","What kind of mutated animal was it?","The base leader had personally come to assign them this mission.","And, allowing them to take a child with them, was that really a good idea?","What if she got upset or fussy on the way? They weren't good at handling kids...","But since this mission came directly from Bai Hongting, they couldn't argue.","While they went to change clothes and eat, Bai Hongting's subordinate brought the tracking device.","Yun Xiaoxiao took it in her hand.","In the next second, the tracking device disappeared.","\"Be careful,\" Bai Hongting couldn't help but give a concerned reminder.","\"Mmh,\" Yun Xiaoxiao casually acknowledged and turned to walk toward the green military vehicle parked nearby."]},{"number":383,"title":"Chapter 383: Get Ready to Go","paragraphs":["Evening.","Under the glow of the setting sun, an off-road vehicle slowly exited the gates of the Northern Base.","The car continued on its way, driving along a desolate highway.","The speed of the car was not fast.","In fact, it could even be described as slow.","The reason was simple: Yun Xiaoxiao was feeling car sick.","Of course, this was all an act.","They had instructed the middle-aged man to inform the opposing party that they would be departing in the evening, and they had already left a bit later than expected.","But who knew when that organization's people would arrive?","What if they drove too fast and missed them?","As for why they didn't specify an exact time,","it was to avoid raising suspicions.","After all, the traitor who previously informed the other side had only given a rough time estimate.","Inside the car,","the atmosphere was somewhat strange.","\"Little sister, are you feeling better?\"","A boy with a small mole on the right side of his nose looked concernedly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","He was lean and had the fairest skin among the four.","He was also the only one who showed concern for Yun Xiaoxiao.","His name was beautifully poetic: Hao Xing.","\"Yes, I'm feeling better, thank you, big brother.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a sweet smile.","\"Honestly, I don't know what the Base Leader was thinking, sending a little kid like her on a mission with us. It's like hanging a weight on a dog's tail, pure dragging us down,\"","the crew-cut boy sitting in the passenger seat glanced back at the 'weak' Yun Xiaoxiao and said disdainfully.","His temper seemed quite bad.","His name also matched his personality: Jin Pan.","\"Don't you guys find this mission a bit odd?\"","At this moment, the boy sitting next to Yun Xiaoxiao spoke up.","He was the only one among the four wearing glasses.","Although he looked slim, his body was full of muscle.","His intelligent black eyes behind the lenses gleamed with wisdom.","\"What's so weird about it?\" Jin Pan asked.","Chen Junzhe adjusted the glasses on his nose bridge.","\"Normally, missions aren't assigned at night, but the Base Leader sent us out now. Just that alone is quite odd.","And...,\"","he glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao,","\"bringing along a little kid makes it even stranger.\"","\"Maybe you're overthinking it,\" Jin Pan said carelessly.","Chen Junzhe's eyes flickered, \"I hope... so.\"","Just then...","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","All four tires of the car suddenly exploded.","The car immediately lost control.","\"Shit, we're ambushed!\"","The boy in the driver's seat, who had remained silent until now, spoke sharply.","\"Hold on tight!\"","'Screech!!!'","With a loud screeching sound, the car instantly slid to the side and crashed into a guardrail.","A loud clanging sound echoed as the rear seat flew up and smashed to the ground.","The occupants inside were thrown into a state of disorientation.","\"Crash!\"","In the next second, the car windows shattered into pieces.","A cloud of smoke drifted in from outside.","\"What the hell is that?!\"","Jin Pan cursed loudly, quickly covering his nose.","He reached out to open the door and get outside.","The other four also began to move, though their actions, due to injuries and the smoke, were somewhat sluggish.","Their reactions were already quite fast.","But just as the door opened halfway, it was forcefully pulled open from the outside.","Without saying a word, the assailants outside grabbed syringes and started jabbing them into the four's bodies.","The situation was too sudden. Hao Xing, Jin Pan, and the driver Yan Su were all injected with the liquid.","Only Chen Junzhe managed to dodge it for a moment.","But it was only temporary.","As soon as he dodged, one of the attackers wearing a gas mask started fighting with him.","He was hindered by the confined space inside the car, while the attacker could move freely.","In no time, Chen Junzhe also got injected.","\"Ah, who are you guys?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had been quiet, suddenly cried out in fear.","It was only then that the outsiders realized there was still a little girl in the car.","One of them reached out to grab Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Don't touch her!\"","Hao Xing immediately used his body to shield her.","On the other side, Chen Junzhe also leaned his body to protect Yun Xiaoxiao.","They had originally planned to fight back, but to their shock, they discovered that their special abilities were gone!","This realization made their eyes widen in shock.","It must have been the effect of the smoke and that blue liquid!","The four were horrified.","Who exactly were these people ambushing them on the road?!","Soon, Chen Junzhe and Hao Xing were pulled out of the car.","A tall, burly man immediately reached out to grab Yun Xiaoxiao.","But Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly vanished from her original spot.","The man was stunned, quickly turning his head and body out of the car.","\"Ah, don't catch me.\"","As soon as he poked his head out, he heard a soft, childish voice in the distance.","Accompanying the voice was a flame.","Although the fire's power was not great, it caused the eyes of the men in gas masks to change simultaneously.","Two kinds of abilities—this was enough to attract them!","Two of them immediately rushed toward Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Ahhhhhhhh!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, pretending to be scared, crawled out of the guardrail and ran into the overgrown grassland.","The grass here was all dry.","Combined with the approaching darkness, the hiding effect was quite good.","Yun Xiaoxiao ran while occasionally looking back.","Seeing that the two were chasing her, she used her teleportation ability to misdirect them, leading them in different directions.","Finally, the two split up to the left and right.","Yun Xiaoxiao targeted one of them, slowing down her speed and waiting for the pursuer to catch up.","As soon as the pursuer got close, Yun Xiaoxiao let out a scream, pretending to fall from fear, causing the pursuer to bend down.","Just as the man bent down to grab her with one hand and take out a syringe with the other to inject her with the blue liquid,","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes suddenly changed.","The man's eyes hidden behind the gas mask suddenly lost focus, and his body froze.","Yun Xiaoxiao acted quickly, grabbing the syringe and injecting all the blue liquid into the ground.","She covered the spot with grass and placed the syringe back in the man's hand.","Three seconds passed, and the man's eyes regained clarity.","He looked at the empty syringe, then grabbed Yun Xiaoxiao's clothes and lifted her up with one hand.","\"Wuu wuu, don't hit me, don't hit me.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao struggled on the man's hand, showing a scared expression.","\"You want something, come at me, picking on a kid is what real men do!\"","Even with his face on the ground, Jin Pan shouted.","Of course, his violent struggle quickly earned him a heavy kick from the attacker.","\"Fuck you!\"","He wanted to fight back, but he had no strength.","He could only curse continuously.","\"Pfft!\"","In the end, he spat out a mouthful of blood, and his consciousness faded.","\"Panzi!\"","Hao Xing anxiously called out.","But Jin Pan had already lost consciousness.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly lowered her head, hiding the cold killing intent in her eyes."]},{"number":384,"title":"Chapter 384: Acting","paragraphs":["\"Go!\"","One of them waved their hand, and those people immediately escorted Yun Xiaoxiao and the others towards the nearby grassland.","Upon hearing an outburst of a foreign language, Chen Junzhe immediately raised his eyes.","His brows knitted tightly.","But unlike Jin Pan, he didn't act rashly.","Because he knew that only by staying calm and finding a way out would they have a chance to escape.","A direct confrontation, given their current situation, was a losing battle!","After a while, they were surprised to discover that a helicopter was hidden nearby.","The location chosen by the enemies was well-thought-out.","It was just a slope away from the highway, surrounded by many dry weeds.","From the road, unless you got out and looked carefully, you wouldn't notice it.","Who would go out of their way to inspect the grass by the roadside while on the move?","At that moment, those people took off their gas masks.","As expected, they were all foreigners with blonde hair and blue eyes.","Four men and one woman.","Each was tall and robust.","Seeing their true forms, the expressions of Chen Junzhe and the others subtly changed.","They exchanged glances in silence.","Those people brought out handcuffs and cuffed their hands behind their backs.","Then, roughly, they shoved them into the helicopter.","Following that, blindfolds were used to cover their eyes.","Everything went dark, and they couldn't see anything.","They could only hear the enemies speaking in foreign languages.","The content was completely incomprehensible to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Throughout her two lifetimes, she had never learned a foreign language or interacted with foreigners.","So, even with her mind-reading ability, it was rendered useless before these people.","It was all due to the disadvantage of not understanding foreign languages.","Yun Xiaoxiao felt a bit embarrassed.","After some rustling sounds of rearranging things, the helicopter's rotors began to spin rapidly.","Yun Xiaoxiao knew they were about to take off.","The helicopter ascended into the sky and swiftly moved away.","At the northern base, Bai Hongting and the others closely watched the small dot on the large screen.","This dot represented the tracker on Yun Xiaoxiao's body.","\"It's moving!\" Nie Yizhou's eyes lit up.","Earlier, the dot had remained stationary in one location for a while, leading them to guess that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others might have already encountered the organization.","Now, the dot was moving rapidly.","The speed and trajectory were impossible for an off-road vehicle.","Everyone immediately stood up excitedly.","The prey had taken the bait!","On the other side.","Yun Xiaoxiao sat quietly.","After boarding the helicopter, those people no longer troubled them.","Instead, they continued talking among themselves.","It was unclear how long they had flown.","When Yun Xiaoxiao felt her hands getting numb, the helicopter finally landed.","She silently raised an eyebrow.","From the duration of the flight, it seemed they hadn't been taken out of the country.","In other words, the location should be relatively close to the northern base.","She wasn't sure if this was just a stopover or their final destination.","So, she decided to stay put and see how things unfolded.","Soon, they were pushed out of the helicopter.","When they regained their sight, they found themselves inside a rusty cage in an old warehouse.","Besides herself, Chen Junzhe and the others were imprisoned together with six strangers.","Once their eyes adjusted to the light, Yun Xiaoxiao started examining their surroundings.","The warehouse was quite empty.","Apart from the iron cage containing them, there were some discarded wooden boxes.","That was about it.","In other words, Xiao Feng, Qu Xiaobei, and the others weren't here.","Were they moved elsewhere, or...","After removing their blindfolds, the enemies seemed confident they wouldn't attempt to escape, locking the warehouse door and leaving.","Yun Xiaoxiao sniffed the air and realized there was a faint smell of a substance that could induce weakness or even unconsciousness.","No wonder the enemies felt secure enough to leave!","However, the dosage of this mist wasn't as strong as in the vehicle earlier.","This strategy was likely aimed at keeping them perpetually weak, unable to flee.","\"Panzi! Panzi, wake up!\"","Hao Xing shifted his body towards Jin Pan, yelling and nudging Jin Pan's body with his leg.","But Jin Pan remained unresponsive.","Chen Junzhe also moved over, placing his head against Jin Pan's chest.","After a moment, he lifted his head and breathed a sigh of relief.","\"He's not dead.\"","He also observed their surroundings, contemplating how to escape.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the six people across from them.","Among them was a female; probably in her mid-twenties, quite pretty.","Yun Xiaoxiao moved closer to her.","She smiled faintly, \"Sister, when were you captured?\"","The woman looked at her and answered in a gentle voice.","\"Probably an hour earlier than you.\"","\"Which base are you from?\" Yun Xiaoxiao continued.","The woman shook her head.","\"We don't belong to any base.\"","They all preferred not to be constrained and didn't like taking orders from others.","So, they traveled together in this post-apocalyptic world, wandering freely.","But they never expected that after avoiding zombies and terrifying mutated creatures, they'd be captured by these people.","Truly, they felt indignant!","Yun Xiaoxiao was about to ask if they had seen Xiao Feng and the others.","But a sound of unlocking came from the warehouse door.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly returned to her position.","Soon, two sets of footsteps approached.","The arrivals were a tall man and a fat man.","Both had beards and appeared dirty and smelly.","They were reeking of alcohol, laughing and chatting as they unlocked the cage.","Their eyes were fixed on the young woman earlier, filled with ill intentions.","The young woman also sensed something and unconsciously stepped back two paces.","A male beside her quickly stepped in front of her, shielding her, his face full of vigilance.","But this didn't deter the two foreigners.","Instead, they laughed even more brazenly.","Their voices carried disdain.","They staggered forward, speaking in a foreign language.","Even though Yun Xiaoxiao couldn't understand them, she knew the words couldn't be pleasant.","The man's face turned ugly.","He shouted angrily, \"Get away!\"","Although he spoke through gritted teeth, full of annoyance, he lacked genuine force.","After all, he looked pathetic and weak.","\"Fuck you!\"","But as soon as he finished, the fat foreign man grabbed his neck with one hand.","Spitting on the ground, he punched him hard.","Meanwhile, the tall and thin foreign man went to the young woman, grinning lecherously as he pulled her up.","\"Let go of me!\"","The woman struggled fiercely, only provoking the man's wild laughter.","\"Little Lin!\"","The man on the ground, beaten repeatedly by the fat man, didn't care about his own situation, repeatedly shouting the woman's name in worry.","The woman's other companions, though feeling uneasy, didn't step forward to help.","Only Hao Xing, Yan Su, and Chen Junzhe stepped out, standing before the tall, thin man."]},{"number":385,"title":"Chapter 385: Trapped in an Iron Cage","paragraphs":["The Tall and Thin Man cursed under his breath, \"Shit!\"","He immediately shoved Mei Lin aside and conjured several thorn-covered wooden vines in his palm, swinging them at Yan Su, who was in front.","As he swung, he muttered curses incessantly.","Yan Su and the others were bound, their powers suppressed, and they had inhaled a smog that made their bodies weak and sluggish. They were no match for the giant.","They could only take the beating passively.","\"Idiot,\" Yun Xiaoxiao muttered silently in her heart.","Without even the ability to protect herself, she knew she was going to get beaten but still went forward to play the hero.","Did she want to die faster?","However, as stupid as he was, he was commendable in character.","She might as well show some kindness and save him.","Although she couldn't reveal herself yet, taking care of these two brutes shouldn't be a problem.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the door.","The two brutes had closed the door to avoid being discovered while they indulged in their vile activities.","Perfect.","Peace and quiet!","She let out an exaggerated \"Ouch!\" and deliberately bumped into the Tall and Thin Man's feet.","Just as he was about to kick her away, he lowered his head and locked eyes with her.","His expression froze instantly.","Three seconds later, he snapped back to reality and immediately punched the fat man behind him with a furious roar.","He blabbered curses as he did so.","The fat man was knocked senseless.","He had no idea what was going on; why had the Tall and Thin Man suddenly attacked him?","But both had been drinking, their tempers flaring.","Bizarrely getting beaten made him seethe with anger.","Thus, he counterattacked immediately.","In the massive iron cage, the two began to brawl.","Everyone present was taken aback by this sudden turn of events.","What... was happening?","But seeing the brutes turn on each other was better than them being harmed.","Fight!","Beat each other up!","It would be best if both ended up dead!","The two men were cursing and shouting as they fought.","Soon, the noise caught the attention of those outside.","The door opened, and a few more men entered.","The one in front seemed furious and immediately ordered the two brutes to be dragged out, slapping each one hard.","The loud smack and the sharp pain finally snapped the men out of their drunken haze.","Facing the yelling, the two brutes apologized repeatedly.","Eventually, everyone else left.","The warehouse was finally quiet once more.","Mei Lin, her eyes wet with tears, threw herself at the injured Yang Qiang.","\"How are you doing? Can you move?\"","She asked through her sobs.","Yang Qiang struggled to lift his head and forced a smile to reassure her.","\"Don't worry, I won't die. Stop crying; you won't be pretty if your face gets all messy.\"","As soon as he said that, the woman cried even harder.","But she tried her best to control her emotions, silently letting the tears stream down her face without making a sound.","Yang Qiang wanted to wipe her tears but realized his hands were still cuffed and had to give up.","He managed to lighten the mood with a few more words, finally making Mei Lin laugh.","Only then did he turn to look at Chen Junzhe and the others.","\"Thank you...cough, cough...for stepping in earlier.\"","\"Actually, we didn't do much,\" Hao Xing replied with a smile.","Chen Junzhe, who had been silent, subtly shifted his gaze toward Yun Xiaoxiao.","He remembered that the Tall and Thin Man had first roared in anger, accusing the fat man of hitting him, before charging at the fat man.","But the fat man hadn't hit him at all.","Was it an accident or mere coincidence?","Noticing Chen Junzhe's gaze, Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a sweet smile.","\"Brother, do I look good to you?\"","Caught red-handed and called out, Chen Junzhe coughed lightly, awkwardly looking away.","Yun Xiaoxiao then moved closer to Mei Lin.","\"Sister, after coming here, did you see any others like yourselves who were also tied up?\" she asked.","Mei Lin shook her head.","\"No, once we entered, there were no other captives here.\"","Upon hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao fell silent.","So where exactly were Xiao Feng and Qu Xiaobei?","In reality, this warehouse was part of a flour mill.","Meanwhile, about a kilometer away from the flour mill, behind a small mound, Lu Chen, Bai Hongting, Ling Jing, Nie Yizhou, Jiang Huai, Peng Shaowei, and Tang Jun were crouched, staring at the well-lit factory area in front of them.","They had tracked the tracing device here.","\"We’ve found the kids; what are we waiting for? Let’s go save them!\" Nie Yizhou exclaimed impatiently.","But Lu Chen held him back. \"Just wait.\"","Bai Hongting added, \"It's not time yet. Xiaoxiao said we have to wait for her signal before we act.","She hasn't signaled yet, which means the big fish hasn't taken the bait.","This place is likely just a transit station.","Be patient.\"","Hearing this, Nie Yizhou calmed down.","To avoid alarming the enemy, only they had come.","This group was the maximum number Nie Yizhou could teleport at once.","The others remained behind, waiting for orders.","That night, everything remained calm.","No one else entered the warehouse.","The next morning, the door opened.","Several foreigners entered, blindfolded them again, and led them out of the iron cage.","It seemed they were once again being ushered onto a plane.","Then came a long, extended flight.","During that time, their captors only gave them a single sip of water.","Other than that, nothing.","They didn't care if they were hungry; they just needed to ensure they wouldn't die.","Time dragged on, so long that Yun Xiaoxiao dozed off during the flight, yet the plane still hadn't landed.","Finally, though, the plane stopped.","They were taken out.","They were led through twists and turns, unsure of where they were being taken.","They only heard voices and footsteps around them.","There were quite a few people.","Next, it seemed they were walking down stairs, descending.","The air around them grew significantly cooler.","At this point, various sounds began to echo in their ears.","There were angry yells, painful cries, and pleas for mercy.","The languages were diverse.","Besides Mandarin, there were also many other native tongues.","Yun Xiaoxiao alone heard at least six different languages.","In such an atmosphere, they walked for quite a while. She clearly sensed that Hao Xing and the others were being separated into different groups.","Finally, she was shoved to the ground by someone and had her blindfold removed.","She realized then that she was being kept with several children under the age of nine.","There were children of all different skin tones.","Yellow, white, black...","They all huddled in the corner, their eyes filled with fear.","Only after the man who had escorted her shut the iron door and left did they slightly relax.","Then they looked at her with pity.","But no one spoke to her.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked around.","This place resembled a massive dungeon.","The aisles were lined with one iron cage after another, separated by gates."]},{"number":386,"title":"Chapter 386: Transference","paragraphs":["Inside those iron cages, many other people were also imprisoned.","There were both men and women.","They came from various countries.","In each cage, people of different skin colors were mixed together.","It seemed like they were being kept apart to prevent them from communicating with each other.","Some people were covered in wounds, barely clinging to life as they lay on the ground.","Others were silent, their eyes lifeless.","Some cowered in fear, their expressions filled with terror.","Others screamed, cried, and made a commotion...","This place was like a large-scale human hell!","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes slightly.","This must be the base of those people.","She glanced at the ceiling above the corridor.","Surveillance cameras were installed at regular intervals.","It was as if countless unseen eyes were watching every move of everyone.","They were indeed very cautious!","She closed her eyes without a sound.","Apparently, she was dozing off.","But in fact, a shadowy silhouette was slowly rising from her body.","Yes, there were now two Yun Xiaoxiaos!","One was the solid body, still quietly sitting on the ground, leaning against the edge of the iron cage, with her eyes closed.","The other was a phantom shadow, flashing out of the cage in plain sight, unnoticed by anyone.","This was another supernatural ability Yun Xiaoxiao had acquired in the past few months.","The Phantom Clone.","The ability to split a phantom shadow from her body.","The main body remained stationary, unable to move, and lost its soul, while the soul attached itself to the phantom shadow.","The phantom was invisible, undetected by outsiders, free to move, and possessed all the abilities of the main body.","At this moment, Yun Xiaoxiao was walking boldly in the corridor, passing by patrolling guards unnoticed.","She searched cage by cage.","Trying to find Xiao Feng and Qu Xiaobei.","After a while, she spotted Xiao Feng, beaten and battered, lying on the ground, his life hanging in the balance.","He was the only one in his cage.","Unlike other cages, which held at least five or six people.","His phoenix wings were not here either.","Yun Xiaoxiao slipped into the cage and quickly approached him.","Since she was now a phantom, she couldn't reveal herself.","So she had to reach out and feel his breath.","After a few seconds, Yun Xiaoxiao let out a heavy sigh of relief.","Thankfully, he's still breathing!","She spread her palm and gently placed it over Xiao Feng's injured wounds.","Delicately, cold spiritual water flowed from her palm, cleansing the horrendous wounds.","In his unconscious state, Xiao Feng felt stinging pain in multiple parts of his body, but it was soon followed by a soothing sensation.","He was startled.","Someone was treating his wounds!","This feeling was too familiar!","Whenever they were injured, the liquid used to clean their wounds wasn't alcohol or water, but the spiritual water Yun Xiaoxiao prepared for them.","After cleansing with that water, it not only prevented inflammation but also accelerated the healing of wounds!","Has the little girl arrived?!","Xiao Feng's heart raced, and he struggled to open his heavy eyelids.","Using his hands, he slowly turned his head to look around his surroundings.","But...","He found nothing.","Apart from him, there was no one else in the cage.","Was it just his imagination?","He frowned slightly.","\"Xiao Feng, don't get excited and don't speak. I've come to save you, but you can't see me now; I'm invisible.\"","Just then, a voice so familiar that it couldn't be mistaken whispered softly into Xiao Feng's ear from his right side.","Hearing this, he froze.","Then, a huge wave of joy surged in his eyes.","The little girl really came!","He struggled to control his emotions, pretending as if nothing had happened.","He didn't dare to say a word, just quietly cooperated with Yun Xiaoxiao as she cleaned his wounds.","After a while, Yun Xiaoxiao's voice rang out again.","\"Xiao Feng, your wounds are temporarily taken care of. Rest here for now, and I'll go find Xiaobei and the others.\"","Xiaobei?","Xiao Feng's heart skipped a beat.","Apart from him, did the base have other people kidnapped by those people as well?!","Dammit!","Those bastards.","Once he gets out, he'll find a way to kill them all!","He nodded silently.","Yun Xiaoxiao then stood up and put the small tracker she had been holding back into her space.","Then she took it out again and put it back in.","This repeated five times.","Putting the tracker into her space made it unusable.","So along the way, she kept taking it out and holding it in her hand to make it work.","The tracker was small, and Yun Xiaoxiao held it discreetly, so no one noticed.","She had an agreement with Lu Chen: once the final location was found, she would make the tracker flash five times.","Then Lu Chen and the others could lock onto the base of these people and come to meet her.","After doing all this, Yun Xiaoxiao slipped out of the cage and continued her search for others.","Finally, she found Lei Ming's companions in the outermost cage.","They were special; they weren't separated and imprisoned with people from other countries but were all kept together in one cage.","However, their condition was even worse than Xiao Feng's.","Almost... none of them was intact!","Some had broken limbs, while others were in a far worse state!","The entire floor of the cage was a bloody mess, and the pungent smell filled the entire space.","Many wounds were already festering and infected.","Those bastards!","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes darkened, and she clenched her fists tightly.","She quickly slipped into the cage.","Approached one of them.","She whispered softly in the man's ear.","\"Don't move, don't speak. I'm Yun Xiaoxiao, here to save you. I'll clean your wounds now; bear with it.\"","The soft yet slightly chilly voice instantly brought a glimmer of light to the man's lifeless eyes.","The little base leader!","She... has come to save them!","The man's eyes turned red, and a mist of tears welled up.","Even when those people cruelly stomped on his hand and broke it, he hadn't shed a single tear.","But now, he wanted to cry.","He really wanted to cry.","He had no idea what kind of place this was.","But he guessed it was no longer within the country.","In such a place where people could be devoured without a trace, he had thought that he and his companions were doomed.","After all, they didn't even know where they were.","How could anyone else find them?","Perhaps, even if they died, no one would know.","They hadn't held any hope that someone would come to save them.","Not to mention finding them, just getting into this demonic dungeon was no easy task.","But now, their little base leader not only found them.","She was even treating their wounds.","And she said she would rescue them.","He didn't know how to describe his feelings at this moment.","He was just very excited, with an impulse to cry.","They hadn't been abandoned!","Their little base leader had come to save them!","She was only six years old, yet she cared for them like a deity, protecting them.","To have such a base leader in their lifetime was an incredible fortune!"]},{"number":387,"title":"Chapter 387: She's Come to Save Them","paragraphs":["\"Does it hurt a lot?\"","The man next to him saw his eyes turn red suddenly, with tears welling up in his eyes. Thinking he was in excruciating pain, the other man, despite his own suffering, tried to comfort him.","\"Bear with it. If it hurts too much, bite me.\"","He extended his only remaining right hand towards the man.","The man shook his head.","He didn't know how to explain.","He knew the others couldn't see the Young Base Leader.","But the Young Base Leader had instructed them not to move or speak.","He had to comply!","He couldn't let those patrolling outside or the ones hiding behind the surveillance cameras notice anything unusual.","Even if they died, they couldn't let the Young Base Leader, who had risked everything to save them, encounter any danger!","He lowered his head, making sure he looked the same as usual.","He knew there was no need to explain; soon, they would all understand the truth.","Sure enough, after a while, the man who had shown concern for him also froze in place.","He exchanged a subtle glance with the first man.","In that instant, everything became clear!","The stern, unyielding man's eyes filled with boundless emotion.","Even a hardened man like himself was overwhelmed with waves of emotion at this moment.","Hastily, he lowered his head to hide the abnormal look in his eyes.","Yun Xiaoxiao went around and treated the injured one by one.","With the fastest speed possible.","Because she still hadn't found Qu Xiaobei!","She had already searched through all the iron cages on this side, but Qu Xiaobei was nowhere to be seen.","Now, only the iron cages on the inner side of the other side remained.","After quickly treating the wounds of Lei Ming's subordinates and ensuring they wouldn't worsen and threaten their lives in the short term, Yun Xiaoxiao swiftly moved to the other side.","She darted rapidly past each iron cage.","But even after searching through all of them, she still didn't find Qu Xiaobei.","Her eyebrows furrowed tightly.","To be honest, she was very worried about Qu Xiaobei.","Her ability was more special than anyone else's.","If the people behind the scenes were after abilities, they might have targeted her first.","At that moment, a group of people appeared at the dungeon's staircase entrance.","They directly walked to the iron cage where Xiao Feng was held, unlocked the chains, and dragged Xiao Feng up from the ground.","Xiao Feng struggled for a moment.","\"Let go of me! You damn motherfuckers!\"","As soon as he spoke, he was beaten by the men.","All the blows landed on his stomach.","Blood immediately flowed from the corner of his mouth.","The leader of the group signaled the two beating Xiao Feng to stop and gestured for them to take him away.","They blindfolded Xiao Feng and then dragged him forward.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised her eyebrows and quickly followed.","They must be preparing to deal with Xiao Feng!","Perhaps, following them would lead her to the final location where those people were performing their experiments on the ability users.","She followed closely behind.","They didn't leave the dungeon but continued downward.","It turned out there was a hidden passage under the staircase.","Inside the passage was a long, downward staircase.","Every so often, there was an automatic sensor light.","The lights would turn on when detecting footsteps.","Though the lighting was dim, it was enough for everyone to see the path beneath their feet.","Soon, they reached the end of the staircase.","The place was brightly lit, clean, and white.","It was a space larger than the dungeon above.","There were many glass-enclosed rooms.","Inside were various research equipment and instruments.","Many foreigners in white lab coats were busy everywhere.","Some walked while holding files, discussing with others.","Others carefully studied bottles and vials inside the glass rooms.","Some wore oddly shaped glasses, observing objects under microscopes...","They all seemed very busy.","Yun Xiaoxiao followed the group escorting Xiao Feng as they moved through the corridors, discreetly observing the activities inside the glass rooms on both sides.","Suddenly, her gaze paused.","Because she saw, in one of the rooms, a Chinese-looking person lying on an operating table, covered in tubes everywhere.","The person seemed to be resisting, but was forcibly restrained by several lab-coated individuals and injected with a sedative.","Soon, the person's eyes began to lose focus and slowly closed.","Then, a person wearing white gloves and a mask picked up two things that looked like medicinal patches but had wires connected to an instrument and placed them on both sides of the person's forehead.","Almost immediately, the person began to tremble all over.","Their face looked extremely pained.","Next to them was another operating table.","A foreign man with brown hair and blue eyes lay there.","Though he was also covered in tubes, his expression was relaxed and even anticipatory, as if something good was about to happen.","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes narrowed.","It seemed this was the operating site where abilities were being extracted and transferred!","What cruelty, treating humans as nothing more than objects!","She quickly darted inside.","She extended her index finger, aiming at the outlet.","In an instant, a flame shot out.","The outlet sparked violently and caught fire with a crackling sound.","'Beep beep...'","The instruments beeped a few times before shutting down completely.","The lab-coated individuals inside the room immediately exclaimed in surprise and hurried to stomp out the fire with their feet and whatever else was nearby.","They seemed puzzled, wondering why the outlet had suddenly caught fire.","Little did they know, the 'arsonist' had come and gone without a trace.","At least, for the time being, the person on the table was safe.","She couldn't directly reveal herself to save them yet.","She didn't want to alert the enemy.","She could only create a minor 'accident' to disrupt their operation and give them something to 'busy' themselves with.","When they were busy, they wouldn't have time to harm others.","In the following rooms, similar inhumane experiments were underway.","Yun Xiaoxiao decided to take more drastic action. Disguised as a phantom, she swiftly moved through the labs, causing all their outlets and plugs to burn out.","Her methods were subtle.","It wouldn't look like intentional sabotage, just like a problem with the wiring.","In no time, the entire underground facility was filled with swearing and frantic activity.","Hearing the frustration and anger of those people, Yun Xiaoxiao felt delighted.","This was just as she wanted it.","Xiao Feng was also taken to a laboratory, where they began to strap him with various instruments.","Just as they prepared to inject him with anesthesia, the outlet in this room also caught fire, and with the commotion outside, they could only pause the procedure, merely cuffing Xiao Feng to the operating table with handcuffs.","While the others were busy putting out fires and fixing outlets, Yun Xiaoxiao came to Xiao Feng's side and whispered a few words in his ear.","Xiao Feng immediately stopped struggling and obediently laid down to rest.","Yun Xiaoxiao continued searching for Qu Xiaobei.","Strangely, even after searching through everything, she still hadn't found her!","Her brows furrowed tightly.","Could it be that something had already happened to her?"]},{"number":388,"title":"Chapter 388: Has Something Already Gone Wrong","paragraphs":["The moment she considered this possibility, a murderous glint filled her eyes.","If those people truly dared to harm Xiaobei, she would slaughter everyone in this entire place!","Suddenly, an idea struck her.","Could there be any hidden compartments or secret passages here?","Maybe because Qu Xiaobei possesses a more special ability, she was isolated and placed somewhere alone?","With renewed vigor, Yun Xiaoxiao immediately began searching again.","But just then, she suddenly sensed someone touching her original body.","Her heart skipped a beat, and she quickly closed her eyes to focus.","The next second, she returned to her own body.","Soul and flesh merged once more.","She opened her eyes swiftly.","She found a foreign man holding her arm, dragging her up from the ground while cursing under his breath.","The children around them looked at her with sympathetic eyes, as if she were about to suffer some unfair mistreatment.","A blindfold was placed over her eyes, and she was shoved out.","Following her memory, she deduced that they had taken her back to the laboratory she had visited earlier.","However, once they descended, they only paused briefly before continuing downward!","As expected, there was indeed a hidden room!","After walking further, they finally stopped.","They removed her blindfold and then left.","It was then that she realized she was in a room surrounded by white walls.","The room contained only a large, spotless bed, and nothing else.","Just as she was about to free herself from her restraints, she heard footsteps approaching the door.","Her movements paused.","Deciding to bide her time, she waited to see what the other person wanted to do.","The door opened, and a tall, handsome young man entered.","He appeared to be a mixed-race person, with features that hinted at Chinese heritage.","However, there was a vivid red handprint on his face, making him look somewhat ridiculous.","Despite his good looks, he exuded an uncomfortable aura.","Being looked at by him felt like being watched by a rat that lived in dark, damp conditions and fed on human flesh, causing an involuntary feeling of disgust.","The man closed the door and approached Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao kept her expression calm, but her heart remained on high alert.","In her previous life, although she hadn't personally experienced such things, she had heard of and even witnessed some hideous acts.","She wasn't sure if this man was that kind of pervert.","But the surroundings and the way he was looking at her made her suspect he was likely a psychopath.","Although she could hear his thoughts, they were in a foreign language.","This...","was quite frustrating!","She couldn't understand it!!!","Why couldn't everyone just speak Chinese?!","The man continued to stare at Yun Xiaoxiao's face, smiling with satisfaction, and then boldly scanned her body as if he had already stripped her naked.","His gaze was that of someone examining a delectable prey.","As soon as he got close, he began sniffing around Yun Xiaoxiao's vicinity in a remarkably perverted manner.","Then, he closed his eyes, looking utterly immersed in pleasure.","\"Mmm, not bad, little sister, you're quite good,\" he said, each word in broken Chinese.","Afterward, he took out a key and began unlocking Yun Xiaoxiao's handcuffs.","It seemed he was confident that even with her hands free, she couldn't cause any trouble.","\"Let’s go, little sister, I’ll take you to wash up, okay?\" He bent down, smiling warmly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","His appearance was that of a harmless, kind older brother.","If she were truly a child, and after being imprisoned and treated roughly, she might feel incredibly relieved and grateful upon encountering such a friendly, handsome older brother.","Then, she would be led into an endless abyss, devoured until there was nothing left, crying out to heaven and earth in vain, experiencing the darkest depths of humanity.","Yun Xiaoxiao silently gave an internal cold laugh.","Wash up?","And then what?","Acting?","Who couldn't do that?","She curved her lips, lifting her head to give him a wide, innocent, and pure smile.","\"Okay~\"","Seeing how easily Yun Xiaoxiao was fooled, the man felt extremely delighted.","He brought Yun Xiaoxiao to the right side of the wall.","Then, by pressing a spot on the smooth, seamless wall, a door appeared.","The door slid open from right to left, revealing the scene inside.","It was a bathroom!","Inside was a dried-up pool.","Neither too big nor too small, it was just enough for two adults.","He started filling the pool with water, all the while smiling and beckoning to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Come here, let me undress you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao leaned against the doorframe, looking casual.","She gently smiled, \"Sure.\"","The man slightly frowned.","Why did he feel that this little sister's smile was a bit strange?","It was still as adorable as before.","But...","somehow it felt different.","Just as he was feeling perplexed, the air in front of him suddenly rippled.","His eyes widened in shock.","Where did she go?!","The next second, he sensed imminent danger from behind.","\"Heh, not bad reaction speed,\" Yun Xiaoxiao praised without holding back.","But that didn't stop her from being one step ahead, using her evolved green vines to impale his chest.","\"You!\"","Before he could react, he already felt his life slipping away.","He was horrified.","He couldn't understand why Yun Xiaoxiao's abilities hadn't been nullified.","Why couldn't he fight back?","\"Shh, don't scream; it might make me unhappy~\" Yun Xiaoxiao silenced him with a gesture, her smile malicious.","While speaking, a layer of ice sprung from her fingertips, freezing his entire mouth solid.","The man's pupils dilated, but no sound could escape him.","He tried to attack Yun Xiaoxiao, but found his whole body bound by thick, sturdy vines.","No matter how much he struggled, he couldn't break free.","He angrily glared at the grinning Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Don’t worry, I’ll send you off properly.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao remained indifferent to his enraged gaze.","Instead, she scrutinized him from head to toe, finally fixing her gaze on a certain spot.","\"Before I send you off, let me give you a parting gift,\" she said with a chuckle.","The mischievous glint in her eyes hinted at something sinister.","Combined with her focused gaze, the man's face filled with fear, backing away with shaky legs.","He seemed to have guessed what Yun Xiaoxiao intended to do!","At this moment, he was filled with endless regret.","Why had he untied her handcuffs?!","And, who had set him up?","He didn't believe Yun Xiaoxiao had infiltrated on her own.","Instead, he thought someone must be plotting against him, deliberately sending her to his presence!","He trembled as he backed away.","Eventually, with nowhere left to go, he fell into the pool still filling with water.","Splash! He was completely drenched.","Utterly humiliated."]},{"number":389,"title":"Chapter 389: Handsome Psycho","paragraphs":["At that very moment, a deluge of ice cascaded from Yun Xiaoxiao's palm, hurtling toward the man's lower body.","In an instant, his entire lower half had transformed into an unyielding block of ice.","The man's face contorted in excruciating pain, his entire body shivering from the cold.","But that wasn't the end of it.","Yun Xiaoxiao flicked a relaxed finger, and with a resounding 'bang,' the once-solid ice pillar exploded into shards, scattering in all directions.","Among the flying shards, vivid splashes of blood and flesh were visible, making the scene horrifying.","Man: !!!","He glared with fury, his eyes widening in disbelief.","It was as if he were undergoing some unbearable torture.","Before he could even exhale, he was sent straight to the afterlife.","Yun Xiaoxiao dusted off her tiny hands, her expression one of utter disdain.","\"Scum like you deserve to be reduced to dust.\"","Killing someone like him felt like a humiliation to her very existence.","The man had quite a few abilities—at least seven, based on her estimation.","But while numerous, they weren't refined.","The highest among them was a Level Four Advanced Light Ability.","Clearly, he wasn't the right material for cultivation.","From the fact that he could wander in and out of here freely, and possessed so many rare abilities, it was evident that his identity was anything but ordinary.","Most likely, he was at a managerial level within this operation.","Yet, with such mediocre strength, it was clear he was the weak link.","No matter how vile his methods, his capabilities were just... so-so.","Yun Xiaoxiao was about to wash her hands and head out to find Qu Xiaobei when she suddenly heard a familiar voice.","\"I’m telling you, let me go right now, or when Xiaoxiao shows up, you’re all finished!\"","That was...","Qu Xiaobei's voice!","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes lit up.","From the direction of the voice, it seemed Qu Xiaobei was just next door!","She instantly teleported over.","The setup here was similar to the previous room.","There was a clean white bed.","Qu Xiaobei stood boldly on the bed, hands on her hips, shouting at the top of her lungs.","Her demeanor was incredibly defiant.","Yun Xiaoxiao was in awe.","On someone else's turf, and yet so brazen—Qu Xiaobei was truly...","Extraordinary!","She couldn’t even begin to fathom where her confidence came from.","A soft chuckle escaped her lips.","The sound wasn't loud, but Qu Xiaobei caught it.","She turned her head, her face lighting up with joy.","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","She jumped off the bed.","Rushing over, she hugged Yun Xiaoxiao tightly.","Taller than Yun Xiaoxiao, she nonetheless nestled her head into Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder.","\"I knew you'd come! I just knew it!\"","She spoke while sobbing, tears streaming down her face.","Her father was right—she had to trust Xiaoxiao.","See? Xiaoxiao had come!","Yun Xiaoxiao gently patted her back, her tone indulgent.","\"Don’t be scared. I’m here.\"","But the more reassuring words Yun Xiaoxiao offered, the harder Qu Xiaobei cried.","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but sigh.","\"Alright, if you keep crying, I’m leaving and not taking you with me,\" she threatened lightly.","At the ripe age of still being considered a child, and yet she was tasked with taking care of a child even older than herself.","It was... quite the predicament...","This ultimatum worked wonders. Qu Xiaobei immediately choked back her sobs, her wails ceasing.","Yun Xiaoxiao found it odd. Despite Qu Xiaobei's relentless ruckus, no one outside seemed to care; there wasn’t a single person who had bothered to step inside.","\"Did they... hurt you?\"","She asked tentatively.","She couldn’t bring herself to be too direct.","After all, Qu Xiaobei was truly just a child.","She feared that asking too bluntly might hurt Qu Xiaobei's fragile psyche.","Judging from the pervert's actions earlier, he was undoubtedly a pedophile.","And given how at ease he was in committing such acts, it was clear he’d done so many times before.","Qu Xiaobei, trapped here, likely faced the risk of...","So, she was deeply concerned.","Not asking wasn’t an option either—if something truly had happened, the resulting psychological trauma needed to be addressed promptly. Suppressing it could lead to more significant issues.","\"Hurt me?\"","Qu Xiaobei tilted her head, as if trying to recall.","\"Well... earlier, there was this handsome older brother who wanted to take off my clothes, but how could I let him do that!","Dad always said that a girl’s clothes aren’t something men can just take off—especially not guys.","So I bit him.","He got mad and tried to hit me.","But—boom!—that slap landed right back on his face.\"","Thinking about the scene, Qu Xiaobei couldn’t help but giggle gleefully.","Yun Xiaoxiao was taken aback.","\"Your abilities didn't disappear?\"","Weren’t you injected with that serum that dissolves abilities?","\"Nope.\"","Qu Xiaobei shook her head matter-of-factly.","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly realized.","Of course, if they tried to inject her with a syringe, given Qu Xiaobei’s abilities, the syringe probably wouldn’t even penetrate.","Instead, it would bounce back onto them.","Meaning, despite being kidnapped and locked up, those people couldn’t actually do anything to her.","An immense sense of relief washed over Yun Xiaoxiao.","She grabbed Qu Xiaobei’s hand and vanished on the spot.","Reappearing moments later, they were in a small room where Xiao Feng was being held.","She swiftly dispatched the three white-coated researchers inside.","Taken completely by surprise, the researchers hadn’t anticipated her sudden arrival.","Before they could even scream for help, they were dead.","She found keys near the operating table and hurriedly unlocked Xiao Feng's handcuffs.","No sooner had she done so than someone spotted them.","Pointing in disbelief, the person shouted.","Without a second thought, Yun Xiaoxiao grabbed Qu Xiaobei and Xiao Feng and quickly teleported away.","Just as they left, the entire basement erupted with an ear-piercing alarm.","The sound reverberated through all three floors.","Everyone was jolted by the alarm.","They knew something major had just gone down.","The few underlings of Lei Ming, still locked in their cages, exchanged glances.","They suspected Yun Xiaoxiao had been discovered.","Anxiety filled their hearts.","Oh no, the young Base Leader mustn’t come to harm!","Yun Xiaoxiao would have never expected her teleportation to fail!","Indeed, just as she was about to whisk Xiao Feng and Qu Xiaobei to safety, she was met with an irresistible force.","Ultimately, only she and Qu Xiaobei managed to escape.","Xiao Feng had vanished without a trace!","Yun Xiaoxiao was horrified.","What on earth was going on?","Her expression darkened as she glanced at the building behind her.","They now found themselves outside an ancient-looking castle in the suburbs.","The ground was littered with the blackened corpses of foreign zombie-like bodies.","She swiftly scanned the castle grounds, finding no imminent danger present.","Then, she urgently turned to Qu Xiaobei. \"Xiaobei, stay here for a moment.\"","They had already distanced themselves far from that sinister lair.","Qu Xiaobei should be safe here.","\"Xiaoxiao, are you going back for Xiao Feng?\" Qu Xiaobei asked anxiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","Her gaze grew heavy as she looked into the distance."]},{"number":390,"title":"Chapter 390: Another Accident Occurred","paragraphs":["Qu Xiaobei nodded seriously, \"Okay, I'll definitely stay here and wait for you! You also need to be careful!\"","She knew that if she followed Yun Xiaoxiao, she would only be a hindrance.","Although her ability was unique, she wasn't good at attacking.","If others deliberately guarded against her and trapped her, even if they tied her up, although it would be painful for them, she would still end up being captured.","In that case, Xiaoxiao would have to save her again, which wouldn't be good.","So, it was better for her to just stay here and wait.","Yun Xiaoxiao handed some food to Qu Xiaobei and made her wait in a safe, empty room before leaving.","When she returned, she didn't immediately show herself but hid in an inconspicuous spot behind a small hill nearby, preparing to contact Lu Chen and the others.","She had taken Qu Xiaobei away and killed one person, so she assumed things inside must be in chaos now.","She didn't know where the energy that had restrained her earlier came from or why Xiao Feng had been captured.","But one thing was certain: there must be a very powerful ability user behind this!","Returning now was extremely risky.","Although she wasn't afraid, she worried that if she appeared, the person behind it all might harm Xiao Feng.","As long as she didn't show herself, those people, out of the desire to catch her, wouldn't really do anything to Xiao Feng.","Instead, they would keep interrogating him, trying to get information about her from his mouth.","Once she appeared, Xiao Feng's value as a hostage would be greatly reduced.","If the person behind it all acted out of anger or to provoke her, affecting her mindset, and did something harmful to Xiao Feng, that would be disastrous.","Moreover, if she entered now, she would delay the timing of meeting up with Lu Chen and the others.","The resulting losses would be even greater.","Besides Xiao Feng, there were many others waiting for rescue.","From her space, she took out a palm-sized, round box.","This was given to her by Bai Hongting.","They had one of their own.","The device claimed that if the two instruments were within a thousand meters of each other, they would display red dots.","Using this, they could successfully rendezvous with the other party.","The functionality was similar to a positioning device.","But the benefit was that it could still function without internet.","This was invented by someone from Bai Hongting's team, who was known for their expertise in developing various electronic instruments.","It was developed after the apocalypse.","Small teams from their base who went on missions outside would always take one along.","It made it easier for the rescue team to find them in case of an emergency.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned on the device.","After waiting for a minute, there was no activity.","Just as she was about to give up waiting and attempt to rescue people on her own again, two small red dots suddenly appeared in the upper right and lower left corners of the screen.","The red dot in the upper right corner was moving steadily.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","They were here!","Worried that the arrival of Lu Chen and the others might attract too much attention, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly teleported towards their location.","After a few moves, she successfully met up with them.","The vanguard was a series of military fighter jets.","A total of twenty-five, presenting an impressive sight!","Behind them followed a dozen modified helicopters.","The people who descended wore the exclusive military-green combat uniforms of the Chinese special forces.","Whether men or women, everyone stood tall and proud, exuding an imposing presence.","Visually, it was awe-inspiring.","There were many who had come.","Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Nie Yizhou, Zheng Yuner, Ci Wan, Lei Ming, and others.","Peng Shaowei, Jiang Huai, Tang Jun, and their trusted subordinates from the base.","Bai Hongting and his extraordinary ability-user special forces.","As well as some of the most talented individuals from other bases.","There were over a hundred in total.","All handpicked elites.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao was observing their uniforms, Ling Jing explained, \"There were many people, from different regions and bases, so to avoid any confusion and harming each other, we all wore the same clothing.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded, indicating she understood.","\"Hey, did you see Xiao Feng and the others?\"","Nie Yizhou stepped forward, his tone somewhat anxious.","The others also looked at her with concern in their eyes.","Yun Xiaoxiao truthfully recounted what she had seen earlier.","Of course, she highlighted the key points.","There wasn't much time to waste!","After explaining the essentials, she also shared her speculations and plans.","Everyone else nodded in agreement.","\"Alright, let's proceed as you suggested.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was the only one who had been inside and knew the situation better.","Moreover, in a short time, they couldn't think of a better plan.","After leaving Bai Hongting and Peng Shaowei to handle strategic deployment and personnel arrangements, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded at Nie Yizhou.","Nie Yizhou also returned a firm look.","In the next moment, the two, along with Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yun, vanished from the spot.","They directly appeared on top of the tallest building in the base.","As soon as they landed, the four began unrestrainedly causing chaos.","\"Boom!\"","A car was struck by lightning and exploded.","\"Boom boom!\"","A building caught fire, flames raging and consuming everything inside.","\"Boom boom boom!\"","A cloud of black mist rose, flipping two oncoming men over.","\"Boom boom boom boom!\"","The ground trembled and buckled as if a massive earthquake had struck, breaking and tossing the earth in all directions, turning the once-smooth ground into disarray.","Cars, supplies, and other objects on the ground began to roll about.","The scene was chaotic and intense!","Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou exchanged glances; while Lu Chen and the others continued to wreak havoc, the two quietly slipped away.","The commotion here was too loud and quickly drew the attention of others.","A large group of people rushed out from all directions.","If Yun Xiaoxiao were there, she would have noticed that one man looked exactly like the pervert she had killed in the underground room earlier!","However, although the facial features were the same, the demeanor and aura were entirely different.","This man exuded the aura of a powerful figure!","While most people were drawn to the chaos, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou teleported to the first floor of the dungeon.","As soon as they appeared, they quickly vanished, leaving only a shadow.","Eventually, they directly arrived at the iron cage where Lei Ming's men were held.","Upon their sudden appearance, Lei Ming's men showed shocked expressions.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't care about their reactions; with Nie Yizhou, she grabbed a few and quickly took them away.","This all happened in just a few seconds.","Even the person monitoring from behind the surveillance screens didn't react in time.","By the time they realized it, the iron cage was empty, with nothing left inside.","This time, everything went smoothly.","Neither Yun Xiaoxiao nor Nie Yizhou encountered the mysterious force that had trapped them before, and they safely brought everyone back to Bai Hongting's location.","So, her decision to first cause chaos and create a diversion was correct!","The person with the mysterious power must have been drawn away by the commotion.","This was excellent."]},{"number":391,"title":"Chapter 391: Break the Venue","paragraphs":["So be it...","Then let's move on to the next step!","Elvis stared intently at Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yuner who were standing on high ground. His expression was cold and ruthless, and the atmosphere around him was chilling.","He twisted his neck, closed his eyes, and let out a disdainful cold laugh.","These insects!","If they came here to die, then he would gladly oblige!","He let out a dark hum, waved his hand, and the group behind him immediately charged towards Lu Chen and the others.","He whispered something to the person beside him, and that individual quickly made their way towards the dungeon.","As the figure disappeared into the entrance of the dungeon, another person rushed to Elvis's side, visibly nervous, and spoke to him urgently.","Upon hearing this, Elvis's expression grew even more gloomy.","Just as he was about to step towards the dungeon, several screams echoed from behind him.","They were all cries from his own men.","He whirled around and stared at Lu Chen and the others.","In that moment, he realized that the trio wasn't ordinary.","They were strong!","A destructive and predatory glint flared up in his eyes.","If mad scientist Dr. Xiu Jie was a lunatic obsessed with studying various special mutated zombies, then Elvis was an extremist fanatic who was eager to study how to appropriate the abilities of those with superpowers.","Compared to his brother's perverted hobby, Elvis's tastes were even more bloodthirsty and cruel.","He loved studying the human brain and organs!","During his university days, he used his handsome appearance and fake kind demeanor to lure young girls and boys into the basement of his home.","He imprisoned them, sliced open their bodies, and enthusiastically studied every nerve and organ...","Later, his secret was discovered by the grandmother who raised him. To prevent her from reporting him, he cruelly murdered her as well.","It could be said that he was an evil person through and through!","In his previous life, during the post-apocalypse, he and his brother took in a family of three.","Initially, he planned to use them as lab rats for his experiments.","But the parents unexpectedly manifested abilities.","Seeing their magical powers, he grew crazed with desire to possess them.","So, one night, he and his brother with their equally wicked intentions drugged the family of three.","The fate of the family was predictable.","After torturing the parents to death, he still couldn't figure out how to transfer someone else's abilities to himself.","But this act felt like opening a gate to a new world.","From then on, he was unstoppable!","He and his brother, continuing to appear as kind and gentle, took in people fleeing for their lives.","Who would have thought that the handsome, smiling brothers were such cruel and twisted demons?!","Naturally, those people became their \"meals.\"","After roughly nine years, his research finally yielded some results.","But it was precisely at this time that their safe house was attacked by a horde of zombies.","In his despair, he was bitten to death by a powerful mutated zombie.","When he opened his eyes again, he found himself back three months before the apocalypse.","So, he decided to accomplish all the goals he hadn't fulfilled in his previous life in this one!","He became even more ruthless in killing.","He seized their assets for himself.","Then, he started constructing bases, stockpiling food and guns, recruiting soldiers.","He used drugs to control some strong retired soldiers to serve him.","So, after the apocalypse, he thrived.","He continued his research.","With the experience accumulated from the previous life, he took fewer detours and continuously upgraded his research, achieving the most ideal results.","Then, he organized a large-scale operation to kidnap local abilities, enhancing his team's strength.","As his team grew stronger, he provoked various major bases in the country.","He forcibly seized their resources.","Of course, those he coveted were not spared.","For others, he simply ordered them killed.","Even ordinary people, children, and the elderly were not spared!","He was a true antisocial individual.","The more people who died, the more excited he became.","He was a twisted and cruel man!","Afterward, his ambitions grew even larger.","He set his sights on other countries...","Elvis stared intently at Lu Chen and the others, his lips curling into a chilling smile.","With just three people, they wanted to destroy his place.","Dream on!","His gaze locked onto Lu Chen. The next moment, Lu Chen felt his energy diminishing.","He was startled.","This was...","The Absolute Domain?!","His brow furrowed, and he quickly gathered purple lightning, shattering the lightning energy ball that suddenly surged towards him.","'Boom!'","The collision of the two energies produced a loud bang.","The air around them trembled.","Both Lu Chen and Elvis were forced back several steps.","But Lu Chen took one more step back than Elvis.","His eyes darkened.","The Absolute Domain was indeed tyrannical!","Elvis's expression also didn't look good.","Even with the Absolute Domain, the opponent only took one more step back than him!","Damn it!","This meant that without the Absolute Domain, the opponent's strength would be far superior to his!","Realizing this, Elvis's nails dug into his flesh.","Why was this happening?","He had been faster than everyone else!","He had transferred the abilities of the strongest he had encountered to himself.","If not for the fact that the number of abilities a human body could carry was limited.","At most, nine abilities could be accommodated.","Otherwise, he would have had even more abilities!","Even so, his abilities were the most numerous among all humans so far.","Moreover, he had been the first to consume the evolutionary serum.","There was no reason for someone from a backward country to be ahead of him by so much!","Where had he gone wrong?!","He absolutely refused to allow anyone to be stronger than him!","This person, had to die!","His gaze grew sharper, and a murderous intent filled his eyes as he stared at Lu Chen.","He maximized the control of the Absolute Domain and unleashed another powerful attack towards Lu Chen.","Lu Chen let out a cold smirk.","The Absolute Domain was indeed formidable.","But...","His expression turned icy. In the next moment, a white light enveloped his entire body.","The light expanded outward, forming a transparent circular space.","Elvis's attack, upon entering the circular space, weakened in power.","Originally, with the Absolute Domain's influence, he had the upper hand in combat with Lu Chen. But now, the weakened attack was shattered by Lu Chen in one move.","Elvis was shocked.","What was happening?","Why, within his Absolute Domain, did the opponent's strength not decrease, while his own attack got weaker?!"]},{"number":392,"title":"Chapter 392: Elvis's Quirks","paragraphs":["What Lu Chen didn't know was that his light-based abilities had undergone a qualitative transformation through continuous evolution and his own insights.","The transparent circle he had formed was, in essence, akin to an Absolute Domain.","Any attacks from outsiders entering this domain would be significantly weakened.","Although Elvis had also activated his Absolute Domain, it only served to weaken Lu Chen's attacks.","Similarly, Lu Chen's light-based domain would also diminish Elvis's offensive power.","In this standoff, the outcome would ultimately depend on their raw strength.","And in terms of raw strength, Lu Chen was undoubtedly superior.","Elvis's expression was fierce, his heart filled with indignation.","In his country, he was unquestionably the strongest!","Yet now, some random person had appeared and was able to defy him.","How could this be?","He soared into the air, launching a relentless barrage of attacks at Lu Chen.","His abilities shifted effortlessly—thunder, fire, ice, light, darkness...","Lu Chen's face remained cold. \"If you had given these abilities to someone with higher talent, perhaps I wouldn't stand a chance today. But you... you're not up to the task.\"","His tone was icy, laced with disdain.","Elvis possessed many abilities, but his talent was lacking.","While he was stronger than the average person in each ability, in Lu Chen's eyes, it was nothing remarkable.","Aside from the Absolute Domain, which was slightly impressive, the rest were pitiful.","When two individuals with the same abilities and equal doses of evolution serum were compared, the one with higher talent would inevitably progress further.","If Elvis had distributed these powerful abilities among his more talented subordinates—such as the black man currently fighting Ling Jing—he might have truly dominated the world.","But he hadn't.","He had selfishly hoarded all the powerful abilities for himself.","Moreover, the strength of his subordinates revealed the truth.","While he had transferred abilities to them, he had strictly controlled their power, ensuring none could surpass him.","Such a selfish and shortsighted person was destined to fail.","\"Heh, there are only three of you. Even if you're strong, what does it matter? In the end, you'll die!\"","Even with sheer numbers, they couldn't possibly lose.","Elvis sneered, his Chinese broken and awkward.","When he uttered the word \"die,\" his teeth clenched tightly.","With a wave of his hand, he ordered his subordinates to surround Ling Jing and the others, launching a coordinated assault.","On the ground, one of his men looked anxious, as if he had urgent news to report.","But since Elvis was still floating in the air, fully focused on the battle, the man was left pacing like an ant on a hot pan.","Finally, unable to wait any longer, he shouted up at the sky, reporting everything that had happened in the dungeon.","Upon hearing this, Elvis froze mid-action.","Then, his eyes burned with rage as he glared at Lu Chen and the others.","\"You were distracting me?!\"","His subordinate had just informed him that everyone in the dungeon had been rescued!","Even the fire-ability man he had sent to capture as leverage had been freed!","\"Congratulations, you figured it out,\" Lu Chen replied coolly.","Elvis: !!!","\"Shit!\"","He roared in fury.","\"Kill them!\"","His eyes were bloodshot, filled with a desire to tear Lu Chen and his companions apart.","The attacks grew even more ferocious.","As the saying goes, even ants can bring down an elephant with enough numbers.","Lu Chen's group consisted of only three people, while Elvis had over a thousand.","No matter how powerful Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yuner were, under the relentless assault from all sides, even they couldn't avoid making mistakes.","All three were injured to varying degrees.","Watching Lu Chen and the others gradually falter, Elvis felt a surge of satisfaction.","He would make sure these three suffered a fate worse than death!","But just then, a loud roar echoed from the distant sky.","Elvis and his men instinctively looked up.","Dozens of military fighter jets were speeding toward them.","In the brief moment of confusion, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou suddenly appeared, whisking Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yuner away from the scene.","It happened in the blink of an eye. By the time Elvis and his men regained their senses, the trio had vanished.","Elvis's eyes bulged with rage, veins popping on his neck.","Who were these people?!","Everything had been meticulously planned, one step after another!","If the sound of the fighter jets hadn't distracted him, he wouldn't have been caught off guard.","Even if someone had tried to rescue the trio, he could have activated a barrier to trap them.","But...","The enemy had calculated everything with precision, anticipating his every move and reaction!","Damn it!","This was utterly infuriating!!!","Elvis seethed, his anger threatening to consume the world.","But he didn't have much time to vent his frustration.","The fighter jets were already circling above the base!","Without hesitation, they unleashed a devastating bombardment.","These jets had been heavily modified, and their firepower was unimaginable.","Amidst the deafening explosions, a relentless barrage of shells rained down on the ground.","Smoke and debris filled the air, and screams of agony echoed as bodies were torn apart.","The number of survivors dwindled rapidly.","Elvis watched in horror as the base he had painstakingly built was mercilessly destroyed. His blood boiled with rage.","\"Fire!\"","He bellowed at his subordinates.","He had stockpiled a considerable arsenal of cannons, originally intended as a contingency against potential zombie hordes.","But now, he had no choice but to deploy them prematurely.","Following his orders, his men dodged the falling shells and rushed to the armory, pushing out cannon after cannon.","But as soon as they were in position, bombs rained down from above.","\"Boom!\"","The cannons and the men operating them were instantly obliterated.","Elvis was so enraged he nearly passed out.","His expression turned dark and sinister. He knew that if he stayed any longer, even his own survival would be at risk.","For now, the only option was to retreat.","But one day, he would have his revenge!","He glared at the fighter jets relentlessly bombarding the base and ordered all surviving members to evacuate immediately.","Out of the thousand-strong, meticulously trained army of ability users, fewer than three hundred remained unharmed—and even that number was rapidly shrinking.","Elvis's heart bled with every loss.","Under the hail of artillery fire, he led his remaining men in a desperate escape.","But the fighter jets pursued them relentlessly, showing no intention of letting them go.","Elvis's eyes were bloodshot.","He realized that with so many subordinates, their group was too large a target. Continuing like this would only lead to certain death.","A dark glint flashed in his eyes.","He directed his men to flee in one direction, then quickly turned and fled in the opposite direction himself.","Subordinates could be replaced.","But he... he could not die!"]},{"number":393,"title":"Chapter 393: About to Explode with Anger","paragraphs":["As a reincarnated individual, Elvis knew the importance of having secret passages in a base.","In critical moments, they could be lifesaving.","So, he hired two separate teams to dig two secret tunnels in different locations.","Once the tunnels were completed, he secretly executed all the workers involved.","Thus, in this world, only he knew about the existence of these secret passages within the base.","Originally, they were meant to protect against a zombie horde.","But now, they had become a great help to him.","He quickly made his way to a corner, yanked out a small sapling from the ground, and dug with his hands a few times, revealing a round black cover about the size of a small bowl.","He lifted the cover, revealing a red button inside.","\"Boom!\"","Artillery fire struck the building behind him, and chunks of debris rained down around him.","Cursing under his breath, he quickly pressed the red button.","Instantly, the grassy patch of land split open like magic, revealing a downward-leading secret passage.","He knocked aside a boulder that was about to fall on his head and hurriedly entered the tunnel.","As soon as he stepped inside, the grassy patch closed back up, leaving no trace of its movement unless one looked closely.","Elvis breathed a sigh of relief as he entered the tunnel.","But soon, a fierce glint flashed in his eyes.","He would definitely make them pay for this—double!","The tunnel was spacious, and he had stockpiled plenty of food and daily necessities here.","He could survive here alone for a hundred years without a problem.","He took off his dirtied clothes and was about to change into clean ones.","\"Your place is quite nice. Since you've been so generous, I’ll take the trouble to claim it for myself.\"","At that moment, a soft yet chilling child's voice suddenly rang out behind him.","His expression changed drastically, and he spun around.","A group of people stood before him.","There were eight in total—five men, two women, and... a little girl.","His pupils contracted sharply.","How had they found this place?!","He turned to flee, and for a moment, he thought he had succeeded.","But just as he was feeling relieved, the group appeared behind him again.","\"Hi, we meet again.\"","\"You’re quite fast, aren’t you?\"","\"Are you tired? Need some water?\"","\"Still running?\"","The taunting voices echoed in his ears like a haunting melody.","He was going insane!","How on earth had they managed to track him down?!","The tunnel had many forks and traps, yet these people could effortlessly locate him, as if they were ghosts!","What he didn’t know was that Yun Xiaoxiao possessed another ability: Soul Lock.","Once she activated this ability, she could clearly sense the presence of all living beings within a one-kilometer radius.","In other words, her mind would conjure a map-like image, where every living creature—human, animal, or mutated plant—would appear as small green dots.","She could easily perceive the location and movement of each dot.","So, to her, Elvis was completely exposed.","No matter where he ran, Yun Xiaoxiao could easily find him.","Letting him run was just a way to torment him both physically and mentally.","After all, he was going to die anyway, but letting him die too easily would be too kind.","Someone like him didn’t deserve a peaceful death.","Elvis’s eyes hardened with resolve.","If he couldn’t escape, then he wouldn’t.","Even in death, he would take someone with him!","His gaze locked onto Yun Xiaoxiao.","She would be the one!","In an instant, a surge of powerful energy erupted from his body, aimed directly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Do I look like the easiest target?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao blinked innocently, a look of helplessness on her face.","Sigh, it was all because of her appearance.","She was actually very strong...","To make him realize his mistake, Yun Xiaoxiao casually waved her hand.","\"Boom!\"","\"Ugh!\"","Elvis spat out a mouthful of blood and was sent flying, crashing heavily to the ground.","He stared at Yun Xiaoxiao in disbelief, his eyes filled with terror.","She had not only blocked his attack but had amplified its power twofold and sent it back at him!","Yun Xiaoxiao slowly walked up to him, looking down at him with a cold gaze.","He tried to move but found his body completely immobilized, as if locked in place.","This was due to Yun Xiaoxiao’s most recently awakened ability: Body Freeze.","This ability could instantly immobilize a person.","It was similar to her \"Stinky Fart\" ability, but without the need for flatulence.","However, its usage conditions were strict.","She had to be within one meter of the target, and it could only target one person at a time, lasting for just one minute.","\"Do you regret choosing the wrong person now?\"","\"Too late for regrets, though.\"","\"Now, let’s have some fun.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly as a knife materialized in her palm. She swiftly stabbed it into Elvis’s right wrist.","With a flick, she pulled out a bloody tendon.","\"Ah!\"","Elvis let out a bloodcurdling scream of pain.","But that wasn’t the end.","Yun Xiaoxiao proceeded to sever the tendons in his other hand and both legs.","Blood pooled around him, and he looked like he was bathing in it—a gruesome sight.","The pain coursed through every nerve in his body, shaking his very soul.","\"Xiao Feng, do you want to vent some anger?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao turned with a smile, looking at Xiao Feng.","Xiao Feng raised an eyebrow.","\"Of course.\"","He stepped forward and took the knife from Yun Xiaoxiao’s hand.","\"Me too.\"","Lei Ming stepped forward, his eyes blazing with fury as he glared at Elvis.","When he saw the rescued companions, each missing limbs or otherwise mutilated, his rage had already reached its peak.","These monsters were utterly inhuman!","\"Alright, then you two can have some fun with him.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao walked aside, her eyes gleaming with excitement, eager to see what would happen next.","Elvis’s heart trembled with fear.","At this moment, he realized something profound.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t the weakest.","On the contrary, she might be the most powerful among them all.","And the most brutal!","With a sadistic sense of humor that made death seem like a mercy!","As Xiao Feng and Lei Ming closed in, he felt a pang of fear.","But what good was fear now?","When he had dissected countless people to satisfy his twisted research desires, he hadn’t cared if they were afraid.","When he had imprisoned, tortured, and forcibly stripped others of their abilities, he hadn’t cared about their fear.","The atrocities he, his brother, and his subordinates had committed were so heinous that even a hundred deaths wouldn’t be enough to atone for them.","What right did he have to be afraid now?"]},{"number":394,"title":"Chapter 394: Do I Look Like the Easiest Target","paragraphs":["Finally, Elvis died in excruciating pain.","Yun Xiaoxiao scavenged all the supplies from the secret passage before leading everyone out.","Once outside, they hurried to Bai Hongting's location.","Bai Hongting was leading others in intercepting and killing Elvis's remaining henchmen.","This den of evil was to be destroyed, and destroyed thoroughly.","After all, there wasn’t a single good person among them.","They were all heartless, ruthless individuals who devoured others without a trace.","Although Elvis's remaining forces were numerous, they were no match for Yun Xiaoxiao and her team.","Without the incapacitating smoke and the blue liquid that nullified their supernatural abilities, they were nothing to fear.","Even though they had consumed the evolution serum, it was far inferior to what Yun Xiaoxiao had sold to others.","The two were simply not on the same level.","What was there to compare?","A massive den of evil ultimately became a pile of ruins.","All the research equipment and potions were set ablaze.","The \"devils\" inside finally found their \"destiny,\" meeting their maker.","As for the supplies Elvis had painstakingly stockpiled, they naturally fell into the hands of Yun Xiaoxiao and her team.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t plan to keep everything for herself; she was quite generous.","She intended to distribute the confiscated supplies fairly among the bases that had participated in the operation, based on their contributions.","As for the people from other countries who had been rescued, Bai Hongting and Peng Shaowei kept a portion of their share of the supplies for them.","Then, they let them go on their own.","That was all they could do to help.","How they would survive, whether they would return to their own countries, and how they would get back—those were matters they would have to figure out for themselves.","After picking up Qu Xiaobei, Yun Xiaoxiao and the group prepared to head back to China.","Lei Ming stood guiltily beside his companions who had lost their limbs, his entire being radiating a low, oppressive aura.","Surviving in this apocalyptic world was already difficult.","Now that they had lost their ability to move and fight, what would become of them?","If he hadn’t left at that time, would things have turned out differently?","Lei Ming was trapped in a spiral of guilt, unable to break free.","\"Boss, don’t be like this. We’re fine, really.\"","\"Yeah, seeing you like this makes us feel worse.\"","Seeing Lei Ming in such a state, the others couldn’t help but try to comfort him.","Seeing his companions comforting him only made Lei Ming feel even worse.","Yun Xiaoxiao had noticed the situation earlier.","She walked over, pursing her lips.","\"Don’t be so pessimistic. There’s actually a way to restore their lost limbs.\"","\"What way?\"","Lei Ming immediately looked up from his guilt, his eyes burning with hope as he stared at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao briefly recounted what had happened with Bai Ruo.","\"So, as long as we find a mutated octopus, there’s a chance to regrow limbs?!\"","Lei Ming’s eyes lit up.","A glimmer of hope also appeared in the eyes of the others.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. \"Exactly. So instead of moping around, you should pull yourselves together and think about what to do next.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao’s words instantly gave everyone hope.","The atmosphere shifted immediately.","What had been a scene of despair and gloom now brimmed with determination.","Soon, everyone packed up and boarded the planes.","When they had first arrived, Bai Hongting had anticipated the large number of people they would rescue and had prepared several helicopters.","Although it was still a bit crowded, they managed to fit everyone.","Fighter jets escorted them from the front and back, with the helicopters sandwiched in between.","The planes took off, flying in a grand formation toward China.","Along the way, they could see the scarred landscape below.","This disaster hadn’t just affected China; the entire world had been left in ruins.","No place had been spared.","On the plane.","\"Can you be gentler?!\"","Xiao Feng cried out in pain, glaring at Nie Yizhou.","Nie Yizhou pouted, \"Alright, alright. You’re so delicate. Anyone would think you’re a fragile little girl.\"","Xiao Feng: !!!","\"I don’t want you to treat me anymore. Ling Jing, you do it.\"","He snatched the medicine from Nie Yizhou and shoved it into the hands of Ling Jing, who was resting with his eyes closed.","Ling Jing opened his eyes and glanced down at the ointment now resting on his chest.","The next second, a hand quickly reached over and took the ointment back.","\"Don’t bother Ling Jing with such a small matter. Do you think he’s the meticulous type?\"","Ling Jing: ...","If you want to apply it yourself, just say so. Was it necessary to insult him?","What a pain!","He couldn’t be bothered to deal with these two anymore and closed his eyes again, putting on his headphones.","His demeanor made it clear he didn’t want to be disturbed.","\"Big brother, is your injury feeling better?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked up at Lu Chen.","Lu Chen nodded. \"Yeah, much better.\"","He had sustained some minor injuries during the fight with Elvis and his men.","But these injuries were nothing to him.","Hadn’t he suffered worse?","There had been times when he was on the brink of death, but he had pulled through.","So these minor wounds were hardly worth mentioning.","The plane sped through the sky.","From the U.S. to China, they had to cross a vast expanse of ocean.","At that moment, they were flying over the sea.","\"Something’s wrong!\"","Suddenly, Zheng Yuner, who was piloting the helicopter, leaned forward slightly, her expression turning serious.","In Yunzhong City, regardless of gender, anyone who frequently went on missions had to learn how to operate various vehicles, including helicopters.","So, Zheng Yuner was quite skilled at flying helicopters.","As soon as she spoke, Yun Xiaoxiao immediately went over.","\"What’s going on?\" she asked.","Zheng Yuner didn’t reply but instead steered the helicopter slightly to the left.","Instantly, the situation ahead came into view.","The fighter jets at the front were swaying unsteadily in mid-air, teetering as if they were about to crash.","The helicopters that followed soon began to experience the same issue.","At that moment, one of the fighter jets lost control and plummeted straight toward the ocean.","Fortunately, someone used their supernatural ability to stabilize the jet.","But the next second, several other fighter jets began to fall as well.","\"What the hell is going on?!\"","Nie Yizhou exclaimed in shock.","Yun Xiaoxiao also had no idea what was happening.","But the most urgent task now was to prevent the situation from worsening and to save lives!","\"Yuner, don’t fly any closer. The air currents up ahead must be unstable.\"","Zheng Yuner understood the gravity of the situation.","She nodded seriously. \"Don’t worry.\"","\"Nie Yizhou, go inform the people in the other planes and tell them not to approach the front.\"","\"Got it.\"","After giving these brief instructions, Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Nie Yizhou disappeared."]},{"number":395,"title":"Chapter 395: Strange Air Currents","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao hovered in mid-air as a thick vine shot out rapidly, heading toward a fighter jet that was about to crash into the water.","The jet was instantly entangled by the vine.","It hung precariously above the water, stabilizing just in time to avoid disaster.","The other jets were also being held by Ling Jing, Lu Chen, Peng Shaowei, Jiang Huai, Tang Jun, and their subordinates, who worked together to keep them afloat.","Bai Hongting was the first to notice something was wrong and the first to rescue the initial falling jet.","Now, beads of sweat formed on his forehead.","Standing at the aircraft door, he shouted:","“This can’t go on. There seems to be an inexplicable magnetic field in this area, interfering with machinery and increasing the weight of objects above it.”","Earlier, he hadn’t noticed, but now he could feel the growing weight in his hands.","“If this continues, we’ll all be overwhelmed and fall into the sea.”","His words sent a chill through everyone.","They, too, began to sense the increasing strain on their arms.","It was taking more and more energy to keep the falling jets from crashing.","This was undeniably dangerous!","Whether it was running out of energy or falling into the ocean, the consequences were dire.","Everyone knew that the ocean was no longer a place to approach lightly.","Let alone fall into.","Since the widespread mutation of plants and animals, the ocean had become one of the most perilous places on Earth.","The fish, seaweed, and other marine life had evolved through constant reproduction, predation, and mutation, becoming terrifyingly dangerous.","If they fell in, they’d likely be devoured in moments, leaving nothing but bones behind.","Perhaps this strange magnetic field was the work of some mutated sea creature lurking below.","Its goal? To wait for them to fall and become its meal!","Bai Hongting’s words left everyone grim-faced.","They knew he was right.","“Let’s try to avoid this area and fly in another direction,” someone suggested.","The idea was met with unanimous agreement.","The ocean was vast, offering plenty of directions to fly.","Perhaps only this specific area was problematic.","If they could bypass it, they might be safe.","So, the unaffected helicopters and fighter jets split into two groups, flying in different directions.","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brow.","She was worried.","But for now, this seemed like the only option.","They couldn’t just stay suspended here indefinitely.","Even if they wanted to, the fuel in the jets wouldn’t allow it.","As the jets adjusted their course and flew toward new areas,","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly pulled the troubled jets back and lifted them higher into the air.","With the combined efforts of the pilots and the team, the jets resumed normal flight.","But just then...","Disaster struck!","The jets that had tried to fly around the area all experienced the same issues, losing control and plummeting toward the ocean.","The situation was urgent, and the number of falling jets was overwhelming. Though Yun Xiaoxiao and the others reacted quickly, managing to save some, two fighter jets and three helicopters still crashed into the sea.","Fortunately, the people inside had sensed the danger and jumped out before the crashes.","They fell into the water one after another.","Some could swim.","Others were hopeless in the water, their abilities useless in this situation.","They gulped down mouthfuls of seawater, thrashing and screaming for help.","The remaining jets, which had regrouped and prepared to set off again, froze in place.","It was clear now: the problem wasn’t limited to one area.","The entire region was affected.","“Head over there,” Lu Chen suddenly said, his gaze fixed on a distant point, his expression dark.","Everyone followed his gaze and saw a lone island in the center of the sea.","It was about two kilometers to the right and behind them.","“Quick, head that way,” Bai Hongting ordered.","For now, their priority was to save lives, preserve their strength, and figure out what was going on.","All the wind-element ability users gathered their energy, propelling the falling jets toward the island.","Those like Lu Chen and Ling Jing, who had special abilities to lift the jets, also pitched in.","Yun Xiaoxiao, ignoring the surprised looks from the others, released Little Eagle from her space.","With a sharp cry, Little Eagle dove down.","Its talons grabbed two people who had swallowed too much water and were on the verge of sinking.","Yun Xiaoxiao had been about to retrieve some boats from her space.","She remembered a large store specializing in inflatable boats and kayaks that she’d come across during the Zombie Purge War.","While others had overlooked it while gathering supplies, she had stashed the items into her space.","But just as she was about to take them out, Nie Yizhou shouted:","“Colossal, what are you doing?!”","As soon as he spoke, something splashed into the water.","A small ripple spread across the surface.","Then, Colossal began to expand at an astonishing rate.","It truly became colossal!","Its massive shell was at least five meters wide!","It surfaced, lifting all the struggling people out of the water.","They were soaked and shaken but safe.","When they realized they were on the back of a giant turtle, their eyes widened in shock.","Seeing that all the fallen were safe, Yun Xiaoxiao decided against taking out the boats.","“Hahaha, I knew it! My Colossal is the best!” Nie Yizhou beamed with pride.","He had the air of a proud father.","Xiao Feng touched his chest.","Ever since Flame Wing had been injured saving him, it had been in a deep slumber.","Now, it was inside his body.","He didn’t know how Flame Wing had entered him, but he could clearly sense its presence.","It seemed to be resting.","“Don’t worry, your Flame Wing will be fine,” Nie Yizhou said, patting Xiao Feng’s shoulder as if reading his thoughts.","“Yeah,” Xiao Feng replied.","But then, his brow furrowed deeply.","“Something’s wrong!”","Nie Yizhou followed his gaze, confused.","“What is it?”","“Look over there. Something’s moving fast through the water, heading straight for Colossal!” Xiao Feng pointed to a spot behind the giant turtle.","Nie Yizhou squinted, then his face paled.","“Holy crap, what the hell is that?!”","Something like a sharp blade was skimming across the water’s surface, leaving ripples in its wake.","Suddenly, a massive splash erupted, revealing the terrifying form of the creature.","It was a shark!","An unprecedented giant shark!","With six enormous heads!"]},{"number":396,"title":"Chapter 396: Six Giant Sharks","paragraphs":["At this moment, the six-headed shark was swimming at an incredibly fast speed toward the giant creature.","The waves it created surged one after another.","The commotion was enormous, making one's scalp tingle with fear.","\"Giant, run!\"","Nie Yizhou shouted anxiously.","He then quickly leaped onto the back of the giant creature.","He steadied himself after a slight wobble.","At this moment, his sense of urgency grew even stronger.","Damn it!","The six-headed shark was only about a hundred meters behind him!","With its six massive heads, it was frantically swimming toward them, closing the distance rapidly!","Each of its heads was enormous, with teeth as large and sharp as rows of meat grinders, terrifying to behold.","Nie Yizhou immediately raised his hand and hurled a series of earthen mounds toward the six-headed shark's massive heads.","However, the six-headed shark was an intelligent mutated creature, cunning and quick.","Before the earthen mounds could hit it, it swiftly dove into the depths of the sea.","Bang, bang, bang...","The earthen mounds missed their target and sank into the water, disappearing into the deep sea.","Splash!","The sound of water erupted as the six-headed shark emerged from another spot, creating massive waves.","It let out a strange cry, as if enraged, and charged forward even more ferociously.","Nie Yizhou cursed under his breath and quickly prepared another attack.","While fighting, he urged the giant creature to hurry and escape.","The others sitting on the giant creature's back, having regained their composure, also joined the battle.","A variety of supernatural abilities were unleashed, bombarding the six-headed shark.","Under the relentless attacks from multiple people, the six-headed shark was eventually reduced to a two-headed shark.","Blood spilled across the sea surface, dyeing the water red.","The two-headed shark, unwilling to give up, dove back into the sea, and Nie Yizhou and the others were temporarily out of danger.","The word \"temporarily\" was used because the blood from the two-headed shark was like an irresistible delicacy, attracting a large number of mutated sea creatures.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had already dragged two helicopters to the isolated island, was about to return to help the others when she suddenly froze.","The white sheet in her mind was now filled with dense dots.","The number was clearly abnormal!","Those dots were converging from all directions, rapidly swimming toward Nie Yizhou and the others, who were still in the water.","Not good!","Yun Xiaoxiao thought to herself and immediately teleported over.","\"Brother Yizhou, quickly shrink the giant and take it and the others away,\" she said urgently as soon as she appeared.","Nie Yizhou didn't know what was happening, but he trusted Yun Xiaoxiao.","Her tone indicated that something serious was going on.","Listening to her was the right move.","After Yun Xiaoxiao teleported away with a few people, Nie Yizhou immediately grabbed the remaining two and instructed the giant to shrink.","The giant obediently shrank to the size of a palm, using the water's surface to leap onto Nie Yizhou's body.","Nie Yizhou then vanished with the others.","The moment they disappeared, the area they had just occupied erupted with a loud 'boom,' and the water churned violently.","A dozen piranhas leaped out of the sea, their sharp teeth snapping open and shut.","If anyone had been bitten, they would have been lucky to escape with their lives.","The piranhas, drawn by the strong scent of blood, quickly tracked down the two-headed shark.","In an instant, the sea churned.","Soon, crimson blood rose to the surface, and fragments of the two-headed shark's body could be seen.","However, the dismembered remains were quickly devoured by the piranhas that had arrived shortly after.","The scene was brutal and bloody.","As soon as Nie Yizhou and the others reached the shore, a swarm of strange-looking fish lunged at them.","Each one was ferocious, as if eager to devour Nie Yizhou and his companions.","Nie Yizhou and the others quickly retreated.","The rest of the group, seeing this, rushed over and worked together to repel the mutated fish attempting to come ashore.","Once the shore was peaceful again, everyone took a moment to pat their chests and let out a sigh of relief.","That was close!","Having narrowly escaped death, everyone stood on the rocks by the isolated island's shore, gazing at the sea with grim expressions.","\"What's going on? We didn't encounter anything strange when we came here, so why is this happening now?\"","Someone frowned in confusion.","When they had traveled to M Country, they had passed through this sea area.","Back then, everything had gone smoothly, and nothing unusual had occurred.","\"Perhaps some kind of magnetic field here has suddenly changed,\" Jiang Huai said with a deep gaze.","Lu Chen added gravely, \"I think it's likely caused by some creature in the depths of the sea.\"","Ever since animals and plants began mutating, many bizarre events had started happening.","If a mutated creature could interfere with magnetic fields, causing the current situation, it wouldn't be surprising at all.","\"Let's check if the remaining planes are still functional,\" Bai Hongting said, turning his gaze from the sea to the chaotic mess of planes on the beach behind them.","They had already lost five planes, and the others absolutely couldn't afford to fail.","They were still a long way from Hua Country, and they were in the middle of the sea.","If their only means of transportation broke down, it would be a true disaster.","\"We'll guard the area over there,\" Peng Shaowei said, leading a group toward the back of the beach.","Behind them was a dense forest, which undoubtedly concealed its own dangers.","Their current location was truly a case of being caught between a rock and a hard place, with threats on all sides.","\"Let's scout the surroundings,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said, nodding to Lu Chen and the others.","They immediately understood her meaning.","Splitting up, their figures quickly vanished from sight.","About fifteen or sixteen minutes later, they returned one by one.","However, each of their expressions had grown even more serious.","\"How did it go?\"","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao landed, everyone turned their attention to her.","She shook her head. \"It's no use. There seems to be an invisible barrier around this sea area. When you get close, the feeling of weightlessness intensifies, pulling you uncontrollably toward the sea.\"","She had tried multiple times.","Every time she attempted to break through, she felt an overwhelming sense of weightlessness.","That weightlessness would drag her, trying to teleport, toward the sea.","Moreover, her abilities were also somewhat affected.","She had even tested it with a drone.","It couldn't last even a second before losing all power and plummeting into the sea.","In other words, humans were somewhat affected, while anything mechanical was severely hindered and couldn't function properly.","No wonder the planes had all malfunctioned earlier.","As Yun Xiaoxiao explained, Lu Chen and the others also shared their findings.","Their experiences were similar to hers.","However, Ling Jing added one more detail.","\"Have you noticed that fog is starting to form around us?\"","Hearing this, everyone froze.","Ling Jing was right—they hadn't noticed it before!"]},{"number":397,"title":"Chapter 397: The Fog Has Risen","paragraphs":["At this moment, a faint darkness began to glow on the horizon, signaling the imminent arrival of night.","If one didn’t look closely, they wouldn’t notice the thin layer of mist that had already risen over the sea.","“Is there something wrong with this mist?” someone asked.","Ling Jing raised an eyebrow. “Don’t you feel a bit dizzy?”","The others: !!!","“Wife, I’m sorry! It’s all my fault!”","Suddenly, a voice filled with regret and apology rang out.","The voice was out of place and strange, especially at a time like this.","Everyone instinctively turned their gaze toward the source of the sound.","There, they saw a bearded man kneeling on the ground, clutching a large rock, weeping bitterly.","“When you rushed at me, I was so scared. I didn’t mean to kill you. Please forgive me!”","“I regret it every day. I’m in pain every day.”","“No, no, I didn’t abandon you. I was just... just too panicked and ran away. The building was full of zombies afterward. I couldn’t get back in. I didn’t mean to leave your body there to rot. You have to believe me!”","The bearded man continued to sob and mutter to himself.","One moment he hugged the rock, the next he kowtowed to it, as if possessed.","Everyone exchanged bewildered glances, unsure of what was happening to him.","He had been fine just moments ago. Why had he suddenly gone mad?","“Ahhh! I’ll fight you to the death!”","At the same time, another voice erupted from a different direction.","It was Jin Pan, who had been working with Yun Xiaoxiao as bait.","His face was filled with rage as he swung his arms wildly, making attacking motions.","But there was no one around him.","It was as if he was fighting the air.","It was beyond bizarre.","Now, everyone was even more confused.","Weird!","Too weird!","One person acting strangely was one thing.","But now there were two, both seemingly possessed.","A coincidence stacked on another coincidence was no longer just a coincidence.","There had to be something more to it.","Suddenly, someone remembered what Ling Jing had said earlier.","“Could it be because of the mist?”","The words hit everyone like a bolt of clarity.","Ling Jing glanced at the two affected individuals. “It must be. The mist is affecting their minds, causing them to hallucinate.","What they’re seeing isn’t real.","But they’re trapped in it, unable to break free.”","Bai Hongting frowned and immediately ordered someone to try and wake the two up.","But they remained unresponsive, impossible to rouse.","With no other choice, Bai Hongting had them knocked unconscious.","After all, staying trapped in the hallucination could damage their minds.","He feared that letting it continue might lead to uncontrollable consequences. It was better to knock them out first and figure out a solution later.","“Everyone, stay focused and alert. If you feel even the slightest bit off, seek help from those around you. Do not act alone,” Bai Hongting instructed sternly.","Then he turned to the team working on repairing the aircraft.","“How’s it looking? Can they still fly?”","One of the mechanics stepped forward. “One helicopter and one fighter jet are beyond repair. The rest are still operational.”","Bai Hongting’s brows furrowed deeply.","That meant they had lost a total of seven aircraft.","Now, they didn’t have enough planes for everyone.","But staying here wasn’t safe either.","They needed to leave as soon as possible.","He quickly shared his thoughts.","If moving forward wasn’t an option, they’d have to retreat.","As long as they could put some distance between themselves and this eerie sea, even if it meant taking a longer route, surely not every place would be this strange.","However, there were two problems with this plan.","First, they had lost seven aircraft, meaning even if they squeezed in, the remaining planes couldn’t carry everyone.","Second, their fuel reserves were running low. It was uncertain whether they had enough to safely leave the sea.","“It’s too early to think about that. Even if we wanted to retreat now, we can’t,” Yun Xiaoxiao interjected bluntly.","Bai Hongting raised an eyebrow. “Xiaoxiao, what do you mean?”","Without looking at him, Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to the right side of the island—the direction they had come from.","There, a thick mist had also begun to rise.","In fact, the fog was now denser than before.","“You can see for yourselves. There was no mist earlier, but now it’s here.”","With that, she levitated into the air.","Her voice grew even more serious.","“The mist has surrounded the entire island.”","To confirm her suspicions, she disappeared again.","Everyone waited quietly, knowing she had gone to investigate.","Soon, she returned.","“Just as I thought.”","Her words confirmed that the situation was dire.","“I’ve checked. The island is now surrounded and covered by the same strange barrier as before. Unless we find the source of this phenomenon and eliminate it, neither people nor aircraft will be able to leave.”","In essence, they were trapped in a transparent enclosure.","The edges of this enclosure were imbued with a peculiar energy.","Anyone or anything that got too close would be affected, losing control and plummeting downward.","To escape, they needed to find the “key” to this enclosure.","In other words, they had to discover what was causing the mist.","“It must be in the sea,” someone immediately suggested.","“But the sea is full of danger. Those terrifying mutated fish monsters are everywhere. How are we supposed to search?”","Nie Yizhou felt the giant creature in his arms squirming, eager to break free. He quickly restrained it.","“No! Absolutely not! You’re not going anywhere!”","The sea was far too dangerous.","Just earlier, a six-headed shark had nearly bitten it.","There was no way he was letting it take such a risk again!","But the usually obedient creature, this time, was unusually defiant.","It shrank its body by half, easily slipping out of Nie Yizhou’s grasp.","Then it scurried quickly toward the edge of the rocks and leaped into the sea.","Nie Yizhou teleported after it but failed to catch it.","Furious, he shouted, “Giant! Get back here!”","With its pitiful fighting ability, venturing into the sea would mean certain death. Those ferocious mutated sharks and piranhas would devour it without a trace.","Nie Yizhou was both angry and anxious.","He wanted to drag the creature back and give it a good thrashing.","But Yun Xiaoxiao was staring thoughtfully at the calm surface of the water.","“Brother Yizhou, don’t you think the giant seems eager to go into the sea?”","Her gaze was distant. “Maybe there’s something in the depths that’s calling to it...”"]},{"number":398,"title":"Chapter 398: The Rebellious Titan","paragraphs":["Nie Yizhou was stunned for a moment.","He felt that Yun Xiaoxiao’s words made sense.","But...","He worriedly glanced toward the sea.","There were many terrifying mutated sea creatures in there!","If the giant creature, with its poor combat ability, encountered them, it would be disastrous!","Seemingly noticing Nie Yizhou’s concern, Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled softly.","“Although we can’t go into the sea, we can lure the things in the sea up to the surface.”","Nie Yizhou’s expression froze for a moment, then he slapped his thigh.","“Right! Why didn’t I think of that?”","He immediately became energized.","If they made enough noise, the mutated creatures in the surrounding waters would gather toward them.","Wouldn’t that make the giant creature much safer?","Thinking of this, he excitedly ran to a spot on the beach a little farther from where the giant creature had jumped into the sea and launched a fierce attack on the water.","*Boom!*","A huge splash erupted on the water’s surface.","He stared intently.","But after a while, there was still no movement in the nearby waters.","He frowned.","Why wasn’t it working?","“Are you stupid? Why would those things come over like this?”","Xiao Feng walked up behind him and rolled his eyes.","Nie Yizhou wasn’t in the mood to argue and asked directly, “What do you mean? Why aren’t they coming?”","“If you were those fish, would you go to a place with danger? You just threw a bunch of dirt into the water and made such a ruckus. Of course, they wouldn’t come. They’d run away as fast as they could.”","Nie Yizhou: “...”","Well... that made sense.","He had been too impatient and hadn’t thought it through.","“Then what should we do?” he asked, frowning.","Yun Xiaoxiao stepped forward and took out a chicken she had prepared earlier.","Nie Yizhou immediately understood her intention.","He grabbed the chicken and pulled out a knife.","Blood flowed into the water, and the scent of blood spread through the air.","Sure enough, after a while, ripples began to form on the surface of the sea not far away.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled. “They’re coming.”","Everyone immediately went on high alert.","Yun Xiaoxiao said to Lu Chen and the others, “You stay here and guard this area. I’ll go down and take a look.”","Lu Chen frowned. “I’ll go with you.”","He knew Yun Xiaoxiao had many strange abilities, but he was still worried.","Such a dangerous task should be his responsibility.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head with a smile. “Big brother, you have a more important task. I need you to protect my physical body.”","The depths of the sea were dangerous.","The more people who went, the bigger the target they would become.","She could separate her soul from her body and enter the sea in her soul form.","As a soul, she would be invisible and undetectable to the mutated sea creatures.","However, this meant her physical body would be left vulnerable on the shore.","If her body were harmed, her soul would also suffer damage.","Therefore, protecting her body was crucial.","“Then I’ll go with you,” Ling Jing said.","Yun Xiaoxiao still refused.","“You should stay on the shore. If that ‘thing’ appears, you’ll need to deal with it together.”","The reason she had Nie Yizhou create a big commotion was not only to draw attention away from the giant creature but also to see if they could lure out the entity responsible for the fog and the barrier.","At the moment, they didn’t know what it was.","Was it a mutated fish? A mutated sea plant? Or something else entirely?","Would it come to the surface and attack them directly, or would it hide in the sea and slowly wear them down with underhanded tactics?","Therefore, they had to consider and prepare for multiple possibilities.","She would leave Lu Chen and the others on the shore while she went into the sea.","Only by identifying the true threat could they take appropriate measures.","After briefly explaining her plan, Lu Chen and the others reluctantly agreed.","They urged her to be careful, not to act impulsively, and to return immediately if she encountered danger so they could figure out a solution together.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and agreed before sitting down on the ground to begin separating her soul from her body.","Bai Hongting, who was standing nearby, seemed to want to say something but ultimately remained silent.","He sighed and walked over to Nie Yizhou and the others.","By now, many terrifying mutated fish had gathered on the sea’s surface.","Everyone was fully focused on the battle.","The sounds of fighting and the scent of blood grew stronger.","Meanwhile...","In her soul form, Yun Xiaoxiao descended vertically, diving deeper and deeper into the sea.","As she went down, she kept an eye on her surroundings.","The deeper she went, the colder the water became.","The light also grew dimmer...","Although she was in her soul form, she could still sense the changes in temperature, though they were less intense.","At first, there were some strange-looking mutated fish with sharp teeth swimming around her.","But soon, all that remained was the chilly seawater.","After what felt like a long time, her feet finally touched something solid.","She knew she had reached the bottom.","Her eyes adjusted to the dim light, and though it was dark, she could vaguely make out her surroundings.","There were a few rocks and some floating seaweed.","Nothing particularly unusual.","So, she continued to explore the area.","Time passed slowly.","She was patient, not giving up just because she hadn’t found anything yet, and continued her search methodically.","Suddenly, a glimmer of light appeared in her vision.","A light in the pitch-black depths of the sea was unusual in itself!","What’s more, she could clearly see that the ripples of water illuminated by the light were strange and unnatural.","How to describe it...","Imagine a line. While other water ripples were straight, the ripples near the light were dotted, as if they had been forcibly segmented into multiple parts.","A flash of excitement crossed Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes.","Perhaps she had found what she was looking for!","She quickly swam toward the light.","Being in her soul form had its advantages.","She could move freely through the water without worrying about drowning or being hindered by the currents.","The closer she got, the more cautious she became.","She was prepared for an attack at any moment.","But strangely, even when she was only about fifty meters away, she encountered no danger.","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but feel puzzled.","Was it because she was in her soul form that the entity ignored her and didn’t attack?","With this thought, she cautiously moved closer, ready to retreat into her space at the first sign of danger.","Yes, even in her soul form, she could still enter her space freely.","This added an extra layer of protection.","It was also why she dared to venture down alone.","The closer she got to the light, the more intense her sensations became.","She was surprised to find that the closer she was to the beam, the faster the energy within her body circulated.","The barrier at the peak of the eighth level, which she had been unable to break through, seemed to be loosening.","Her eyes widened in shock.","Could being near this light help her improve her strength?"]},{"number":399,"title":"Chapter 399: Yun Xiaoxiao Enters the Sea","paragraphs":["To verify her suspicions, she moved forward several more meters.","It was at this moment that her body was uncontrollably and swiftly pulled.","She didn’t even have time to enter her space before a sharp, intense pain shot through her head.","Immediately after, she completely lost consciousness.","What she didn’t know was that she had been sucked into a giant seashell.","As soon as she entered, the shell automatically closed.","The light in the depths of the ocean vanished instantly.","Everything returned to calm, as if nothing had happened.","On the surface of the sea.","Everyone was engaged in a fierce battle with mutated sea creatures.","Suddenly, someone shouted in surprise.","\"Look, everyone! The black fog around us has disappeared!\"","Hearing this, many took a moment to glance up at the sea.","Indeed, the increasingly thick and encroaching black fog was gone!","It had happened in the blink of an eye.","Just moments ago, many had seen the fog lingering around them.","But now, not a trace of it remained!","Though only a sliver of light remained on the horizon, they could still see the scene clearly for several kilometers around.","This was real!","And the most immediate sensation was that the dizziness they had felt earlier was gone.","In other words, whatever had been trapping them had truly vanished!","While everyone was overjoyed, they also felt puzzled.","Why had the fog suddenly disappeared?","\"It must be Xiao Xiao!\" Nie Yizhou exclaimed excitedly.","There was another possibility—his giant turtle, Wuji.","But he wasn’t too confident in Wuji’s abilities, so he dismissed that thought outright.","He looked around, frowning slightly.","\"Where’s Xiao Xiao? Why hasn’t she come back yet?\"","\"Maybe she just destroyed that thing and hasn’t had time to surface yet,\" Xiao Feng suggested.","Nie Yizhou thought that made sense.","But then, he started to worry about Wuji again.","Where had that guy gone?","Had it run into Xiao Xiao?","Just as he was pondering this, a loud splash erupted from the shore behind them.","The sound startled everyone, and those who could spare a moment turned to look.","There, the water churned violently, forming a massive whirlpool.","The sea was being stirred up as if something enormous was about to emerge.","Soon, a giant turtle rose from the center of the whirlpool.","Wait, not just a turtle!","Behind the massive black shell, a huge snake’s head lifted high.","As the snake’s head swayed, its body coiled around the turtle’s shell.","What... was this thing?!","Had the turtle cheated, or had the snake strayed?","At first glance, everyone was stunned.","They had never seen a mutated creature like this before.","\"I feel like I’ve seen this somewhere before,\" Hao Xing muttered, his expression conflicted.","Chen Junzhe, standing beside him, adjusted his glasses.","A glint of wisdom flashed in his eyes behind the lenses.","\"This is Xuanwu,\" he said calmly.","As soon as he spoke, something clicked in Hao Xing’s mind.","\"That’s right! It’s Xuanwu, the mythical beast from ancient legends! I’ve seen it in the *Classic of Mountains and Seas*!\"","\"Xuanwu? No way! Isn’t that just a myth?\"","The others were equally astonished.","\"Wow, it really does look like it!\"","\"Oh my god, this world has truly gone supernatural. Even mythical beasts are showing up now. What’s next?\"","\"I thought we were in the apocalypse, but now it feels like we’ve crossed into another dimension!\"","\"We’re doomed! Xuanwu’s coming toward us! Are we going to die?!\"","Everyone was on high alert, fighting off the vicious mutated fish while keeping a wary eye on the rapidly approaching Xuanwu.","Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Xiao Feng, Nie Yizhou, Bai Hongting, Jiang Huai, Peng Shaowei, and Tang Jun all rushed to the front, ready for battle.","Nie Yizhou snorted. \"Hmph, half-turtle, half-snake—it’s not even that impressive. Not as cool as my Wuji! Whatever this Xuanwu is, if it dares to come, we’ll take it down together!\"","Just as everyone tensed up, preparing for a fierce battle, they realized that Xuanwu wasn’t heading for them at all. Instead...","It was targeting the mutated fish monsters thrashing in the sea!","In one swift motion, it opened both its turtle and snake mouths, swallowing a massive barrel-sized mutated grouper and a spiky pufferfish whole.","Then, it swiftly attacked the remaining mutated fish.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","This Xuanwu... seemed to be on their side!","Xuanwu wreaked havoc, slaughtering the mutated fish with ease.","The once-ferocious fish either fell to its attacks or fled in terror, seemingly suppressed by its sheer presence.","With Xuanwu’s sudden assistance, everyone had a moment to breathe.","They watched in awe as Xuanwu systematically eliminated every mutated fish near the shore.","\"You know,\" Ling Jing said, shoving his hands into his pockets and smirking at Nie Yizhou, \"this Xuanwu kind of reminds me of your little turtle.\"","Nie Yizhou: !!!","Really?","No way...","Could it be?!","His eyes sparkled as he stared at the heroic Xuanwu.","Was this really his Wuji?","Had his weakling turned into a god of war?","He wanted to believe it but was afraid of being disappointed, so he nervously watched Xuanwu dominate the battlefield.","When Xuanwu finally killed the last mutated crab, tossing it onto the rocks, and swam toward him, his excitement reached its peak.","Xuanwu stretched its turtle head toward Nie Yizhou, stopping right in front of him, and gently nudged his shoulder.","Nie Yizhou: !!!","Yes, yes!","This was definitely his Wuji!","Xuanwu quickly shrank to the size of a palm, crawling up Nie Yizhou’s arm and settling into his embrace.","At that moment, Nie Yizhou was filled with pride.","His smug expression was almost unbearable.","But even Xiao Feng, who loved to bicker with him, didn’t say a word.","Everyone felt that, for once, his arrogance was justified.","Nie Yizhou might often be unreliable, but when Wuji was still weak, everyone had expected him to abandon it and find a new partner. Yet he hadn’t.","Despite his constant complaints, he had always cared for Wuji and treated it as a true companion.","So now that Wuji had become so powerful, no one begrudged him his moment of glory.","No one knew what kind of encounter Wuji had experienced in the depths of the sea, but it had clearly evolved into the legendary mythical beast, Xuanwu.","It was truly unbelievable.","\"What are you looking at?\" Ling Jing asked as he approached Lu Chen.","Lu Chen gazed at the calm sea, a hint of worry flashing in his cold eyes.","\"Xiao Xiao hasn’t come back yet.\""]},{"number":400,"title":"Chapter 400: Sucked into the Shell","paragraphs":["Ling Jing slowly scanned the sea surface.","The sea stretched as far as the eye could see, calm and waveless.","\"What are you talking about?\"","At this time, Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng walked over.","After learning of Lu Chen's concerns, Nie Yizhou immediately looked at the Black Tortoise in his arms.","\"Big guy, did you see any little ghosts underwater?\"","Both the turtle's head and the snake's head of the Black Tortoise shook simultaneously.","\"Did you get rid of those black mists?\" Ling Jing asked.","The Black Tortoise shook its head again.","Seeing this, everyone's faces looked rather grim.","That meant it was Yun Xiaoxiao who had dealt with the black mists.","But it had been a while since the black mists dissipated, and she still hadn't come out.","Could it be that she had encountered danger while dealing with that thing?","Almost simultaneously, everyone thought of this possibility, and their worries deepened.","\"Let it take us down to look for her.\"","Lu Chen pointed at the big guy and said to Nie Yizhou.","Nie Yizhou also had this idea and immediately let the Black Tortoise show itself.","\"Are you going to look for Xiaoxiao?\"","Just then, Bai Hongting walked over.","\"Yes.\"","Lu Chen responded briefly, without any extra words.","\"Can I go with you?\"","There was a look of worry in Bai Hongting's eyes, no less than that of Lu Chen and the others.","His voice was a bit hesitant, afraid that Lu Chen and the others would directly reject him.","The others exchanged glances, and Lu Chen said, \"Come on board.\"","They knew about the relationship between Bai Hongting and Yun Xiaoxiao.","Although they didn't quite like Bai Hongting's previous actions.","But the situation was special now.","More people meant more strength.","Bai Hongting was quite powerful, and he might be able to help.","So, the four of them plus Bai Hongting stepped onto the back of the Black Tortoise.","Lu Chen conjured up a transparent light shield and covered everyone with it, like putting on a transparent waterproof suit for everyone.","The big guy's body slowly sank to the bottom of the sea, and the others sank with it.","Actually, Lei Ming, Zheng Yuner, Qu Xiaobei and other people from Yun City all said they wanted to go with them.","But Lu Chen asked them to stay above. Firstly, Lei Ming's subordinates still needed someone to take care of them, and Yun Xiaoxiao's physical body also needed someone to guard.","Secondly, besides looking for Yun Xiaoxiao, someone was needed to check if the invisible barrier around had disappeared.","If Yun Xiaoxiao came back before them, someone was also needed above to receive and inform them.","They and Lei Ming all had walkie - talkies. If there was any situation above, Lei Ming could contact them.","Of course, as long as the distance between them was not too far.","Although the walkie - talkies were modified, after all, they were not mobile phones and couldn't make long - distance calls.","However, the communication distance was still longer than that of ordinary walkie - talkies.","As soon as the big guy entered the sea, it sped up.","Some mutated fish monsters smelled the human scent and swam over quickly.","But after sensing the big guy's aura, they all took a detour.","So, led by the big guy, they were like invincible beings underwater.","However, none of them was happy at all.","Because they still hadn't seen Yun Xiaoxiao's figure!","They searched for a full two days and two nights.","But still, there was no sign of her.","Yun Xiaoxiao seemed to have evaporated from the bottom of the sea without a trace.","During this time, although it had been proven that the strange barrier that had trapped them had also disappeared, no one chose to leave.","Instead, they decided to wait until they found Yun Xiaoxiao before leaving together.","So, they built temporary shelters at the junction of the beach and the dense forest.","There they could avoid the direct sunlight.","As for food, they didn't lack at all.","The mutated fish monsters they killed on the first evening were enough for them to eat for a long time.","But fearing that the hot weather would make the corpses rot and get maggots, they sliced the corpses of the mutated fish and dried them on the rocks on the beach.","When they wanted to eat fresh grilled fish, they just made some noise to attract one or two mutated fish monsters up.","They had always coexisted peacefully with the dense forest behind the beach.","No terrifying things had come out of the forest.","Nor had they been curious enough to explore inside.","Until the afternoon of the third day, there was a sudden rustling sound from the dense forest.","Everyone who was resting immediately got up.","The next second, countless mutated beach crabs emerged from the thorny grass and rushed towards everyone like crazy.","There were a huge number of them, tens of thousands!","Most other mutated animals had become larger.","But these beach crabs were different. They had become smaller.","They were as small as little fingers.","Moreover, their color was almost transparent.","If you didn't look carefully, you wouldn't notice them at all.","So when they moved quickly and in large numbers, it was even more difficult to spot their traces.","They would climb onto your body along your feet when you weren't paying attention.","Then they would use their evolved sharp pincers to pierce into your flesh.","If it was just a moment of pain and a little blood loss, it wouldn't be so bad.","The key was that they not only made you hurt and bleed but also made your nerves go numb.","For a moment, everyone was very troubled.","And this wasn't the scariest part.","The scariest thing was that besides these mutated beach crabs, there was also an unknown kind of tree root covered with thorns that, at the same time, quickly extended out from the dense forest along the ground.","They had many branches and would entangle anyone they saw.","Once entangled, your whole body would feel like being stabbed by thousands of fine needles.","In a more serious case, you would be tightened all over and suffocate to death.","What was even more annoying was that this thing just couldn't be completely eradicated!","Even if you cut or burned it, new branches would emerge later.","It was extremely terrifying!","The successive attacks of these two waves of mutated species made everyone suffer a great deal.","After a battle, although no one died, many were injured.","After finally defeating the beach crabs and the multi - armed tree roots, someone finally couldn't hold it in anymore.","\"How long are we going to stay here? It's not that I'm being ungrateful, but we've waited for so many days, and her soul hasn't come back. Are we going to wait here forever?\"","Seeing someone speak up, some others who had long wanted to leave also began to chime in.","\"I also want to go back. It's too dangerous here! Although no one died just now, everyone has experienced that the mutated species on this island are very strange. What if there are even more powerful ones later? Aren't we just waiting to die if we stay here?\"","\"Yes, yes, and it's been so many days. Maybe...\"","The speaker glanced at the tent where Yun Xiaoxiao's physical body was placed.","He didn't continue, but everyone more or less guessed what he wanted to say.","These people had wanted to leave as soon as the fog dispersed and the crisis was over. But at that time, most people had decided to stay. They were afraid that if they voiced their true thoughts, they would be despised by others.","At the same time, they also took into account Yun Xiaoxiao's status.","They were afraid that if they really proposed to leave, they would be targeted by Yun City and wouldn't be sold evolution fluid or supplies in the future.","So they reluctantly stayed together.","During these three days of waiting, their dissatisfaction had been growing stronger.","And the sudden battle just now had pushed their dissatisfaction to the peak.","With one person taking the lead, they felt they couldn't wait any longer and started to voice their thoughts one after another.","As soon as that person finished speaking, Xiao Feng immediately strode over with his fists clenched. He grabbed the person by the collar and pretended to punch him.","\"Damn it, what the hell are you talking about? If you dare to say another word, do you believe I'll beat your mouth to a pulp!\""]}]);
